<node id="Bassanite">
  <data key="d0">Bassanite</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Bassanite is a calcium sulfate hemihydrate mineral with the chemical formula CaSO4·½H2O. It is scientifically recognized as a stable precursor phase in the precipitation of gypsum. In mineralogical and chemical contexts, bassanite is classified as both a distinct mineral species and a chemical compound that plays a central role in sulfate hydration and crystallization processes.

Within industrial byproducts, bassanite is a primary constituent of phosphogypsum, where it occurs as a major mineralogical species and can also form as a secondary compound through the reaction of phosphogypsum with sulfuric acid. Analytically, the substance is sometimes designated as chemical phase "B" in scientific legends, corresponding to a small diffraction peak observed around 14 degrees. Together, these characteristics define bassanite as a key mineral and chemical phase in both natural precipitation systems and industrial sulfate management.&lt;SEP&gt;A calcium sulfate phase identified within phosphogypsum based on calcium and sulfur content.&lt;SEP&gt;Bassanite is a mineral phase present in Group 1 phosphogypsum alongside gypsum and anhydrite.&lt;SEP&gt;A calcium sulfate hemihydrate phase produced during ardealite decomposition and transformed into anhydrite III above 150°C.&lt;SEP&gt;A mineral compound identified as a major component in washed PG at 170°C.&lt;SEP&gt;Bassanite is a mineral component in phosphogypsum that transforms into anhydrite during calcination at temperatures above 600°C.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28fbd4302bba090e667215c840757ff7-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28fbd4302bba090e667215c840757ff7-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-160a0fe95f7c82b193c6af751106ab6d-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e0549fcda95f7199440791b20bf85635-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e0549fcda95f7199440791b20bf85635-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
