<node id="Carbon Dioxide Sequestration">
  <data key="d0">Carbon Dioxide Sequestration</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Carbon dioxide sequestration is an environmental process targeted by modified mineral carbonation techniques using phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Carbon dioxide sequestration is an environmental process targeted by modified mineral carbonation techniques using phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Carbon dioxide sequestration is an environmental process targeted by modified mineral carbonation techniques using phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Carbon dioxide sequestration is an environmental process explored through the mineral carbonation of industrial byproduct gypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Carbon dioxide sequestration is the environmental application of the carbonation process using phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Carbon dioxide sequestration is a key research theme involving the capture and storage of CO2, often through mineral carbonation processes.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-054&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80e3f6300e001922a5ca2a6a8ac2e0d2-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80e3f6300e001922a5ca2a6a8ac2e0d2-chunk-016</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792120308</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Wet Conversion">
  <data key="d0">Wet Conversion</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Wet conversion is a chemical processing method used to extract valuable compounds like potassium sulfate from phosphogypsum and synthetic gypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Wet conversion is a chemical processing method used to extract valuable compounds like potassium sulfate from phosphogypsum and synthetic gypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Wet conversion is a chemical synthesis method used to produce potassium sulfate from phosphogypsum and synthetic gypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Wet conversion is a chemical processing method used to extract valuable compounds like potassium sulfate from phosphogypsum and synthetic gypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Wet Conversion is an aqueous chemical process used to transform phosphogypsum into valuable sulfate compounds.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-026</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791593795</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Construct. Build. Mater.">
  <data key="d0">Construct. Build. Mater.</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Construct. Build. Mater. is a scientific and academic journal dedicated to publishing research and studies in the field of construction and building materials engineering. A central theme of its publication portfolio is the investigation, modification, purification, and practical utilization of phosphogypsum, a common industrial byproduct. The journal consistently features comprehensive studies that explore advanced methods for processing this material and integrating it into diverse engineering contexts.

Specific research published in Construct. Build. Mater. spans a wide array of construction applications and material science topics. These include the development of phosphogypsum-modified cement, supersulfated cement, and phosphogypsum composites, as well as its application in clay bricks, aerated concrete, mortar, and insulation materials. Additionally, the journal covers the mechanical properties of alkali-activated systems, the recycling of waste gypsum, and the use of these materials in road base construction. By consolidating investigations into both the chemical modification of phosphogypsum and its practical deployment, the journal serves as a vital resource for advancements in sustainable construction and building material engineering.&lt;SEP&gt;Construct. Build. Mater. is a scientific journal that published multiple articles on construction materials and phosphogypsum applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Construct. Build. Mater. is a scientific journal covering construction and building materials research.&lt;SEP&gt;Construction and Building Materials, a journal publishing research on phosphogypsum performance.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-032&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-031&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-024</data>
