<node id="Science">
  <data key="d0">Science</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Science is a prominent scientific journal that published research on the crystallization and precipitation mechanisms of gypsum and bassanite.&lt;SEP&gt;Science is a prominent scientific journal that published research on the crystallization and precipitation mechanisms of gypsum and bassanite.&lt;SEP&gt;Science is a scientific journal that published research on using phosphoric acid as a precursor to white phosphorus.&lt;SEP&gt;Science is a prominent scientific journal that published research on the crystallization and precipitation mechanisms of gypsum and bassanite.&lt;SEP&gt;Science is a journal that published a study on fire-derived charcoal causing forest humus loss.&lt;SEP&gt;Science is a scientific journal that published papers by S. Mann, F.C. Meldrum, and A. Firouzi.&lt;SEP&gt;Science is a prominent scientific journal that published multiple cited papers on climate change, energy infrastructure, and technology paths.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9e17ad262bd9835860df552d7ff475f1-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2196dee89de9694f28ef4eaa0e85f130-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80e3f6300e001922a5ca2a6a8ac2e0d2-chunk-013</data>
