<node id="Methane">
  <data key="d0">Methane</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Methane is a gaseous compound that functions as a significant greenhouse gas with distinct environmental and industrial characteristics. In natural and agricultural settings, it is produced and released within flooded environments through various biogeochemical pathways. As a greenhouse gas, its atmospheric removal rate is notably reduced due to chemical competition with phosphine gas. Furthermore, methane is emitted during the storage of phosphogypsum, a fact documented in reference tables.

Industrially, methane is generated during the gasification of lignite, where it acts as a reactant derived from the coal's volatile components. It serves as a primary component of syngas, and its production is strongly dependent on the concentration of water vapor. During this gasification process, methane also contributes to hydrogen production. These combined roles underscore methane's importance across both ecological cycles and chemical manufacturing processes.&lt;SEP&gt;Methane is a hydrocarbon pollutant targeted for oxidation using hydroxyapatite-supported catalysts.&lt;SEP&gt;Methane is a hydrocarbon gas targeted for dry reforming and oxidation reactions using hydroxyapatite-based catalysts.&lt;SEP&gt;Methane is partially oxidized to syngas using hydroxyapatite-based catalysts.&lt;SEP&gt;Methane is a hydrocarbon gas whose oxidation and selective conversion were studied on strontium hydroxyapatite catalysts.&lt;SEP&gt;Methane is a reducing gas used in experimental settings for phosphogypsum decomposition.&lt;SEP&gt;Methane is a gas whose adsorption in micro- and mesoporous carbons was simulated in cited research.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-036&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80e3f6300e001922a5ca2a6a8ac2e0d2-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
