  <data key="d0">Van Beek, P.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Van Beek, P. is a co-author of the 2019 study on radiation hazard assessment in Tunisia.&lt;SEP&gt;Van Beek, P. is a co-author of the research article on natural radioactivity and radiation hazard assessment.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-026</data>
