<node id="Tunisia">
  <data key="d0">Tunisia</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Tunisia is a North African country situated along the southern Mediterranean Sea, encompassing the Gulf of Gabes and the Sfax-Agareb region. It serves as a major global producer of phosphogypsum, generating approximately 10.0 million tons annually and accounting for 6.24% of worldwide production and reserves. As the primary geographic origin for the phosphorite ores utilized in this process, Tunisia hosts numerous phosphate fertilizer factories, coastal treatment plants, and the Sra Oertane phosphate rock deposit, which has been studied for thermal beneficiation. Tunisian phosphogypsum is extensively characterized for its chemical composition, trace element content, and radionuclide levels, with analytical data frequently showing weight percentages around 42 percent and a high impurity value of 21.18 percent. Scientific investigations, including studies by Zrelli et al. (2018), regularly examine radon-222 exposure in treatment facilities and evaluate the material's potential for valorization.

Despite these research efforts, phosphogypsum remains largely stockpiled in Tunisia and is widely regarded as both an industrial and environmental problem due to its underutilized value. Treatment and disposal strategies are adapted to local national conditions, with the material being partially utilized as a filler in papermaking, clay bricks, and cement manufacture, as well as in experimental brick mixtures designed to monitor radon emissions. Environmentally, the country is a focal point for assessing the ecological footprint of its phosphate industry. The Gulf of Gabes and surrounding coastal areas have been extensively monitored for industrial pollution and heavy metal contamination, which have documented adverse effects on local marine ecosystems. Concurrently, the Sfax-Agareb region has been the subject of targeted studies on groundwater contamination from phosphogypsum stacks and leachate, alongside research into the impacts on local soil bacteria and wild plant life. Consequently, Tunisia remains a vital region for evaluating the practical challenges of phosphogypsum handling, analyzing storage impacts, and developing ecological strategies to mitigate the consequences of phosphate processing.&lt;SEP&gt;Tunisia is a geographical source of Phosphogypsum reported to contain very high levels of cadmium, mercury, and zinc.&lt;SEP&gt;Tunisia is a geographic location where Phosphogypsum samples were analyzed for morphological studies.&lt;SEP&gt;A region included in a dataset detailing phosphate rock characteristics and activity concentrations.&lt;SEP&gt;Tunisia is a country where environmental evaluations of phosphate treatment in the Sfax coastal zone were conducted.&lt;SEP&gt;A country where phosphogypsum management strategies and stabilization processes have been investigated.&lt;SEP&gt;Tunisia is a geographical location where phosphogypsum samples were analyzed and reported in scientific literature.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-043&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-042&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-046&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-037&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-050&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-047&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-038&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-042&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-044&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-043&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80e3f6300e001922a5ca2a6a8ac2e0d2-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80e3f6300e001922a5ca2a6a8ac2e0d2-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80e3f6300e001922a5ca2a6a8ac2e0d2-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-001</data>
