<node id="Anhydrous Calcium Sulfate">
  <data key="d0">Anhydrous Calcium Sulfate</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Anhydrous calcium sulfate is a calcium sulfate compound that forms when calcium sulfate dihydrate undergoes thermal dehydration, specifically losing two water molecules (2H2O). This processing method is frequently applied to phosphogypsum, as the heat treatment effectively eliminates most harmful impurities while yielding a refined material.

In analyzed phosphogypsum samples, anhydrous calcium sulfate manifests as a distinct crystalline phase, constituting 42.2 wt% of the total composition. Its presence is reliably identified and verified through characteristic absorption bands and X-ray diffraction (XRD) reflections. Owing to its enhanced purity and stable physical properties, anhydrous calcium sulfate is extensively employed in practical applications, particularly as a key component in flooring systems and construction binders.&lt;SEP&gt;Anhydrous Calcium Sulfate is a secondary mineral phase present in the phosphogypsum waste alongside hemi-hydrate gypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;A mineral compound (CaSO4) identified in MPG samples, appearing at a diffraction peak of 14.639° and indicating crystallization quality.&lt;SEP&gt;Anhydrous Calcium Sulfate is a compound formed from PG during the calcination process.&lt;SEP&gt;Anhydrous calcium sulfate is a chemical compound whose oxygen ions and calcium ions can be replaced by heavy metal ions to form solid solutions.&lt;SEP&gt;Anhydrous calcium sulfate is a chemical compound that forms alongside hemihydrate calcium sulfate during phosphogypsum treatment.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6825862084b162a4b16cd1037c76e3d7-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
