<node id="Calcium Sulfate Whiskers">
  <data key="d0">Calcium Sulfate Whiskers</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Calcium Sulfate Whiskers are fine, synthetic crystalline fibers engineered as high-value chemical raw materials and industrial feedstocks. They are primarily synthesized from phosphogypsum, which serves as their main component, with high-purity variants often produced using washed phosphogypsum. The fabrication process enables the creation of these materials with adjustable aspect ratios, typically achieved through microdroplet techniques.

These engineered fibers exhibit a robust set of physical and chemical properties, most notably high temperature resistance, strong chemical corrosion resistance, and a strong affinity for polymers. Owing to these characteristics, Calcium Sulfate Whiskers are extensively utilized across various sectors to enhance material durability and performance. Their applications range from reinforcing agents in plastics and construction materials to specialized uses such as medical grafts. Ultimately, they function as versatile, high-performance additives that improve the structural and chemical resilience of composite systems.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-049&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-020</data>
