<node id="Ettringite-Based Mortar">
  <data key="d0">Ettringite-Based Mortar</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Ettringite-Based Mortar is a construction material incorporating ladle slag and phosphogypsum, evaluated for radiological safety and leaching behavior.&lt;SEP&gt;Ettringite-Based Mortar is a construction material incorporating ladle slag and phosphogypsum, evaluated for radiological safety and leaching behavior.&lt;SEP&gt;Ettringite-Based Mortar is a construction material incorporating ladle slag and phosphogypsum, evaluated for radiological safety and leaching behavior.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-016</data>
