<node id="Portland Cement Mortar">
  <data key="d0">Portland Cement Mortar</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Portland Cement Mortar is a construction material whose physical and mechanical properties are modified by varying phosphogypsum content.&lt;SEP&gt;Portland Cement Mortar is a construction material whose physical and mechanical properties are modified by varying phosphogypsum content.&lt;SEP&gt;Portland Cement Mortar is a construction material whose physical and mechanical properties are modified by varying phosphogypsum content.</data>
