<node id="Hydrothermal Synthesis">
  <data key="d0">Hydrothermal Synthesis</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Hydrothermal Synthesis is a versatile aqueous chemical processing technique conducted under controlled thermal and pressure conditions, typically within a sealed autoclave. By facilitating the crystallization and precipitation of materials from dissolved precursors, it serves as a robust pathway for engineering nanomaterials, functional crystals, and hierarchical nanostructures. While generally characterized by elevated temperatures and pressures, it can also function as a relatively low-temperature route for producing uniform nanoparticles. The process parameters, including temperature, pressure, pH, and reaction duration, are precisely regulated to dictate crystal growth, nanostructure formation, and particle morphology.

A primary and extensively documented application of Hydrothermal Synthesis is the production of hydroxyapatite and its diverse nanostructured forms, including nanocrystalline nanopowders, needle-like rods, porous and hollow microspheres, carbonated hydroxyapatite, and core-shell structures. The technique is highly advantageous for valorizing industrial byproducts and waste streams, particularly phosphogypsum and recycled calcium phosphate feedstocks, to synthesize nanocrystalline and phase-pure hydroxyapatite. The process often operates in strong alkaline media (e.g., pH 11) with heating typically between 180 °C and 200 °C for 6 to 15 hours. It acts as a time-dependent, one-step, or one-pot method that transforms amorphous calcium phosphate layers or microspheres into porous hydroxyapatite core-shell structures, facilitating in situ mixing and milling. Extended durations and slower heating rates enhance crystallinity and promote the growth of hydroxyapatite rods along the c-axis, whereas shorter processing times may result in lower crystallinity. The incorporation of surfactants or complexing agents, such as EDTA and fluorine compounds, further enables the coprecipitation of calcium and rare earth elements to produce modified or doped nanostructures.

Beyond hydroxyapatite, Hydrothermal Synthesis is widely applied to synthesize a broad spectrum of crystalline compounds, such as calcium sulfate whiskers and hierarchical nanoflowers including calcium fluoride and lanthanide-doped calcium fluoride. By precisely tuning reaction conditions, the technique effectively converts raw or waste-derived calcium phosphate precursors into fully transformed hydroxyapatite products while simultaneously engineering complex nanostructures through controlled growth mechanisms. Overall, Hydrothermal Synthesis operates as a highly adaptable and efficient chemical method for manufacturing both conventional and waste-derived nanostructured materials with precisely controlled physicochemical properties, and it is frequently cited as a key keyword in relevant production literature.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4a64a852097fdc910b98ed788503ce4-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4a64a852097fdc910b98ed788503ce4-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4a64a852097fdc910b98ed788503ce4-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4a64a852097fdc910b98ed788503ce4-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4a64a852097fdc910b98ed788503ce4-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2760dc2a11fedad02d24741a978cf20d-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6825862084b162a4b16cd1037c76e3d7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6825862084b162a4b16cd1037c76e3d7-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6825862084b162a4b16cd1037c76e3d7-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6825862084b162a4b16cd1037c76e3d7-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6825862084b162a4b16cd1037c76e3d7-chunk-00