<node id="Pyrolysis">
  <data key="d0">Pyrolysis</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Pyrolysis is a thermal decomposition process applied to phosphogypsum to extract sulfur-containing chemical raw materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Pyrolysis is a thermal decomposition process applied to phosphogypsum to extract sulfur-containing chemical raw materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Pyrolysis is a thermal decomposition process applied to phosphogypsum to extract sulfur-containing chemical raw materials.&lt;SEP&gt;A technique used to obtain phosphate materials like hydroxyapatite.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4a64a852097fdc910b98ed788503ce4-chunk-001</data>
