<node id="Chemical Looping Gasification">
  <data key="d0">Chemical Looping Gasification</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Chemical Looping Gasification is a thermochemical process designed to convert solid fuels, primarily lignite and biomass, into syngas through the use of oxygen carriers. The technology operates via non-homogeneous reactions, typically within a circulating fluidized bed, where the oxygen carrier facilitates fuel gasification without direct contact between air and fuel. This mechanism enables the efficient transformation of low-order lignite and other solid fuels into syngas, with a specific focus on generating hydrogen-rich outputs for energy conversion and transformation applications.

A defining characteristic of this process is its frequent utilization of phosphogypsum, often in a metal-supported form, as the oxygen carrier. This configuration not only drives the gasification of lignite but also provides a sustainable pathway for the treatment and valorization of phosphogypsum waste. While phosphogypsum remains the most extensively studied carrier, the process has also been adapted to utilize alternative materials such as carbide slag. Ultimately, Chemical Looping Gasification functions as a versatile energy technology that combines efficient syngas and hydrogen production with environmental benefits through the recycling of industrial byproducts.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemical looping gasification is a process that utilizes phosphogypsum as an oxygen carrier for energy conversion.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemical looping gasification is a process that uses phosphogypsum as an oxygen carrier to convert lignite into syngas.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemical looping gasification is an energy process that utilizes phosphogypsum as an oxygen carrier.&lt;SEP&gt;A gasification process that utilizes phosphogypsum as an oxygen carrier to manage fluorine and phosphorus.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemical looping gasification is a process studied by Yang et al. where silicon dioxide participates in syngas production and inhibits hydrogen sulfide formation.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemical Looping Gasification is a thermochemical process utilized to convert high-silicon phosphogypsum into energy or syngas.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-039&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-001</data>
