<node id="Ammonium Sulfate">
  <data key="d0">Ammonium Sulfate</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Ammonium sulfate ((NH4)2SO4) is a versatile chemical compound that functions as both a directly synthesized commodity and a recovered by-product across chemical manufacturing and sustainable agriculture. As a primary industrial raw material and high-quality agricultural fertilizer, it serves as a vital source of nitrogen and sulfur, enhancing soil retention, preventing nutrient imbalances, and proving particularly effective for alkaline soils. Beyond its agricultural applications, it is widely utilized in protein purification. Thermodynamically, the compound is characterized by a standard enthalpy of formation of -1180.9 kJ/mol, a value consistently documented in thermodynamic evaluation tables and chemical reaction listings.

In industrial processing, ammonium sulfate frequently emerges as a by-product or co-product, notably during the synthesis of nano-crystalline hydroxyapatite from phosphogypsum waste. It forms in the aqueous phase or liquid filtrate following phase separation and hydroxyapatite filtration, often appearing as a material present before washing steps. The compound is recovered by evaporating the remaining solution and is generated through various manufacturing methods, including direct chloride hydrometallurgy, one-step and two-step ammonia-carbonation processes, the specialized Merseburg ammonocarbonation method, and complex decomposition reactions involving phosphogypsum, calcium carbonate, and ammonia. Chemically, it forms when phosphogypsum or gypsum reacts with ammonium hydroxide or ammonium chloride. Manufacturing operations frequently incorporate radionuclide flow analysis to monitor these conversion streams, and the environmental impact of its production is routinely assessed in conjunction with phosphogypsum utilization.

The compound's identity and prepared form are routinely verified, as its infrared absorption bands match those of established reference materials. While it gains significant commercial value as a secondary raw material in phosphogypsum recycling initiatives and through carbonation processes, its economic competitiveness is occasionally challenged by cheaper alternative products. Ultimately, ammonium sulfate demonstrates broad utility, effectively bridging industrial waste management with agricultural resource recovery and chemical synthesis.&lt;SEP&gt;Ammonium Sulfate is a chemical compound produced during the conversion process of phosphogypsum, involving radionuclide flow studies.&lt;SEP&gt;A chemical solution used in hot aqueous treatments to remove impurities from phosphogypsum.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-031&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-031&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-043&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-036&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2760dc2a11fedad02d24741a978cf20d-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2760dc2a11fedad02d24741a978cf20d-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2760dc2a11fedad02d24741a978cf20d-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2760dc2a11fedad02d24741a978cf20d-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2760dc2a11fedad02d24741a978cf20d-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-edfc4dcbd74cbf0b294f83f2034b209d-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-edfc4dcbd74cbf0b294f83f2034b209d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-35aef6efc801611130c5dd196fe513df-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-35aef6efc801611130c5dd196fe513df-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-35aef6efc801611130c5dd196fe513df-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-35aef6efc801611130c5dd196fe513df-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-35aef6efc801611130c5dd196fe513df-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-176fa906dd9c8409d2d1c49b8bdf9948-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-176fa906dd9c8409d2d1c49b8bdf9948-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-176fa906dd9c8409d2d1c49b8bdf9948-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-176fa906dd9c8409d2d1c49b8bdf9948-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-001</data>
