<node id="K-feldspar">
  <data key="d0">K-feldspar</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">K-feldspar is a mineral that co-reacts with phosphogypsum to extract soluble potassium salts.&lt;SEP&gt;K-feldspar is a mineral that co-reacts with phosphogypsum to extract soluble potassium salts.&lt;SEP&gt;K-feldspar is a mineral that co-reacts with phosphogypsum to extract soluble potassium salts.&lt;SEP&gt;K-feldspar is a mineral with extensive global reserves that serves as a secure source of potassium.</data>
