  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Saline alkali soil is a type of degraded land that can be treated and improved using harmless phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Saline alkali soil is a type of degraded land that can be treated and improved using harmless phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Saline alkali soil is a type of degraded land that can be treated and improved using harmless phosphogypsum.</data>
