<node id="Hydration–Recrystallization Process">
  <data key="d0">Hydration–Recrystallization Process</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Hydration–Recrystallization Process is a novel industrial technique used to convert waste phosphogypsum into non-fired bricks.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydration–Recrystallization Process is a novel industrial technique used to convert waste phosphogypsum into non-fired bricks.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydration–Recrystallization Process is a novel industrial technique used to convert waste phosphogypsum into non-fired bricks.</data>
