<node id="Two-step Hydration Process">
  <data key="d0">Two-step Hydration Process</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Two-step Hydration Process is a cement-free preparation method utilized to produce bricks from phosphogypsum waste.&lt;SEP&gt;Two-step Hydration Process is a cement-free preparation method utilized to produce bricks from phosphogypsum waste.&lt;SEP&gt;Two-step Hydration Process is a cement-free preparation method utilized to produce bricks from phosphogypsum waste.&lt;SEP&gt;An innovative process presented by Zhou et al. to manufacture non-fired bricks without cement.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-014</data>
