<node id="Hardened Tiles">
  <data key="d0">Hardened Tiles</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Hardened Tiles are ceramic building materials manufactured from phosphogypsum using an intermittent pressing hydration technique.&lt;SEP&gt;Hardened Tiles are ceramic building materials manufactured from phosphogypsum using an intermittent pressing hydration technique.&lt;SEP&gt;Hardened Tiles are ceramic building materials manufactured from phosphogypsum using an intermittent pressing hydration technique.</data>
