<node id="Plasterboard">
  <data key="d0">Plasterboard</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Plasterboard is a high-strength, fiber-free building material produced using phosphogypsum as a primary component.&lt;SEP&gt;Plasterboard is a high-strength, fiber-free building material produced using phosphogypsum as a primary component.&lt;SEP&gt;A building material whose development and application utilize phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Plasterboard is a high-strength, fiber-free building material produced using phosphogypsum as a primary component.&lt;SEP&gt;Plasterboard is a construction material that can utilize phosphogypsum as a substitute for natural gypsum.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-030</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
