<node id="Intermittent Pressing Hydration">
  <data key="d0">Intermittent Pressing Hydration</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Intermittent Pressing Hydration is a novel technique applied to manufacture hardened tiles from phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Intermittent Pressing Hydration is a novel technique applied to manufacture hardened tiles from phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Intermittent Pressing Hydration is a novel technique applied to manufacture hardened tiles from phosphogypsum.</data>
