<node id="Hydrothermal treatment">
  <data key="d0">Hydrothermal treatment</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Hydrothermal treatment is a process used to regulate gypsum crystals for heavy metal extraction.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydrothermal treatment is a process used to regulate gypsum crystals for heavy metal extraction.&lt;SEP&gt;A processing method coupled with micro-arc oxidation to modify material surfaces.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydrothermal treatment is a process used to regulate gypsum crystals for heavy metal extraction.</data>
