  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">J. CO2 Util. is a scientific journal publishing research on CO2 capture using phosphogypsum decomposition products.&lt;SEP&gt;J. CO2 Util. is a scientific journal publishing research on CO2 capture using phosphogypsum decomposition products.&lt;SEP&gt;J. CO2 Util. is a scientific journal that published research on CO capture using phosphogypsum hydrolysate.&lt;SEP&gt;J. CO2 Util. is a scientific journal publishing research on CO2 capture using phosphogypsum decomposition products.&lt;SEP&gt;J. CO2 Util. published a study on a new method for carbon dioxide mineralization using phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;J. CO2 Util. is the journal that published studies on CO2 capture and phosphogypsum carbonation.</data>
