<node id="Cemented paste backfill">
  <data key="d0">Cemented paste backfill</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Cemented paste backfill is a construction material prepared using recycled flue gas desulfurisation gypsum and phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Cemented paste backfill is a construction material prepared using recycled flue gas desulfurisation gypsum and phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Cemented paste backfill is a solid waste remediation technology that uses phosphogypsum as an alternative aggregate.&lt;SEP&gt;Cemented paste backfill is a construction material prepared using recycled flue gas desulfurisation gypsum and phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Cemented paste backfill is a construction application utilizing recycled phosphogypsum and demolition waste.&lt;SEP&gt;Cemented paste backfill is an application utilizing phosphogypsum and phosphate tailings in mining or construction.&lt;SEP&gt;Cemented paste backfill is an application utilizing phosphogypsum and phosphate tailings in mining or construction.</data>
