  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">A product formed from the decomposition of calcium aluminum hydroxide, also known as gibbsite.&lt;SEP&gt;A chemical compound produced alongside calcium hydroxide during decomposition.&lt;SEP&gt;Aluminum Hydroxide is a product represented as two moles in the first reaction, often found in nature as Gibbsite.</data>
