<node id="Salt Marshes">
  <data key="d0">Salt Marshes</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Salt marshes are coastal ecosystems where phosphogypsum application creates a barrier effect against radionuclide migration.&lt;SEP&gt;Salt marshes are coastal ecosystems where phosphogypsum application creates a barrier effect against radionuclide migration.&lt;SEP&gt;Salt marshes are coastal ecosystems where phosphogypsum application creates a barrier effect against radionuclide migration.&lt;SEP&gt;Salt marshes are coastal ecosystems where the radioactive impact of phosphogypsum piles was evaluated.&lt;SEP&gt;Salt marshes are coastal wetland ecosystems in Huelva, Spain, where phosphogypsum stacks are situated.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-035&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-004</data>
