  <data key="d2">Environmental functional materials represent a primary application pathway for phosphogypsum resource utilization.&lt;SEP&gt;Environmental functional materials represent a broad application category for phosphogypsum, including adsorbents and sound absorbers.&lt;SEP&gt;Environmental functional materials represent a primary application pathway for phosphogypsum resource utilization.&lt;SEP&gt;Environmental functional materials represent a broad application category for phosphogypsum, including adsorbents and sound absorbers.&lt;SEP&gt;Environmental functional materials represent a primary application pathway for phosphogypsum resource utilization.&lt;SEP&gt;Environmental functional materials represent a broad application category for phosphogypsum, including adsorbents and sound absorbers.&lt;SEP&gt;Environmental functional materials are specialized products developed using phosphogypsum for ecological purposes.</data>
