  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Poultry manure is an organic amendment applied alongside phosphogypsum to modify the alkaline characteristics of bauxite residue.&lt;SEP&gt;Poultry Manure is used alongside phosphogypsum to modify the alkaline characteristics of bauxite residue.&lt;SEP&gt;Poultry manure is an organic amendment applied alongside phosphogypsum to modify the alkaline characteristics of bauxite residue.&lt;SEP&gt;Poultry Manure is used alongside phosphogypsum to modify the alkaline characteristics of bauxite residue.&lt;SEP&gt;Poultry manure is an organic amendment applied alongside phosphogypsum to modify the alkaline characteristics of bauxite residue.&lt;SEP&gt;Poultry Manure is used alongside phosphogypsum to modify the alkaline characteristics of bauxite residue.&lt;SEP&gt;Poultry manure is an organic material combined with phosphogypsum to enhance soil fertility and biodiversity in agricultural settings.</data>
