<node id="Greenhouse gas emissions">
  <data key="d0">Greenhouse gas emissions</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Greenhouse gas emissions are atmospheric pollutants that industrial wastes like phosphogypsum may help mitigate in agricultural settings.&lt;SEP&gt;Greenhouse gas emissions are atmospheric pollutants that industrial wastes like phosphogypsum may help mitigate in agricultural settings.&lt;SEP&gt;Greenhouse gas emissions are environmental pollutants that industrial byproducts like fly ash and steel slag aim to reduce in agricultural settings.&lt;SEP&gt;Greenhouse gas emissions are atmospheric pollutants that industrial wastes like phosphogypsum may help mitigate in agricultural settings.&lt;SEP&gt;Greenhouse gas emissions are environmental pollutants that industrial byproducts like fly ash and steel slag aim to reduce in agricultural settings.</data>
