<node id="Construction Industry">
  <data key="d0">Construction Industry</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The construction industry drives the increasing demand for building materials, prompting the exploration of phosphogypsum as a sustainable substitute.&lt;SEP&gt;The construction industry drives the increasing demand for building materials, prompting the exploration of phosphogypsum as a sustainable substitute.&lt;SEP&gt;The construction industry drives the increasing demand for building materials, prompting the exploration of phosphogypsum as a sustainable substitute.&lt;SEP&gt;The construction industry is a major consumer of phosphogypsum, utilizing it in materials like plates, hollow blocks, walls, and bricks.&lt;SEP&gt;The construction industry is a key sector for collaboration to utilize phosphogypsum in building materials.&lt;SEP&gt;The construction industry is a major sector driving the demand for gypsum products and the shift toward by-product alternatives.&lt;SEP&gt;The primary sector utilizing phosphogypsum-based materials for applications like flooring tiles and hollow blocks.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-011</data>
