  <data key="d2">The two-step hydration process is the underlying mechanism for the formation of burn-free bricks and gypsum blocks.&lt;SEP&gt;The two-step hydration process is the underlying mechanism for the formation of burn-free bricks and gypsum blocks.&lt;SEP&gt;The two-step hydration process is the underlying mechanism for the formation of burn-free bricks and gypsum blocks.&lt;SEP&gt;Two-Step Hydration Process is an alternative method for synthesizing cement-free non-fired bricks from waste phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Two-step hydration process is a novel method for preparing cement-free non-fired bricks from waste phosphogypsum.</data>
