<node id="Thorium">
  <data key="d0">Thorium</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Thorium is a naturally occurring radioactive chemical element and radionuclide that primarily exists in the +4 oxidation state and occurs predominantly as the radioisotope Th-232. It is found as a trace component in phosphate rocks, phosphorites, and marketable rock phosphate, with concentrations in phosphorites comparable to those in shales, thereby contributing to the natural radioactivity of these geological formations. During industrial acid processing, particularly via sulfuric acid and wet phosphoric acid methods, thorium is mobilized in a polymeric colloidal form before converting into a soluble sulfate. Approximately 70 to 85 percent of its isotopes are retained in the phosphoric acid stream, while the remainder accumulates in phosphogypsum, where it is essentially located in the residual phase.

Within phosphogypsum, thorium acts as a radioactive trace heavy metal found alongside lead, with concentrations measured in parts per million across various sampled locations. It exhibits strong preferential retention in coarse and larger grain size fractions, localizing more heavily than radium, and is also detected in significant concentrations within the fluorite phase. Thorium demonstrates high retention within the phosphogypsum matrix, often requiring full matrix dissolution for release. While it generally exhibits low mobility due to the formation of insoluble complexes with fluorides, hydroxides, and phosphates, it is categorized as having intermediate mobility in phosphogypsum, with an increasing leaching rate over time. Its radioactivity levels in this byproduct are significantly higher than those of conventional building materials.

Analytical assessments frequently employ alpha-particle spectrometry to measure thorium alongside uranium-238 and radium. Its distribution and partitioning across phosphogypsum fractions are typically evaluated using the 228Th/228Ra activity ratio, with concentration data utilized in Ra-Eq calculations. Thorium is a key contributor to the Radioactivity Index and is referenced in worldwide activity concentration standards, underscoring its importance in environmental science and industrial waste management. Consequently, it necessitates careful handling protocols, and its presence can be mitigated through washing treatments.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-040&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-053&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28fbd4302bba090e667215c840757ff7-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-25198f8665e133385fd54e5a03e28a44-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-036&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-001</data>
