<node id="Carbon Neutralization">
  <data key="d0">Carbon Neutralization</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Carbon neutralization is an environmental strategy focused on balancing carbon emissions through industrial waste utilization.&lt;SEP&gt;Carbon neutralization is an environmental strategy focused on balancing carbon emissions through industrial waste utilization.&lt;SEP&gt;Carbon neutralization is an environmental strategy focused on balancing carbon emissions through industrial waste utilization.&lt;SEP&gt;Carbon neutralization is a policy or environmental goal shaping the development of gypsum building materials.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-029</data>
