<node id="Kumar, S.S.">
  <data key="d0">Kumar, S.S.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Kumar, S.S. is a lead author who researched the use of industrial wastes like phosphogypsum to mitigate greenhouse gas emissions.&lt;SEP&gt;Kumar, S.S. is a lead author of a 2020 study investigating industrial wastes to mitigate greenhouse gas emissions.&lt;SEP&gt;Kumar, S.S. is a lead author of a 2020 study investigating industrial wastes to mitigate greenhouse gas emissions.</data>
