<node id="Kuryatnyk, T.">
  <data key="d0">Kuryatnyk, T.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Kuryatnyk, T. is a researcher who explored the valorization of phosphogypsum as a hydraulic binder.&lt;SEP&gt;Kuryatnyk, T. is a lead author of a 2008 study on utilizing phosphogypsum as a hydraulic binder.&lt;SEP&gt;Kuryatnyk, T. is a lead author of a 2008 study on utilizing phosphogypsum as a hydraulic binder.</data>
