<node id="Lei, L.">
  <data key="d0">Lei, L.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Lei, L. is a researcher who studied microbial succession and ecological networks in response to phosphogypsum addition during swine manure composting.&lt;SEP&gt;Lei, L. is a lead author of a 2021 study examining microbial succession and ecological networks during swine manure composting with phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Lei, L. is a lead author of a 2021 study examining microbial succession and ecological networks during swine manure composting with phosphogypsum.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-018</data>
