<node id="Lieberman, R.N.">
  <data key="d0">Lieberman, R.N.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Lieberman, R.N. is a researcher who analyzed the geochemical evolution of brines from phosphogypsum deposits in Huelva, SW Spain.&lt;SEP&gt;Lieberman, R.N. is a lead author of a 2020 study analyzing the geochemical evolution of brines from phosphogypsum deposits.&lt;SEP&gt;Lieberman, R.N. is a lead author of a 2020 study analyzing the geochemical evolution of brines from phosphogypsum deposits.&lt;SEP&gt;Lieberman, R.N. is a lead author of a 2020 study on the geochemical evolution of brines from phosphogypsum deposits.</data>
