<node id="Lopez, F.I.A.">
  <data key="d0">Lopez, F.I.A.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Lopez, F.I.A. is a researcher who co-authored a 2011 study on the microencapsulation of phosphogypsum into a sulfur polymer matrix.&lt;SEP&gt;Lopez, F.I.A. is a researcher associated with the study of phosphogypsum deposits and their geochemical evolution.&lt;SEP&gt;Lopez, F.I.A. is a researcher who co-authored a 2011 study on the microencapsulation of phosphogypsum into a sulfur polymer matrix.&lt;SEP&gt;Lopez, F.I.A. is a researcher who co-authored a 2011 study on the microencapsulation of phosphogypsum into a sulfur polymer matrix.</data>
