<node id="Chemosphere">
  <data key="d0">Chemosphere</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Chemosphere is a peer-reviewed scientific journal dedicated to publishing original research and critical reviews in environmental chemistry, remediation, waste management, advanced chemical processes, and waste valorization. The publication serves as a comprehensive resource for addressing complex ecological and chemical challenges, with a notable emphasis on phosphogypsum waste. Research featured in the journal extensively examines the environmental impacts of phosphogypsum under redox oscillations, the mobility of natural radionuclides in disposal areas, and the leaching of rare earth elements. It also highlights advanced treatment methodologies, including cement-free in-situ remediation utilizing ground granulated blast furnace slag, highly efficient fluoride retention and solidification techniques, and comprehensive assessments of nanominerals and hazardous elements within the material.

Beyond phosphogypsum, Chemosphere covers a diverse range of environmental and chemical topics. Recent publications include a 2022 review on the environmental impact and health risks associated with phosphogypsum nanoparticles, alongside a 2023 study on cement-free remediation. The journal has also disseminated research on utilizing industrial wastes to mitigate greenhouse gas emissions, developing eco-friendly geopolymers from solid wastes, and analyzing the chemical behavior of fluorine and phosphorus during chemical looping gasification. Additional studies address fluorine transfer characteristics, the neurological impacts of chronic fluoride exposure, the dynamics of metals in phosphate mine backfill via sequential extraction, and the application of Corynebacterium Pollutisoli SPH6 in waste activated sludge fermentation. Furthermore, the journal has contributed to broader sustainability frameworks, such as a systems model for global phosphorus security and recovery options, as well as regional pollution evaluations like the 2019 assessment of salt-marshes in Huelva. Collectively, these publications underscore Chemosphere’s broad scope and commitment to advancing sustainable environmental and chemical solutions.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemosphere is an academic journal publishing research on environmental chemistry and ecology.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemosphere is a scientific journal publishing assessments of nanominerals and leaching processes involving phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemosphere is the academic journal that published the 2022 review on the environmental and health impacts of phosphogypsum.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e290dd6268316238694f70c30a367426-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-031&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-041&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-037&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-033&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-037&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-176fa906dd9c8409d2d1c49b8bdf9948-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1b5f95e85d7bfa3b7aab581f3c82b33-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-033&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-033</data>
