<node id="J. Clean. Prod.">
  <data key="d0">J. Clean. Prod.</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Journal of Cleaner Production, commonly abbreviated as J. Clean. Prod., is a peer-reviewed academic and scientific journal dedicated to advancing research on clean production, environmental technologies, sustainable industrial practices, and circular economy solutions. Serving as a comprehensive platform for scientific inquiry into industrial sustainability and ecological stewardship, the publication regularly features critical analyses, reviews, and empirical studies addressing waste stream management, resource recovery, sustainable manufacturing, and environmental remediation.

A central and extensively covered theme within the journal is the valorization, stabilization, and utilization of industrial residues, with a particular emphasis on phosphogypsum. The publication has featured numerous studies evaluating phosphogypsum waste management methods, including a notable 2020 comparative analysis, alongside research on the sustainability of its reuse processes. Investigations detailed in the journal explore the immobilization, environmental impacts, and diverse applications of phosphogypsum, such as its integration into road and asphalt materials, construction backfill, cement composites, supersulfated cement, and cemented paste backfill. Specific technical approaches highlighted include the efficient precipitation of soluble phosphorus impurities, the co-preparation of cement and sulfuric acid, the immobilization of lime-neutralized phosphogypsum, and the use of modified quartz sand for phosphate pollution control in backfill applications.

Beyond phosphogypsum, the journal encompasses a broad spectrum of sustainable material innovations and industrial by-product utilization. Its scope includes research on modifying granulated copper slag, recycling construction and demolition waste, utilizing biochar additives, and developing hydroxyapatite composites for efficient pollutant adsorption. The publication also examines advanced processing techniques such as carbon dioxide curing and mineral sequestration for calcium carbonate production, as well as flue gas desulfurization gypsum composites. Furthermore, J. Clean. Prod. addresses resource recovery challenges and opportunities, featuring studies on rare earth element leaching and recovery, tailings valorization, and fertilizer industry waste valorization. The journal also tackles practical implementation issues, such as barriers to smart waste management in China, and publishes reviews on balancing environmental and economic systems and transitioning to sustainable mining operations. Through these diverse contributions, the Journal of Cleaner Production continues to support global scientific efforts toward resource recovery and sustainable industrial development.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-051&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-037&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-035&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-050&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-045&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2760dc2a11fedad02d24741a978cf20d-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2760dc2a11fedad02d24741a978cf20d-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-034&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-039&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-035&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-037&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-036&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-176fa906dd9c8409d2d1c49b8bdf9948-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-033&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-031&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-033&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-034&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-024</data>
