  <data key="d2">Zhengzhou University is the academic institution affiliated with Liu Ying's research on phosphorus chemical industry evaluation.&lt;SEP&gt;Zhengzhou University is the academic institution where research on the economic evaluation of the phosphorus chemical industry was conducted.&lt;SEP&gt;Zhengzhou University is the academic institution where research on the economic evaluation of the phosphorus chemical industry was conducted.&lt;SEP&gt;Zhengzhou University is the academic institution affiliated with the corresponding and contributing authors.</data>
