<node id="Serbia">
  <data key="d0">Serbia</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Serbia is a geographic location where phosphogypsum production and radiological characterization were studied.&lt;SEP&gt;Serbia is a country where phosphogypsum production and its radiological characteristics have been scientifically characterized.&lt;SEP&gt;Serbia is a country where phosphogypsum production and its radiological characteristics have been scientifically characterized.&lt;SEP&gt;Serbia is a location where phosphogypsum is radiologically characterized for environmental monitoring.&lt;SEP&gt;Serbia is a country that produces phosphogypsum, contributing to worldwide production statistics.&lt;SEP&gt;Serbia is a country where the radiological characterization of phosphogypsum was conducted.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-021</data>
