<node id="Huelva">
  <data key="d0">Huelva</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Huelva is a city and coastal region situated in southwestern Spain, historically defined by a major industrial complex focused on phosphate processing, phosphoric acid production, and fertilizer manufacturing. This extensive industrial activity has led to the creation and accumulation of large phosphogypsum deposits and stacks, which are central to ongoing environmental and geochemical investigations in the area.

The phosphogypsum waste undergoes significant geochemical evolution that directly influences the composition of associated brines. Deep leachates generated from these phosphogypsum stacks contribute to pollution within local salt marshes, while the accumulated material within these marshes has been linked to elevated regional radiation levels. Additionally, the coastal environment of Huelva features superficial sediments whose composition and controlling factors have been extensively statistically analyzed.

Research in Huelva heavily emphasizes phosphogypsum waste management, brine geochemistry, and sediment dynamics. Studies also evaluate the radiological impacts of phosphogypsum piles, including radon exhalation rates, to better understand the environmental consequences of phosphate industry operations. Consequently, Huelva serves as a critical site for assessing the long-term ecological and radiological effects of industrial phosphogypsum disposal.&lt;SEP&gt;A region in southwestern Spain where fugitive phosphogypsum particles have been geochemically analyzed.&lt;SEP&gt;Huelva is a coastal region in Spain where phosphogypsum stacks are located on salt marshes.&lt;SEP&gt;Huelva is a region in Spain where the Tinto and Odiel estuary is located.&lt;SEP&gt;Huelva is a location in Spain where phosphogypsum ponds and cesium-137 disposal sites were subject to radiological control.&lt;SEP&gt;A region in southwestern Spain where phosphoric acid production and phosphogypsum waste generation occur.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-041&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-035&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-044&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-049&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-038&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-045&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-004</data>
