<node id="SW Spain">
  <data key="d0">SW Spain</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">SW Spain is a geographic region in southwestern Spain that broadly encompasses the coastal area of Huelva. It serves as a significant industrial and environmental research zone, primarily due to the presence of phosphoric acid factories that process phosphate rock and generate phosphogypsum as a byproduct. Consequently, the region hosts extensive phosphogypsum deposits and stacks, which have been the subject of detailed scientific investigations, including a notable 2009 study that extensively characterized the radioactivity of these stacks.

The area is frequently studied for environmental contamination, particularly concerning phosphogypsum disposal practices and estuarine dynamics. Research in SW Spain has extensively evaluated how phosphogypsum-amended soils affect agricultural systems, specifically focusing on trace-element uptake by crops and the ecological impacts of such amendments on reclaimed marsh soils. Additionally, sediment studies have been conducted along the Huelva coast to monitor environmental changes. Overall, SW Spain functions as a critical geographic and scientific focal point for understanding the environmental, agricultural, and geochemical implications of phosphogypsum management and coastal ecosystem dynamics.&lt;SEP&gt;A geographic region where a phosphogypsum stack was extensively characterized for radioactive elements.&lt;SEP&gt;SW Spain is a region where phosphate rock and phosphogypsum from phosphoric acid factories have been characterized.&lt;SEP&gt;SW Spain is a geographic region where phosphate rock and phosphogypsum from phosphoric acid factories were characterized.&lt;SEP&gt;SW Spain is the location of a phosphogypsum-amended soil studied for its implications on trace-element uptake by tomatoes.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-042&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-043&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-035&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-050&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-049&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80e3f6300e001922a5ca2a6a8ac2e0d2-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-25198f8665e133385fd54e5a03e28a44-chunk-016</data>
