<node id="Cemented Paste Backfill">
  <data key="d0">Cemented Paste Backfill</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Cemented Paste Backfill is a specialized construction and mining technique primarily engineered for underground structural support, in-situ waste management, and environmental remediation. Functioning as a cost-effective and scalable solution, it balances technical feasibility with economic rationality, making it highly suitable for large-scale industrial applications. The material is fundamentally utilized to fill excavated mine voids and goafs, manage mine tailings, and immobilize phosphogypsum, a solid byproduct generated during phosphate fertilizer production. By integrating this industrial waste stream into a cohesive construction medium, often alongside slag and other composite industrial wastes, the technique effectively manages phosphogypsum stockpiles while advancing sustainable resource management and waste valorization practices.

The formulation and performance of Cemented Paste Backfill heavily depend on the processing and integration of phosphogypsum, which serves as a primary aggregate. The phosphogypsum is utilized in various states, including immobilized, water-washed, pre-treated, and purified forms. Water-washing and pre-treatment processes are specifically employed to enhance the mixture's functional and mechanical characteristics, such as compressive strength, workability, and acid resistance. To further optimize these properties alongside retention capacity, cementitious binders, mineral materials, water, and specialized additives are systematically incorporated to create a stable filling slurry. This engineered matrix ensures robust structural integrity while effectively sequestering hazardous components, including toxic elements, phosphorus, and fluorine, thereby requiring careful management of fluorine immobilization to prevent environmental contamination.

Beyond its geotechnical applications, Cemented Paste Backfill serves as a critical environmental technology that retains pollutants and contributes to reduced CO emissions. It provides a dual-purpose utility by simultaneously stabilizing hazardous industrial waste and delivering reliable underground support to suppress collapse. Consequently, this technique represents a comprehensive engineering solution that successfully merges practical geotechnical requirements with advanced environmental remediation and industrial waste management strategies.&lt;SEP&gt;Mining backfill material whose performance is enhanced by citric acid pre-treated phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;A construction technique involving the immobilization of materials like phosphogypsum using cementitious binders.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-031&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-034&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-033&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-039&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-035&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-038&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-036&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-028</data>
