<node id="Waste Gypsum">
  <data key="d0">Waste Gypsum</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Waste gypsum is a solid waste material that can be used to treat industrial carbon dioxide for resource utilization and carbon emission reduction.&lt;SEP&gt;Waste gypsum is a solid waste material that can be used to treat industrial carbon dioxide for resource utilization and carbon emission reduction.&lt;SEP&gt;Waste gypsum is a solid waste material that can be used to treat industrial carbon dioxide for resource utilization and carbon emission reduction.&lt;SEP&gt;Waste gypsum is an industrial waste used as a raw material for CO2 carbonation.&lt;SEP&gt;Waste gypsum is a material studied for environment hazard mitigation and use in construction.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80e3f6300e001922a5ca2a6a8ac2e0d2-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-017</data>
