  <data key="d2">Industrial carbon dioxide is a component of tail gas that can be treated using waste gypsum for resource utilization.&lt;SEP&gt;Industrial carbon dioxide is a component of tail gas that can be treated using waste gypsum for resource utilization.&lt;SEP&gt;Industrial carbon dioxide is a component of tail gas that can be treated using waste gypsum for resource utilization.</data>
