<node id="Green Water And Green Mountains Are Golden Mountains And Silver Mountains">
  <data key="d0">Green Water And Green Mountains Are Golden Mountains And Silver Mountains</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">This concept emphasizes the economic and social value of environmental protection and is deeply practiced through waste gypsum utilization.&lt;SEP&gt;This concept emphasizes the economic and social value of environmental protection and is deeply practiced through waste gypsum utilization.&lt;SEP&gt;This concept emphasizes the economic and social value of environmental protection and is deeply practiced through waste gypsum utilization.</data>
