<node id="Leaching">
  <data key="d0">Leaching</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Leaching is a chemical and physical extraction process fundamentally characterized by the dissolution and migration of soluble substances from a solid matrix into a liquid phase. In industrial and hydrometallurgical contexts, it functions as a controlled separation methodology primarily employed to recover valuable materials, particularly rare earth elements, lanthanides, and trace components, from solid byproducts such as phosphogypsum, fertilizers, municipal solid waste incineration ash, and filling bodies. This targeted extraction typically utilizes dilute mineral or organic acids, aqueous solutions, salts, or organic solvents, with process efficiency heavily dependent on variables such as temperature, time, and reagent composition. The technique can occasionally be integrated with sintering to optimize metal recovery, though it may also inadvertently dissolve impurities originating from crystal structure substitutions in phosphate ore, introducing operational complexities and potential environmental risks during downstream product generation.

In environmental and geochemical applications, Leaching serves as a critical assessment method to evaluate the release, mobility, and fractionation of contaminants, radionuclides, and hazardous constituents from raw phosphogypsum and other solid matrices into adjacent media. Analytical studies utilizing both destructive and non-destructive techniques reveal that while certain metals exhibit high fractionation, rare earth elements often demonstrate low mobility even at elevated temperatures, whereas compounds like sodium and fluorine readily migrate. Beyond its engineered utility, Leaching also denotes the natural or anthropogenically influenced subsurface transport mechanism where water infiltration drives the downward movement of dissolved geochemical species through soil and groundwater systems into underlying water bodies. Collectively, these dimensions establish Leaching as both a precise, solvent-mediated strategy for critical resource recovery and a fundamental hydrological process governing the environmental fate of dissolved pollutants.&lt;SEP&gt;Leaching is an environmental pathway through which PG enters the ecosystem.&lt;SEP&gt;Leaching is a process through which PG and heavy metals are transferred into the environment.&lt;SEP&gt;Leaching is a treatment method applied to phosphogypsum to extract and remove specific impurities.&lt;SEP&gt;Leaching is a process used to extract soluble metals and radionuclides from phosphogypsum using water or acids.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-035&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-045&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-edfc4dcbd74cbf0b294f83f2034b209d-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28fbd4302bba090e667215c840757ff7-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28fbd4302bba090e667215c840757ff7-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28fbd4302bba090e667215c840757ff7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28fbd4302bba090e667215c840757ff7-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-01