<node id="α-Hemihydrate Gypsum">
  <data key="d0">α-Hemihydrate Gypsum</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">α-Hemihydrate gypsum is a processed form of phosphogypsum prepared for use in construction materials and sound absorbing applications.&lt;SEP&gt;α-Hemihydrate gypsum is a processed form of phosphogypsum prepared for use in construction materials and sound absorbing applications.&lt;SEP&gt;α-Hemihydrate gypsum is a processed form of phosphogypsum prepared for use in construction materials and sound absorbing applications.&lt;SEP&gt;α-Hemihydrate gypsum is a processed material prepared from phosphogypsum, with its performance evaluated in recent studies.&lt;SEP&gt;α-Hemihydrate gypsum is a synthesized material derived from cleaner phosphogypsum processing.&lt;SEP&gt;A gypsum form characterized by regular hexagonal prisms, high strength, and excellent fluidity, suitable for reinforcement and mortar.&lt;SEP&gt;A processed form of gypsum prepared from phosphogypsum after impurity removal.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-98d8b2df45924e721bfa570f652f33e3-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-019</data>
