<node id="Rare Earths">
  <data key="d0">Rare Earths</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Rare Earths are a group of critical and valuable chemical elements, frequently referenced as minerals, that are indispensable for a wide range of high-tech and industrial applications. Their strategic and economic importance has firmly established them as critical materials, driving extensive analysis of market dynamics and supply chain vulnerabilities. A prominent 2021 research study specifically modeled potential disruptions to the global supply of Rare Earths, highlighting the critical need for diversified sourcing and resilient supply chain management to mitigate future shortages.

To secure these resources while reducing reliance on traditional mining, significant recovery efforts are directed toward industrial byproducts, particularly phosphogypsum waste, including deposits located in the Philippines. Specialized extraction techniques are actively employed to target Rare Earths from these complex mixtures, utilizing methods such as hydrothermal conversion, direct and indirect leaching, fractional precipitation, and specific chemical extractants for simultaneous separation. Additionally, recovery processes are being optimized for wet process phosphoric acid. The concentrations of Rare Earths in various materials are typically quantified in parts per million (ppm). By advancing these recovery and processing methodologies, the industry aims to maximize resource utilization, minimize the extraction of primary ores, and ensure a sustainable, economically viable supply chain.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-041&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-048&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-047&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-031&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-019</data>
