<node id="Calcination Modification">
  <data key="d0">Calcination Modification</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Calcination modification is a treatment process applied to phosphogypsum to alter its properties for cement applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Calcination modification is a treatment process applied to phosphogypsum to alter its properties for cement applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Calcination modification is a treatment process applied to phosphogypsum to alter its properties for cement applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Calcination modification is a thermal process used to alter the properties of phosphogypsum for cement applications.</data>
