<node id="Microencapsulation">
  <data key="d0">Microencapsulation</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Microencapsulation is a technique used to embed phosphogypsum within a sulfur polymer matrix for characterization.&lt;SEP&gt;Microencapsulation is a technique used to embed phosphogypsum within a sulfur polymer matrix for characterization.&lt;SEP&gt;Microencapsulation is a technique used to embed phosphogypsum within a sulfur polymer matrix for characterization.&lt;SEP&gt;Microencapsulation is a stabilization technique used to encapsulate phosphogypsum within a sulfur polymer matrix to improve its physico-chemical and radiological safety.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-018</data>
