<node id="Mater. Res. Bull.">
  <data key="d0">Mater. Res. Bull.</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Mater. Res. Bull. is a scientific journal that has published research across various materials science topics. Notably, it has featured studies on the fabrication of nanostructured biphasic materials derived from phosphogypsum. Additionally, the journal published a 2009 study focusing on titania/hydroxyapatite composite granules. It has also disseminated research concerning alendronate functionalized hydroxyapatite nanoparticles.

Through these diverse publications, Mater. Res. Bull. serves as a dedicated platform for advancing knowledge in advanced material synthesis, composite development, and functionalized nanoparticle research. The journal continues to document scientific advancements in these specialized areas of materials engineering.&lt;SEP&gt;A materials research journal that published the 2013 article on synthesizing hydroxyapatite and ammonium sulfate from phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Mater. Res. Bull. is a scientific journal that published research on hydroxyapatite synthesis from phosphogypsum waste.&lt;SEP&gt;Materials Research Bulletin is the journal that published the 2018 study on copper-substituted hydroxyapatite.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2760dc2a11fedad02d24741a978cf20d-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-020</data>
