<node id="Ion-Exchange Resins">
  <data key="d0">Ion-Exchange Resins</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Ion-exchange resins are materials investigated for the systematic recovery of rare earth elements from phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Ion-exchange resins are materials investigated for the systematic recovery of rare earth elements from phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Ion-exchange resins are materials investigated for the systematic recovery of rare earth elements from phosphogypsum.</data>
