<node id="Yang et al.">
  <data key="d0">Yang et al.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Yang et al. are a research group recognized for their multifaceted contributions to energy conversion and materials science, with a particular focus on the industrial application of phosphogypsum. In the domain of syngas production, they have extensively investigated the use of phosphogypsum as an oxygen carrier. Their work encompasses proposing the direct generation of syngas through chemical looping gasification of lignite, utilizing phosphogypsum-based materials and specifically high-silicon phosphogypsum variants as oxygen carriers. These studies highlight their efforts to optimize syngas yield and process efficiency through advanced gasification methodologies.

In addition to their energy research, Yang et al. have made significant contributions to construction materials and structural analysis. They have systematically illustrated the influence of phosphogypsum concentration on the compressive strength of concrete, identifying an optimal performance threshold at 10%. Furthermore, their experimental data has been actively cited in the X-ray diffraction (XRD) analysis of concrete samples, underscoring the relevance of their findings in characterizing material composition and validating structural properties. Together, these efforts demonstrate the broad scientific impact of their work across both chemical engineering and civil materials disciplines.&lt;SEP&gt;Yang et al. formulated a self-leveling mortar mixture containing phosphogypsum and natural sand at specific ratios.&lt;SEP&gt;Yang et al. autoclaved PG and mixed it with fly ash, lime, and sand to manufacture bricks, noting strength decline with higher PG content.&lt;SEP&gt;Yang et al. are researchers who investigated the effects of PG on abrasion resistance and freeze-thaw resistance.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-009</data>
