<node id="Carbon Monoxide">
  <data key="d0">Carbon Monoxide</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Carbon Monoxide is a hazardous gaseous chemical compound that serves as a significant byproduct and intermediate across various industrial and chemical reduction processes. It is generated during the gasification and conversion of lignite, a process notably promoted by released oxygen, as well as through the reduction and decomposition of PG and the mixing of CPGFM slurry containing yellow phosphorus slag. Additionally, Carbon Monoxide forms as a gaseous byproduct of carbothermal reduction, high-temperature reduction processes, and general reduction reactions involving carbon and oxygen. In these contexts, it frequently acts as a gaseous intermediate and a secondary reducing agent that actively participates in the reduction process, including the carbon reduction of calcium sulfate and its subsequent regeneration.

Beyond its role in reduction chemistry, Carbon Monoxide is a key gaseous component in analytical and thermodynamic studies, where it is frequently measured within the H2/CO ratio and featured prominently in ternary phase diagrams. It is also utilized industrially to prepare syngas. Due to its classification as an environmental pollutant, effective elimination strategies are essential. Current research and applications target the oxidation of Carbon Monoxide at room and low temperatures using specialized catalytic systems. These systems frequently employ hydroxyapatite-supported catalysts, including gold nanoparticle catalysts and Au/FeO-hydroxyapatite composites, which effectively facilitate the low-temperature oxidation and removal of the gas.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-039&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d5e4f0f96b4ad61d23685552d3211225-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d5e4f0f96b4ad61d23685552d3211225-chunk-009</data>
