<node id="Alkali-Activated Fly Ash">
  <data key="d0">Alkali-Activated Fly Ash</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Alkali-activated fly ash is a construction material matrix studied for its compatibility with phosphogypsum under thermal stress.&lt;SEP&gt;Alkali-activated fly ash is a construction material matrix studied for its compatibility with phosphogypsum under thermal stress.&lt;SEP&gt;Alkali-activated fly ash is a construction material matrix studied for its compatibility with phosphogypsum under thermal stress.&lt;SEP&gt;Alkali-activated fly ash is a construction material studied alongside phosphogypsum under elevated temperatures and thermal shock.</data>
