<node id="Journal of Cleaner Production">
  <data key="d0">Journal of Cleaner Production</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The Journal of Cleaner Production is a peer-reviewed academic and scientific publication dedicated to advancing research on sustainable production, environmental technologies, and sustainable industrial processes. It serves as a key platform for academic and industrial studies aimed at reducing environmental impacts, promoting resource efficiency, and addressing global food demand and yield potential. The journal maintains a strong focus on the circular economy and recycling of industrial byproducts, particularly phosphogypsum. It extensively publishes research detailing the utilization of phosphogypsum as a raw and construction material, its integration into cementitious and alkali-activated fly ash systems, and its application in sorption processes. Notable publications include studies on synthesizing gypsum from cleaner phosphogypsum sources and the 2020 research on treated phosphogypsum in cement production.

In the domain of resource recovery, the journal regularly disseminates investigations into the leaching and recycling of rare earth elements from phosphogypsum, including research published in 2018. It strongly supports comprehensive environmental evaluations by featuring life cycle assessments that analyze the sustainability and ecological footprints of these industrial materials and associated recovery methodologies. Beyond phosphogypsum applications, the publication has also featured multiple studies on the development of nanocomposites designed for toxic metal removal. Through its rigorous peer-review process and broad environmental scope, the Journal of Cleaner Production remains a vital resource for researchers and practitioners focused on cleaner production techniques and ecological sustainability.&lt;SEP&gt;A publication that reviewed the expected transition to a balanced interplay of environmental and economic systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Journal of Cleaner Production is a scientific journal that published research on phosphogypsum and resource efficiency.&lt;SEP&gt;Academic journal where the manuscript is set to appear.&lt;SEP&gt;A peer-reviewed academic journal that has published multiple studies on the utilization of phosphogypsum and industrial byproducts in construction.&lt;SEP&gt;A peer-reviewed journal that published a 2016 study on phosphogypsum utilization.&lt;SEP&gt;A scientific journal whose cover features a natural landscape and a special issue on Phosphogypsum.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-176fa906dd9c8409d2d1c49b8bdf9948-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-032&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-000</data>
