<node id="Science of the Total Environment">
  <data key="d0">Science of the Total Environment</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Science of the Total Environment is an academic journal and publisher that disseminates research across a diverse range of environmental and ecological topics. The publication serves as a key resource for scientific studies focusing on pollution dynamics, material stabilization, and agricultural impacts.

Specific research featured in the journal includes investigations into pollutant flows originating from phosphogypsum disposal areas, alongside studies on heavy metal stabilization techniques utilizing phosphogypsum-steel slag cement. The journal has also published findings regarding the effects of irrigation on heavy metal accumulation in rice fields. Furthermore, its scope encompasses atmospheric and material science research, including documented analyses of airborne particulate matter from 2017 and a 2021 study concerning molybdenum solidification through the use of synthetic C-S-H.&lt;SEP&gt;Science of the Total Environment is a scientific journal that published studies on phosphogypsum by-products and environmental impacts.&lt;SEP&gt;Science of the Total Environment is a journal that published research on radioactivity levels in aerosol particles near TENORM waste repositories.&lt;SEP&gt;A scientific journal that published multiple studies on the environmental impacts and radionuclide distribution in phosphogypsum.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-032&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-015</data>
