</node>
<node id="Elsevier">
  <data key="d0">Elsevier</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Elsevier is a prominent academic and scientific publishing organization and the parent company of the Academic Press imprint. Operating as both a traditional publishing house and a major digital journal platform, it distributes a wide array of scholarly works across diverse scientific disciplines. Its extensive catalog encompasses foundational texts on apatite chemistry, specialized technical volumes such as Hydrometallurgy of Rare Earths, and publications addressing sustainability, including a 2020 work on sustainable remediation, a chapter on sustainable remediation using low-carbon cement, and the chapter Advanced bioceramics within Advances in Biological Science Research. The organization also publishes prominent academic journals, notably the Journal of Environmental Radioactivity.

Beyond content distribution, Elsevier actively manages intellectual property and distribution rights for numerous specialized scientific studies. It holds copyrights for environmental research, particularly studies focusing on the valorization of phosphogypsum in construction materials and phosphogypsum preparation. As the official publisher, Elsevier grants reprint permissions for these works, as well as for specific reprinted materials such as Figure 13. To facilitate scholarly communication and content verification, its digital academic journal website hosting platform incorporates several user interface features. These include a Check for Updates function, typically displayed as a UI icon, and a ribbon bookmark element designed to help researchers track revisions and updates to published papers. Additionally, Elsevier utilizes the CrossMark service and logo across its scientific articles to ensure document verification and maintain the integrity of published research.&lt;SEP&gt;Elsevier is the publisher of Neuman's reference module on soil organic matter maintenance.&lt;SEP&gt;Elsevier is a major academic publisher that released works on soil organic matter and environmental sciences.&lt;SEP&gt;The publisher represented by a small blue square logo in the top left corner of the journal cover.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-036&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2760dc2a11fedad02d24741a978cf20d-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54b92b2ad16a2528ff6a863329c5d403-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-176fa906dd9c8409d2d1c49b8bdf9948-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b81aeff540d385f1d1eda298b44619be-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b81aeff540d385f1d1eda298b44619be-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-25198f8665e133385fd54e5a03e28a44-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-25198f8665e133385fd54e5a03e28a44-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-026</data>
