  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Mohamed, K.R. is a researcher who co-authored a study on fabricating nanostructured biphasic materials from phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Mohamed, K.R. is a researcher who co-authored a study on fabricating nanostructured biphasic materials from phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Mohamed, K.R. is a researcher who co-authored a study on fabricating nanostructured biphasic materials from phosphogypsum.</data>
