<node id="Rashad, A.M.">
  <data key="d0">Rashad, A.M.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Rashad, A.M. is a researcher whose academic work primarily focuses on the industrial and construction applications of phosphogypsum. Throughout their research career, they have authored multiple studies dedicated to exploring the potential use of this byproduct within construction materials. Their contributions to the field emphasize the practical viability and technical considerations of integrating phosphogypsum into building and infrastructure projects.

A significant portion of their published work centers on a comprehensive 2017 publication that reviews and analyzes the various applications of phosphogypsum in construction. This study, along with their other related research, provides valuable insights into how phosphogypsum can be effectively utilized as a construction material, highlighting both its benefits and implementation strategies within the industry.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-036&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-032&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-031</data>
