<node id="Decomposition">
  <data key="d0">Decomposition</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Decomposition involves PG reacting with external additives to form precipitates and complexes.&lt;SEP&gt;Decomposition involves PG reacting with external additives to form precipitates and complexes.&lt;SEP&gt;Decomposition involves PG reacting with external additives to form precipitates and complexes.&lt;SEP&gt;Decomposition is a chemical reaction process of phosphogypsum that can be analyzed using thermal methods.</data>
