<node id="Hydroxide Precipitation">
  <data key="d0">Hydroxide Precipitation</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Hydroxide precipitation is a form of solidification that stabilizes toxic impurities from PG.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydroxide precipitation is a form of solidification that stabilizes toxic impurities from PG.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydroxide precipitation is a form of solidification that stabilizes toxic impurities from PG.&lt;SEP&gt;A phenomenon occurring at higher pH levels that complicates the accurate quantification of adsorption capacity.</data>
