<node id="Saadaoui, E.">
  <data key="d0">Saadaoui, E.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Saadaoui, E. is a researcher recognized for their scholarly contributions to the study of industrial byproducts. In 2017, Saadaoui, E. served as the lead author and co-author of a comprehensive review paper dedicated to phosphogypsum. This publication was developed to systematically evaluate the material's viability for broader industrial implementation.

The research extensively examines the potential applications and practical uses of phosphogypsum, while concurrently addressing the significant operational challenges and environmental problems associated with its production and utilization. Through this work, Saadaoui, E. has provided a critical analysis of how phosphogypsum can be effectively repurposed, highlighting both its industrial promise and the ecological considerations that must be managed.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-25198f8665e133385fd54e5a03e28a44-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-032</data>
