<node id="Calcium Sulfate Hemihydrate">
  <data key="d0">Calcium Sulfate Hemihydrate</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Calcium sulfate hemihydrate (CaSO₄·½H₂O) is a solid chemical compound and mineral phase that serves as a critical intermediate stage during the thermal dehydration of gypsum. It is commonly identified as a secondary component in phosphogypsum and forms when gypsum loses approximately three-quarters of its combined water, particularly during calcination or sodium carbonate treatment processes, where its concentration increases with higher temperatures and longer holding times. Structurally, the compound exhibits a layered crystal lattice composed of sulfate tetrahedra and calcium ions, crystallizing into polygonal aggregates of sheet- and plate-like formations. In experimental settings, it is frequently tracked in data tables and identified in MPG samples via a characteristic diffraction peak at 29.691°.

Chemically, calcium sulfate hemihydrate functions as a highly reactive precursor that dissolves in water to reach saturation, subsequently undergoing a hydration-driven phase transformation to crystallize into calcium sulfate dihydrate (gypsum). This hydration process generates a rigid skeleton structure that imparts strength to phosphogypsum hardened bodies. However, its dissolution and hydration kinetics may be impeded by the presence of soluble phosphorus, and the compound demonstrates a notably higher propensity to co-precipitate Radium-226 compared to its dihydrate counterpart. Beyond its role in cementitious applications and environmental chemistry, it is actively utilized in precipitation, drying, and heavy metal ion replacement processes.

In advanced materials and biomedical engineering, medicine-grade calcium sulfate hemihydrate plays a pivotal role in orthopedic surgery and tissue regeneration. When precisely blended with hydroxyapatite and sodium chloride, it forms a composite bone cement that facilitates structural repair. Additionally, it serves as the primary calcium source reactant in synthesis reactions aimed at producing hydroxyapatite. By bridging materials science, environmental chemistry, and medical engineering, the compound’s compositional versatility, hydration dynamics, and multifaceted industrial and clinical utility continue to drive ongoing research and practical implementation.&lt;SEP&gt;Calcium Sulfate Hemihydrate is a main component of phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Calcium Sulfate Hemihydrate is a primary chemical component found in phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Calcium sulfate hemihydrate is a form of calcium sulfate formed at slightly higher temperatures in the hemihydrate process.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c22d31cfad5421c936a23705a3bc6e0-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-031&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6825862084b162a4b16cd1037c76e3d7-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28fbd4302bba090e667215c840757ff7-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-035&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-036&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d5e4f0f96b4ad61d23685552d3211225-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d5e4f0f96b4ad61d23685552d3211225-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-005</data>
