<node id="Langmuir">
  <data key="d0">Langmuir</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Langmuir refers to two distinct entities: a scientific journal and a researcher. 

As a scientific journal, Langmuir specializes in surface chemistry and adsorption phenomena. It has published numerous studies on the transformation of calcium sulfate hemihydrate to gypsum. The journal also features extensive research on hydroxyapatite, including investigations into hydroxyapatite citrate interfacial structures, apatite nanofiber preparation, surface energetics, and molecular dynamics simulations. Furthermore, Langmuir published a 1998 FTIR study examining carbon dioxide adsorption on hydroxyapatite.

As a researcher, Langmuir is credited with identifying that radium forms solid solutions with elements such as barium and strontium.&lt;SEP&gt;Langmuir is a scientific journal publishing studies on zinc and magnesium doped hydroxyapatite nanoparticles for protein release.&lt;SEP&gt;Langmuir is a scientific journal covering studies on ZnO photocatalysts and graphene hybridization.&lt;SEP&gt;A scientific journal publishing surface and colloid science research.&lt;SEP&gt;Langmuir is a scientific journal covering studies on ZnO photocatalysts and graphene hybridization.&lt;SEP&gt;Langmuir is the researcher associated with the development of the Langmuir isotherm model.&lt;SEP&gt;Langmuir is a researcher who authored a foundational 1918 paper on gas adsorption on solid surfaces.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f2534f7a997df3f80305323317b15be9-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6825862084b162a4b16cd1037c76e3d7-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4739e42903c95e1fb7e0ecfbca3a12df-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-35aef6efc801611130c5dd196fe513df-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e992f3bad9db87c40308ea55e121bd8a-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e992f3bad9db87c40308ea55e121bd8a-chunk-012</data>
