</node>
<node id="Potassium Chloride">
  <data key="d0">Potassium Chloride</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Potassium chloride serves as a versatile chemical reagent and salt component across various industrial, analytical, and biomedical applications. In industrial chemical synthesis, it functions as a primary reactant in double decomposition reactions designed to produce potassium sulfate from phosphogypsum. It is similarly employed as a chloride salt reagent that reacts directly with gypsum to yield potassium sulfate. Additionally, potassium chloride acts as a reactant to convert sodium sulfate into glaserite, after which it is utilized as a solvent to facilitate the subsequent transformation of glaserite.

In biomedical and physiological research, potassium chloride is a critical reagent in the preparation of simulated body fluid, where it is specifically added to maintain proper ionic balance. Analytically, it is formulated as a chloride solution to investigate the solubility characteristics of phosphogypsum. Experimental studies have also examined potassium chloride as a solid salt component within chemical solutions at a precise concentration of 5.00 mmol L⁻¹. Furthermore, its behavior and reactivity have been extensively investigated at elevated concentrations, reaching up to 180 g L⁻¹ when dissolved in hydrochloric acid solutions.&lt;SEP&gt;Potassium Chloride is a reactant used in both one-step and two-step processes to synthesize potassium sulfate from PG.&lt;SEP&gt;Potassium Chloride is an inorganic salt dissolved to prepare a standard solution at 50 g/L.&lt;SEP&gt;Potassium chloride is a chemical component included in the experimental buffer mixture.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-60e237a0a1045feedf76d35d654a79bd-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b81aeff540d385f1d1eda298b44619be-chunk-002</data>
