<node id="Soil Conditioner">
  <data key="d0">Soil Conditioner</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">Soil conditioner is an agricultural product and amendment formulated from phosphogypsum (PG) to enhance soil quality and agricultural productivity. Primarily derived as a mature application product of phosphogypsum technology, it is specifically designed to improve the physical and chemical properties of soil, including its structure and fertility. By optimizing these soil characteristics, the conditioner effectively enhances overall crop yields, with documented applications specifically aimed at improving grape cultivation outcomes.

Despite its established agricultural benefits, the product currently yields low added value in industrial markets. Furthermore, it represents a minor but recognized segment of phosphogypsum management, accounting for approximately 2.3% of total phosphogypsum utilization.&lt;SEP&gt;Product derived from treated phosphogypsum used to remediate saline-alkali land.&lt;SEP&gt;Soil conditioner is an agricultural application for sulphate compounds.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28fbd4302bba090e667215c840757ff7-chunk-006</data>
