  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">High-strength gypsum is a specialized gypsum product prepared from phosphogypsum with enhanced structural properties.&lt;SEP&gt;High-strength gypsum is a specialized gypsum product prepared from phosphogypsum with enhanced structural properties.&lt;SEP&gt;High-Strength Gypsum is a construction material derived from phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;High-strength gypsum is a specialized gypsum product prepared from phosphogypsum with enhanced structural properties.</data>
