<node id="Agricultural Fertilizer">
  <data key="d0">Agricultural Fertilizer</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Agricultural fertilizer is a nutrient supplement prepared from phosphogypsum for agricultural use.&lt;SEP&gt;Agricultural fertilizer is a nutrient supplement prepared from phosphogypsum for agricultural use.&lt;SEP&gt;Agricultural fertilizer is a nutrient supplement prepared from phosphogypsum for agricultural use.&lt;SEP&gt;Agricultural fertilizer represents a phosphogypsum application for enhancing crop production, regulating soil pH, and mitigating salinization.</data>
