<node id="Resource Utilization">
  <data key="d0">Resource Utilization</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Resource Utilization refers to the systematic process of repurposing industrial waste, specifically phosphogypsum, into valuable and useful materials. This practice functions as both an economic and environmental strategy aimed at the efficient, large-scale application of phosphogypsum. Its core objectives encompass the development and deployment of phosphogypsum-based materials in civil engineering, addressing broader environmental challenges, and mitigating ecological risks such as excessive land occupation. Recognized as a key focus of contemporary research, Resource Utilization emphasizes the transformation of industrial byproducts into sustainable, high-value commodities.

Despite its substantial potential, the widespread implementation of this process is currently hindered by technical constraints. The conversion of phosphogypsum into commercial products is largely restricted by the material's inherent impurities and complex morphology. Consequently, ongoing research initiatives are directed toward overcoming these physical and chemical barriers, with the ultimate goal of fully realizing the economic and environmental benefits of repurposing phosphogypsum on an industrial scale.&lt;SEP&gt;Resource Utilization is the process of converting phosphogypsum into valuable gypsum resources for various applications to address environmental issues.&lt;SEP&gt;Resource utilization refers to the beneficial reuse of phosphogypsum, promoted by improved purification processes.&lt;SEP&gt;Resource utilization refers to the industrial and environmental strategies aimed at repurposing phosphogypsum and other mineral by-products.&lt;SEP&gt;Resource utilization encompasses the processes of converting phosphogypsum into valuable materials or products to reduce environmental hazards.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-98d8b2df45924e721bfa570f652f33e3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-007</data>
