<node id="Characterization Methods">
  <data key="d0">Characterization Methods</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Characterization methods are techniques applied to phosphogypsum to detect its composition, physical properties, and chemical properties.&lt;SEP&gt;Characterization methods are techniques applied to phosphogypsum to detect its composition, physical properties, and chemical properties.&lt;SEP&gt;Characterization methods are techniques applied to phosphogypsum to detect its composition, physical properties, and chemical properties.</data>
