  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Environmental problems are issues caused by the long-term accumulation of phosphogypsum, which restricts phosphorus chemical enterprise development.&lt;SEP&gt;Environmental problems are issues caused by the long-term accumulation of phosphogypsum, which restricts phosphorus chemical enterprise development.&lt;SEP&gt;Environmental problems are issues caused by the long-term accumulation of phosphogypsum, which restricts phosphorus chemical enterprise development.&lt;SEP&gt;Environmental problems are a key metric visualized in the dual-axis chart comparing industrial sectors in the phosphogypsum industry.</data>
