<node id="Micro morphology">
  <data key="d0">Micro morphology</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Micro morphology describes the physical surface structure of phosphogypsum, characterized by flake irregular and rhombic crystal forms.&lt;SEP&gt;Micro morphology describes the physical surface structure of phosphogypsum, characterized by flake irregular and rhombic crystal forms.&lt;SEP&gt;Micro morphology describes the physical surface structure of phosphogypsum, characterized by flake irregular and rhombic crystal forms.</data>
