<node id="Fine powder">
  <data key="d0">Fine powder</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Fine powder is the physical classification of phosphogypsum based on its particle size distribution.&lt;SEP&gt;Fine powder is the physical classification of phosphogypsum based on its particle size distribution.&lt;SEP&gt;Fine powder is the physical classification of phosphogypsum based on its particle size distribution.</data>
