<node id="Cao, W.">
  <data key="d0">Cao, W.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Cao, W. is a researcher whose academic work primarily focuses on the utilization, recovery, and processing of phosphogypsum. A significant portion of their research investigates the preparation of anhydrite from phosphogypsum, a topic on which they have co-authored multiple studies. Their work also encompasses broader investigations into phosphogypsum recovery and general utilization strategies, contributing to the scientific understanding of industrial byproduct valorization.

In addition to these collaborative efforts, Cao, W. served as the lead author on a dedicated study examining the recycling of phosphogypsum for the production of gypsum plaster. Their research portfolio further extends to analyzing the effects of calcination temperature on phosphogypsum processing. Through these lead-authored and co-authored publications, Cao, W. has established a consistent research trajectory centered on optimizing phosphogypsum conversion and application methods.&lt;SEP&gt;Cao, W. is a researcher who authored multiple studies on phosphogypsum recovery and recycling.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2760dc2a11fedad02d24741a978cf20d-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-176fa906dd9c8409d2d1c49b8bdf9948-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-031&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-024</data>
