<node id="Bensalah, H.">
  <data key="d0">Bensalah, H.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Bensalah, H. is a researcher who investigated the hydrothermal synthesis of nanocrystalline hydroxyapatite from phosphogypsum waste.&lt;SEP&gt;Bensalah, H. is a researcher who investigated the hydrothermal synthesis of nanocrystalline hydroxyapatite from phosphogypsum waste.&lt;SEP&gt;Bensalah, H. is a researcher who investigated the hydrothermal synthesis of nanocrystalline hydroxyapatite from phosphogypsum waste.&lt;SEP&gt;Bensalah, H. is a researcher who conducted hydrothermal synthesis of nanocrystalline hydroxyapatite from phosphogypsum waste.&lt;SEP&gt;A lead researcher who authored a 2018 paper on the hydrothermal synthesis of nanocrystalline hydroxyapatite.</data>
