<node id="Lanthanides">
  <data key="d0">Lanthanides</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Lanthanides are a valuable subset of rare-earth elements that are increasingly targeted for recovery and extraction from various phosphate-related industrial sources and processing streams. Primarily occurring as impurities in phosphate rock, phosphogypsum, and phosphohemihydrate, these elements hold significant economic value and drive specialized leaching and purification efforts within the phosphate industry. The industrial production of phosphoric acid generates process liquors rich in Lanthanides, which necessitate dedicated purification protocols.

To extract these elements, chemical leaching methods are systematically applied across different phosphate-derived materials. Specifically, mineral acids are utilized to leach Lanthanides from phosphogypsum fertilizers, while nitric acid is employed for extraction from phosphohemihydrate. The efficiency of removing Lanthanides from materials such as phosphogypsum is rigorously evaluated using various analytical techniques. Modern extraction methodologies consistently recover these elements from phosphoric acid production streams and other phosphate byproducts, underscoring their critical importance in sustainable resource recovery and the effective utilization of industrial waste materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Lanthanides are a series of elements that retard gypsum crystal growth due to ionic radius similarities with calcium.&lt;SEP&gt;Lanthanides are a subset of rare earth elements extracted from phosphate ores and phosphoric acid production processes using various leaching and ion exchange methods.&lt;SEP&gt;Lanthanides are minor components extracted from PG that do not increase private production costs.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-041&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-043&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-045&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80e3f6300e001922a5ca2a6a8ac2e0d2-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-003</data>
