  <data key="d2">Industrial process residues are waste materials containing valuable components that are targeted for zero-waste valorisation.&lt;SEP&gt;Industrial process residues are waste materials containing valuable components that are targeted for zero-waste valorisation.&lt;SEP&gt;Industrial process residues are waste materials containing valuable components that are targeted for zero-waste valorisation.</data>
