<node id="Nanocrystalline Hydroxyapatite">
  <data key="d0">Nanocrystalline Hydroxyapatite</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Nanocrystalline hydroxyapatite is a nanomaterial synthesized from phosphogypsum waste.&lt;SEP&gt;Nanocrystalline hydroxyapatite is a nanomaterial synthesized from phosphogypsum waste.&lt;SEP&gt;Nanocrystalline hydroxyapatite is a nanomaterial synthesized from phosphogypsum waste.&lt;SEP&gt;Nanocrystalline hydroxyapatite is a specific form of hydroxyapatite that outperforms activated carbon in metal removal.&lt;SEP&gt;Nanocrystalline Hydroxyapatite is a nanostructured form of the material prepared from fish scale waste for adsorption applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Nanocrystalline hydroxyapatite is the synthesized product characterized by specific dimensions and aspect ratios.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4a64a852097fdc910b98ed788503ce4-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-000</data>
