  <data key="d2">Environmental regulations are policy factors analyzed for their market impacts on rare earth production using computable general equilibrium analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;Environmental regulations are policy factors analyzed for their market impacts on rare earth production using computable general equilibrium analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;Environmental regulations are policy factors analyzed for their market impacts on rare earth production using computable general equilibrium analysis.</data>
