  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Wang, Q. is a researcher who authored multiple studies on phosphogypsum-based materials, including self-leveling mortar and foam insulation.&lt;SEP&gt;Wang, Q. is a researcher who authored multiple studies on phosphogypsum-based materials, including self-leveling mortar and foam insulation.&lt;SEP&gt;Wang, Q. is a researcher who authored multiple studies on phosphogypsum-based materials, including self-leveling mortar and foam insulation.&lt;SEP&gt;Wang, Q. is a researcher who co-authored a 2024 study tracing the environmental footprint of copper wire rod manufacturing in China.&lt;SEP&gt;Wang, Q. is a researcher who co-authored multiple studies on phosphogypsum and cementitious materials.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-032</data>
