<node id="Liu">
  <data key="d0">Liu</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Liu is a researcher whose work spans materials science, environmental engineering, and chemical processing, with a significant focus on phosphogypsum remediation and advanced catalytic materials. In the realm of phosphogypsum processing, Liu investigated multiple purification and optimization techniques. These include testing the effectiveness of water washing for impurity removal, proving the efficiency of N-Al2O3 for remediation, and demonstrating the complete removal of soluble phosphates through calcination at 600 °C, which notably improved the material's mechanical performance. Liu also examined the impact of phosphorus pentoxide on phosphogypsum hydration, confirming its effects in a 2020 study. Furthermore, Liu explored thermal treatment conditions and residence times to optimize impurity conversion, utilizing the Phreeqc program to analyze mineralogical species during the leaching of phosphogypsum and a calcium phosphogypsum fly ash mixture (CPGFM). This research revealed that fluorine forms aluminum-fluorine complexes at low pH and precipitates as calcium fluoride at higher pH, leading to a frequently cited recommended CPGFM formulation established in 2009. Liu also documented early formulations for goaf stabilization and is cited for contributions regarding the importance of the phosphorus sector.

Beyond environmental applications, Liu has made substantial contributions to materials science and photocatalysis. A 2003 publication detailed a hydrothermal synthesis method for hydroxyapatite, a technique that subsequently influenced broader research methodologies. Liu reported that porous structures are highly desirable due to their high specific surface area and abundant active sites. In photocatalytic studies, Liu documented the decomposition of methyl orange using hydroxyapatite under UV irradiation and investigated an amorphous iron(III)-substituted hydroxyapatite compound specifically for the degradation of rhodamine B. Collectively, these efforts highlight Liu's extensive research across chemical optimization, environmental remediation, and advanced catalytic materials.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4739e42903c95e1fb7e0ecfbca3a12df-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1b5f95e85d7bfa3b7aab581f3c82b33-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-72ff3bbf1e2b594abc3ec5c8d86e3178-chunk-000</data>
