  <data key="d1">creature</data>
  <data key="d2">Upland rice is an agricultural crop whose yield and nutrition are affected by the surface application of phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Upland rice is an agricultural crop whose yield and nutrition are affected by the surface application of phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Upland rice is an agricultural crop whose yield and nutrition are affected by the surface application of phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;An agricultural crop whose soil fertility, nutrition, and grain yield were analyzed in relation to phosphogypsum application.</data>
