<node id="Calcium Sulfoaluminate Cement">
  <data key="d0">Calcium Sulfoaluminate Cement</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Calcium Sulfoaluminate Cement is a specialized construction material that can be synthesized using phosphogypsum as a sole source of calcium oxide. The manufacturing process permits the substitution of conventional raw materials with treated phosphogypsum. However, the performance of this cement is notably influenced by phosphorus impurities present in phosphogypsum and similar feedstocks.

Beyond structural applications, Calcium Sulfoaluminate Cement serves as a functional matrix for environmental remediation and waste management. Research and practical implementations focus on its ability to incorporate phosphogypsum for the immobilization of hazardous elements. Additionally, the material is utilized in the management and stabilization of radioactivity, underscoring its role in both sustainable construction and nuclear waste containment.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-035&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-032</data>
