  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">S. Wu is a researcher who authored multiple studies on recycling phosphogypsum for cement production and its environmental impacts.&lt;SEP&gt;S. Wu is a researcher who authored multiple studies on recycling phosphogypsum for cement production and its environmental impacts.&lt;SEP&gt;S. Wu is a researcher who co-authored a critical review on hydrometallurgical processes for recovering rare earth elements from phosphate rock.&lt;SEP&gt;A researcher who explored recycling phosphogypsum as a calcium oxide source in cement production.&lt;SEP&gt;S. Wu is a researcher who authored multiple studies on recycling phosphogypsum for cement production and its environmental impacts.</data>
