<node id="Lignite Chemical Looping Gasification">
  <data key="d0">Lignite Chemical Looping Gasification</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Lignite Chemical Looping Gasification is a process utilizing phosphogypsum as an oxygen carrier for syngas generation.&lt;SEP&gt;Lignite Chemical Looping Gasification is a process utilizing phosphogypsum as an oxygen carrier for syngas generation.&lt;SEP&gt;Lignite chemical looping gasification is an innovative technology proposed to produce syngas from lignite using phosphogypsum as an oxygen carrier.&lt;SEP&gt;Lignite Chemical Looping Gasification is a process utilizing phosphogypsum as an oxygen carrier for syngas generation.</data>
