<node id="Self-Leveling Mortar">
  <data key="d0">Self-Leveling Mortar</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Self-Leveling Mortar is a specialized construction and building material primarily engineered for structural and finishing applications within the construction sector. It is fundamentally prepared using original phosphogypsum as its core raw material, classifying it as a phosphogypsum-based product. A typical commercial formulation consists of a specialized fluid mixture containing 20% cement, 40% phosphogypsum, and 40% natural sand. This composition makes it an ideal application for α-hemihydrate gypsum, leveraging the material's excellent fluidity to ensure smooth, even surface finishes.

The incorporation of phosphogypsum into the mortar mixture introduces specific performance characteristics that must be accounted for during application. Notably, phosphogypsum-based self-leveling mortar exhibits reduced wear resistance alongside increased drying shrinkage. Despite these trade-offs, the material is commercially produced to meet rigorous industry demands, with manufacturing processes consistently focused on delivering standardized performance. As a reliable building solution, Self-Leveling Mortar supports modern architectural and engineering practices by providing a consistent, high-quality substrate for various construction projects.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-98d8b2df45924e721bfa570f652f33e3-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-008</data>
