  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Aluminium oxide is a chemical compound present in phosphogypsum composition.&lt;SEP&gt;Aluminium oxide is a chemical compound present in phosphogypsum composition.&lt;SEP&gt;Aluminium oxide is a chemical compound present in phosphogypsum composition.</data>
