<node id="Free Water">
  <data key="d0">Free Water</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Free water is a component found in phosphogypsum composition.&lt;SEP&gt;Free water is a component found in phosphogypsum composition.&lt;SEP&gt;Free Water is moisture present in PG that is removed at temperatures between 100-150 °C.&lt;SEP&gt;Free water is a component found in phosphogypsum composition.&lt;SEP&gt;Free water is stored in PGCM pores and freezes or evaporates, driving expansion and shrinkage stresses.&lt;SEP&gt;Unbound moisture in phosphogypsum that is removed by drying at 60°C without affecting structural integrity.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-004</data>
