  <data key="d2">Crystal water is a component found in phosphogypsum composition.&lt;SEP&gt;Crystal water is a component found in phosphogypsum composition.&lt;SEP&gt;Crystal water is a component found in phosphogypsum composition.&lt;SEP&gt;Crystal water is stored in PGCM pores that melts slowly and continuously squeezes and expands pores during temperature cycles.&lt;SEP&gt;A component of the phosphogypsum determined by mass loss during drying at 230 °C.</data>
