<node id="Soil Solution">
  <data key="d0">Soil Solution</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Soil Solution is the aqueous and liquid phase within the soil matrix and micro-basins, serving as the primary medium for dissolved ions, compounds, and microelements. It contains a diverse array of chemical species, including macro-ions, hydroxyl ions, and active cadmium ions, with cadmium concentrations typically remaining significantly lower than those of macro-ions. This liquid phase is fundamentally governed by chemical equilibria, such as the calcium-carbonate equilibrium, and facilitates ion associations, chemical migration phenomena, and continuous interactions with surrounding soil properties. Within this medium, heavy metals and cadmium exist in various chemical forms, exhibit mobility, and directly influence their bioavailability.

Functionally, Soil Solution acts as the critical transport mechanism that delivers essential ions and nutrients directly to plant roots. Because of its complex chemical dynamics, it serves as the essential environment for thermodynamic modeling, particularly regarding cadmium status, and functions as the standard medium for measuring ion activities, heavy metal bioavailability, and macro-ion or hydroxyl ion dynamics. Ultimately, Soil Solution plays a central role in governing soil chemistry, nutrient cycling, and the migration of dissolved substances throughout the terrestrial ecosystem.&lt;SEP&gt;The water extract of soil used to study ion equilibrium, heavy metal passivation, and calcium-carbonate equilibrium.&lt;SEP&gt;Soil Solution is the aqueous environment in the soil whose macroion free form equilibrium concentration and molar fraction are analyzed.&lt;SEP&gt;The aqueous phase in soil where lead ions and other macroions exist in dynamic chemical equilibrium.&lt;SEP&gt;The liquid medium in soil where ionic strength and solubility affect substance mobility.&lt;SEP&gt;The aqueous environment in the soil where microelement forms and ion associations are analyzed.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-25198f8665e133385fd54e5a03e28a44-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-25198f8665e133385fd54e5a03e28a44-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-25198f8665e133385fd54e5a03e28a44-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-25198f8665e133385fd54e5a03e28a44-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-25198f8665e133385fd54e5a03e28a44-chunk-008</data>
