  <data key="d0">Carbonate Forms</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Carbonate Forms refer to various chemical species that migrate and accumulate throughout the soil profile.&lt;SEP&gt;Carbonate Forms refer to various chemical species that migrate and accumulate throughout the soil profile.&lt;SEP&gt;Various chemical compounds containing carbonate ions that migrate and accumulate throughout the soil profile.</data>
