<node id="Sposito">
  <data key="d0">Sposito</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Sposito is a researcher whose 1989 publication provided thermodynamic stability constants for cadmium associates.&lt;SEP&gt;Sposito is a researcher who authored foundational works on soil chemistry and global food security.&lt;SEP&gt;Sposito is a researcher whose 1989 publication provided thermodynamic stability constants for cadmium associates.&lt;SEP&gt;Sposito is a researcher who provided typical soil values for uranium concentration.&lt;SEP&gt;Sposito is a researcher whose literature values for terrestrial materials were used for chemical comparison.&lt;SEP&gt;Sposito is a researcher who provided baseline soil cadmium concentration levels for comparison with phosphogypsum-treated soil.&lt;SEP&gt;Sposito is a researcher who provided thermodynamic stability constants for lead associates.</data>
