<node id="Heuristic Synthesis">
  <data key="d0">Heuristic Synthesis</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Heuristic synthesis is an educated guess approach used to design new devices by combining multifaceted information and qualified intuition.&lt;SEP&gt;Heuristic synthesis is an educated guess approach used to design new devices by combining multifaceted information and qualified intuition.&lt;SEP&gt;Heuristic synthesis refers to the device and technology approach for intrasoil ameliorative mechanical processing and pollutant passivation.&lt;SEP&gt;Heuristic synthesis is a knowledge-based approach to technological development for soil engineering.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-25198f8665e133385fd54e5a03e28a44-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-25198f8665e133385fd54e5a03e28a44-chunk-004</data>
