  <data key="d1">creature</data>
  <data key="d2">Tree is a plant type whose rhizosphere depth makes the 30-70 cm soil layer preferable for processing.&lt;SEP&gt;Tree is a plant type whose rhizosphere depth makes the 30-70 cm soil layer preferable for processing.</data>
