<node id="Polymicrobial Biofilms">
  <data key="d0">Polymicrobial Biofilms</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Polymicrobial biofilms are microbial communities that originate and function within the synthesized multilevel heterogeneous soil architecture.&lt;SEP&gt;Polymicrobial biofilms are microbial communities that originate and function within the synthesized multilevel heterogeneous soil architecture.&lt;SEP&gt;Polymicrobial biofilms are microbial communities that thrive in synthesized heterogeneous soil architectures.</data>
