<node id="Equation 4">
  <data key="d0">Equation 4</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Equation 4 is a mathematical equation excluded from the macro-ion system due to cadmium's minimal impact on ionic strength.&lt;SEP&gt;Equation 4 is a mathematical equation excluded from the macro-ion system due to cadmium's minimal impact on ionic strength.&lt;SEP&gt;Equation 4 portrays the precipitation step of metal phosphates in the dissolution-precipitation mechanism.&lt;SEP&gt;Equation 4 defines the calculation for total ecological service as the sum of maximum air and water dilution values.&lt;SEP&gt;Equation 4 is a non-linear mathematical expression defining the pseudo-first-order adsorption model.&lt;SEP&gt;Equation 4 defines the integral form of the reaction mechanism function G(alpha).</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e992f3bad9db87c40308ea55e121bd8a-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d5e4f0f96b4ad61d23685552d3211225-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792364185</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Macro-ions">
  <data key="d0">Macro-ions</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Macro-ions are ions in soil solution whose equation system excludes Equation 4 due to trace element considerations.&lt;SEP&gt;Ions present in the water extract from soil, whose analytical content and equilibrium concentrations were analyzed.&lt;SEP&gt;Macro-ions are chemical species whose activity and concentration are analyzed in soil solution after phosphogypsum application.&lt;SEP&gt;Macro-ions are ions in soil solution whose equation system excludes Equation 4 due to trace element considerations.&lt;SEP&gt;Ions present in the water extract from soil, whose analytical content and equilibrium concentrations were analyzed.&lt;SEP&gt;Macro-ions are chemical species whose activity and concentration are analyzed in soil solution after phosphogypsum application.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-009</data>
