</node>
<node id="Soil Organic Matter">
  <data key="d0">Soil Organic Matter</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Soil organic matter is a natural component that originates and functions within the synthesized multilevel heterogeneous soil architecture.&lt;SEP&gt;Soil organic matter is a natural component that originates and functions within the synthesized multilevel heterogeneous soil architecture.&lt;SEP&gt;Soil component that, when enriched in this context, reduces the soil's fertilizer retention and supply capacity.&lt;SEP&gt;Soil organic matter is synthesized and functions within the heterogeneous soil architecture created by processing.&lt;SEP&gt;Soil organic matter is a key component studied for its role in calcium carbonate equilibrium and maintenance in agricultural systems.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e290dd6268316238694f70c30a367426-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-25198f8665e133385fd54e5a03e28a44-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-25198f8665e133385fd54e5a03e28a44-chunk-017</data>
