  <data key="d2">Techno-soil synthesis is a methodological approach that transforms intra-soil aggregate systems to improve soil quality.&lt;SEP&gt;Techno-soil synthesis is a methodological approach that transforms intra-soil aggregate systems to improve soil quality.</data>
