<node id="Thermodynamic Mathematical Model">
  <data key="d0">Thermodynamic Mathematical Model</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A computational approach used to calculate soil solution macro-ion equilibrium forms and stability constants.&lt;SEP&gt;A model developed to describe the Kastanozem complex and establish principles for sustainable semiarid silviculture management.&lt;SEP&gt;A computational approach used to calculate soil solution macro-ion equilibrium forms and stability constants.&lt;SEP&gt;A model developed to describe the Kastanozem complex and establish principles for sustainable semiarid silviculture management.&lt;SEP&gt;A computational approach used to analyze soil solution macroion equilibrium and calculate stability constants.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-25198f8665e133385fd54e5a03e28a44-chunk-004</data>
