<node id="Ionic Strength">
  <data key="d0">Ionic Strength</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Ionic strength is a fundamental solution property that quantifies the concentration of ions within a given medium, serving as a critical measure of the solution's ionic environment. It plays a pivotal role in determining the transformation of free ions into ion associates and significantly influences the thermodynamic processes governing macro-ion association, ion association, and complexation. In soil science, ionic strength reflects the ionic concentration in soil solutions, directly impacting these association and complexation dynamics.

Beyond natural environments, ionic strength acts as a key chemical condition in industrial and experimental contexts. Within phosphogypsum stacks, it dictates the dominant chemical species present. In laboratory and remediation studies, ionic strength is frequently manipulated, often by adjusting it with sodium chloride (NaCl), to systematically evaluate its effects on the competitive adsorption and removal efficiency of heavy metals, particularly when utilizing adsorbents like HAP-BC. Overall, ionic strength serves as a unifying parameter that governs ion behavior, chemical speciation, and interaction efficiency across diverse aqueous and soil-based systems.&lt;SEP&gt;A key parameter identified as highly influential in determining phosphogypsum stability and solubility.&lt;SEP&gt;Ionic strength is a chemical property that significantly enhances phosphogypsum solubility and trace element leachability.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-034&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9e17ad262bd9835860df552d7ff475f1-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9e17ad262bd9835860df552d7ff475f1-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792487165</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
