  <data key="d0">Stability Constants</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Calculated values representing the stability of associated and complex ions, which differed from standard thermodynamic values.&lt;SEP&gt;Calculated values representing the stability of associated and complex ions, which differed from standard thermodynamic values.&lt;SEP&gt;Numerical coefficients in the equation representing the formation strength of various lead complexes.</data>
