<node id="Association Coefficient">
  <data key="d0">Association Coefficient</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">A calculated metric ($k_{as}$) representing the ratio of active to total cadmium in soil solution.&lt;SEP&gt;A calculated metric ($k_{as}$) representing the ratio of active to total cadmium in soil solution.&lt;SEP&gt;Association Coefficient is a calculated parameter (k_as) derived using Eq 4 to describe chemical binding.&lt;SEP&gt;A calculated quantitative value representing the binding strength between ions and associates, ranging from 14.543 to 31.207 units.&lt;SEP&gt;A parameter indicating the degree of heavy metal binding into associates and complexes with main soil solution ions.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-25198f8665e133385fd54e5a03e28a44-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-25198f8665e133385fd54e5a03e28a44-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-25198f8665e133385fd54e5a03e28a44-chunk-005</data>
