<node id="Carbonate Chemical Equilibrium">
  <data key="d0">Carbonate Chemical Equilibrium</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Carbonate chemical equilibrium (CCE) is a phenomenon determining the migration and accumulation of carbonate forms and salts in the soil profile.&lt;SEP&gt;Carbonate chemical equilibrium (CCE) is a phenomenon determining the migration and accumulation of carbonate forms and salts in the soil profile.</data>
