  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">An associated ion form ($CdCO_3^0$) of cadmium that contributes to reducing free cadmium ion activity in soil.&lt;SEP&gt;An associated ion form ($CdCO_3^0$) of cadmium that contributes to reducing free cadmium ion activity in soil.&lt;SEP&gt;Cadmium carbonate is a chemical complex formed between cadmium and carbonate ions, characterized by a specific stability constant.</data>
