<node id="Springer Nature">
  <data key="d0">Springer Nature</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Springer Nature is a prominent academic publishing house and organization responsible for disseminating scholarly research through journal articles and academic publications. As a leading publisher, it holds exclusive rights to its published articles and actively manages publishing agreements. In its editorial and publication practices, Springer Nature maintains strict neutrality regarding jurisdictional claims in both its general publications and published maps.

Additionally, the organization has granted permission for the reprinting of specific scientific studies and reviews, including research focused on phosphate rock, phosphogypsum characterization, and related environmental topics. Through these functions, Springer Nature serves as a key disseminator of academic knowledge while upholding standardized publishing rights and editorial neutrality.&lt;SEP&gt;Springer Nature is the parent organization associated with the publication of the research paper.&lt;SEP&gt;The publisher holding exclusive rights to the article and maintaining neutrality regarding jurisdictional claims.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e290dd6268316238694f70c30a367426-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-98d8b2df45924e721bfa570f652f33e3-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-024</data>
