<node id="Biogeochemical Passivation">
  <data key="d0">Biogeochemical Passivation</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A process that reduces the bioavailability and toxicity of heavy metals in soil solution through ion association and complex formation.&lt;SEP&gt;A process that reduces the bioavailability and toxicity of heavy metals in soil solution through ion association and complex formation.</data>
