<node id="Soil pH">
  <data key="d0">Soil pH</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Soil pH is a chemical parameter that influences the transfer rate of cadmium ions to plants.&lt;SEP&gt;A chemical property of soil that influences cadmium binding forms and is reduced by phosphogypsum application.&lt;SEP&gt;Soil pH is a chemical parameter that influences the transfer rate of cadmium ions to plants.&lt;SEP&gt;A chemical property of soil that influences cadmium binding forms and is reduced by phosphogypsum application.&lt;SEP&gt;Soil pH is a soil parameter that was slightly reduced by phosphogypsum application and dictates lead chemical speciation.&lt;SEP&gt;Soil pH is a chemical parameter that was slightly reduced due to phosphogypsum application.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-25198f8665e133385fd54e5a03e28a44-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-25198f8665e133385fd54e5a03e28a44-chunk-007</data>
