<node id="Plant Organogenesis">
  <data key="d0">Plant Organogenesis</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Plant organogenesis is the developmental stage of plants where soil moisture and nutrient flux critically impact growth.&lt;SEP&gt;The biological development of plant organs, which faces minimal adverse influence from low water-soluble cadmium in soil.&lt;SEP&gt;The biological development of plant organs, which faces minimal adverse influence from low water-soluble cadmium in soil.&lt;SEP&gt;Plant organogenesis is the developmental stage of plants where soil moisture and nutrient flux critically impact growth.&lt;SEP&gt;Plant organogenesis refers to the developmental process of plant organs studied in the supporting information.</data>
