<node id="Equilibrium Concentration">
  <data key="d0">Equilibrium Concentration</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The concentration of free microelement ions at chemical equilibrium within the soil solution.&lt;SEP&gt;The concentration of free microelement ions at chemical equilibrium within the soil solution.&lt;SEP&gt;Equilibrium concentration represents the concentration of metal ions in solution at adsorption equilibrium.&lt;SEP&gt;The concentration of a pollutant remaining in a solution after reaching equilibrium.&lt;SEP&gt;The concentration of fluoride in the solution at equilibrium, used as a variable in the Langmuir isotherm equation.&lt;SEP&gt;Equilibrium Concentration represents the remaining amount of a substance in a solution after a treatment process reaches equilibrium.&lt;SEP&gt;Equilibrium Concentration is a measured value representing the effective concentration of macroions in the soil solution.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9e17ad262bd9835860df552d7ff475f1-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9e17ad262bd9835860df552d7ff475f1-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e992f3bad9db87c40308ea55e121bd8a-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e992f3bad9db87c40308ea55e121bd8a-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-25198f8665e133385fd54e5a03e28a44-chunk-003</data>
