  <data key="d2">A chemical ion whose concentration levels are tracked across experimental stages in the chart and table.&lt;SEP&gt;An anion that interacts with Cadmium in the chemical speciation model.&lt;SEP&gt;A chemical ion tracked in the chart, starting just below 100 and showing a very slight gradual decline.&lt;SEP&gt;A chemical ion ($HCO_3^-$) that forms lead complexes and suggests solution equilibrium with atmospheric CO2 or soil carbonates.</data>
