  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Nauru is a phosphate rock deposit with a cadmium concentration of 100 mg/kg.&lt;SEP&gt;Nauru is a geographic location referenced for soil cadmium concentration data.&lt;SEP&gt;Nauru is a geographic location referenced for soil cadmium concentration data.&lt;SEP&gt;Nauru is a phosphate rock deposit with a cadmium concentration of 100 mg/kg.&lt;SEP&gt;Nauru is a South Pacific island nation that historically supplied guano to Australia.&lt;SEP&gt;Nauru is a location with phosphate rocks containing 100 mg kg⁻¹ cadmium.</data>
