<node id="Soil solution">
  <data key="d0">Soil solution</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Soil solution is the liquid phase in soil where chemical equilibria and ion associations occur.&lt;SEP&gt;Soil solution is the liquid phase in soil where chemical equilibria and ion associations occur.&lt;SEP&gt;Soil solution is a high-quality liquid component within microbasins that facilitates plant nutrition.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-25198f8665e133385fd54e5a03e28a44-chunk-009</data>
