  <data key="d2">Eolian transfer is an uncontrolled wind-driven process that moves phosphogypsum particles on the soil surface.&lt;SEP&gt;Eolian transfer is an uncontrolled wind-driven process that moves phosphogypsum particles on the soil surface.</data>
