  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Liming is a soil treatment method capable of reducing heavy metal transfer and cadmium penetration into plants.&lt;SEP&gt;Liming is a soil treatment method capable of reducing heavy metal transfer and cadmium penetration into plants.&lt;SEP&gt;Liming is an agricultural practice used to alter soil chemistry and reduce the transfer of heavy metals to plants.</data>
