<node id="Phalaborwa">
  <data key="d0">Phalaborwa</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Phalaborwa is a phosphate rock deposit in South Africa with a cadmium concentration of 4 mg/kg.&lt;SEP&gt;Phalaborwa is a phosphate rock deposit in South Africa with a cadmium concentration of 4 mg/kg.&lt;SEP&gt;Phalaborwa is a location in South Africa where phosphogypsum samples were collected.&lt;SEP&gt;Phalaborwa is a phosphate rock mining site in South Africa with a cadmium concentration of 4 mg kg⁻¹.</data>
