  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Ponds are storage locations for utilized phosphogypsum that result in environmental pollution.&lt;SEP&gt;Ponds are storage locations for utilized phosphogypsum that result in environmental pollution.&lt;SEP&gt;Ponds are water bodies into which unused phosphogypsum is discharged.&lt;SEP&gt;Ponds are bodies of water where unused phosphogypsum and fly ash are currently discarded.&lt;SEP&gt;Ponds are storage locations for phosphogypsum before purification or disposal.</data>
