<node id="CO2">
  <data key="d0">CO2</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Carbon dioxide (CO2) is a greenhouse gas that exhibits distinct environmental and industrial characteristics. In soil environments, its partial pressure and seasonal cycles are notably influenced by CCE. Beyond its natural atmospheric and pedological roles, CO2 is extensively utilized in experimental and industrial processes centered on phosphogypsum (PG) management and carbon capture.

In these applications, CO2 is actively targeted for sequestration and serves as a reactive agent in the transformation of phosphogypsum. It is captured through sulfur-looping mechanisms and utilized in carbonation processes where it is sorbed by nano-calcium carbonate (nano-CaCO3) derived from phosphogypsum. During phosphogypsum decomposition, CO2 functions as an oxidizing agent for calcium sulfide (CaS), while in high-temperature coupling operations, it undergoes mineralization concurrently with potassium extraction. These multifaceted interactions underscore CO2's significance in both environmental monitoring and advanced material processing technologies.&lt;SEP&gt;CO2 is a gaseous reactant injected into Portlandite solutions to facilitate mineral carbonation and greenhouse gas mitigation.&lt;SEP&gt;A chemical compound measured in weight percent in the provided analytical data.&lt;SEP&gt;Carbon dioxide, a chemical compound with a molar mass of 44.01 g/mol.&lt;SEP&gt;CO2 is a gas sequestered via geological sequestration and mineral carbonation into solid carbonates.&lt;SEP&gt;Carbon dioxide is a major chemical component measured in percentage.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-055&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-042&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-045&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-60e237a0a1045feedf76d35d654a79bd-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80e3f6300e001922a5ca2a6a8ac2e0d2-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-007</data>
