<node id="Endovitsky, A. P.">
  <data key="d0">Endovitsky, A. P.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Endovitsky, A. P. is a researcher investigating ion association and metal mobility in soil solutions.&lt;SEP&gt;Endovitsky, A. P. is a researcher who co-authored studies on ion association in soil solutions and cadmium status in chernozems.&lt;SEP&gt;Endovitsky, A. P. is a researcher investigating ion association and metal mobility in soil solutions.&lt;SEP&gt;Endovitsky, A. P. is a researcher who co-authored studies on ion association in soil solutions and cadmium status in chernozems.&lt;SEP&gt;Endovitsky, A. P. is a researcher who authored papers on carbonate calcium equilibrium and ion association in soil solutions.&lt;SEP&gt;Endovitsky, A. P. is a researcher who co-authored a patent for a method of substance synthesis inside a supracolloidal system.&lt;SEP&gt;Endovitsky, A. P. is a co-author of the patent for a method of substance synthesis inside a supracolloidal system.</data>
