  <data key="d0">Amelioration and Remediation Technology</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Amelioration and remediation technology is the developed process for utilizing phosphogypsum in soil treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Amelioration and remediation technology is the developed process for utilizing phosphogypsum in soil treatment.</data>
