  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A mathematical chemical-thermodynamic model used alongside ION-3 to calculate heavy metal forms in soil solution.&lt;SEP&gt;A mathematical chemical-thermodynamic model used alongside ION-3 to calculate heavy metal forms in soil solution.</data>
