</node>
<node id="Biosphere">
  <data key="d0">Biosphere</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The biosphere is the ecological system affected by cadmium pollution and soil contamination.&lt;SEP&gt;The global ecological system referenced in studies optimizing matter flow and climate at the stage of technogenesis.&lt;SEP&gt;The biosphere is the ecological system affected by cadmium pollution and soil contamination.&lt;SEP&gt;The global ecological system referenced in studies optimizing matter flow and climate at the stage of technogenesis.&lt;SEP&gt;The biosphere is a global ecological system that the BGT methodology aims to stabilize.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-25198f8665e133385fd54e5a03e28a44-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-25198f8665e133385fd54e5a03e28a44-chunk-014</data>
