  <data key="d0">Academic Press</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Academic Press is a publishing imprint that released a foundational soil ecology textbook.&lt;SEP&gt;Academic Press is a publishing imprint that released a foundational soil ecology textbook.&lt;SEP&gt;Academic Press is a publishing house that released foundational texts on soil ecology and hydropedology.</data>
