<node id="Contaminants and the Soil Environment in the Australasia-Pacific Region">
  <data key="d0">Contaminants and the Soil Environment in the Australasia-Pacific Region</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Contaminants and the Soil Environment in the Australasia-Pacific Region is a publication examining soil contamination in the specified geographic area.&lt;SEP&gt;Contaminants and the Soil Environment in the Australasia-Pacific Region is a publication examining soil contamination in the specified geographic area.</data>
