  <data key="d0">Biosolids</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Biosolids are treated organic materials regulated for safe application to agricultural land.&lt;SEP&gt;Biosolids are treated organic materials regulated for safe application to agricultural land.&lt;SEP&gt;Biosolids are the solid fraction output from wastewater treatment that can be applied to land or disposed of in landfills.&lt;SEP&gt;Biosolids are a component of wastewater treatment that can be lost to landfill or recycled to agriculture.&lt;SEP&gt;Biosolids are a byproduct from the wastewater sector that contain phosphorus and can be recirculated.&lt;SEP&gt;A processed output from wastewater treatment that splits into recycled and unused streams.&lt;SEP&gt;Semi-solid residues from wastewater treatment containing phosphorus that can be recycled to agriculture.</data>
