<node id="Silica Release">
  <data key="d0">Silica Release</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Silica Release is the solubilization of silica into silicic acid, relevant to understanding leaching into groundwater or soil.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-028</data>
