<node id="Calcium Aluminate Hydrates">
  <data key="d0">Calcium Aluminate Hydrates</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Calcium Aluminate Hydrates are complex compounds that can form in phosphogypsum when aluminum is present.&lt;SEP&gt;Calcium aluminate hydrates provide surfaces for fluoride adsorption and retention.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-024</data>
