  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Fly ash is an industrial waste material studied for its potential to mitigate greenhouse gas emissions in agricultural applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Fly ash is an alkaline solid waste studied for CO2 fixation applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Fly ash is an industrial waste material studied for its potential to mitigate greenhouse gas emissions in agricultural applications.&lt;SEP&gt;A by-product material utilized as a resource input in the PSC process scenario.&lt;SEP&gt;A mineral admixture used in concrete and as a soil stabilizer, referenced in multiple standards and studies.</data>
