<node id="Industrial Processes">
  <data key="d0">Industrial Processes</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Manufacturing operations involving phosphate compounds where the described reaction is common.&lt;SEP&gt;Industrial processes are a source of volatile organic compound emissions.&lt;SEP&gt;Manufacturing and processing activities that generate dicalcium phosphate dihydrate as a byproduct.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4739e42903c95e1fb7e0ecfbca3a12df-chunk-010</data>
