<node id="Setting Time">
  <data key="d0">Setting Time</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Setting Time is a fundamental physical property and measured parameter that quantifies the duration required for cementitious, plaster, gypsum-based, and composite materials to harden or solidify. Universally categorized into initial and final hardening stages and typically recorded in minutes, this characteristic dictates material handling properties and is optimized for diverse applications ranging from general construction to clinical uses in dentistry and orthopedics. It is evaluated across a broad spectrum of matrices, including cement, cement paste, mortar, gypsum plaster, and composite bone cement, and is highly sensitive to base composition, chemical additives, and processing conditions.

The influence of phosphogypsum (PG) on Setting Time is particularly pronounced and heavily dependent on its processing state. The addition of raw or unprocessed PG, along with soluble phosphorus and phosphate contaminants, consistently prolongs the hardening duration. This retarding effect is attributed to protective coatings forming on material particles and scales proportionally with PG content. Conversely, the use of calcined or purified PG, as well as washing and heating treatments, significantly reduces or shortens the Setting Time. Incomplete calcination at lower temperatures, however, leads to irregular hardening changes. Furthermore, the solidification duration of modified PG is directly modulated by ambient temperature and particle size, with hydration progress often monitored through conductivity stabilization.

Beyond PG, various chemical modifiers and environmental factors alter the hardening duration. In composite bone cement, increasing sodium chloride concentrations decrease the Setting Time, while higher sodium hydroxide concentrations in PG mixtures similarly reduce it. The impact of specific trace impurities presents documented discrepancies in the literature. While soluble phosphates and general contaminants reliably exert a retarding effect, the role of fluorine remains contested; some records indicate that soluble fluorine shortens the Setting Time, whereas others state that fluorine impurities severely retard it. This uncertainty underscores the complex interplay of trace elements in cementitious hydration, highlighting the necessity for precise compositional control to meet specific industrial and clinical handling requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;A key performance metric for cement, measuring the duration required for the material to harden.&lt;SEP&gt;Setting Time is a chemical property metric that is delayed by impurities in untreated phosphogypsum but improved with calcined variants.&lt;SEP&gt;Setting time refers to the initial and final hardening periods of cement pastes containing varying Phosphogypsum replacements.&lt;SEP&gt;Setting time is a fresh mix property of PG mortar that is significantly affected by the percentage of PG replacement.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e0549fcda95f7199440791b20bf85635-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e0549fcda95f7199440791b20bf85635-chunk-003</data>
