<node id="Autoclave Expansion">
  <data key="d0">Autoclave Expansion</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Autoclave Expansion is a dimensional stability property of Portland cement and Portland slag cement that complies with standard requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;Autoclave expansion measures the percentage of expansion in paste mixes after autoclaving.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e0549fcda95f7199440791b20bf85635-chunk-002</data>
