<node id="Cement Clinker">
  <data key="d0">Cement Clinker</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">Cement clinker is a synthetic material and a fundamental component of the construction industry, primarily serving as a key ingredient in various cementitious formulations. It is traditionally combined with slag and gypsum during the production of Portland slag cement, and it also functions as a component in yellow phosphorus slag-based binders utilized for filling bodies. In specialized applications, cement clinker acts as an auxiliary activator in cementitious composite material (CCM) formulations to enhance overall performance.

A significant focus of industrial and theoretical research involves optimizing the production of cement clinker through the utilization of phosphogypsum (PG). Specifically, calcium oxide and other calcium sources derived from phosphogypsum are employed to support a two-step preparation process, which provides theoretical backing for its industrial application. These phosphogypsum-derived calcium sources are instrumental in optimizing both the phase formation and calcination processes of cement clinker. Furthermore, the content of cement clinker in final mixtures can be strategically reduced by substituting it with phosphogypsum, promoting resource efficiency. To ensure consistent output during manufacturing, the quality of cement clinker is actively monitored using advanced soft sensor modeling techniques.&lt;SEP&gt;Cement clinker is a material fired in a kiln where phosphogypsum is utilized to avoid kiln ringing during production.&lt;SEP&gt;Cement clinker is a primary binder component partially replaced by phosphogypsum in various studies.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792453914</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
