<node id="Impure Phosphogypsum">
  <data key="d0">Impure Phosphogypsum</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Impure phosphogypsum is a type of gypsum evaluated for use in Portland slag cement and gypsum plaster.&lt;SEP&gt;Impure phosphogypsum is a raw form of phosphogypsum with a fineness of 330 m²/kg that significantly prolongs cement setting time.</data>
