  <data key="d2">Ammonium sulphate is a chemical used in alternative treatment methods to reduce phosphates and fluorides in phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Ammonium sulphate is a chemical raw material produced from phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Ammonium sulphate is a chemical used in hot aqueous solutions for treating phosphogypsum.</data>
