<node id="Polonium-210">
  <data key="d0">Polonium-210</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Polonium-210 is a radioactive isotope and radionuclide derived from phosphate rocks. During the chemical processing and production of phosphate rock, it partitions into and coprecipitates with calcium sulfate in phosphogypsum. This relatively long-lived radionuclide is a major alpha emitter in groundwater and is consistently found within phosphogypsum deposits.

Due to its presence in this industrial byproduct, Polonium-210 is frequently quantified and analyzed during comprehensive phosphogypsum assessments. Environmental monitoring of the isotope includes measuring its levels in air samples collected near phosphogypsum ponds, as well as assessing its concentration in soil and forage following the low-rate agricultural application of phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Polonium-210 is a radioactive daughter product of radon-222 detected in higher concentrations in sedimentary phosphate rock and phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific radionuclide whose distribution in Syrian phosphogypsum was documented in research studies.&lt;SEP&gt;Polonium-210 is a radioactive isotope whose concentration is tracked alongside other radionuclides in phosphogypsum studies.&lt;SEP&gt;A radioactive element that persists in phosphogypsum after phosphate rock processing.&lt;SEP&gt;Polonium-210 is a radionuclide measured in phosphogypsum samples from multiple regions.&lt;SEP&gt;Polonium-210 is a radioactive isotope present in the thermal process stream.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-034&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-033&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-031&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-033&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
