<node id="P2O5">
  <data key="d0">P2O5</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Phosphorus pentoxide (P2O5) is a chemical compound primarily generated during the combustion of yellow phosphorus and serves as a fundamental metric across the phosphate industry. It is widely utilized to quantify phosphorus content in crude phosphoric acid, particularly from the dihydrate process, as well as in purified gypsum products, phosphate fertilizers, phosphogypsum brut, Portlandite, and commercial potassium sulphate. In industrial and scientific contexts, P2O5 is consistently recorded as a major chemical component measured in weight percentages across multiple samples. Its concentration is frequently determined through drying and weighing procedures, calculated via specific formulas, and visualized in scientific data representations such as violin plot legends. Additionally, P2O5 functions as a standard reference metric for tracking total phosphate fertilizer production volumes and the production ratio of phosphogypsum waste.

Within phosphogypsum processing, P2O5 is a key chemical constituent and impurity, typically measured at average mass fractions ranging from approximately 1.31% to 1.70 wt%, generally exceeding fluorine concentrations. It exists in multiple forms, including soluble contaminants, lattice-bounded impurities trapped within the gypsum crystal structure, and specific chemical species such as H3PO4 and Ca(H2PO4)2.H2O4. The lattice-bounded form is highly resistant to removal via conventional water-washing, but P2O5 can be eliminated during purification or calcination processes. As an impurity, it restricts the application of phosphogypsum in building materials. However, despite its impurity status, P2O5 retains significant agricultural and industrial utility. When comprising less than one percent of phosphogypsum material, its residual presence acts as a direct phosphorus source that enhances soil management and plant nutrition, effectively transforming an industrial byproduct into a valuable agricultural resource. In high-quality cement applications, P2O5 appears in a syncrystallized form that conditions the material as a setting regulator. Furthermore, increases in its percentage correlate with intensity shifts in ardealite absorption bands, and it is frequently used as a representative chemical component to indicate analytical parameters in phosphogypsum studies.&lt;SEP&gt;A chemical compound with measurable concentrations in the compositional analysis.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e290dd6268316238694f70c30a367426-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-043&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28fbd4302bba090e667215c840757ff7-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-160a0fe95f7c82b193c6af751106ab6d-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-35aef6efc801611130c5dd196fe513df-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-60e237a0a1045feedf76d35d654a79bd-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-60e237a0a1045feedf76d35d654a79bd-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80e3f6300e001922a5ca2a6a8ac2e0d2-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-764bdde7c1b68efdbe7342cc41c2d3d4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e0549fcda95f7199440791b20bf85635-chunk-004</data>
