<node id="Wet Process">
  <data key="d0">Wet Process</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The Wet Process is the primary, mainstream, and most prevalent global industrial method for the commercial production of phosphoric acid and phosphate fertilizers. Functioning as a foundational chemical and hydrometallurgical technique, it is widely recognized as an energy-saving and cost-effective procedure. The core mechanism involves the acidulation, digestion, or dissolution of phosphate rock, specifically fluorapatite or apatite ore, using concentrated sulfuric acid or other strong mineral acids at moderate temperatures. This reaction efficiently decomposes the ore to extract phosphoric acid while partitioning various impurities into the final acid product and solid byproducts based on their solubility characteristics.

The process encompasses several distinct operational variants, including hemihydrate, dihydrate, and di-hemihydrate configurations. A major solid byproduct generated throughout these operations is phosphogypsum, which is typically produced as a filter cake. The specific chemical composition of this phosphogypsum waste is directly dictated by the chosen process type and operational parameters, notably incorporating silicon dioxide from the calcium phosphate rock. Beyond primary extraction, the Wet Process drives secondary chemical transformations; for instance, hydrofluoric acid generated during acidulation reacts with silica to form hexafluorosilicic acid. Additionally, the technique serves as the simplest and most economical hydrometallurgical method for converting phosphogypsum into valuable industrial products.

From an environmental and material science perspective, the Wet Process significantly impacts the distribution of trace elements and radionuclides. As a large-scale industrial treatment of phosphate rock, it actively redistributes and fractionates uranium-series radionuclides throughout the entire material stream. This fractionation directly influences both the purity of the extracted phosphoric acid and the radiological profile of the resulting waste products, making the management of these byproducts a critical consideration in modern chemical plant operations.&lt;SEP&gt;The Wet Process is a chemical treatment method widely used to produce phosphoric acid and generate phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;A chemical process for producing phosphoric acid from phosphates, discussed in Becker's work.&lt;SEP&gt;Wet process is an industrial processing method involving reaction with sulfuric acid to produce phosphoric acid scale, fertilizers, and phosphogypsum.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-058&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2760dc2a11fedad02d24741a978cf20d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-edfc4dcbd74cbf0b294f83f2034b209d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-764bdde7c1b68efdbe7342cc41c2d3d4-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-176fa906dd9c8409d2d1c49b8bdf9948-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-022</data>
