<node id="Jordan">
  <data key="d0">Jordan</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Jordan is a country and geographic region recognized as a major global producer of phosphogypsum, generating approximately three million tons annually primarily from fertilizer industries. The nation's phosphate rock deposits contain a rare earth element concentration of 0.01%, and the resulting industrial byproduct has been extensively reviewed for its potential utilizations, particularly in building materials and construction applications. Because of this widespread use, Jordan has served as a critical location for comprehensive scientific assessments evaluating the radiological impacts of treated phosphogypsum when incorporated into construction projects.

Extensive multidisciplinary research has been conducted on Jordanian phosphogypsum, with a strong emphasis on samples sourced from Aqaba and Eshidiya. These materials have been systematically characterized for their chemical composition, impurities, radionuclide activity concentrations, and trace metal mobility. Additionally, the country has hosted important geotechnical and environmental case studies, including work by Malkaw et al. (2022) that examined the sustainable management and slope stability of phosphogypsum stockpiles. Collectively, these investigations highlight Jordan's substantial contribution to worldwide phosphogypsum production and its enduring importance as a focal point for environmental, radiological, and engineering research related to this industrial material.&lt;SEP&gt;Jordan is a geographic region where research examines the bioavailability and mobility of trace metals in phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Jordan is the country where the Jordan University of Science &amp; Technology and the city of Irbid are located.&lt;SEP&gt;Jordan is the country where the phosphate industry and mining operations are situated.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-031&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-046&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-033&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-035&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-043&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e0549fcda95f7199440791b20bf85635-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e0549fcda95f7199440791b20bf85635-chunk-000</data>
