  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">X-Ray diffraction analysis confirms the elimination of sodium sulfate during the washing process.&lt;SEP&gt;X-ray diffraction analysis is employed to determine the calcium-to-phosphorus ratio in calcium-deficient hydroxyapatite.</data>
