<node id="Life Cycle Assessment">
  <data key="d0">Life Cycle Assessment</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Life Cycle Assessment is a systematic, comprehensive, and standardized multi-step analytical framework and calculation approach designed to evaluate the environmental performance, impacts, resource consumption, emissions, and overall sustainability of products, materials, industrial processes, and waste management strategies across all stages of their existence. As a structured methodology, it quantifies ecological footprints, predicts long-term environmental consequences, and determines specific environmental impact indicators such as global warming potential and acidification potential. The technique is widely applied to analyze the impacts of diverse systems, including recycling technologies, industrial production routes like phosphate fertilizer manufacturing, and various by-products or waste streams.

Beyond purely ecological metrics, Life Cycle Assessment incorporates economic, social, and techno-economic dimensions, frequently functioning alongside techno-economic assessments to measure resource efficiency and inventory data. It serves as a versatile instrument for sustainable decision-making, enabling the comparison of alternative management approaches and the evaluation of performance, sensitivity, and transformation characteristics. Notable practical implementations include assessing the recovery of rare earth elements from waste fluorescent powders, comparing disposal and utilization methods for Plaster of Paris, and extensively analyzing the environmental and economic challenges associated with phosphogypsum waste management, recycling, and valorization.

Through these diverse applications, Life Cycle Assessment provides a rigorous, objective foundation for optimizing resource utilization and minimizing ecological footprints. By systematically evaluating both environmental and economic factors across complex industrial and material contexts, it guides environmentally responsible practices and supports informed, sustainable decision-making in waste management and industrial operations.&lt;SEP&gt;Life Cycle Assessment (LCA) is a material accounting tool that utilises mass balance principles within a systems framework.&lt;SEP&gt;Life Cycle Assessment is a methodological framework used to evaluate the environmental and economic challenges of utilizing phosphogypsum waste.&lt;SEP&gt;Life Cycle Assessment is a methodology used to compare environmental performance of different production routes.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-176fa906dd9c8409d2d1c49b8bdf9948-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1b5f95e85d7bfa3b7aab581f3c82b33-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-024</data>
