<node id="Poland">
  <data key="d0">Poland</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Poland is a European country that plays a pivotal role in the industrial and scientific management of phosphogypsum and related metallurgical processes. The nation produces approximately 1.5 million tons of phosphogypsum annually, accounting for 6.57% of global production and reserves, and serves as the primary source for phosphogypsum samples utilized in numerous research initiatives. To address the environmental and industrial implications of this byproduct, Poland has established comprehensive management protocols and radiation monitoring practices. The country has also developed innovative techniques for co-producing sulfuric acid and cement from phosphogypsum, supported by a robust output of scientific literature in this domain. A central focus of these industrial and research efforts is the WIZÓW Chemical Plant, which has been extensively documented in case studies examining industrial waste management, phosphogypsum recovery, and rare earth element extraction.

Beyond its phosphogypsum operations, Poland functions as a key region for copper metallurgical slag processing, particularly through bacterial leaching techniques. In the academic and commercial spheres, the country hosts the Maria Curie-Skłodowska University and serves as the base for the authors' research institution. Furthermore, Poland is the origin of Hydrolab and Ertec, recognized suppliers of experimental materials and equipment. Collectively, these industrial, academic, and commercial contributions highlight Poland's multifaceted engagement in advancing sustainable metallurgical practices, chemical processing, and scientific research.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4739e42903c95e1fb7e0ecfbca3a12df-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-028</data>
