<node id="Resour. Policy">
  <data key="d0">Resour. Policy</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Resour. Policy is the journal publishing research on rare earth elements policies and industry narratives in China.&lt;SEP&gt;Resour. Policy is a scientific journal covering resource supply potential and sustainability strategies in emerging economies.&lt;SEP&gt;Resour. Policy is a journal that published a 2016 analysis on potential uranium supply from phosphoric acid.&lt;SEP&gt;Resour. Policy is a scientific journal that published research on environmentally sustainable mining and tailings storage facilities.&lt;SEP&gt;Resour. Policy is the academic journal that published the 2020 analysis of circular economy barriers in the mining sector.</data>
