<node id="J. Geochem. Explor.">
  <data key="d0">J. Geochem. Explor.</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">J. Geochem. Explor. publishes a review on the recovery potential of rare earth elements from mining and industrial residues.&lt;SEP&gt;J. Geochem. Explor. is a scientific journal that published research on trace element leaching from mine waste.&lt;SEP&gt;Journal of Geochemical Exploration, which published the 2021 review on rare earth element recovery.&lt;SEP&gt;J. Geochem. Explor. is a scientific journal publishing research on geochemical exploration and soil analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;J. Geochem. Explor. is a journal that published research on soil pollution and reclamation.</data>
