  <data key="d2">Malaysia is a geographic location containing the Lehat rare earth source.&lt;SEP&gt;Malaysia is a country where clay bricks from Beruas were studied for their microstructure and physical properties.&lt;SEP&gt;Malaysia is the country where Universiti Kebangsaan Malaysia is located and where the research was conducted.&lt;SEP&gt;Malaysia is the country where Universiti Kebangsaan Malaysia is located and where the research was conducted.&lt;SEP&gt;Malaysia is a predominant country within South East Asia that receives Australian agricultural exports.&lt;SEP&gt;Malaysia is a key market in South East Asia for Australian agricultural commodities.</data>
