  <data key="d5">1791423891</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Xenotime">
  <data key="d0">Xenotime</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">A mineral source of rare earth elements located in Malaysia and China.&lt;SEP&gt;Xenotime is a mineral source of rare earth elements found at Lehat and Longnan.&lt;SEP&gt;Xenotime is a stable mineral phase where Rare Earth Elements occur independently within Phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Xenotime is an undissolved independent Rare Earth Element mineral inclusion found in the leaching residue.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791039586</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Acid Mine Drainage">
  <data key="d0">Acid Mine Drainage</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Acid Mine Drainage is a highly acidic water flow and environmental pollutant generated by mining activities, which significantly impacts water reservoirs and has prompted extensive research into natural attenuation processes. While primarily recognized as a waste product and ecological challenge, it is also increasingly studied as a valuable resource, particularly at sites in Pennsylvania, USA, where it serves as a source of rare earth elements and yttrium.

Remediation efforts for Acid Mine Drainage frequently employ calcium carbonate derived from the conversion and processing of phosphogypsum. Passive remediation techniques are actively explored to neutralize its acidity while simultaneously facilitating the recovery of these valuable minerals. Consequently, Acid Mine Drainage represents a complex environmental phenomenon that bridges ecological remediation challenges with emerging opportunities for sustainable resource extraction.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-051&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-048&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-030</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792405868</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
