<node id="Centrifugation">
  <data key="d0">Centrifugation</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Centrifugation is a fundamental separation technique primarily employed to isolate liquid phases from residual insoluble solid phases and to achieve phase separation of reaction mixtures. As a core unit operation, it enables the efficient collection and isolation of solid products and particles across various experimental and industrial workflows.

In practical applications, the method is utilized at multiple stages of material processing and synthesis. It is commonly applied to process initial materials prior to washing, typically under controlled conditions such as 15 minutes at 3000 rpm, and to isolate solid products following washing procedures. The technique is particularly vital in the handling of hydroxyapatite and related composites, where it facilitates the collection of hydroxyapatite synthesis products immediately after chemical reactions, gathers hydroxyapatite particles during functionalization steps, and recovers HAP-BC materials after oscillation cycles or subsequent acid washing during regeneration protocols.&lt;SEP&gt;Centrifugation is a separation technique applied at 4000 r/min to isolate the solid product after maturation.&lt;SEP&gt;A post-treatment separation method used to remove hydroxide precipitates from the solution.&lt;SEP&gt;Centrifugation is a separation technique applied after leaching to isolate the solid residue from the liquid solution.&lt;SEP&gt;Centrifugation is a separation technique used to isolate leaching products from the decontaminated phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Centrifugation is a separation technique used to separate phases after extraction trials.&lt;SEP&gt;Centrifugation is a separation technique using high rotational speed to isolate solid particles from liquid.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9e17ad262bd9835860df552d7ff475f1-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9e17ad262bd9835860df552d7ff475f1-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-edfc4dcbd74cbf0b294f83f2034b209d-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
