<node id="PG1">
  <data key="d0">PG1</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A sample material analyzed for the concentration of rare earth elements and main metal elements.&lt;SEP&gt;PG1 is the source sample from which WBS and TWBS were obtained for elemental analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;PG1 is one of four phosphogypsum samples analyzed using X-ray Diffraction to compare mineral phases.&lt;SEP&gt;PG1 is a sample represented by a grey line, showing a flat baseline with distinct sharp peaks.&lt;SEP&gt;PG1 is a specific type of phosphogypsum board with 2.2 cm thickness and 259 Bq/kg radium content.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-039&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-038&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-006</data>
