<node id="Contact Time">
  <data key="d0">Contact Time</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Contact Time is a fundamental hydrometallurgical and separation process parameter defined as the duration of interaction or exposure between reactants, phases, or adsorbents and target solutions. As a critical process factor, it is systematically investigated and optimized to control reaction kinetics, enhance treatment effectiveness, and maximize overall separation performance. Its precise management directly dictates the efficiency of chemical interactions and the successful recovery of target materials across various industrial applications.

In specific leaching procedures, Contact Time governs the interaction duration between hydrofluoric acid and WBS, while also influencing the synergism of solvent-based systems like the TBP-TOPO leaching process. During adsorption operations, it represents the exposure period between adsorbents and heavy metal or metal solutions, directly determining adsorption efficiency, adsorption performance, and heavy metal removal percentages. Furthermore, in liquid-liquid extraction and stripping stages, Contact Time measures the duration that two distinct phases remain in contact. Empirical studies have identified 40 minutes as the optimal duration for these extraction and stripping operations, as this timeframe is sufficient to achieve phase equilibrium and maximize process yield. Across all contexts, Contact Time remains a vital, adjustable variable that must be carefully calibrated to ensure optimal operational outcomes.&lt;SEP&gt;The duration of interaction between the adsorbent and adsorbate, monitored to track pH changes.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9e17ad262bd9835860df552d7ff475f1-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9e17ad262bd9835860df552d7ff475f1-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-edfc4dcbd74cbf0b294f83f2034b209d-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-edfc4dcbd74cbf0b294f83f2034b209d-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e992f3bad9db87c40308ea55e121bd8a-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792317345</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
