<node id="Chem. Eng. J.">
  <data key="d0">Chem. Eng. J.</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The Chemical Engineering Journal, commonly abbreviated as Chem. Eng. J., is a peer-reviewed scientific publication dedicated to advancing research in chemical engineering, practical industrial applications, and related technical and environmental fields. Serving as a comprehensive platform for scholarly work, the journal covers a broad spectrum of topics ranging from theoretical modeling and chemical production to sustainable processes like CO2 sequestration and photocatalyst design. It places particular emphasis on applied environmental and materials engineering, frequently publishing studies on advanced material synthesis and remediation techniques.

A significant portion of the journal’s published research focuses on hydroxyapatite and its derivatives. Notable contributions include studies on the morphology-controlled fabrication of hydroxyapatite nanostructures, the preparation and application of nanocrystalline hydroxyapatite, and the adsorption of heavy metals such as cadmium and zinc using both magnetic hydroxyapatite nanoparticles and Fe-doped hydroxyapatite, with specific research documented as recently as 2023. Beyond hydroxyapatite applications, the journal has featured diverse environmental engineering solutions and chemical processes. These include low-carbon stabilization of contaminated soil, fixed-bed reactor modeling, phosphorus recovery from sewage sludge ash, zinc removal utilizing phosphogypsum (notably in a 2007 study), and the development of MOF-based ion-imprinted polymers for Gd(III) recovery. Collectively, these publications underscore the journal’s commitment to disseminating innovative research that bridges fundamental chemical engineering principles with practical, real-world industrial and environmental challenges.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-037&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80e3f6300e001922a5ca2a6a8ac2e0d2-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-018</data>
