<node id="Philippines">
  <data key="d0">Philippines</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Philippines is a country where phosphogypsum is evaluated for radiation risks and resource recovery opportunities.&lt;SEP&gt;The Philippines is a region where phosphogypsum is evaluated for rare earth element extraction.&lt;SEP&gt;The Philippines utilizes PG for cement production and minor applications in agriculture and rare earth recovery.&lt;SEP&gt;A country where phosphogypsum was evaluated for radiation risks and resource opportunities.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-025</data>
