<node id="Crystal regulation">
  <data key="d0">Crystal regulation</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Crystal regulation is a technical approach used to moderately improve the leaching efficiency of rare earth elements from phosphogypsum.</data>
