<node id="Sodium EDTA">
  <data key="d0">Sodium EDTA</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Sodium EDTA is a chemical agent used for alkaline solubilization to facilitate rare earth element beneficiation.&lt;SEP&gt;An alkaline solution used to solubilize PG, with solubility rates increasing with concentration.&lt;SEP&gt;Sodium EDTA is a chelating agent referenced in the context of hydroxyapatite processing.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b81aeff540d385f1d1eda298b44619be-chunk-006</data>
