<node id="Beneficiation">
  <data key="d0">Beneficiation</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Beneficiation is an enrichment process required to concentrate rare earth elements from low-grade sources.&lt;SEP&gt;Beneficiation is a physical processing method used to concentrate phosphate rock prior to acid treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;A physical processing method that concentrates phosphate rock and increases its radioactivity by up to 400%.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
