<node id="Mineral Carbonation">
  <data key="d0">Mineral Carbonation</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Mineral carbonation is a chemical process and targeted technique designed for the permanent sequestration and fixation of carbon dioxide by reacting it with metal-rich or calcium-rich minerals to form thermodynamically stable, solid carbonate compounds. Because the resulting carbonate products are highly stable, the method is considered inherently safe and provides a reliable pathway for long-term carbon capture and storage. The process typically occurs in a liquid solution and can be optimized under increased carbon dioxide pressure, often utilizing specific chemical agents and conditions such as ammonia, calcium hydroxide, and the formation of calcium oxide nanoparticles. In certain applications, it also encompasses the remineralization of brine water.

A primary industrial application of mineral carbonation involves utilizing phosphogypsum and other gypsum-based solid wastes as feedstock to reduce greenhouse gas emissions. By chemically modifying these industrial byproducts, the process effectively sequesters carbon dioxide while simultaneously converting the waste materials into valuable carbonate and sulfate salts. This dual functionality establishes mineral carbonation as a key environmental and industrial strategy, successfully transforming surplus industrial waste into useful chemical products while achieving significant atmospheric carbon reduction.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-054&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-038&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80e3f6300e001922a5ca2a6a8ac2e0d2-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80e3f6300e001922a5ca2a6a8ac2e0d2-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80e3f6300e001922a5ca2a6a8ac2e0d2-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80e3f6300e001922a5ca2a6a8ac2e0d2-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80e3f6300e001922a5ca2a6a8ac2e0d2-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80e3f6300e001922a5ca2a6a8ac2e0d2-chunk-016</data>
