<node id="Organic Extractants">
  <data key="d0">Organic Extractants</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Organic extractants are chemical agents used to treat phosphogypsum waste and facilitate the extraction of valuable components.&lt;SEP&gt;Organic extractants are chemical compounds applied in the treatment of phosphogypsum waste to facilitate element separation.&lt;SEP&gt;Organic extractants are chemical substances used in the leaching process to extract materials from the phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Organic extractants are chemical agents used to treat and separate components from phosphogypsum waste.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemical compounds used to remove radioactive isotopes like lead-210 and uranium-238 from phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Organic extractants are chemical agents used to remove radioactive isotopes from phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Organic extractants are chemical agents used to treat phosphogypsum waste.</data>
