<node id="J. Radioanal. Nucl. Chem.">
  <data key="d0">J. Radioanal. Nucl. Chem.</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">J. Radioanal. Nucl. Chem. is the journal that published the 2011 study on treating phosphogypsum waste.&lt;SEP&gt;A scientific journal that published research on radiological impacts and phosphogypsum treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;J. Radioanal. Nucl. Chem. published studies on radionuclide levels and temporal variation in phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;J. Radioanal. Nucl. Chem. is a scientific journal that published research on fluoride ion removal using hydroxyapatite.&lt;SEP&gt;J. Radioanal. Nucl. Chem. is a scientific journal that published research on lead-210 removal using hydroxyapatite.&lt;SEP&gt;J. Radioanal. Nucl. Chem. is a scientific journal that published multiple studies on phosphogypsum and phosphate fertilizers in Brazil.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-050&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-039&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-037</data>
