<node id="Miner. Eng.">
  <data key="d0">Miner. Eng.</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Miner. Eng. is a scientific journal dedicated to publishing research within the field of mineral engineering. It serves as a comprehensive platform for scholarly work covering a diverse range of technical and environmental topics, including rare earth element extraction and concentrate production, sulfuric acid bioproduction, and the management of industrial byproducts. The journal has featured notable publications such as a 2019 study on rare earth concentrate production and a critical review of acid rock drainage prediction methods.

A significant focus of the journal's literature involves the processing and utilization of phosphogypsum. Research published in Miner. Eng. explores methodologies for extracting rare earth concentrates from phosphogypsum, alongside investigations into the stabilization and controlled release of hazardous substances within this material. Additionally, the journal disseminates studies on solid waste binders and the development of dihydrate phosphogypsum aggregate backfill materials, underscoring its role in advancing sustainable waste valorization and engineering solutions in the mineral processing industry.&lt;SEP&gt;A journal featuring research on impurity removal from phosphogypsum during gypsum preparation.&lt;SEP&gt;Miner. Eng. is the journal that published the 2011 study on the safety assessment of the Xiangyun phosphogypsum tailings pond.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-053&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-042&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-048&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-040&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-039&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-25198f8665e133385fd54e5a03e28a44-chunk-016</data>
