  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">J. Mater. Cycles Waste Manag. is the journal that published the 2019 study on recovering compounds from Moroccan phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;J. Mater. Cycles Waste Manag. is an academic journal publishing studies on solidified phosphogypsum as a Portland cement retarder.&lt;SEP&gt;A journal focused on materials and waste management that published the 2023 phosphate sludge valorization study.&lt;SEP&gt;J. Mater. Cycles Waste Manag. is a scientific journal that published a 2023 review on phosphogypsum waste utilization.&lt;SEP&gt;A journal publishing reviews on the environmental and economic challenges of using phosphogypsum waste.&lt;SEP&gt;J. Mater. Cycles Waste Manag. is a scientific journal that published research on rare earth leaching from phosphate rock.</data>
