<node id="Scanning Electron Microscopy">
  <data key="d0">Scanning Electron Microscopy</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Scanning Electron Microscopy is a versatile analytical and imaging technique primarily utilized to examine and visualize the surface morphology, microscopic texture, microstructural characteristics, crystalline structure, and surface properties of a wide range of materials and synthesized samples. The method functions by generating high-magnification grayscale micrographs, frequently at magnifications such as 200KX or at increasing levels, alongside detailed surface scans and technical metadata. To facilitate accurate morphological studies, samples are typically prepared by sputtering them with a thin layer of gold. Beyond structural visualization, the technique is frequently coupled with energy dispersive spectroscopy to map elemental distributions, identify rare earth elements, and characterize the mineralogical composition of substances.

In practical applications, Scanning Electron Microscopy is extensively deployed across research and industrial settings to characterize diverse solid raw and production materials. It is commonly applied to analyze hydroxyapatite, providing critical insights into particle size, size distribution, morphology, and potential aggregation of dried, calcined powders, and nanopowders at various magnifications. The technique is equally vital for investigating phosphogypsum, where it reveals the crystalline structure, microstructure, crystalline arrangement, and surface properties of raw, leached, and citric acid-treated samples, as well as individual particles, stacked plate-like crystals, and phosphogypsum-based brick samples to assess microstructure and densification. Furthermore, Scanning Electron Microscopy effectively examines the surface structure and morphology of crystals, ceramics, and materials exhibiting specific structural traits, such as cylindrical rod-like morphologies, delivering comprehensive data on the structural, morphological, and compositional attributes of materials across multiple scientific domains.&lt;SEP&gt;Scanning electron microscopy is an analytical technique used to examine the hydration products of cement blends.&lt;SEP&gt;Scanning electron microscopy is an analytical technique used to examine the microstructure of hydration products.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f2534f7a997df3f80305323317b15be9-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f2534f7a997df3f80305323317b15be9-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f2534f7a997df3f80305323317b15be9-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2760dc2a11fedad02d24741a978cf20d-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6825862084b162a4b16cd1037c76e3d7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6825862084b162a4b16cd1037c76e3d7-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-160a0fe95f7c82b193c6af751106ab6d-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-35aef6efc801611130c5dd196fe513df-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-35aef6efc801611130c5dd196fe513df-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-35aef6efc801611130c5dd196fe513df-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80e3f6300e001922a5ca2a6a8ac2e0d2-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80e3f6300e001922a5ca2a6a8ac2e0d2-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-036&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d5e4f0f96b4ad61d23685552d3211225-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d5e4f0f96b4ad61d23685552d3211225-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-72ff3bbf1e2b594abc3ec5c8d86e3178-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-72ff3bbf1e2b594abc3ec5c8d86e3178-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-72ff3bbf1e2b594abc3ec5c8d86e3178-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-72ff3bbf1e2b594abc3ec5c8d86e3178-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e0549fcda95f7199440791b20bf85635-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e0549fcda95f7199440791b20bf85635-chunk-000</data>
