<node id="Energy Dispersive X-ray Spectroscopy">
  <data key="d0">Energy Dispersive X-ray Spectroscopy</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Energy Dispersive X-ray Spectroscopy (EDS) is a fundamental analytical, materials science, and spectroscopic technique designed to determine the elemental composition of a sample. Operating as an analytical method, it functions by generating an EDS spectrum that plots signal intensity against photon energy or energy levels. This process enables the precise identification and quantification of the elements present within a given material, providing critical data for chemical characterization and materials analysis.

The technique is frequently coupled with microscopy systems, particularly scanning electron microscopy, to facilitate advanced spatial analysis. This integration allows researchers to generate detailed elemental mapping data that visualizes the distribution of elements across a sample, as well as to determine elemental composition at specific microscopic spots such as pt1 and pt2. In practical applications, Energy Dispersive X-ray Spectroscopy has been extensively utilized to analyze diverse substances, such as phosphogypsum particles, where it effectively detects specific mineral phases, determines the calcium-to-phosphorus ratio, and characterizes the overall elemental profile of the material.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-35aef6efc801611130c5dd196fe513df-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b81aeff540d385f1d1eda298b44619be-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b81aeff540d385f1d1eda298b44619be-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-037&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792294020</data>
