  <data key="d0">Holmium</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Holmium is a chemical element whose concentration and enrichment were measured in the samples.&lt;SEP&gt;Holmium is a rare earth element measured in WBS and TWBS samples.&lt;SEP&gt;Holmium is a chemical element listed in the compositional analysis table.&lt;SEP&gt;Holmium is a rare earth element with a concentration below the detection limit in the analyzed sample.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-013</data>
