  <data key="d0">Lutetium</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Lutetium is a rare earth element measured in WBS and TWBS samples.&lt;SEP&gt;Lutetium is a chemical element listed in the compositional analysis table.&lt;SEP&gt;Lutetium is a rare earth element analyzed in Idaho phosphogypsum with a mean concentration of 0.41 mg/kg.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-007</data>
