<node id="Hydrometallurgical Processes">
  <data key="d0">Hydrometallurgical Processes</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Hydrometallurgical Processes are aqueous chemical techniques used to extract and recover metals and elements from ores and industrial waste.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydrometallurgical processes are reviewed for recovering yttrium from primary and secondary sources.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydrometallurgical processes are sustainable and viable approaches for recovering rare earth elements from PG due to low energy consumption and environmental friendliness.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydrometallurgical Processes are sustainable extraction techniques applied to recover rare earth elements from phosphogypsum with low energy consumption.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydrometallurgical Processes are chemical extraction techniques reviewed for recovering yttrium and other elements from primary and secondary sources.&lt;SEP&gt;Methods reviewed for recovering rare earth elements from phosphate rock.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-043&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-024</data>
