  <data key="d2">An analytical technique used for determining and mapping rare earth elements in phosphogypsum stacks.&lt;SEP&gt;Instrumental neutron activation analysis is a laboratory technique used alongside gamma-ray spectrometry for radioactivity determination.&lt;SEP&gt;Instrumental neutron activation analysis is a technique used for determining and mapping rare earth elements in phosphogypsum stacks.&lt;SEP&gt;Instrumental Neutron Activation Analysis is an analytical technique used to detect heavy metals in phosphogypsum and marine samples.&lt;SEP&gt;Instrumental neutron activation analysis is a precise analytical method used for determining and mapping rare earth elements in environmental samples.&lt;SEP&gt;Instrumental Neutron Activation Analysis is a highly sensitive technique used for determining and mapping trace elements.&lt;SEP&gt;Instrumental neutron activation analysis is a scientific technique used to determine and map rare earth elements in phosphogypsum stacks.</data>
