<node id="Radiochemical Procedures">
  <data key="d0">Radiochemical Procedures</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Radiochemical procedures are applied to uranium sources to prepare them for alpha-spectra analysis.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-004</data>
