<node id="Table 5">
  <data key="d0">Table 5</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Table 5 is a generic identifier utilized across numerous distinct scientific publications, with each instance corresponding to a different data table tailored to specific research contexts. In environmental and nuclear science, one version functions as a reference document detailing radioactive element content, specifically listing U-238 series radionuclides present in significant quantities within phosphogypsum. This iteration summarizes reported radionuclide activities in phosphogypsum samples from various global locations, presents the frequencies and attributions for both raw and thermogravimetric analysis-treated phosphogypsum spectra, and outlines the environmental impacts of the phosphogypsum storage process on atmospheric, water, and soil ecosystems. It also incorporates Life Cycle Inventory data regarding phosphogypsum disposal in a stack.

In nuclear physics, a separate instance of Table 5 presents data on the natural isotopic ratios of uranium isotopes, calculated based on alpha-particle measurements. Within materials science and catalysis research, another version documents the catalytic decomposition results of nitrous oxide when processed over rhodium-supported metal phosphates. This same domain is further represented by data providing phase estimation via the Rietveld refinement method, including percentages of HAp, Alpha TCP, and Beta TCP, alongside measurements of average particle diameters and crystallite sizes for synthetic hydroxyapatites. Additional materials-focused entries calculate average particle diameters based on specific surface area.

In agricultural studies, Table 5 summarizes the outcomes of a three-year application of a silica-calcium–potassium–magnesium fertilizer, specifically tracking the fertilizer's effects on various crops with a focus on changes in crop yield and soluble sugar content. For engineering and construction applications, it lists the composition and mix proportions of proposed road technique materials. In environmental and emergy analysis, the table documents emergy loss caused by various pollutant emissions across different scenarios, highlighting Scenario 1 as exhibiting the most significant loss. Finally, in methodological and computational contexts, Table 5 indicates systematic errors introduced by simplifying assumptions in equations. Collectively, these varied entries demonstrate how the identifier serves as a versatile placeholder for highly specialized datasets across diverse scientific disciplines.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 5 exhibits parameter values and sources for the risk assessment model.&lt;SEP&gt;A table listing active energies and linearities calculated with different mechanism functions.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 5 documents the percentage reduction in compressive, flexural, and tensile strengths at 10% and 80% PG replacements.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 5 is a data table referenced in the text, likely containing experimental results.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-033&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c22d31cfad5421c936a23705a3bc6e0-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-160a0fe95f7c82b193c6af751106ab6d-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d5e4f0f96b4ad61d23685552d3211225-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e0549fcda95f7199440791b20bf85635-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e0549fcda95f7199440791b20bf85635-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792502638</data>
