<node id="Uranium Series">
  <data key="d0">Uranium Series</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Uranium Series is the radioactive decay chain containing the measured parent and daughter isotopes.&lt;SEP&gt;The uranium series is a radioactive decay chain containing isotopes like uranium-238, radium-226, and lead-210.&lt;SEP&gt;The Uranium Series is a radioactive decay series that includes Radium-226 and Lead-210.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-014</data>
