  <data key="d2">Chemical compound mixed with samples to prepare discs for infrared spectroscopy analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;Potassium Bromide is used as a disc medium to measure the infrared spectra of PG waste samples.&lt;SEP&gt;A chemical medium used in the pellet technique for infrared spectroscopy analysis.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c22d31cfad5421c936a23705a3bc6e0-chunk-004</data>
