<node id="Phosphoric Acid Production">
  <data key="d0">Phosphoric Acid Production</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Phosphoric Acid Production is a critical industrial and chemical manufacturing process primarily defined by the conversion of phosphate rock, typically in slurry form, and sulfuric acid into phosphoric acid. The operation is executed through various established techniques, including wet, kiln, and thermal methods, and is frequently optimized through advanced approaches such as the di-hemihydrate or hemihydrate process. A central and defining characteristic of this manufacturing cycle is the generation of phosphogypsum, a solid waste byproduct composed largely of calcium sulphate. The specific production method directly influences the chemical composition of this calcium sulphate, which is notably characterized by the presence of radioactive isotopes.

From an operational and environmental standpoint, Phosphoric Acid Production functions as a major industrial activity with substantial ecological footprints. While it yields essential chemical compounds and serves as a direct application site for co-production technologies, it simultaneously generates significant solid waste that carries notable radiological and environmental impacts. The process actively influences the mobility of toxic elements within surrounding ecosystems and is closely associated with the fractionation of natural radioactivity. Furthermore, the manufacturing unit necessitates strict environmental management, particularly the reduction of Total Phosphorus discharge into wastewater, to mitigate its broader geochemical and ecological consequences.&lt;SEP&gt;The industrial process that generates phosphogypsum as a primary by-product, linked to toxic element mobility.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-035&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-038&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e4a551024f80f822f3f35e38ec278151-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28fbd4302bba090e667215c840757ff7-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54b92b2ad16a2528ff6a863329c5d403-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80e3f6300e001922a5ca2a6a8ac2e0d2-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-018</data>
