<node id="Rutherford et al.">
  <data key="d0">Rutherford et al.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Researchers cited regarding the radioactivity sources and environmental pathways of phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Rutherford et al. are researchers who highlighted the need for further clarification on the chemical form and location of Ra-226 in phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Rutherford et al. are researchers who studied the variation of phosphogypsum's major elemental composition based on the wet phosphoric acid process.&lt;SEP&gt;Rutherford et al. are researchers who documented the precipitation of barium as barium sulfate and the oxidation state of thorium.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-033&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-017</data>
