<node id="Solvent Extraction">
  <data key="d0">Solvent Extraction</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Solvent Extraction is a widely utilized chemical separation technique designed to isolate and purify specific elements from complex mixtures by transferring target compounds from an aqueous phase into an immiscible organic or specialized liquid phase. The method serves as a primary and highly selective purification process across various industrial and research contexts. It is extensively applied to separate rare earth elements and other metals, including thorium, uranium, and vanadium, from aqueous solutions, leachates, and nitrate media. Specific operational mechanisms include the use of phosphonium cations to extract lanthanum-nitrate complexes into an organic phase, as well as the targeted transfer of rare earth ions into ionic liquid phases. Additionally, uranium can be effectively isolated using a TOPO/cyclohexane system, demonstrating the technique's adaptability to different chemical environments and reagents.

In the context of rare earth element recovery, Solvent Extraction functions as a crucial process for isolating individual elements into separate solutions, often utilizing colored liquids, and separating them into constituent groups to produce high-quality materials. While it is a common and highly effective method for recovering rare earth oxides from leached solutions, its broader implementation faces notable challenges related to economic viability and waste management. Despite these hurdles, the technique remains a fundamental and versatile approach for elemental separation, continuously adapted through specialized solvents to meet precise purification requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;A chemical separation technique used to recover uranium from wet process phosphoric acid.&lt;SEP&gt;Solvent Extraction is a chemical separation technique compared with ion exchange for recovering uranium and other elements from phosphoric acid.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-031&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-057&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-edfc4dcbd74cbf0b294f83f2034b209d-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-edfc4dcbd74cbf0b294f83f2034b209d-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-edfc4dcbd74cbf0b294f83f2034b209d-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-edfc4dcbd74cbf0b294f83f2034b209d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-edfc4dcbd74cbf0b294f83f2034b209d-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-edfc4dcbd74cbf0b294f83f2034b209d-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-edfc4dcbd74cbf0b294f83f2034b209d-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-edfc4dcbd74cbf0b294f83f2034b209d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-edfc4dcbd74cbf0b294f83f2034b209d-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-028</data>
