  <data key="d0">Florida Institute of Phosphate Research</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Florida Institute of Phosphate Research is an organization based in Bartow, FL, involved in phosphogypsum research.&lt;SEP&gt;The Florida Institute of Phosphate Research published foundational reports on phosphogypsum microbiology and reuse.&lt;SEP&gt;An organization located in Florida focused on phosphate research.&lt;SEP&gt;The Florida Institute of Phosphate Research is the institution that published a report on phosphogypsum for secondary road construction.&lt;SEP&gt;Florida Institute of Phosphate Research is an organization involved in phosphate research and phosphogypsum applications.</data>
