  <data key="d0">Genie 2000 Software</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Software used to process spectral acquisition data from the HPGe detector.&lt;SEP&gt;Genie 2000 Software is used to process acquisition spectra from the MCA connected to an IBM personal computer.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-001</data>
