  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">New York is the location of the United Nations headquarters, which published UNSCEAR reports.&lt;SEP&gt;New York is a location where Plenum Press is based and where research on environmental radon was published.&lt;SEP&gt;The publication location for the textbook Elements of X-ray crystallography.&lt;SEP&gt;New York is the publication location for the 1975 analytical chemistry text on radium.&lt;SEP&gt;The city where the United Nations published the 2000 UNSCEAR report.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-040&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-054&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-019</data>
