  <data key="d0">Permeability</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A property of CPB mixtures that increases with lower binder content, affecting mechanical properties and leaching risks.&lt;SEP&gt;Permeability is a material characteristic that generally decreases when treated or calcined phosphogypsum is used.&lt;SEP&gt;A property of the matrix affected by phosphogypsum usage.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-011</data>
