<node id="Sustainability">
  <data key="d0">Sustainability</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Sustainability is a multifaceted term that encompasses both a foundational environmental concept and a specific academic publication. As a core concept, sustainability serves as a central theme and guiding principle across diverse scientific and policy assessments. It is used to evaluate recycling initiatives, resident consumption patterns, and industrial development trends, while also directing the assessment of rare earth supply chains and environmental management practices. The concept functions as a measure of overall system health, a metric quantified by the Environmental Sustainability Index. In specialized engineering applications, it represents a critical requirement that must be carefully balanced with structural safety, particularly within cemented paste backfill mixture formulations. Furthermore, the concept remains a primary research focus for experts such as Dr. Marc Azab.

Sustainability is also the title of an academic and scientific journal dedicated to publishing research and perspectives on global challenges and environmental innovations. The journal features studies on agricultural and geotechnical topics, including the development of biochar phosphate fertilizers, nitrogen preservation techniques, and case studies on slope stability analysis for phosphogypsum stockpiles. Additionally, it disseminates research addressing broader sustainability issues, such as the environmental impacts of plant-based diets and the biorefining of food waste.&lt;SEP&gt;Sustainability is a journal that published clarifications and debates regarding peak phosphorus and long-term phosphorus security.&lt;SEP&gt;Sustainability is a journal that published a 2015 landmark report on understanding and enhancing soil biological health.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-036&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2760dc2a11fedad02d24741a978cf20d-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-035&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-033&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1b5f95e85d7bfa3b7aab581f3c82b33-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-25198f8665e133385fd54e5a03e28a44-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-018</data>
