  <data key="d2">Carbon Neutrality Economy is an economic framework aimed at achieving net-zero carbon emissions, influencing industrial policy.&lt;SEP&gt;The Carbon Neutrality Economy is an economic model pursued by China to achieve net-zero emissions by twenty-sixty.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-000</data>
