<node id="Flotation">
  <data key="d0">Flotation</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Flotation is a physical separation and pretreatment technique primarily applied to phosphogypsum for purification and quality enhancement. The process involves introducing phosphogypsum and water into specialized machinery, where targeted components or contaminants rise to the surface and are subsequently scraped off. Its main objectives include removing undesirable impurities such as fine mud and organic debris, isolating gypsum, and extracting valuable components, particularly rare earth elements. By effectively targeting these specific materials, flotation significantly improves the industrial suitability and overall purity of the processed phosphogypsum.

In practical applications, flotation is frequently integrated with other processing methods to maximize efficiency. It is commonly employed alongside wet sieving or combined with lime addition to further eliminate residual contaminants and optimize the final product's composition. As a versatile pretreatment strategy, flotation plays a critical role in transforming raw phosphogypsum into a refined material capable of meeting stringent industrial standards.&lt;SEP&gt;Flotation is a laboratory-scale purification method. Flotation removes impurities from phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Flotation is a laboratory-scale purification technology for phosphogypsum that faces scalability challenges for large-scale industrial use.&lt;SEP&gt;A purification technique applied to whiten and purify phosphogypsum.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791610710</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
