  <data key="d2">NaOH is an alkaline substance used in base-washing procedures to adjust the pH of the PG system.&lt;SEP&gt;NaOH is the chemical formula representing sodium hydroxide.&lt;SEP&gt;A chemical compound used to prepare a 200 g/L solution as specified in the standard.&lt;SEP&gt;NaOH is a base employed alongside HCl to adjust the pH levels of aqueous solutions during adsorption experiments.</data>
