<node id="National Natural Science Foundation of China">
  <data key="d0">National Natural Science Foundation of China</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The National Natural Science Foundation of China is a dedicated funding organization that serves as a primary financial backer for scientific and academic research. It operates as a key institutional body responsible for allocating monetary resources and grant numbers to support various scholarly projects and studies.

In the context of the referenced research, the foundation provided direct financial support under Project number 72374112, alongside other associated grant allocations. As a central funder, it plays an essential role in enabling scientific inquiry by consistently providing the necessary financial backing for academic investigations.&lt;SEP&gt;National Natural Science Foundation of China is a funding body that supported the research work.</data>
