<node id="J. Environ. Manage.">
  <data key="d0">J. Environ. Manage.</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">J. Environ. Manage. is a peer-reviewed scientific journal dedicated to publishing research, assessments, and critical reviews in environmental science and management. A primary focus of its publication portfolio is phosphogypsum, encompassing studies on pollutant leaching, geochemical characterization, and comprehensive environmental impact assessments. The journal extensively covers practical management and utilization strategies for this material, including research on recycling phosphogypsum for cement production and its associated environmental effects, developing phosphogypsum-based road materials, and implementing it in backfill applications.

In addition to its strong emphasis on phosphogypsum, the journal addresses broader environmental and industrial challenges. It has published reviews on resource utilization pathways for industrial solid waste, highlighting sustainable recovery methods. Furthermore, the journal serves as a platform for wastewater treatment research, featuring critical evaluations of textile wastewater treatment approaches and studies analyzing catalyst performance in treatment processes. Collectively, these publications establish the journal as a multidisciplinary resource for environmental investigations, pollution control, and industrial resource optimization.&lt;SEP&gt;J. Environ. Manage. is a peer-reviewed scientific journal that published research on the flotation purification of phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;J. Environ. Manage. is the academic journal that published the 2009 study on phosphogypsum environmental impact and management.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-033&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-037&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-033</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792406917</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
