  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Int. J. Miner. Metall. Mater. is a peer-reviewed journal that published research on fluoride immobilization in phosphogypsum-based backfill.&lt;SEP&gt;Int. J. Miner. Metall. Mater. is a scientific journal that published research on erosion wear during tailings slurry transportation.</data>
