  <data key="d0">J. Build. Eng.</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">J. Build. Eng. is the journal that published the research on phosphogypsum valorization in eco-efficient construction.&lt;SEP&gt;J. Build. Eng. is a journal that published research on recycling phosphogypsum for gypsum plaster production.&lt;SEP&gt;A scientific journal that published studies on valorizing phosphogypsum in construction materials.&lt;SEP&gt;J. Build. Eng. is a scientific journal that published research on the solar thermal treatment of phosphogypsum for cement production.&lt;SEP&gt;J. Build. Eng. is a scientific journal that published research on recycling phosphogypsum for gypsum plaster.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-031</data>
