<node id="Soil Degradation">
  <data key="d0">Soil Degradation</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Soil degradation is an environmental consequence of phosphogypsum storage that extends beyond local areas.&lt;SEP&gt;Soil degradation is an environmental issue addressed in research focusing on biological health indicators and reversal strategies.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-25198f8665e133385fd54e5a03e28a44-chunk-015</data>
