<node id="Dental Fluorosis">
  <data key="d0">Dental Fluorosis</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Dental fluorosis is a health condition caused by high fluoride intake exceeding 1.5 mg/L.&lt;SEP&gt;A health condition linked to volcanic degassing in Vanuatu, cited as a novel exposure pathway comparable to industrial chemical exposure.&lt;SEP&gt;Dental fluorosis is a health condition. Dental fluorosis is caused by fluorine pollution and poses health risks to local communities.&lt;SEP&gt;Dental fluorosis is a health impact caused by fluorine impurities in phosphogypsum.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-033&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-016</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791612145</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Skeletal Fluorosis">
  <data key="d0">Skeletal Fluorosis</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Skeletal fluorosis is a severe health condition caused by high fluoride intake.&lt;SEP&gt;Skeletal fluorosis is a health condition. Skeletal fluorosis results from fluorine exposure and contributes to safety risks in affected areas.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-003</data>
