<node id="Water Eutrophication">
  <data key="d0">Water Eutrophication</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Water eutrophication is an environmental issue caused by phosphorus enrichment from phosphogypsum in aquatic bodies.&lt;SEP&gt;An ecological issue caused by phosphogypsum storage, affecting aquatic ecosystems.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-011</data>
