<node id="Chlorapatite">
  <data key="d0">Chlorapatite</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">Chlorapatite is a calcium chloride phosphate compound that can replace fluorides in fluorapatite.&lt;SEP&gt;Chlorapatite is a chlorine-containing apatite mineral that can be converted into hydroxyapatite.&lt;SEP&gt;Chlorapatite is a standard material used for calibrating Cl measurements.</data>
