<node id="Fourier Transform Infrared Spectroscopy">
  <data key="d0">Fourier Transform Infrared Spectroscopy</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Fourier Transform Infrared Spectroscopy is a widely utilized analytical and spectroscopic characterization technique designed to identify chemical bonds, functional groups, and molecular vibrations within diverse materials. Operating primarily in the mid-infrared region, the method functions by measuring light transmittance against wavenumber to generate transmittance spectra. These spectra are then systematically analyzed to determine the precise chemical composition, structural characteristics, and molecular interactions of a given sample, effectively elucidating the presence of organic functional groups and underlying chemical structures.

The technique has been extensively applied across various scientific research domains, particularly in the detailed characterization of specific inorganic and biological materials. It is frequently employed to analyze the chemical composition, properties, and functional group vibrations of synthesized and elaborated hydroxyapatite powders. Furthermore, Fourier Transform Infrared Spectroscopy serves as a critical tool for monitoring the chemical conversion of amorphous calcium phosphate into hydroxyapatite. Beyond hydroxyapatite, the method is also utilized to examine the functional groups and detailed chemical makeup of raw phosphogypsum, demonstrating its broad utility in correlating spectral data with molecular interactions for comprehensive material analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;Fourier Transform Infrared Spectroscopy is an analytical technique used to characterize biological calcium phosphates.&lt;SEP&gt;A spectroscopic technique used to compare synthesized samples, determine optimal reaction times, and identify chemical absorption bands.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f2534f7a997df3f80305323317b15be9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f2534f7a997df3f80305323317b15be9-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9e17ad262bd9835860df552d7ff475f1-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4a64a852097fdc910b98ed788503ce4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4a64a852097fdc910b98ed788503ce4-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4a64a852097fdc910b98ed788503ce4-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54b92b2ad16a2528ff6a863329c5d403-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80e3f6300e001922a5ca2a6a8ac2e0d2-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80e3f6300e001922a5ca2a6a8ac2e0d2-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b81aeff540d385f1d1eda298b44619be-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-72ff3bbf1e2b594abc3ec5c8d86e3178-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792425339</data>
