<node id="Greenhouse Gas">
  <data key="d0">Greenhouse Gas</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Greenhouse gas emissions are an environmental concern associated with the high energy consumption of calcination processes.&lt;SEP&gt;Greenhouse gas refers to emissions targeted for reduction through the Circular Economy strategy and cleaner technologies.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of emission targeted for reduction through circular economy strategies and cleaner technologies.</data>
