<node id="Eutrophication">
  <data key="d0">Eutrophication</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Eutrophication is an ecological and environmental process characterized by severe water quality degradation and nutrient overload in aquatic systems. It is primarily driven by excessive phosphorus and phosphate enrichment, which frequently originates from anthropogenic sources such as phosphogypsum (PG) export, soil leaching, agricultural applications, and brick production. This nutrient pollution introduces soluble phosphorus, impurities, and occasionally elevated fluorine levels into surface waters, fundamentally altering the aquatic survival environment. The resulting surplus triggers rapid and excessive algal blooms, disrupts phytoplankton populations, and leads to significant oxygen depletion. In restricted water bodies, the condition may also be closely associated with or exacerbated by algal blooms.

As a recognized environmental impact category, eutrophication is subject to footprint assessments where PG use as a soil amendment typically registers the lowest impact, while brick production ranks highest. However, inherent data limitations often necessitate the use of alternative assessment methods to evaluate its impact accurately. The cascading effects of this process pose severe threats to aquatic organisms, biodiversity, and overall ecosystem health. Consequently, eutrophication represents a critical ecological consequence of phosphorus leakage that sustainable phosphorus management measures actively aim to mitigate.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-033&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1b5f95e85d7bfa3b7aab581f3c82b33-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1b5f95e85d7bfa3b7aab581f3c82b33-chunk-010</data>
