<node id="Leachate">
  <data key="d0">Leachate</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Leachate is a complex liquid mixture that forms and percolates through industrial stockpile sites, particularly within phosphogypsum storage facilities. It is characterized by a highly acidic and polluted composition, containing significant concentrations of phosphoric acid, total phosphorus, sulfate ions, toxic heavy metals, and various non-heavy metal pollutants. This liquid phase is generated during cyclic leaching processes and serves as the medium for the diffusion and extraction of rare earth elements from phosphogypsum, accumulating these valuable components before they are separated during the wet processing phase.

The substance is frequently identified as the primary source of reddish liquid pools observed on the ground, highlighting its potential for environmental dispersion. Due to its toxic and acidic nature, leachate requires rigorous environmental safety studies and the implementation of strict isolation barriers. These containment measures are essential to prevent uncontrolled contamination, mitigate ecological risks, and manage the hazardous byproducts effectively throughout industrial operations.&lt;SEP&gt;A highly acidic liquid byproduct generated from phosphogypsum storage, containing high concentrations of heavy metals and fluorides.&lt;SEP&gt;Leachate is a liquid formed during phosphogypsum landfilling that mobilizes hazardous constituents into groundwater.&lt;SEP&gt;Leachate is a liquid discharge from the slag yard mitigated by PG reuse.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28fbd4302bba090e667215c840757ff7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-017</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792223386</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
