  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A construction material studied for its potential use with phosphogypsum under elevated temperatures and thermal shock.&lt;SEP&gt;A composite material studied for its potential use with phosphogypsum under elevated temperatures and thermal shock.&lt;SEP&gt;Alkali-activated fly ash is a composite material that utilizes phosphogypsum under elevated temperature conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Alkali-activated fly ash is a cementitious material system where phosphogypsum is utilized as an activator, particularly under elevated temperature conditions.</data>
