<node id="Industrial Separation Procedures">
  <data key="d0">Industrial Separation Procedures</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Industrial separation procedures are manufacturing processes with limitations that cause residual acids to remain in PG.</data>
