  <data key="d2">Environmental Science and Pollution Research is a journal that published a study on phosphate rock and phosphogypsum characterization.&lt;SEP&gt;Environ. Sci. Pollut. Res. is the journal that published the overview on natural radioactivity in mineral phosphate fertilizers.&lt;SEP&gt;Environ. Sci. Pollut. Res. is a scientific journal that published research on acid mine drainage hydrochemical characteristics.&lt;SEP&gt;A journal that published research on radionuclide distribution in phosphogypsum grains.&lt;SEP&gt;Environ. Sci. Pollut. Res. is a scientific journal that published research on lead(II) removal using microwave-assisted hydroxyapatite.&lt;SEP&gt;A scientific journal that published research on the characterization of phosphate rock and phosphogypsum from Tunisia.&lt;SEP&gt;Environ. Sci. Pollut. Res. featured studies on the impact of phosphogypsum addition on composting processes.</data>
