<node id="Materials">
  <data key="d0">Materials</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Materials is an open-access, peer-reviewed academic journal dedicated to publishing research across material science and engineering. It serves as a comprehensive platform for disseminating scientific advancements and practical applications within these disciplines. The journal’s scope encompasses biomaterials, environmental remediation, construction materials, and industrial waste utilization. A substantial body of its published work focuses on phosphogypsum, featuring studies on its recovery, decomposition, impurity removal, and in situ remediation. Research also extends to phosphogypsum-based construction materials and its application in cemented backfill, where investigations address pollutant release, fluoride pollution control, and phosphate removal utilizing iron tailings. Additionally, the journal has documented studies on slag properties and utilization. In the biomedical and environmental sectors, Materials has published work on hydroxyapatite sintering behavior, porous hydroxyapatite scaffolds, and hydroxyapatite-titanium dioxide composites for photocatalytic degradation, alongside research on the photocatalytic degradation of diclofenac and coating formation mechanisms for dental implants.

In a distinct context, Materials refers to a specific column in data tables that lists the isotopes or elements being measured.&lt;SEP&gt;Materials is the journal that published the 2023 study on TiO nanotubes decorated with MoC.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-033&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-039&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-032&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-040&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-040&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-035&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-037&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-020</data>
