  <data key="d0">Green Development Principles</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Green development principles guide the proposed recovery process by emphasizing wastewater-free operations and reagent conservation.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791038121</data>
