<node id="Soluble P2O5">
  <data key="d0">Soluble P2O5</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Soluble P2O5 is an impurity present in high-purity gypsum, limited to less than 0.06 wt%.&lt;SEP&gt;Soluble P2O5 is an impurity present in the recovered gypsum, measured at less than 0.06 wt%.&lt;SEP&gt;Soluble P2O5 is a chemical component of Phosphogypsum measured in weight percent.&lt;SEP&gt;Soluble P2O5 content represents the amount of soluble phosphorus pentoxide in quicklime.&lt;SEP&gt;Soluble P2O5 is a water-soluble fraction of phosphorus pentoxide, measured in percentage.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-007</data>
