<node id="Recrystallization of Gypsum Matrix">
  <data key="d0">Recrystallization of Gypsum Matrix</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Recrystallization of the gypsum matrix is the mechanism underlying the cycle leaching process.</data>
