<node id="Phosphate Fertilizer">
  <data key="d0">Phosphate Fertilizer</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Phosphate Fertilizer is a widely utilized agricultural and chemical product manufactured primarily from phosphate rock. Its preparation and increasing global demand serve as key drivers for large-scale phosphate rock mining and acid manufacturing processes. Classified within industrial statistics charts and recognized as a pillar industry product in China's agricultural development, the sector also encompasses specific waste management categories that regulate its manufacturing footprint. Furthermore, the production boundary of phosphate fertilizer is explicitly covered under established carbon emission accounting methods, highlighting its significance in industrial environmental reporting.

The manufacturing process of phosphate fertilizer is notable for generating phosphogypsum as a major byproduct, with its preparation responsible for large-scale phosphogypsum production. Beyond industrial outputs, the long-term agricultural application of phosphate fertilizer poses environmental challenges, particularly the gradual accumulation of toxic metal(loid)s in soils. These dual impacts, encompassing substantial industrial byproduct generation and soil contamination risks, underscore the compound's complex role in modern agriculture and industrial ecology.&lt;SEP&gt;An agricultural product whose industry development and fertilizer production are linked to phosphogypsum generation.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphate fertilizer is a product manufactured alongside phosphoric acid by industrial companies.&lt;SEP&gt;A chemical product whose production routes were compared for environmental performance using LCA.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d5e4f0f96b4ad61d23685552d3211225-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792400237</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
