<node id="J Clean Prod">
  <data key="d0">J Clean Prod</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">J Clean Prod is a scientific and academic journal that publishes extensive research focused on sustainable materials, waste management, and environmental assessment. A significant portion of its published work centers on the utilization of phosphogypsum, exploring its applications as a construction material and as an additive in various cement formulations, including calcium sulfoaluminate cement and eco excess-sulphate cement. The journal also features studies on the synergistic effects of additives when phosphogypsum is combined with other industrial by-products, such as Bayer red mud, as well as research on the feasibility, treatment methods, and environmental impacts of phosphogypsum utilization.

Beyond phosphogypsum, J Clean Prod covers diverse waste valorization and resource recovery topics, including the synthesis of brucite nanosheets from nickel slag and advanced processes for rare earth recovery. Overall, the journal serves as a key platform for interdisciplinary research on sustainability, life cycle assessment, and circular economy principles, emphasizing the transformation of industrial waste streams into valuable construction and chemical resources.&lt;SEP&gt;J Clean Prod is a scientific journal publishing research on the utilization of phosphogypsum and cleaner production methods.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-036&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-035&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-98d8b2df45924e721bfa570f652f33e3-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791674254</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Chem Eng J">
  <data key="d0">Chem Eng J</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Chem Eng J is a scientific journal containing a critical review on hydrometallurgical processes for recovering rare earth elements from phosphate rock.&lt;SEP&gt;Chem Eng J is a scientific journal that published research on potassium sulfate production via double decomposition reaction.&lt;SEP&gt;Chem Eng J is a journal that published research on CO2 sequestration via indirect carbonation of artificial gypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Chem Eng J is a scientific journal that published a study on strontium substituted hydroxyapatite porous microspheres.&lt;SEP&gt;A journal containing a critical review of hydrometallurgical processes for rare earth recovery.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54b92b2ad16a2528ff6a863329c5d403-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-024</data>
