<node id="Recrystallization">
  <data key="d0">Recrystallization</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Recrystallization is a physicochemical process and synthesis technique fundamentally characterized by the dissolution of smaller particles or surface layers to facilitate the growth and reformation of larger, denser crystalline structures. In industrial and environmental applications, it is primarily deployed as a leaching reinforcement and purification method targeting gypsum and phosphogypsum matrices, which are common byproducts of phosphoric acid production. The mechanism typically initiates with the dissolution of the gypsum surface during leaching, followed by an in situ phase transformation where hemihydrated gypsum converts into a dense dihydrate gypsum microstructure. This controlled physicochemical restructuring, often driven by acidic media, triggers the release of entrained or soluble components into the surrounding solution.

When integrated with carbonation and indirect leaching strategies, Recrystallization serves as a critical pre-treatment and modification step for phosphogypsum. Its primary applications focus on resource valorization and waste remediation. The process is extensively utilized to enhance the concentration and subsequent extraction of soluble rare earth elements and lanthanides, while simultaneously facilitating the removal of radium isotopes and heavy metals. Furthermore, by decomposing phosphogypsum slag, Recrystallization enables carbon dioxide capture and the production of high-purity calcium carbonate, as well as the formation of fertilizer compounds. Ultimately, this technique optimizes the processing of gypsum-based materials, effectively purifying gypsum, recovering valuable minerals, and mitigating environmental hazards associated with industrial byproducts.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-98d8b2df45924e721bfa570f652f33e3-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-edfc4dcbd74cbf0b294f83f2034b209d-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-edfc4dcbd74cbf0b294f83f2034b209d-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-edfc4dcbd74cbf0b294f83f2034b209d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-016</data>
