<node id="Changsha">
  <data key="d0">Changsha</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Changsha is the city in China where Central South University is located.&lt;SEP&gt;A city in China associated with Central South University and research on phosphogypsum backfill.&lt;SEP&gt;Changsha is a city in China where Central South University is located and where Zhou's research was conducted.&lt;SEP&gt;A city in Hunan, China, hosting a conference on gypsum building materials and technology exchange.&lt;SEP&gt;Changsha is a city where heavy metals in size-segregated airborne particulate matter were assessed.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-040&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-039&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-032</data>
