<node id="Rare Earth Oxides">
  <data key="d0">Rare Earth Oxides</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Rare Earth Oxides are the chemical forms of rare earth elements quantified in dried PG using analytical methods.&lt;SEP&gt;Rare earth oxides are chemical compounds recovered from phosphoric acid by-products and phosphogypsum through leaching and extraction.</data>
