<node id="Hydrocyclone">
  <data key="d0">Hydrocyclone</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A hydrocyclone is a mechanical device used for gravity separation of particles in slurry.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydrocyclone is a processing device used in the wet sieve cyclone treatment to further refine phosphogypsum after initial sieving.</data>
