<node id="Leaching Process">
  <data key="d0">Leaching Process</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The Leaching Process is a specialized chemical extraction and separation technique designed to recover valuable materials and remove hazardous contaminants from solid phosphogypsum waste. Functioning as a phase-transfer procedure, it facilitates the movement of target substances from a solid matrix into a liquid phase. The primary objectives of this process are the targeted extraction of rare earth elements alongside the removal of radionuclides, radioactive elements, and other active contaminants. By effectively isolating these components, the procedure transforms phosphogypsum from a hazardous byproduct into a potential resource stream while mitigating radiological risks.

To achieve this selective separation, the Leaching Process employs specific organic solvent systems, most notably a mixture of TBP-TOPO dissolved in kerosene. This developed chemical extraction step utilizes the TBP-TOPO and kerosene combination to efficiently solubilize and extract both radioactive elements and rare earth elements from phosphogypsum samples. As a core operational procedure, it provides a reliable method for the simultaneous recovery of economically valuable rare earth elements and the detoxification of phosphogypsum waste through precise chemical partitioning.&lt;SEP&gt;The leaching process involves adding chemical reagents to phosphogypsum to extract radionuclides under controlled temperature and agitation.&lt;SEP&gt;The leaching process involves extracting elements from phosphogypsum using water or strong chemicals under controlled temperature and time.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28fbd4302bba090e667215c840757ff7-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792041352</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
