  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Proton Concentration refers to the acid strength, which positively correlates with Leaching Efficiency up to 4 mol/L.&lt;SEP&gt;Proton concentration in the solution directly controls the adsorption capacity of</data>
