<node id="Leaching Time">
  <data key="d0">Leaching Time</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Leaching Time determines extraction duration, with 3 hours found sufficient to maximize Rare Earth Element recovery.&lt;SEP&gt;Leaching time denotes a process variable that influences the mobility and release rate of trace elements during phosphogypsum leaching.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-019</data>
