<node id="Water Washing">
  <data key="d0">Water Washing</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Water washing is a physical treatment and separation process primarily utilized as a pretreatment technique for the purification and preparation of phosphogypsum. This method functions by effectively removing soluble contaminants, trace elements, and reaction products from the crystal surfaces and internal matrix of the material. It is widely recognized as a straightforward purification technique that eliminates a broad spectrum of impurities, particularly serving as a necessary physical separation step to wash away reaction products following citric acid treatment. Beyond general impurity removal, water washing is strategically applied to condition phosphogypsum, preparing it to function as a viable aggregate for cemented backfill applications.

In specialized or experimental processing workflows, water washing is also implemented as a post-calcination treatment applied to specific sample subsets to deliberately alter the material's chemical composition. Despite its effectiveness in purifying phosphogypsum and enhancing its utility in construction and backfilling, the process inherently generates liquid effluent containing dissolved contaminants. Consequently, this aqueous byproduct requires dedicated treatment and management systems to ensure environmental compliance and safe handling. Overall, water washing remains a fundamental physical method in phosphogypsum processing, balancing efficient contaminant elimination with the operational necessity of managing its resulting effluent.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-040&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e0549fcda95f7199440791b20bf85635-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792503313</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
