<node id="Rychkov">
  <data key="d0">Rychkov</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Rychkov is a researcher who achieved over 70% Rare Earth Element leaching efficiency using mechanical grinding, ultrasonic impact, and resin-in-pulp.&lt;SEP&gt;A researcher who investigated mechanical treatments like grinding and ultrasonic impact to improve rare earth element leaching.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-020</data>
