  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Hammas-Nasri is a researcher who enriched Rare Earth Elements in Phosphogypsum using a double-stage sulfuric acid leaching process.&lt;SEP&gt;Hammas-Nasri is a researcher who conducted experiments using sulfuric acid leaching and salt solutions to enhance rare earth element enrichment.&lt;SEP&gt;Hammas-Nasri denotes a researcher who conducted a study using a double sulfuric acid leaching step for rare earth element recovery.</data>
