<node id="SBF Solution">
  <data key="d0">SBF Solution</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">A simulated body fluid in which composite bone cements were immersed to evaluate in vitro apatite formation.&lt;SEP&gt;SBF Solution is a simulated body fluid solution used to evaluate the apatite-forming ability of bone cements.&lt;SEP&gt;SBF Solution is a simulated body fluid with ion concentration matching human blood plasma, used for in vitro screening of bone bioactive materials.&lt;SEP&gt;A simulated body fluid used to immerse bone cement samples to evaluate apatite precipitation and bioactivity.&lt;SEP&gt;Simulated Body Fluid used to evaluate the in vitro apatite-forming ability and biocompatibility of the material.&lt;SEP&gt;Dispersant medium used for zeta potential measurements of HAp particles.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-003</data>
