  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The setting period required before the cement samples undergo X-ray diffraction phase analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;24 Hours is the duration seeds were prepared and moistened to ensure optimal germination before planting.&lt;SEP&gt;24 Hours is the standard duration for hydrothermal processes to ensure complete deposition.&lt;SEP&gt;24 hours is the duration required for the self-assembly of rod-like structures into hierarchical microparticles.&lt;SEP&gt;24 hours is the duration for which HAP microspheres were treated with the AL aqueous solution.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e290dd6268316238694f70c30a367426-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-008</data>
