</node>
<node id="Extraction">
  <data key="d0">Extraction</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Extraction is a method for deriving hydroxyapatite from natural sources such as fish bones, shells, and bovine bones.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemical separation method attempted for removing radium isotopes from phosphogypsum.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-001</data>
