<node id="Cao et al.">
  <data key="d0">Cao et al.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Cao et al. are researchers who investigated sodium chloride-added hydroxyapatite/silk fibroin composites for bone tissue repair.&lt;SEP&gt;Researchers who explored application technologies for recycled PG.&lt;SEP&gt;Researchers who compared recycling technologies using the synergetic degree index.&lt;SEP&gt;Researchers cited for proposing the indicator degree of influence metric.&lt;SEP&gt;Cao et al. are researchers cited for their work on the relationship between calcination temperature and gypsum phase composition.&lt;SEP&gt;Researchers cited for noting that longer holding times result in sharper diffraction peaks and better crystallization.&lt;SEP&gt;Cao et al. are researchers cited for findings on MPG peak shape and crystallization quality.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-008</data>
