<node id="Cytotoxicity">
  <data key="d0">Cytotoxicity</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Cytotoxicity is a biological property evaluated through in vitro cell culture analysis to assess safety.&lt;SEP&gt;Cytotoxicity measures the degree to which a substance is toxic to cells, often assessed using colorimetric assays.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-000</data>
