<node id="Ceram. Int.">
  <data key="d0">Ceram. Int.</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Ceram. Int. is an academic and scientific journal dedicated to publishing research on ceramic materials and their diverse applications. The journal's editorial scope prominently features studies on hydroxyapatite synthesis, calcium phosphate materials, and injectable brushite for bone repair. Additionally, it covers advanced biomedical topics such as drug release applications and reinforced hydroxyapatite bone cement. By maintaining a strong focus on both fundamental ceramic science and practical material innovations, Ceram. Int. serves as a vital publication venue for researchers in materials science and biomedical engineering.

The journal's publication history includes a variety of specific studies and references across multiple years. Notable contributions include a 1997 paper that employed FTIR and QXRD techniques to investigate calcium phosphate materials. Its recent output encompasses research published in 2021 and 2022, alongside a 2019 paper co-authored by H. Nosrati. The journal also documented reference 54 in 2022, further illustrating its active role in disseminating contemporary scientific findings. Through these continuous publications, Ceram. Int. remains a consistent source of peer-reviewed research in its specialized field.&lt;SEP&gt;A scientific journal specializing in ceramic materials and technology.&lt;SEP&gt;A scientific journal referenced in the provided text.&lt;SEP&gt;Ceram. Int. is a scientific journal that published research on ceramics.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f2534f7a997df3f80305323317b15be9-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4a64a852097fdc910b98ed788503ce4-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-35aef6efc801611130c5dd196fe513df-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b81aeff540d385f1d1eda298b44619be-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b81aeff540d385f1d1eda298b44619be-chunk-007</data>
