  <data key="d2">The Micrograph is the high-magnification image captured using scanning electron microscopy.&lt;SEP&gt;The Micrograph displays a dense network of needle-like crystals with annotations for measurements and technical imaging parameters.&lt;SEP&gt;The micrograph is a grayscale Scanning Electron Microscope image displaying the surface morphology and microstructure of phosphogypsum.</data>
