<node id="EDX">
  <data key="d0">EDX</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">EDX is an abbreviation for Energy Dispersive X-ray Spectroscopy, used for elemental analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;Energy Dispersive X-ray Spectroscopy used to determine the elemental composition of BC and HAP-BC.&lt;SEP&gt;EDX is an analytical method used to detect elemental concentrations, particularly oxygen, in the samples.&lt;SEP&gt;EDX is an analytical method used to detect elemental concentrations, particularly oxygen, in the samples.</data>
