  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">RSC Advances, a journal that published the 2024 study on bone repair cements.&lt;SEP&gt;RSC Advances is a journal containing review articles on the synthesis, functionalization, and biomedical applications of hydroxyapatite.&lt;SEP&gt;RSC Adv. is a scientific journal that published research in 2022.&lt;SEP&gt;RSC Adv. is a scientific journal that published a 2024 paper co-authored by M. Kawsar and colleagues.&lt;SEP&gt;RSC Adv. is a scientific journal that published reference 53 in 2022.&lt;SEP&gt;RSC Adv. is a scientific journal publishing research on aqueous-phase catalytic hydroxylation using apatite nanocatalysts.&lt;SEP&gt;RSC Adv. is a scientific journal publishing research on aqueous-phase catalytic hydroxylation using apatite nanocatalysts.</data>
