  <data key="d0">X-ray Diffraction (XRD)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A technique used to identify crystalline phases of materials by displaying experimental data curves alongside reference patterns.&lt;SEP&gt;X-ray diffraction is a characterization technique used to analyze crystal structures and phase compositions of the synthesized specimens.&lt;SEP&gt;A characterization technique used to analyze the structure refinement and phase purity of the HAp sample.</data>
