<node id="Phosphate Fertilizers">
  <data key="d0">Phosphate Fertilizers</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Phosphate fertilizers are widely utilized agricultural and industrial products derived from phosphate rock, specifically engineered to supply essential phosphorus to plants. Commercial formulations encompass single superphosphate, triple superphosphate, and ammonium phosphates. These products have historically served as a primary focus for Chinese phosphorus chemical companies, with substantial market demand directly driving significant operational shifts within the sector. The manufacturing process is intrinsically tied to phosphogypsum production, meaning the environmental performance and lifecycle of phosphate fertilizers are routinely analyzed in conjunction with phosphogypsum disposal and synthesis protocols.

From an environmental and safety standpoint, conventional phosphate fertilizers exhibit higher fluoride leaching rates than phosphogypsum, presenting a comparatively greater risk to groundwater systems. Consequently, these commercial products undergo rigorous evaluation for radiological safety and potential hazards. This assessment relies on detailed radiological characterization utilizing alpha and gamma spectrometry, alongside comprehensive studies tracking the distribution of radionuclides and trace elements throughout their industrial production and application.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphate fertilizers are agricultural products whose application and production generate phosphogypsum, prompting studies on metal and radionuclide availability.&lt;SEP&gt;Industrial products whose production generates phosphogypsum as a major byproduct.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-051&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-050&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-049&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-037&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792455914</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
