  <data key="d2">Reaction kinetics model is a theoretical framework established to quantitatively reveal the molecular-level reaction mechanism.&lt;SEP&gt;The Reaction Kinetics Model is used to study the molecular-level reaction mechanisms of phosphogypsum utilization alongside phase diagrams.</data>
