<node id="Fig. 12">
  <data key="d0">Fig. 12</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A figure referenced in the text, continuing the analysis of the CLG process.&lt;SEP&gt;Fig. 12 displays compressive strength data comparing non-autoclaved aerated concrete with PG and foam concrete.&lt;SEP&gt;Fig. 12 illustrates the mineral phase of PGCM under different environmental conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Fig. 12 illustrates the kinetics of carbonation for calcium hydroxide obtained from treated phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Fig. 12 is a visual representation displaying the FTIR results of MPG.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80e3f6300e001922a5ca2a6a8ac2e0d2-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-009</data>
