<node id="Phosphate Tailings">
  <data key="d0">Phosphate Tailings</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Phosphate tailings are industrial waste materials utilized alongside phosphogypsum for cemented paste backfill applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphate tailings are mining byproducts integrated with phosphogypsum to create sustainable cemented paste backfill formulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphate tailings are raw materials combined with phosphogypsum powder to produce fertilizer-filling material.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphate tailings are input parameters whose variation significantly impacts the environmental loading ratio.</data>
