<node id="Decomposition Temperature">
  <data key="d0">Decomposition Temperature</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Decomposition temperature is the thermal threshold at which lignite or oxygen carriers break down during the CLG process.&lt;SEP&gt;Decomposition Temperature is the thermal threshold at which PG begins to break down, lowered by catalysts.</data>
