  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Ion Exchange Reaction is a chemical process occurring on PG surfaces during impregnation with iron salt solution.&lt;SEP&gt;A chemical process between hydroxyapatite and fluoride that occurs primarily at the initial stage of adsorption.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e992f3bad9db87c40308ea55e121bd8a-chunk-009</data>
