  <data key="d2">Thermodynamic Calculations are analytical methods used to determine reaction pathways and enthalpy changes in PG decomposition.&lt;SEP&gt;Thermodynamic Calculations are computational methods used to analyze the low-temperature decomposition of PG.</data>
