  <data key="d2">Rankinite is a calcium silicate compound formed as a solid product during the reaction process.&lt;SEP&gt;A red segment that appears above the black base when the PG to lignite ratio is between 0.2 and 0.25.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-029</data>
