  <data key="d2">Sulfur-looping mechanism is a chemical process technique used for cyclic carbon dioxide capture.&lt;SEP&gt;Sulfur-looping is a two-step cyclic process for CO2 capture assisted by H2S and phosphogypsum thermal decomposition.</data>
