<node id="W. Zhang">
  <data key="d0">W. Zhang</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">W. Zhang is a researcher who co-authored studies on CO capture and hydrolysate utilization.&lt;SEP&gt;W. Zhang is a researcher who co-authored a 2020 study on CO2 capture using phosphogypsum decomposition hydrolysate.&lt;SEP&gt;W. Zhang is a researcher who utilized rod-shaped hydroxyapatite with a mesoporous structure as protein drug carriers.&lt;SEP&gt;W. Zhang is a researcher who co-authored a study on rod-shaped hydroxyapatite as drug carriers.&lt;SEP&gt;W. Zhang is a researcher who utilized rod-shaped hydroxyapatite with a mesoporous structure as protein drug carriers.&lt;SEP&gt;W. Zhang is a researcher who co-authored a 2014 study on rod-shaped hydroxyapatite published in Appl. Surf. Sci.</data>
