<node id="Thermogravimetric Analysis">
  <data key="d0">Thermogravimetric Analysis</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Thermogravimetric Analysis, also referred to as TG, is a fundamental thermal analysis technique designed to monitor changes in mass or weight as a function of temperature and heating rate under controlled conditions. By tracking the percentage of mass remaining or plotting mass variations against temperature on a dual-axis chart, the method provides critical quantitative data on material composition, degradation pathways, and overall thermal performance. It is primarily utilized to evaluate thermal stability, physical and chemical behavior, and material transformations, including dehydration stages and thermal decomposition processes.

The technique serves as a precise analytical procedure for measuring total water content and distinguishing between surface and structural water through controlled heating. It characterizes weight loss steps across specific temperature ranges and is frequently conducted under inert or helium atmospheres to study material behavior up to 1000 degrees Celsius. As a versatile experimental tool, Thermogravimetric Analysis delivers essential insights into the structural integrity and thermal reactions of diverse substances.

In materials science and industrial research, Thermogravimetric Analysis is extensively applied to investigate phosphogypsum, tracking its mass loss, dehydration, and thermal decomposition, as well as its catalytic decomposition when impregnated with iron chloride solutions, though practitioners note it may yield insufficient data for capturing certain complex behaviors in that specific context. In biomedical and advanced materials research, the technique is a standard approach for assessing apatite and hydroxyapatite nanopowders, determining the evaporation temperature of CTAB, quantifying the loading amounts of BSA and LSZ on hydroxyapatite supports, and studying weight loss steps in dried samples. Additionally, it is employed to examine thermal reactions between carbon and calcium sulfate compounds in inert environments, underscoring its broad utility across scientific disciplines.&lt;SEP&gt;Thermogravimetric Analysis is used to characterize the decomposition process of phosphogypsum under varying conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Thermogravimetric analysis is used to measure mass loss and generate TGA curves during the decomposition experiments.&lt;SEP&gt;A thermal analysis technique used to study the decomposition and dehydration behavior of phosphogypsum and related materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Thermogravimetric Analysis is a thermal analysis technique that provides the scientific context for the kinetic analysis plot.&lt;SEP&gt;Thermogravimetric Analysis is employed as part of the analytical suite for phosphogypsum characterization.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c22d31cfad5421c936a23705a3bc6e0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c22d31cfad5421c936a23705a3bc6e0-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c22d31cfad5421c936a23705a3bc6e0-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c22d31cfad5421c936a23705a3bc6e0-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c22d31cfad5421c936a23705a3bc6e0-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c22d31cfad5421c936a23705a3bc6e0-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4739e42903c95e1fb7e0ecfbca3a12df-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-35aef6efc801611130c5dd196fe513df-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-35aef6efc801611130c5dd196fe513df-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d5e4f0f96b4ad61d23685552d3211225-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d5e4f0f96b4ad61d23685552d3211225-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d5e4f0f96b4ad61d23685552d3211225-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d5e4f0f96b4ad61d23685552d3211225-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-004</data>
