<node id="Mass Fraction">
  <data key="d0">Mass Fraction</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">A quantitative measure of chemical species composition illustrated in the stacked bar chart.&lt;SEP&gt;A quantitative metric measured in percentage, ranging from 0 to 100, used on the Y-axis.&lt;SEP&gt;Mass fraction measures the percentage concentration of chemical components, specifically ranging from 0.37% to 2.61% for phosphorus pentoxide.&lt;SEP&gt;Mass fraction is the calculated percentage composition of metal oxides in the sample.</data>
