<node id="Impurity Removal">
  <data key="d0">Impurity Removal</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Processing technique focused on eliminating eutectic phosphate impurities from phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Impurity removal involves techniques to eliminate soluble phosphorus, fluoride, and organic contaminants from phosphogypsum to enable safe reuse.&lt;SEP&gt;Impurity removal eliminates non-rare earth contaminants to enrich the overall rare earth element concentration.&lt;SEP&gt;Impurity removal is a process that uses precipitation to extract phosphate ions from solution.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-057&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-044</data>
