<node id="14th Five-Year Plan">
  <data key="d0">14th Five-Year Plan</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The 14th Five-Year Plan is a comprehensive Chinese national policy framework and strategic development period designed to guide the country's transition toward clean energy, green growth, and sustainable development. As a foundational national development strategy, it establishes critical directives for the comprehensive utilization of bulk solid waste, issuing specific guidelines to manage and reduce industrial solid waste emissions and storage. The plan serves as a pivotal policy instrument that aligns industrial practices with broader environmental sustainability goals.

A central focus of the 14th Five-Year Plan is its targeted impact on the phosphorus chemical sector and phosphogypsum management. It explicitly prioritizes the strengthening of total phosphorus pollution control and mandates the resource utilization of solid wastes, particularly phosphogypsum. By driving advancements in phosphogypsum utilization and formally recognizing the phosphogypsum recycling industry as vital to national sustainability, the plan aims to indirectly reduce phosphogypsum production through broader solid waste management initiatives. Consequently, the 14th Five-Year Plan functions as a strategic period that integrates circular economy practices, phosphorus pollution mitigation, and industrial waste reduction into China's long-term sustainable development agenda.&lt;SEP&gt;A national development plan period referenced in research regarding future trends for phosphogypsum utilization.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-016</data>
