<node id="Yunnan">
  <data key="d0">Yunnan</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Yunnan is a province in China that serves as a central hub for the nation's phosphorus chemical industry and phosphogypsum sector. It contributes significantly to China's total phosphogypsum production, yet the region is characterized by a distinct industrial imbalance marked by high output alongside limited local demand for phosphogypsum-based products. Because of these conditions, Yunnan has emerged as a key province targeted for comprehensive utilization initiatives and large-scale phosphogypsum demonstration projects. It has been extensively analyzed in academic and industrial studies focusing on the phosphogypsum recycling industry, highlighting its strategic importance in developing sustainable waste management and resource recovery frameworks.

In addition to its industrial and research significance, Yunnan functions as a primary operational region for phosphogypsum usage, hosting notable industry players such as Company Q and Company R. The province has also been the designated source location for the collection and subsequent chemical analysis of phosphogypsum samples in various scientific investigations. Together, these factors establish Yunnan as a critical geographic and economic focal point for advancing phosphogypsum recycling, utilization, and industrial innovation within China.&lt;SEP&gt;Yunnan is a Chinese province where PG generation is prevalent and strict reduction policies have been established.&lt;SEP&gt;Yunnan is the province in China where the affiliated university is located.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d5e4f0f96b4ad61d23685552d3211225-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792362031</data>
