<node id="Chemical Looping Combustion">
  <data key="d0">Chemical Looping Combustion</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A method utilizing phosphogypsum as an oxygen carrier to produce sulfur dioxide for sulfuric acid production.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemical looping combustion is a technique utilizing mixed oxygen carriers to facilitate the combustion of methane or coal.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemical looping combustion is a process that uses phosphogypsum as an oxygen carrier to produce sulfuric acid.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemical looping combustion is a process utilizing phosphogypsum as an oxygen carrier for sulfur acid production.&lt;SEP&gt;A combustion characteristic studied in relation to coal processed with a novel mixed oxygen carrier.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-021</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
