<node id="Hydrothermal Method">
  <data key="d0">Hydrothermal Method</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The Hydrothermal Method is a versatile chemical synthesis and treatment technique that operates under elevated temperatures and pressures within sealed, aqueous environments, frequently utilizing strong alkaline media. By leveraging sustained thermal and pressure conditions, the process drives targeted chemical reactions, modifies crystal growth, and neutralizes impurities. It is broadly deployed across advanced materials engineering and environmental remediation, functioning as a highly adaptable aqueous synthesis route that achieves precise structural engineering, high crystallinity, and targeted morphological control.

In materials science, the Hydrothermal Method is extensively utilized to synthesize functional compounds, with a primary focus on hydroxyapatite and titanium-based nanomaterials. For hydroxyapatite production, the technique can be adapted as either a one-step or two-step heterogeneous reaction process, often employing phosphogypsum as a calcium source. It enables meticulous control over crystal morphology, crystallinity, phase purity, and metal ion occupancy, facilitating the formation of stoichiometric, phase-pure nanostructures, nanocrystals, powders, bulk structures, and core-shell microspheres. Standard operational parameters typically range from 80 to 400°C under alkaline conditions, with specific variations utilizing structural templates like F127 to fabricate mesoporous rod-shaped structures. The method also supports the growth of crystals directly on substrates such as FTO glass and yields solid solutions with optimal thermal stability, maintaining structural integrity up to 1370°C. Additionally, it is employed to engineer titanium-based nanomaterials, including mesoporous anatase TiO2 nanofibers and titanate nanotubes.

In environmental applications, the Hydrothermal Method serves as an effective strategy for processing phosphogypsum waste. It facilitates the simultaneous removal of phosphorus and organic contaminants through the thermal activation of mineralizers, thereby regenerating gypsum resources and modifying their inherent properties. The technique is also specifically applied to prepare α-hemihydrate gypsum in atmospheric salt solution media. Despite its efficacy in resource regeneration and material fabrication, the process is recognized for its limited processing capacity and high energy consumption, prompting ongoing modifications to enhance its efficiency for hydroxyapatite and other target syntheses.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-039&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9e17ad262bd9835860df552d7ff475f1-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4a64a852097fdc910b98ed788503ce4-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4a64a852097fdc910b98ed788503ce4-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4a64a852097fdc910b98ed788503ce4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4a64a852097fdc910b98ed788503ce4-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2760dc2a11fedad02d24741a978cf20d-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2760dc2a11fedad02d24741a978cf20d-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6825862084b162a4b16cd1037c76e3d7-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2196dee89de9694f28ef4eaa0e85f130-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-033&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-039&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4739e42903c95e1fb7e0ecfbca3a12df-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54b92b2ad16a2528ff6a863329c5d403-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-176fa906dd9c8409d2d1c49b8bdf9948-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-176fa906dd9c8409d2d1c49b8bdf9948-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-72ff3bbf1e2b594abc3ec5c8d86e3178-chunk-001</data>
