<node id="CO">
  <data key="d0">CO</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">CO is a gas involved in the redox reaction system of PG, analyzed via the Ellingham diagram.&lt;SEP&gt;CO is a carbon monoxide gas utilized as a reducing agent in Steps 2 and 4.&lt;SEP&gt;CO is a gas whose concentration changes mildly with increasing temperature.&lt;SEP&gt;CO is carbon monoxide, produced from the gasification of carbon at smaller coal sizes.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d5e4f0f96b4ad61d23685552d3211225-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d5e4f0f96b4ad61d23685552d3211225-chunk-006</data>
