  <data key="d2">H2O is water involved in double salt formation and decomposition reactions.&lt;SEP&gt;H2O is the chemical formula representing water.&lt;SEP&gt;Water, a chemical compound mentioned in the introductory equation.&lt;SEP&gt;Water is a byproduct formed during the hydroxyapatite synthesis reaction.&lt;SEP&gt;A chemical compound representing water content measured in the samples.</data>
