<node id="Nanoparticles">
  <data key="d0">Nanoparticles</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">Nanoparticles are microscopic particles released from phosphogypsum that pose potential health impacts and environmental concerns.&lt;SEP&gt;Nanoparticles in phosphogypsum adsorb heavy metal elements, contributing to environmental contamination.&lt;SEP&gt;Microscopic particles released from phosphogypsum that are assessed for potential environmental and health impacts.&lt;SEP&gt;Uniform rod-like structures formed during the synthesis of HAp.&lt;SEP&gt;Nanoparticles (NPs) refer to the synthesized hydroxyapatite particles with dimensions in the nanometer range.&lt;SEP&gt;Nanoparticles are microscopic particles released from phosphogypsum that pose potential health risks.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-052&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6825862084b162a4b16cd1037c76e3d7-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-033</data>
