<node id="LCA">
  <data key="d0">LCA</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Life Cycle Assessment (LCA) is a methodological focus used to evaluate the environmental impact and potential of urban mining from phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;LCA is a methodological framework referenced in the table for calculating environmental burden indicators.&lt;SEP&gt;A life cycle assessment approach used to fill in missing data for materials like urea and paraffin using global-scale data.&lt;SEP&gt;A methodology used to compare the environmental performance of wet and thermal routes for phosphate fertilizer production.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-025</data>
