  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A catalyst is added during the two-step method to reduce the decomposition and oxidation temperatures of phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;A raw material consumed by the PSC process.&lt;SEP&gt;Catalyst refers to the use of hydroxyapatite in chemical reactions to increase reaction rates.&lt;SEP&gt;Catalysts are industrial applications where hydroxyapatite is extensively utilized due to its chemical properties.&lt;SEP&gt;Catalyst is a functional application of hydroxyapatite due to its versatile&lt;SEP&gt;Catalyst is a functional application of hydroxyapatite due to its versatile</data>
