<node id="Circular Economy">
  <data key="d0">Circular Economy</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The Circular Economy is a comprehensive economic model, sustainable development framework, and industrial strategy designed to replace traditional linear production systems with self-circulating processes that prioritize continuous material use, resource recovery, and recycling. By maintaining product values and maximizing resource efficiency, this framework aims to minimize waste generation, reduce pollution, lower environmental impact, and decrease reliance on raw material extraction and carbon emissions. Widely recognized in academic literature and gaining significant momentum, it serves as a foundational conceptual framework for sustainable resource management, frequently cited in research focused on achieving long-term ecological balance and sustainability targets while simultaneously boosting economic efficiency.

In specialized industrial contexts, particularly within the mining, phosphate ore, and phosphogypsum recycling sectors, the Circular Economy provides a critical framework for evaluating and implementing waste valorization and management strategies. Within this model, industrial by-products and mining tailings are reclassified from waste into secondary raw material resources. The framework guides targeted market strategies, optimized waste management practices, and Life Cycle Assessments to systematically utilize materials like phosphogypsum, effectively transforming them into economically beneficial outputs. This targeted application not only aligns with broader goals of sustainable resource management but also specifically advances phosphorus management and drives research into recovering critical materials such as rare earths and uranium from industrial byproducts. By encouraging the mining and phosphate industries to adopt these sustainable practices, the Circular Economy demonstrates its capacity to optimize utilization, mitigate ecological harm, and foster long-term ecological and economic resilience across diverse industrial operations.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-035&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2760dc2a11fedad02d24741a978cf20d-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2760dc2a11fedad02d24741a978cf20d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2760dc2a11fedad02d24741a978cf20d-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2760dc2a11fedad02d24741a978cf20d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-176fa906dd9c8409d2d1c49b8bdf9948-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-176fa906dd9c8409d2d1c49b8bdf9948-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-176fa906dd9c8409d2d1c49b8bdf9948-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-00