<node id="Building Material">
  <data key="d0">Building Material</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Building Material is a primary application sector for the comprehensive utilization of phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Building material refers to the application of phosphogypsum in construction, which exposes workers to increased inhalation of radioactive substances and heavy metals.&lt;SEP&gt;A general category of materials, including cementitious binders, used in construction applications.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-011</data>
