<node id="Waste Lime">
  <data key="d0">Waste Lime</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Waste lime acts as an activator used in conjunction with phosphogypsum for nonsintering cement production.&lt;SEP&gt;Waste lime is a by-product used as an activator in the formulation of non-sintering cement.&lt;SEP&gt;Waste lime is used as an activator in non-sintering cement production alongside phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Waste lime is used as an activator alongside phosphogypsum in the production of nonsintering cement.&lt;SEP&gt;Waste lime is an industrial byproduct activated by phosphogypsum in Mun's non-sintering cement process.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-031&lt;SEP&gt;doc-98d8b2df45924e721bfa570f652f33e3-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-014</data>
