<node id="Response Surface Methodology">
  <data key="d0">Response Surface Methodology</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Response Surface Methodology is a statistical experimental design applied to optimize phosphogypsum-based composites.&lt;SEP&gt;Response surface methodology is a statistical technique applied to optimize adsorption parameters for fluoride removal.&lt;SEP&gt;Response surface methodology is a statistical technique used to analyze the impact of various chemical components on material strength.&lt;SEP&gt;Response surface methodology is a statistical optimization technique applied to fluoride adsorption processes.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-032&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4739e42903c95e1fb7e0ecfbca3a12df-chunk-007</data>
