  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Fuzhou is a Chinese city where phosphogypsum is applied to stabilize dredged soil.&lt;SEP&gt;Fuzhou is a city in China that served as the source location for dredged soil samples used in geotechnical research.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-028</data>
