  <data key="d0">Set Retarder</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Set retarder is a functional role of weathered phosphogypsum in controlling the hardening time of Portland cement.&lt;SEP&gt;A set retarder is a functional additive in cement chemistry, for which chemically and physically treated phosphogypsum is investigated as a suitable alternative.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-018</data>
