  <data key="d0">Phosphine Gas</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Phosphine gas is generated through microbial reduction of phosphates in exposed phosphogypsum and contributes to atmospheric warming.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphine gas is a toxic compound generated by microbial decomposition of phosphates within phosphogypsum storage facilities.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-006</data>
