<node id="Human Body">
  <data key="d0">Human Body</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The human body is the biological system that absorbs and accumulates radioactive elements and heavy metals from environmental exposure.&lt;SEP&gt;Human body is exposed to phosphogypsum pollutants through drinking water and food consumption.&lt;SEP&gt;The Human Body is the final endpoint for heavy metal migration through the food chain.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-004</data>
