<node id="Atmospheric Environment">
  <data key="d0">Atmospheric Environment</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Atmospheric Environment is an environmental component affected by abnormal toxic gas levels near phosphogypsum stockpiles.&lt;SEP&gt;One of the primary environmental domains affected by phosphogypsum storage, impacted by toxic gas emissions.&lt;SEP&gt;Atmospheric Environment influences chemical precipitation by allowing carbon dioxide adsorption during synthesis.&lt;SEP&gt;The atmospheric environment provides ecological services primarily used to dilute air pollutants like SO2.</data>
