<node id="Human Health">
  <data key="d0">Human Health</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Human Health, recognized as a fundamental biological aspect and measure of human well-being, serves as a critical environmental impact category and primary damage domain in ecological and industrial assessments. Within these frameworks, it is explicitly quantified through metrics such as healthy human loss to evaluate the consequences of pollutant discharge. This impact domain primarily assesses severe exposure pathways, including carcinogenic effects, radiation exposure, and elevated disease risks, which are directly or indirectly linked to the environmental footprint of phosphogypsum management. Proximity to phosphogypsum stockpiles and storage facilities introduces significant hazards, notably the long-term accumulation of heavy metals in nearby agricultural crops, which subsequently degrades local human health outcomes.

To mitigate these adverse effects, the optimization of phosphogypsum disposal and the adoption of resource utilization strategies play a pivotal role. By implementing phosphogypsum reuse methods, overall pollutant emissions and environmental contamination are substantially reduced, thereby lowering the associated health risks. Consequently, Human Health emerges as a primary beneficiary of sustainable phosphogypsum management practices, demonstrating how targeted industrial interventions can effectively safeguard biological well-being against the negative impacts of hazardous material storage and processing.&lt;SEP&gt;Human health is negatively impacted by the migration of heavy metals from PG into soil, water, and the atmosphere.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-015</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792301772</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
