  <data key="d2">Toxicological Effects represent the study of adverse health impacts and biological hazards caused by phosphogypsum exposure.&lt;SEP&gt;Health impacts on humans resulting from exposure to phosphogypsum.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-011</data>
