</node>
<node id="Soil Improvement">
  <data key="d0">Soil Improvement</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Soil Improvement is an agricultural application of phosphogypsum aimed at enhancing crop yields.&lt;SEP&gt;Soil improvement is an agricultural application of phosphogypsum to amend sodic soils by replacing excess sodium with calcium.&lt;SEP&gt;Soil improvement is an agricultural technique utilizing phosphogypsum to enhance soil quality and fertility.&lt;SEP&gt;An agricultural application goal achieved through the harmless modification and application of phosphogypsum.</data>
