<node id="Hubei Province">
  <data key="d0">Hubei Province</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Hubei Province is a central-western region in China situated within the Yangtze River Basin, characterized by a topography of plains and hills and home to major urban centers such as Wuhan. It holds a dominant position in China's phosphate sector, serving as a key hub for the phosphorus chemical industry and a major producer of phosphate rock and phosphorus fertilizers. Consequently, Hubei is the nation's leading producer of phosphogypsum, accounting for 37.8 percent of the national total. To manage this substantial industrial output, the province has implemented targeted policies that have significantly improved phosphogypsum utilization, achieving a recycling rate of 44.35 percent, which ranks second nationally. This recycling industry capitalizes on the developed water transportation networks along the Yangtze River, with companies primarily concentrated in Yichang City. The utilized phosphogypsum is predominantly applied in cement retardants and gypsum-based building materials, though the local market for fundamental products remains saturated.

Despite these operational advancements, Hubei faces significant environmental challenges related to phosphogypsum management. The province hosts numerous active and closed phosphogypsum tailings ponds, which pose severe environmental risks. Notably, a tailings pond leakage in the region has caused severe water contamination. Chemically, phosphogypsum in Hubei exhibits high concentrations of silicon dioxide, phosphorus pentoxide, and fluoride, resulting in elevated pollutant levels in leachate. These environmental impacts are further influenced by the province's specific geological and climatic conditions, which dictate pollutant migration and diffusion patterns.

Hubei Province is also a focal point for environmental and industrial research. It has been surveyed as one of three key regions for phosphorus fertilizer enterprises and serves as a primary site for environmental studies, including composting and sampling experiments related to phosphogypsum management. Chemical analysis of phosphogypsum samples collected in the province has been documented, and the region is featured in metrics tracking phosphogypsum production and utilization. Additionally, research notes from the area reference specific environmental parameters, such as a recorded pH value of 2.71, underscoring the ongoing scientific scrutiny of the region's industrial and ecological landscape.&lt;SEP&gt;Hubei Province is the location of the monoammonium phosphate production enterprise used as the case study.&lt;SEP&gt;Hubei Province is a geographic region in China where the case study enterprise is located.&lt;SEP&gt;A geographic region in China with abundant hydroelectric resources that are often discarded during the wet season.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e290dd6268316238694f70c30a367426-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792225860</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Yunnan Province">
  <data key="d0">Yunnan Province</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Yunnan Province is a mountainous, karst-dominated plateau region situated in southwestern China within the Yangtze River basin and the broader Yunnan-Guizhou Plateau. Characterized by sparse population density and complex topography, the province is a major phosphate-rich industrial hub and ranks as China’s second-largest producer of phosphogypsum (PG), contributing 26.8 percent of the national total. PG manufacturing is heavily concentrated around Kunming City, where multiple enterprises conduct research, development, and application testing. The region’s phosphorus industry, which concentrates emissions from three major phosphorus sectors, generates PG with notably low iron(III) oxide, aluminum oxide, and overall impurity content, making it a frequent subject of chemical analysis and a key focus in industry surveys. Yunnan Province is also prominently featured in national charts tracking phosphogypsum metrics.

Despite its substantial production output, Yunnan Province faces persistent challenges in PG comprehensive utilization and recycling, currently maintaining a recycling rate of 25.84 percent. The province’s mountainous terrain and limited transportation logistics hinder efficient distribution and scaling, while policy constraints, developmental hurdles, and a small, near-saturated surrounding market further impede commercialization efforts. To overcome these structural and geographical barriers, Yunnan Province has increasingly emphasized high-efficiency and high-value PG utilization strategies, particularly focusing on mine backfilling and filling technologies, ecological restoration, and the development of building materials. However, the region’s distinctive karst landforms present environmental complexities, as they facilitate rapid pollutant migration through karst channels, complicating waste management. Consequently, Yunnan Province continues to navigate logistical, policy, and geographical challenges while striving to enhance phosphogypsum recycling and sustainable industrial practices.&lt;SEP&gt;A region in China where the phosphogypsum used in the study was sourced.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-002</data>
