<node id="Sichuan Province">
  <data key="d0">Sichuan Province</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Sichuan Province, situated in China within the Yangtze River Basin, is geographically characterized by flat eastern areas and intersecting river networks. The region contains Deyang City, which has established varied economic policy standards to support industrial byproduct management. Economically, Sichuan Province is a significant producer of phosphate rock and phosphorus fertilizer, though its direct phosphogypsum output remains relatively small.

Despite modest phosphogypsum production, the province functions as a major hub for the phosphogypsum recycling industry in China. It is a surveyed region hosting small-scale integrated phosphogypsum production and recycling operations, including Company C. Following the implementation of comprehensive utilization policies, the province has achieved a 100% phosphogypsum recycling rate, with overall utilization rates significantly improving. While fundamental phosphogypsum-based product markets in the region are currently saturated, local markets retain the capacity to absorb its annual phosphogypsum production, underscoring the effectiveness of its integrated recycling infrastructure and policy framework.&lt;SEP&gt;Sichuan Province contains a substantial number of phosphogypsum tailings ponds. Sichuan Province is located within the Yangtze River Basin.&lt;SEP&gt;Sichuan Province is a region in China where phosphorus emissions from the three phosphorus industries are concentrated.&lt;SEP&gt;Sichuan Province is a geographic region in China hosting the Qingping Phosphate Mine.&lt;SEP&gt;One of the seven provinces/cities guided by the 2019 rectification plan to investigate phosphorus-related enterprises.&lt;SEP&gt;Sichuan Province is the specific case study location for investigating the impact of waste reuse on municipal solid waste incineration sustainability.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-029</data>
