<node id="Figure 1">
  <data key="d0">Figure 1</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Figure 1 is not a single unified entity but rather a conventional labeling convention applied to primary illustrative components across numerous distinct scientific publications and research domains. Each instance serves as a standalone visual aid tailored to its specific study, collectively demonstrating how the label is utilized in academic literature.

In phosphogypsum research, multiple distinct versions of Figure 1 appear across various studies. One instance functions as a chart tracking the utilization of phosphogypsum in China from 2010 to 2020, while another outlines the overall methodological approach for phosphogypsum characterization. Several iterations focus on analytical data: one presents X-ray diffraction patterns alongside structural refinement data for phosphogypsum waste, another displays XRD patterns specifically for mineralogy analysis, and a third compiles XRD, thermogravimetric, and scanning electron microscopy-energy dispersive X-ray spectroscopy results for high-silica phosphogypsum. Additional phosphogypsum-related instances track the activity concentration of Radium-226 across different countries, visualize microstructures observed at various time intervals, and provide a flowchart illustrating the preparation process of nano-hydroxyapatite particles from phosphogypsum.

Within materials science and adsorption studies, Figure 1 takes on different analytical forms. One visualization compares XRD patterns and Fourier-transform infrared spectra between biochar and hydroxyapatite-loaded biochar, while another presents XRD analysis results contrasting s-HAp and BA samples against a standard reference file. A related depiction in this category graphs the zeta potential of the HAP1/NaCl solution interface as a function of pH.

In microscopic and thermal analysis contexts, a separate Figure 1 presents scanning electron microscopy images of samples labeled S1 through S4, alongside their corresponding thermal treatments designated S1T through S4T. In process engineering, another instance serves as a graphical representation mapping the effects of various operational parameters on a specific extraction process. Finally, in reactor design literature, Figure 1 illustrates the general draft, prototype view, and load/unload system principle of the MSS2 reactor. Collectively, these independent visualizations confirm that Figure 1 is conventionally applied as a primary reference point across disparate scientific fields rather than denoting a single, cohesive subject.&lt;SEP&gt;A figure illustrating raw phosphogypsum (PG).</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9e17ad262bd9835860df552d7ff475f1-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2760dc2a11fedad02d24741a978cf20d-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4739e42903c95e1fb7e0ecfbca3a12df-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-edfc4dcbd74cbf0b294f83f2034b209d-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28fbd4302bba090e667215c840757ff7-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-176fa906dd9c8409d2d1c49b8bdf9948-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e992f3bad9db87c40308ea55e121bd8a-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d5e4f0f96b4ad61d23685552d3211225-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-020</data>
