<node id="Industrial Solid Waste">
  <data key="d0">Industrial Solid Waste</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">Industrial Solid Waste is a broad category encompassing bulk, non-hazardous materials generated from industrial processes. It is frequently addressed in disposal and utilization research, with a specific focus on phosphogypsum, which is traditionally classified under this designation. However, there is a growing industry and policy push to shift away from viewing phosphogypsum strictly as waste, aiming instead to reframe it as a valuable resource for reuse.

National policies and standards actively target Industrial Solid Waste for reduction and comprehensive utilization. These regulatory frameworks establish preliminary indicators and guidelines that guide companies toward multidirectional resource utilization. In practical applications, this waste category is often coupled with phosphogypsum for material preparation, supporting efforts to transform traditional waste streams into functional industrial inputs.

From an environmental and economic assessment perspective, Industrial Solid Waste is evaluated for emergy loss and eco-environmental loss across various treatment methods. Additionally, the volume or amount of this waste serves as a critical parameter in land occupation calculations, highlighting its significant spatial and ecological footprint. Collectively, these factors underscore the importance of optimizing disposal strategies and advancing sustainable utilization practices for Industrial Solid Waste.&lt;SEP&gt;Industrial solid waste is the classification of material that PG represents, subject to pollution evaluation.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-005</data>
