<node id="Inorganic Chemicals Industry">
  <data key="d0">Inorganic Chemicals Industry</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Inorganic Chemicals Industry is a journal publishing research on phosphogypsum utilization.&lt;SEP&gt;Inorganic Chemicals Industry is a journal that published research on the comprehensive utilization of phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Inorganic Chemicals Industry is the academic journal that published the 2022 experimental study on removing water-soluble phosphorus and fluorine.&lt;SEP&gt;A journal covering research on phosphogypsum utilization and modification processes.&lt;SEP&gt;Inorganic Chemicals Industry is an academic journal that published studies on the preparation of α-hemihydrate gypsum and composite cementitious materials.&lt;SEP&gt;An academic journal that published research on phosphogypsum-based architectural gypsum preparation.&lt;SEP&gt;A scientific journal that published the 2022 study on phosphogypsum utilization trends during the 14th Five-Year Plan.</data>
