  <data key="d0">Phosphate &amp; Compound Fertilizer</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">An academic journal publishing research on the comprehensive utilization of phosphogypsum resources.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphate &amp; Compound Fertilizer is a journal publishing research on phosphorus chemical industry and slag dumps.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphate &amp; Compound Fertilizer is a journal that published research on sulfuric acid production integrated with cement.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphate &amp; Compound Fertilizer is the academic journal that published the 2023 study on building gypsum preparation equipment.&lt;SEP&gt;An academic journal that published research on phosphogypsum impurity removal and comprehensive utilization.&lt;SEP&gt;A scientific journal that published the 2020 study on phosphogypsum resource utilization led by Li Ming.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphate &amp; Compound Fertilizer is an academic journal that published research on impurity removal and whitening of phosphogypsum.</data>
