<node id="Heavy Metal Pollution">
  <data key="d0">Heavy Metal Pollution</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Heavy metal pollution is an environmental concern associated with phosphogypsum storage and disposal.&lt;SEP&gt;Heavy Metal Pollution is a global environmental problem caused by toxic, non-degradable metals in water and soil.&lt;SEP&gt;Contamination of aquatic and coastal environments addressed through efficient removal approaches and sediment property assessments.&lt;SEP&gt;Heavy Metal Pollution is an environmental issue mitigated by the comprehensive utilization of industrial waste in this research.&lt;SEP&gt;Heavy metal pollution is an environmental issue that can be mitigated through phosphogypsum adsorption and solidification.&lt;SEP&gt;Heavy metal pollution is an environmental issue addressed through adsorption and solidification techniques in soil.&lt;SEP&gt;Heavy metal pollution refers to environmental contamination assessed in drilling fields and agricultural soils.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9e17ad262bd9835860df552d7ff475f1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-034&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-040&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-035</data>
