<node id="Comprehensive Utilization Rate">
  <data key="d0">Comprehensive Utilization Rate</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Comprehensive utilization rate is a quantitative metric measuring the percentage of industrial byproducts effectively reused, such as the 99.22% rate in Guizhou.&lt;SEP&gt;The comprehensive utilization rate of phosphogypsum is approximately 25% globally, indicating significant room for improvement.&lt;SEP&gt;Comprehensive utilization rate is a metric tracking the percentage of phosphogypsum that is effectively reused or processed rather than discharged.&lt;SEP&gt;A metric tracking the percentage of phosphogypsum that is recycled or repurposed, showing an upward trend from 2015 to 2022.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-002</data>
