  <data key="d0">Gypsum Block</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Gypsum Block is a construction material product manufactured from phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Gypsum Block is a wall material produced from PG offering fire prevention and environmental benefits.&lt;SEP&gt;Gypsum blocks are new wall materials offering fire prevention, environmental protection, renewability, and workability.&lt;SEP&gt;Gypsum Block is the hydrated form of MPG composed of interlocking rod-like crystals.</data>
