  <data key="d0">Gypsum Powder</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Gypsum Powder is a refined, processed construction material derived from phosphogypsum (PG). Functioning as a direct substitute for natural gypsum, it is widely utilized in the preparation of gypsum-based building materials and general construction applications. A key characteristic of this PG-based product is its good gel strength, which enhances its suitability for structural and industrial uses. In addition to its primary role in construction, Gypsum Powder is also employed in various craft projects.

The production of Gypsum Powder is documented in specific industrial frameworks, such as Scenario 2, where it is manufactured using air. This particular production method contributes to local renewable input shares, highlighting the material's role in sustainable resource management. By transforming phosphogypsum into a versatile building and crafting medium, Gypsum Powder supports both infrastructure development and specialized artistic applications while promoting efficient material utilization.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-003</data>
