  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Chemical Extraction is a process used to separate rare earth elements from phosphogypsum using strong bases.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemical extraction is a recommended treatment process to purify phosphogypsum by removing harmful impurities.</data>
