<node id="Chalk">
  <data key="d0">Chalk</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Chalk is a common solid form in which calcium carbonate is found.&lt;SEP&gt;Chalk is mixed with cement and PG to produce masonry with specific compressive strength values at 7 and 28 days.&lt;SEP&gt;Chalk is a material combined with waste gypsum for environment hazard mitigation in construction.</data>
