  <data key="d0">Proteobacteria</data>
  <data key="d1">creature</data>
  <data key="d2">A bacterial phylum representing 2.29% of the microbial community during composting.&lt;SEP&gt;Proteobacteria is a bacterial phylum represented in the Circos plot with a corresponding color code and abundance scale.&lt;SEP&gt;A bacterial taxonomic group represented by blue ribbons in the Circos plot, heavily dominating Group A1 samples.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e290dd6268316238694f70c30a367426-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e290dd6268316238694f70c30a367426-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e290dd6268316238694f70c30a367426-chunk-017</data>
