  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Biological development process positively influenced by phosphogypsum biofertilizers and improved soil conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Plant growth is a biological outcome substantially improved by the application of the prepared biofertilizer and optimized nutrient ratios.&lt;SEP&gt;Plant growth is positively affected by the environmentally friendly preparation of phosphogypsum and straw as biofertilizers.</data>
