<node id="Deltaproteobacteria">
  <data key="d0">Deltaproteobacteria</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Deltaproteobacteria is a bacterial phylum represented in the Circos plot with a corresponding color code and abundance scale.&lt;SEP&gt;A bacterial taxonomic group represented by purple ribbons in the Circos plot, showing visible connections in Group A1 samples.</data>
