<node id="Dual-Axis Line Graph">
  <data key="d0">Dual-Axis Line Graph</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A chart type displaying two variables over time using a scatter plot with connecting lines and error bars.&lt;SEP&gt;Chart type displaying two variables over time with connecting lines and error bars.&lt;SEP&gt;The Dual-Axis Line Graph represents Thermogravimetric Analysis and Derivative Thermogravimetry data tracking mass change as a function of temperature.&lt;SEP&gt;A dual-axis line graph presenting both thermogravimetric and differential scanning calorimetry data against temperature.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e290dd6268316238694f70c30a367426-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e290dd6268316238694f70c30a367426-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4739e42903c95e1fb7e0ecfbca3a12df-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-35aef6efc801611130c5dd196fe513df-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792002844</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Scatter Plot">
  <data key="d0">Scatter Plot</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A graphical representation used in the dual-axis line graph to plot data points with vertical error bars.&lt;SEP&gt;Specific chart type mentioned as part of the dual-axis line graph structure.&lt;SEP&gt;Scatter Plot is a two-dimensional graphical representation displaying clustered data points for sample groups.&lt;SEP&gt;The Scatter Plot is a two-dimensional graphical representation displaying data points and a linear regression line for kinetic analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;Scatter Plot is a chart visualizing the negative correlation between strontium concentration and the radioactivity index.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e290dd6268316238694f70c30a367426-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e290dd6268316238694f70c30a367426-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e290dd6268316238694f70c30a367426-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d5e4f0f96b4ad61d23685552d3211225-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-036</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792405761</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
