  <data key="d2">The final unit of the mathematical formula result, adjusted by conversion factors of 100 and 1000.&lt;SEP&gt;The mathematical format resulting from the conversion of a fraction, used to express the final metric.&lt;SEP&gt;Percentage is the standardized unit of measurement used to express the concentration of all chemical constituents in the table.</data>
