<node id="Urea">
  <data key="d0">Urea</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Urea is a versatile chemical compound utilized across agricultural and materials science applications. In agricultural and composting contexts, it is incorporated in small quantities to optimize the carbon-to-nitrogen ratio during the composting process. As a fertilizer, its performance can be improved by amending it with phosphogypsum, a practice that significantly reduces ammonia volatilization.

In materials science and nanotechnology, Urea functions as a critical organic modifier and mineralizer within hydrothermal and synthesis reaction systems. When applied during the production of hydroxyapatite, it actively alters the material's crystalline structure, crystallite size, and overall morphology. Specifically, Urea facilitates the directed formation of hydroxyapatite nanorods and nanobundles. Additionally, its use in modifying nano-hydroxyapatite particles enhances the slow-release performance of nanohybrid fertilizers, demonstrating its structural directing capabilities in advanced material synthesis.&lt;SEP&gt;Urea is a chemical reagent that undergoes hydrolysis during synthesis to generate carbonate groups.&lt;SEP&gt;Urea is a chemical reagent added to the solution during the hydrothermal preparation of HA microspheres.&lt;SEP&gt;A chemical compound that undergoes slow hydrolysis to produce hydroxide ions and create an alkaline environment.&lt;SEP&gt;Urea is a chemical compound that undergoes slow hydrolysis to provide an alkaline environment and hydroxide ions.&lt;SEP&gt;Urea is a chemical compound that influences hydroxyapatite formation during double-step hydrothermal processing.&lt;SEP&gt;A material lacking local data, for which global-scale data was used in the LCA.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e290dd6268316238694f70c30a367426-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54b92b2ad16a2528ff6a863329c5d403-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54b92b2ad16a2528ff6a863329c5d403-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54b92b2ad16a2528ff6a863329c5d403-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54b92b2ad16a2528ff6a863329c5d403-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54b92b2ad16a2528ff6a863329c5d403-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54b92b2ad16a2528ff6a863329c5d403-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-012</data>
