<node id="Absorbance">
  <data key="d0">Absorbance</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Absorbance is a measurement taken at 665 nm and 649 nm to calculate chlorophyll concentration.&lt;SEP&gt;Absorbance is a potential metric for the Y-Axis in the spectral graph.&lt;SEP&gt;Absorbance is a potential measurement scale for the y-axis intensity in the spectroscopy plot.&lt;SEP&gt;Absorbance is the vertical axis metric ranging from 0.0 to 0.6, quantifying light absorption intensity.&lt;SEP&gt;Absorbance is a quantitative measurement of light absorption, with values noted around 0.2 for a specific peak and close to 0.0 for the baseline.&lt;SEP&gt;Absorbance is a vertical axis measurement representing raw intensity ranging from 0.00 to 0.15 in the FTIR spectrum.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e290dd6268316238694f70c30a367426-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f2534f7a997df3f80305323317b15be9-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f2534f7a997df3f80305323317b15be9-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6825862084b162a4b16cd1037c76e3d7-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6825862084b162a4b16cd1037c76e3d7-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-72ff3bbf1e2b594abc3ec5c8d86e3178-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
