  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Sodium Acetate is a chemical component used to prepare the acetic acid-sodium acetate buffer for vitamin C measurement.&lt;SEP&gt;Sodium acetate is a chemical compound used to prepare the buffer solution in the SW-846 testing procedure.&lt;SEP&gt;Sodium Acetate is a chemical compound used as a primary component in preparing acidic buffer solutions.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e290dd6268316238694f70c30a367426-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-60e237a0a1045feedf76d35d654a79bd-chunk-002</data>
