  <data key="d0">105 °C</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">105 °C is the temperature setting used by the Electrothermal Constant Temperature Blast Dryer to dry plant samples.&lt;SEP&gt;105 °C is the specific drying temperature applied during synthesis, which is higher than standard freeze drying temperatures.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e290dd6268316238694f70c30a367426-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-012</data>
