  <data key="d0">4 h</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">4 h is the immersion duration for plant samples in 95% ethanol during chlorophyll extraction.&lt;SEP&gt;4 h represents a specific milling duration where target volume fractions for region I and II appear to reach a maximum.</data>
