<node id="Constr Build Mater">
  <data key="d0">Constr Build Mater</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Constr Build Mater is the journal that published the 2019 study on the ground granulated blast furnace slag-waste gypsum system.&lt;SEP&gt;A journal that published the 2008 study on phosphogypsum in building products.&lt;SEP&gt;Constr Build Mater is a journal that published research on the environment hazard mitigation of waste gypsum and chalk.&lt;SEP&gt;Constr Build Mater is a scientific journal publishing studies on phosphogypsum utilization in building products and bricks.&lt;SEP&gt;A scientific journal that published studies on the thermo-physical characteristics and durability of building materials.&lt;SEP&gt;A scientific journal publishing multiple studies on construction materials and durability.&lt;SEP&gt;A journal reporting on the preparation of load-bearing building materials from autoclaved phosphogypsum.</data>
