<node id="Rice Straw">
  <data key="d0">Rice Straw</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Rice straw is a major agricultural byproduct in China, often underutilized and disposed of through open burning, but can be used to increase soil nutrients.&lt;SEP&gt;Rice Straw is the agricultural biomass used as the raw material for producing biochar.&lt;SEP&gt;Rice Straw is the source material whose lignin structure contributes to the organic functional groups observed in the biochar spectra.&lt;SEP&gt;Agricultural biomass used as the raw feedstock for producing BC.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e290dd6268316238694f70c30a367426-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9e17ad262bd9835860df552d7ff475f1-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9e17ad262bd9835860df552d7ff475f1-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9e17ad262bd9835860df552d7ff475f1-chunk-001</data>
