<node id="Radon Gas">
  <data key="d0">Radon Gas</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Radon gas is a potential environmental contamination source from phosphogypsum storage.&lt;SEP&gt;Radon Gas is a radioactive gas originating from phosphogypsum that poses significant health risks to humans.&lt;SEP&gt;Radon gas is an inert radioactive gas released from phosphogypsum that causes internal exposure through inhalation.&lt;SEP&gt;A radioactive gas released from phosphogypsum stockpiles that contributes to atmospheric contamination.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-001</data>
