  <data key="d0">FIPR</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">FIPR is an organization that published proceedings for multiple international symposia on phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;FIPR is an organization that publishes proceedings and publications related to phosphogypsum research and symposiums.&lt;SEP&gt;A research organization that published proceedings for international symposia on phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;An organization that published research papers and symposium proceedings on radioelement migration and phosphogypsum management.&lt;SEP&gt;An organization that published proceedings of the International Symposium on Phosphogypsum in Orlando, FL.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-037&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-040&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-039&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-042&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-015</data>
