<node id="Heavy metals">
  <data key="d0">Heavy metals</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Heavy metals were assessed for mobility in Alberta groundwater systems by SENES.&lt;SEP&gt;Heavy metals are contaminants in phosphogypsum that contribute to environmental concerns restricting its widespread agricultural use.&lt;SEP&gt;Pollutant ions, including Pb(II), Cu(II), and Zn(II), targeted for removal from water.&lt;SEP&gt;Heavy metals are hazardous components in phosphogypsum whose mobility and speciation are influenced by environmental conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Heavy metals are toxic impurities in phosphogypsum that pose potential safety risks and environmental hazards, especially after low-temperature calcination.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemical elements with strong migration and transformation abilities that pose ecological risks.&lt;SEP&gt;Heavy metals are environmental contaminants studied for their pollution characteristics, spatial distribution, and sources in soil.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9e17ad262bd9835860df552d7ff475f1-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-031&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-001</data>
