<node id="Federal Register">
  <data key="d0">Federal Register</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The Federal Register published the E.P.A. allowable toxic elemental criteria for hazardous waste classification.&lt;SEP&gt;The Federal Register published the 1990 final ruling by the U.S. E.P.A. regarding phosphogypsum storage.&lt;SEP&gt;The official publication where the U.S. E.P.A. limit on Rn-222 emissions was documented in 1989.&lt;SEP&gt;The Federal Register published the U.S. Environmental Protection Agency ruling regarding phosphogypsum use in agriculture.&lt;SEP&gt;Federal Register is the official journal of the U.S. federal government where the E.P.A. ruling on phosphogypsum was published.&lt;SEP&gt;The Federal Register is the official journal of the U.S. federal government that published the 1999 standards for radon emission from phosphogypsum stacks.&lt;SEP&gt;The Federal Register published the 1990 ban on phosphogypsum use in building materials in the United States.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-032&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-033&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-004</data>
