<node id="Gold">
  <data key="d0">Gold</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Gold is a chemical element that occurs naturally as a trace component in geological formations, maintaining concentrations in phosphorites that are comparable to those found in shales. Beyond its geochemical distribution, gold serves multiple specialized functions in materials science, catalysis, and analytical microscopy. In catalytic applications, gold is frequently utilized in nanoparticle form supported on hydroxyapatite. This specific support structure significantly amplifies the metal's reactivity and stability, as phosphate and hydroxyl groups on the hydroxyapatite surface effectively prevent nanoparticle sintering. This gold-hydroxyapatite composite is actively employed across several chemical processes, including catalytic oxidation reactions, carbon monoxide elimination, and the water gas shift reaction. In the context of analytical microscopy, gold is commonly introduced as an elemental coating during sample preparation for scanning electron microscopy (SEM). A thin layer of the metal is applied to specimens, including hydroxyapatite samples, via a sputtering process. This conductive coating is essential for preventing electrical charging during microscopy examinations, thereby ensuring high-quality imaging and accurate analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;A metal used for sputter-coating HAp samples prior to SEM imaging.&lt;SEP&gt;Gold is a trace metal found in Phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Gold is a chemical element whose concentration in phosphogypsum was specifically measured in Idaho samples.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-037&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9e17ad262bd9835860df552d7ff475f1-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6825862084b162a4b16cd1037c76e3d7-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-021</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792481783</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
