  <data key="d2">Lead is a trace element measured in phosphogypsum and terrestrial materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Pb is a chemical element whose concentration is measured and reported in the geochemical dataset.&lt;SEP&gt;Pb is a chemical element listed in the data table with specified concentration values.&lt;SEP&gt;Lead is a heavy metal ion that causes cancers and damages the immune system, often coexisting with other heavy metals.&lt;SEP&gt;Pb is a chemical element listed in the first table with associated measurement values.&lt;SEP&gt;Pb is a trace metal listed in the provided table data.</data>
