  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Ti is an element whose concentration increases with decreasing particle size of beneficiated phosphate ore.&lt;SEP&gt;Ti is a chemical element whose concentration is measured and reported in the geochemical dataset.&lt;SEP&gt;Ti is a chemical element listed in the data table with specified concentration values.&lt;SEP&gt;Ti represents Titanium or a specific tracer element scattered in the soil and groundwater layers.&lt;SEP&gt;A trace element measured in parts per million in the provided analytical data.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-046&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-056&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-005</data>
