<node id="Burnett">
  <data key="d0">Burnett</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Burnett is a researcher who investigated the adsorption of U(VI) onto apatite and the lattice positioning of Ra-226.&lt;SEP&gt;Burnett researched how high ionic strength groundwater enhances Ra-226 leachability and retention.&lt;SEP&gt;Burnett is a researcher from the Florida Institute Oceanography who proposed converting phosphogypsum waste into ammonium sulfate.&lt;SEP&gt;Burnett is a researcher cited in a 1996 study related to the United States.&lt;SEP&gt;Burnett is a researcher cited for findings on heavy metals in phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Burnett is a researcher who analyzed phosphogypsum samples from multiple global locations in 1996.&lt;SEP&gt;Burnett co-authored a 2001 study evaluating radionuclide migration from phosphogypsum stacks in Florida.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-007</data>
