  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Groundwater contamination is an environmental issue linked to phosphogypsum disposal sites.&lt;SEP&gt;Groundwater contamination is a severe environmental issue. Groundwater contamination is caused by inadequate leachate control from tailings ponds.&lt;SEP&gt;An environmental risk associated with improper phosphogypsum disposal that recycling aims to mitigate.</data>
