  <data key="d2">Zirconium is a chemical element analyzed in phosphogypsum samples with documented concentration data.&lt;SEP&gt;Zirconium is a trace chemical element present in phosphogypsum with a measured concentration of 6.2 ± 0.8.&lt;SEP&gt;Zirconium is a heavy metal found in phosphogypsum, primarily in fine particle fractions.&lt;SEP&gt;Zirconium is a trace metal found in Phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Zirconium is a chemical element whose concentration in phosphogypsum was measured, with notably high levels recorded in South African samples.</data>
