  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Process water is liquid waste from phosphogypsum production whose chemical composition was analyzed in multiple studies.&lt;SEP&gt;Process water is acidic recycled water used to sluice phosphogypsum and contains solubilized elements and acids.&lt;SEP&gt;Process water contains high levels of total dissolved solids and toxic elements from industrial operations.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-022</data>
