  <data key="d2">Arman and Seals are researchers cited for their work on the chemical and mineralogical characteristics of phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Arman and Seals are researchers who documented the factors influencing Phosphogypsum properties and disposal characteristics.</data>
