  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">Reaction slurry is the mixture in which gypsum crystals form, controlled by various chemical and physical factors.&lt;SEP&gt;The reaction slurry contains trace elements and contaminants in higher concentrations than radioactive contaminants during phosphoric acid production.</data>
