  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Habashi is a researcher who documented the composition of igneous phosphates, including thorium and rare earth elements.&lt;SEP&gt;Habashi is a researcher who documented that up to 80% of REEs from phosphate rock are found in phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Habashi is a researcher who documented the contrasting uranium and thorium concentrations between sedimentary and igneous phosphates.&lt;SEP&gt;Habashi described a method similar to the one-step process developed by Zhao et al.</data>
