<node id="Alkaline Subsoils">
  <data key="d0">Alkaline Subsoils</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Alkaline subsoils are subsurface geological layers capable of buffering acidic seepage waters and reducing heavy metal mobility.</data>
