<node id="Groundwaters">
  <data key="d0">Groundwaters</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Groundwaters are subsurface water systems that can buffer acidic seepage and are at risk of contamination from phosphogypsum stacks.&lt;SEP&gt;Groundwaters are an environmental resource at risk of contamination from phosphogypsum applications.</data>
