</node>
<node id="Calcareous Soils">
  <data key="d0">Calcareous Soils</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Calcareous soils are a soil type where phosphogypsum application increases the availability of nitrogen, phosphorus, potassium, and magnesium.&lt;SEP&gt;Calcareous soils are the agricultural substrate where phosphogypsum and poultry manure improve crop growth.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-015</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
