<node id="Dissolution Rate">
  <data key="d0">Dissolution Rate</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Dissolution Rate is a quantitative metric used to measure the speed at which various materials break down or dissolve under specific environmental, biological, or experimental conditions. As a standard analytical tool, it is typically plotted on the vertical axis against experimental time variables to track material degradation and dissolution over time. The specific application and interpretation of this metric vary significantly depending on the material being studied.

In the context of phosphogypsum, the dissolution rate measures how quickly the material breaks down, a factor that partially controls its effectiveness when used as a soil amendment. When applied to hydroxyapatite, it functions as a biological degradation metric that exhibits an inverse relationship with crystallinity, meaning the rate decreases as the material's crystallinity increases.

For phosphogypsum-based cementitious materials (PGCM) and similar composite systems, the dissolution rate tracks the breakdown speed of components such as dihydrate gypsum and various admixtures. This metric is heavily influenced by factors like curing age and admixture dosage. It is commonly assessed under cyclic environmental conditions, including dry-wet cycles and freeze-thaw cycles, where it serves as a quantitative measure of mass loss used to evaluate material failure. In PGCM specifically, the dissolution rate fluctuates significantly after approximately twenty cycles, a behavior that indicates the progression of crack expansion and the onset of secondary hydration. Overall, the dissolution rate provides a critical, time-dependent measure of material stability and degradation across diverse scientific and engineering applications.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-016</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791515430</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
