<node id="Washing">
  <data key="d0">Washing</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Washing is a versatile physical purification and modification technique primarily applied to phosphogypsum, chemical precipitates, and synthesized crystals. Operating on a scale that spans from laboratory research to full industrial implementation, the process functions as a harmless treatment method designed to eliminate impurities, residual chemicals, water-soluble substances, byproducts, heavy metals, thorium, rare earth elements, and oxides from the target material. Fundamentally, Washing relies on the physical separation of clear liquid and sediment to leach out unwanted soluble components.

Depending on the specific processing stage and desired chemical outcomes, the technique is deployed as an initial pre-treatment for raw materials, a dedicated post-processing step immediately following hydrothermal synthesis, or a preparatory phase prior to dehydration and cement blending. To achieve optimal purification, Washing utilizes various aqueous media, including ionized water, warm water, and lime water. By effectively modifying the chemical properties of the material, reducing its setting time, and standardizing its composition, Washing serves as an essential and widely adopted protocol in both industrial operations, such as those conducted by Company R, and laboratory settings.&lt;SEP&gt;Washing is a treatment method recommended to remove impurities from phosphogypsum for safer applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Washing is a purification technique using water or lime milk to remove water-soluble impurities from phosphogypsum.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-057&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-008</data>
