  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Terrestrial Acidification Potential is an environmental impact category that exhibited higher variability in the PBG technology.&lt;SEP&gt;TAP is an environmental impact metric that decreases as PSC technology proportion increases.&lt;SEP&gt;TAP is an environmental impact indicator measuring terrestrial acidification potential.&lt;SEP&gt;TAP is an environmental impact category evaluated in the comparative analysis.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-010</data>
