  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Steam is a product listed in the table.&lt;SEP&gt;A product generated by the PSC process, specified at 0.8Mpa and 200 °C, with a quantity of 124.00 kg.&lt;SEP&gt;Steam is a resource used as a substitution factor in the PSC scenario.&lt;SEP&gt;Steam is the form of purchased heat considered in the system for calculating CE_h.&lt;SEP&gt;The heating medium contributing to carbon emissions in the production scenarios.&lt;SEP&gt;A form of heating power used in the processes.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-022</data>
