</node>
<node id="Slag Powder">
  <data key="d0">Slag Powder</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Slag powder is a raw material consumed in the PSC technology process.&lt;SEP&gt;A raw material consumed by the PSC process.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-003</data>
