</node>
<node id="Natural Gas">
  <data key="d0">Natural Gas</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Natural gas is a gaseous fossil fuel that functions as a critical energy source, raw material, and industrial fuel across multiple technological and environmental contexts. It is formally classified as a fossil fuel material within energy consumption tables and is actively monitored in specific industrial frameworks. In the PSC technology process and its corresponding scenario, natural gas operates as both a primary raw material and a tracked fuel source. Within the phosphate fertilizer production system, it serves as a key gaseous fossil fuel and acts as the primary energy input for FN production during the building materials stage.

In specific industrial applications, natural gas is burned in furnaces to dry natural gypsum and is consumed in rotary kilns to dry PG within Scenario 2. It is also utilized in burners specifically designed to process captured emissions. Quantitatively, natural gas plays a substantial role in Scenario 2, contributing 1.55% to the total emergy input and driving increases in both overall emergy input and the R1 proportion. Its deployment in drying operations notably elevates energy intensity. Environmentally, natural gas is a major contributor to carbon emissions, ranking alongside coal as a significant emission source, and its combustion in industrial drying processes results in substantial environmental impacts.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-031&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-020</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792223242</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
