  <data key="d0">Particulates</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Particulates are air emissions listed in the emissions table.&lt;SEP&gt;Airborne emissions quantified in kilograms across the PCR, PBG, and PSC process scenarios.&lt;SEP&gt;An emission produced by PCR, PBG, and PSC processes.&lt;SEP&gt;Particulates are airborne emissions estimated during Phosphogypsum spreading and road shaping.&lt;SEP&gt;Particulates are air emissions measured in the LCI data for PG disposal.&lt;SEP&gt;Particulates represent airborne solid particles larger than 10 micrometers quantified in grams.</data>
