  <data key="d2">HCl is an air emission listed in the emissions table.&lt;SEP&gt;An emission produced by the PSC process.&lt;SEP&gt;HCl is a byproduct gas found in small amounts in the effluent during the oxidative decomposition of chlorinated compounds over hydroxyapatite.&lt;SEP&gt;HCl is an acid employed alongside NaOH to adjust the pH levels of aqueous solutions during adsorption experiments.</data>
