  <data key="d2">The positive financial returns generated by PG resource utilization technologies, with PBG showing the highest net gain.&lt;SEP&gt;Economic benefits are one of the three comprehensive benefits to be evaluated in future research on the PG recycling industry.&lt;SEP&gt;Economic benefits represent the financial outcomes of the MAP production process, minimally affected by PG reuse methods.</data>
