  <data key="d0">Sulfuric Acid-Portland Cement Co-production</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Sulfuric Acid-Portland Cement Co-production is a PG-based technology that recycles calcium and sulfur elements to produce sulfuric acid and cement within a circular economy framework.</data>
