  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Mineral CO Sequestration is a process that utilizes recycled phosphogypsum wastes for carbon capture.&lt;SEP&gt;Mineral CO sequestration is a process that applies phosphogypsum waste to capture and store carbon dioxide.&lt;SEP&gt;Mineral CO sequestration is a potential application where phosphogypsum captures and stores carbon dioxide.&lt;SEP&gt;Mineral CO sequestration is a process involving the recycling of phosphogypsum wastes to capture carbon dioxide.</data>
