<node id="Palladium">
  <data key="d0">Palladium</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Palladium is a precious metal catalyst traditionally used for formaldehyde oxidation.&lt;SEP&gt;Palladium is a metal catalyst supported on hydroxyapatite, demonstrating high efficiency in methane and toluene oxidation reactions.&lt;SEP&gt;A metal loaded onto hydroxyapatite for catalyzing the hydrolysis of ammonia-borane.&lt;SEP&gt;Palladium is a metal promoter supported on hydroxyapatite for CO elimination processes.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-025</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791245856</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Calcium-Deficient Hydroxyapatite">
  <data key="d0">Calcium-Deficient Hydroxyapatite</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Calcium-deficient hydroxyapatite is a modified support material that enhances catalytic activity through surface acid sites and cationic vacancies.&lt;SEP&gt;A variant of hydroxyapatite used in studies focusing on vapor phase decomposition and catalytic reactions.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-033</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791246204</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Methane Oxidation">
  <data key="d0">Methane Oxidation</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Methane Oxidation is a catalytic process for breaking down methane, utilizing hydroxyapatite as a catalyst support.&lt;SEP&gt;Methane oxidation is a chemical reaction where hydroxyapatite-supported palladium proves efficient as a catalyst carrier.&lt;SEP&gt;Methane oxidation is a catalytic reaction utilizing hydroxyapatite and fluoroapatite in butan-2-ol conversion.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-025</data>
