<node id="Drug Delivery">
  <data key="d0">Drug Delivery</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Drug delivery is a fundamental biomedical, pharmaceutical, and clinical application concept that encompasses the systems and methodologies designed for the effective administration and controlled release of therapeutic agents. At its core, this field relies on advanced carrier materials and nanomaterial platforms to transport drugs precisely and efficiently to target sites within the body. The primary objective is to optimize therapeutic outcomes by regulating the rate, time, and location of drug release, thereby enhancing efficacy while minimizing systemic side effects.

A significant focus within drug delivery is the utilization of specialized carrier materials, most notably hydroxyapatite. Valued for its excellent biocompatibility and osteoconductive properties, hydroxyapatite serves as a versatile bioceramic carrier in various forms, including nanostructured particles, microspheres, and nanoparticles. These hydroxyapatite-based systems are extensively employed in clinical and pharmaceutical settings to facilitate targeted drug administration. Additionally, the field explores other innovative carriers, such as worm-like particles with hollow hierarchical structures. These specialized particles are highly advantageous due to their high specific surface area, which significantly improves drug loading capacity and release kinetics. Collectively, drug delivery represents a critical interdisciplinary domain where engineered materials and nanotechnology converge to advance therapeutic treatments.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-032&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f2534f7a997df3f80305323317b15be9-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54b92b2ad16a2528ff6a863329c5d403-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791985383</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
