  <data key="d2">Fish bones are a specific type of animal waste utilized as a biological source for hydroxyapatite extraction.&lt;SEP&gt;Fish bones are animal waste sources successfully used to derive hydroxyapatite.&lt;SEP&gt;Fish bones serve as a renewable biological source for extracting biological hydroxyapatite.&lt;SEP&gt;Fish Bones are a natural source material referenced for obtaining Biological Hydroxyapatite.</data>
