<node id="Nanocrystalline Form">
  <data key="d0">Nanocrystalline Form</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The nanocrystalline form of the material is identified as the most effective adsorbent, maintaining high removal rates across a wide range of elements.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-040</data>
