  <data key="d0">Wang, Y.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Wang, Y. is a researcher who co-authored studies on osteoblastic cell responses to fluoridated hydroxyapatite and gold nanoparticle catalysts.&lt;SEP&gt;Wang, Y. is a researcher who co-authored a study on developing and optimizing phosphogypsum-based geopolymer cement.&lt;SEP&gt;Wang, Y. is a researcher who co-authored research on phosphorus and fluorine retention, in situ remediation, and CO abatement in phosphogypsum applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Wang, Y. is a co-author of studies investigating lime additives, utilization strategies, and proportion optimization for phosphogypsum composites.&lt;SEP&gt;Wang, Y. is a lead author of a 2018 study on the preparation and curing mechanism of new cementitious backfilling materials.&lt;SEP&gt;A researcher who developed and optimized phosphogypsum-based geopolymer cement.&lt;SEP&gt;Co-author of a 2014 study on preparing cement-free non-fired bricks from waste phosphogypsum.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-037&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2760dc2a11fedad02d24741a978cf20d-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-034&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-033&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-038&lt;SEP&gt;doc-176fa906dd9c8409d2d1c49b8bdf9948-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-020</data>
