<node id="Appl. Surf. Sci.">
  <data key="d0">Appl. Surf. Sci.</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Appl. Surf. Sci., widely recognized as Applied Surface Sciences, is a scientific journal dedicated to applied surface science, surface science, and technology. The publication focuses on interface reactions, XPS analysis, and surface chemical studies. It serves as a platform for research investigating material interactions and functional properties, including heavy metal trapping on hydroxyapatite surfaces and BSA protein adsorption on hydroxyapatite nanoparticles.

The journal has also documented specialized advancements in materials science and biomedical applications. Notable publications include a 2014 study examining rod-shaped hydroxyapatite as drug carriers, alongside a 2019 research article detailing kapok fibre-based photocatalysts. Through its consistent focus on surface phenomena and technological innovation, Appl. Surf. Sci. continues to disseminate critical findings across the fields of surface chemistry and materials engineering.&lt;SEP&gt;Appl. Surf. Sci. is a scientific journal that published research on applied surface science.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-037&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-35aef6efc801611130c5dd196fe513df-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b81aeff540d385f1d1eda298b44619be-chunk-006</data>
