  <data key="d2">Gold nanoparticles are synthesized on hydroxyapatite supports to serve as high-performance catalysts for low-temperature reactions.&lt;SEP&gt;Gold nanoparticles are used as probes to track the evolution of amorphous calcium phosphate into hydroxyapatite.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54b92b2ad16a2528ff6a863329c5d403-chunk-009</data>
