  <data key="d2">CRC Press is a publisher that released chapters on the thermal stability and applications of hydroxyapatite.&lt;SEP&gt;A publishing house that released a book on hydroxyapatite coatings for biomedical applications.&lt;SEP&gt;CRC Press is a publishing organization that released works on pollution control in fertilizer production.&lt;SEP&gt;CRC Press is the publisher of the first edition of the book "Nanobiomaterials: Research Trends and Applications".&lt;SEP&gt;A publishing house responsible for releasing the 95th edition of the Handbook of Chemistry and Physics.&lt;SEP&gt;CRC Press is a scientific publishing house that published Bioceramics of Calcium Phosphate.&lt;SEP&gt;A publishing house responsible for releasing the 95th edition of the Handbook of Chemistry and Physics.</data>
