<node id="Magnetic Hydroxyapatite Nanoparticles">
  <data key="d0">Magnetic Hydroxyapatite Nanoparticles</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Magnetic Hydroxyapatite Nanoparticles are engineered adsorbents used to capture cadmium and zinc from aqueous solutions.&lt;SEP&gt;Magnetic Hydroxyapatite Nanoparticles are engineered adsorbents used for the removal of cadmium and zinc ions.</data>
