<node id="Ion Exchange">
  <data key="d0">Ion Exchange</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Ion exchange is a fundamental retention and sorption mechanism that facilitates the exchange of ions between solid and liquid phases, functioning as a versatile separation technique. At the chemical level, the process involves the substitution or replacement of specific ions within a host material's structure by ions from the surrounding medium. For example, divalent or toxic heavy metal ions frequently substitute for calcium ions within the hydroxyapatite lattice or within the hydration products of backfill materials. The interaction between fluoride ions and hydroxyapatite crystal surfaces also operates through this chemical exchange mechanism. In other specialized applications, such as when polymeric aluminum chloride is utilized, the exchange between hydroxyl and fluoride ions serves as the primary mechanism for fluorine immobilization.

Beyond these specific chemical interactions, ion exchange is widely deployed across industrial and environmental remediation sectors. It is employed as a key separation technique for the purification of rare earth elements and acts as the primary mechanism by which phosphogypsum removes heavy metal ions from industrial wastewater. While the method is highly effective for environmental heavy metal removal and contaminant immobilization, its application in these contexts is noted to carry potential drawbacks. Overall, ion exchange remains a critical physicochemical process for ion retention, material purification, and wastewater treatment across diverse scientific and engineering fields.&lt;SEP&gt;Ion Exchange is a separation method utilized for extracting lanthanides and uranium during continuous recrystallization and phosphoric acid processing.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9e17ad262bd9835860df552d7ff475f1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e992f3bad9db87c40308ea55e121bd8a-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-028</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792407610</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
