<node id="Huang et al.">
  <data key="d0">Huang et al.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Researchers whose work is referenced for nitrous oxide conversion data on various rhodium catalysts.&lt;SEP&gt;Huang et al. analyzed phosphogypsum from Hubei, finding a sulfur trioxide concentration of 42.10%.&lt;SEP&gt;Huang et al. prepared concrete mixtures using pretreatment PG, clicker, steel slag, slag, and aggregates.&lt;SEP&gt;Huang et al. is a research group that detailed the specific procedural steps for the citric acid leaching method.&lt;SEP&gt;Huang et al. prepared concrete with pretreated PG and slag, demonstrating a significant decline in chloride diffusion coefficient.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-010</data>
