  <data key="d0">Air Pollution</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Air pollution is an environmental contamination issue addressed by hydroxyapatite applications for gas phase contaminant removal.&lt;SEP&gt;Air Pollution is environmental pollution reduced through the eco-friendly application of phosphogypsum.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-025</data>
