<node id="Water Pollution">
  <data key="d0">Water Pollution</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Water pollution is an environmental contamination issue addressed by hydroxyapatite applications for liquid phase contaminant removal.&lt;SEP&gt;Contamination of aquatic systems caused by heavy metals and fluorides leaching from phosphogypsum reservoirs.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791900752</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Soil Pollution">
  <data key="d0">Soil Pollution</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Soil pollution is an environmental contamination issue addressed by hydroxyapatite applications for solid phase contaminant removal.&lt;SEP&gt;Soil pollution is an ecological concern resulting from phosphogypsum waste accumulation.&lt;SEP&gt;Soil pollution is a potential environmental risk that can be driven by the soil water regime or mitigated through passivation.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-25198f8665e133385fd54e5a03e28a44-chunk-007</data>
