  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Protein delivery is a pharmaceutical application where hydroxyapatite serves as a functional delivery media.&lt;SEP&gt;Protein delivery is the target biomedical application field suggested by the results for mesoporous rod-shaped HAp.</data>
