<node id="Environmental Management">
  <data key="d0">Environmental Management</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Environmental management is the field where hydroxyapatite provides significant value and vital contributions.&lt;SEP&gt;Environmental management is a major application category for phosphogypsum with nearly 980 publications.&lt;SEP&gt;A field where phosphogypsum is applied to address pollution and support sustainable development.&lt;SEP&gt;Environmental management is a sector where phosphogypsum has been applied, though challenges remain for large-scale routes.&lt;SEP&gt;A framework of policies and countermeasures designed to mitigate the ecological risks associated with phosphogypsum accumulation.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-057&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-002</data>
