<node id="Ca(II) Ions">
  <data key="d0">Ca(II) Ions</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Ca(II) ions are a specific type of calcium ion that borders the second channel and hosts hydroxyl groups in the hydroxyapatite lattice.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-002</data>
