<node id="Photocatalyst">
  <data key="d0">Photocatalyst</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Photocatalyst is a role hydroxyapatite can fulfill in environmental remediation processes.&lt;SEP&gt;Photocatalyst is a specific application role where hydroxyapatite facilitates chemical reactions under light exposure.&lt;SEP&gt;A material designed to accelerate chemical reactions using light, with heterostructured 1D/2D designs optimized for energy applications.&lt;SEP&gt;A material designed to accelerate chemical reactions using light, with heterostructured 1D/2D designs optimized for energy applications.</data>
