  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Pretreatment is a process applied to naturally derived hydroxyapatite to eliminate organic matter and achieve a pure phase.&lt;SEP&gt;Pretreatment methods are used to reduce impurities like magnesium, silicon, and aluminum in phosphogypsum to promote complete chemical reactions.&lt;SEP&gt;Pretreatment refers to a set of procedures applied to phosphogypsum to remove impurities and prepare it for resource utilization.</data>
