<node id="Zhou, Y.">
  <data key="d0">Zhou, Y.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Zhou, Y. is a researcher who developed nano-structured pig bone hydroxyapatite for high-efficiency Pb2+ adsorption.&lt;SEP&gt;Zhou, Y. is a primary author of a 2022 paper on phosphogypsum reuse.&lt;SEP&gt;Zhou, Y. is a researcher who co-authored studies on durability evaluation and fluoride immobilization of phosphogypsum-based backfill.&lt;SEP&gt;A researcher who studied the influence mechanism and removal method of fluoride in cemented phosphogypsum backfill.&lt;SEP&gt;Zhou, Y. is a researcher who applied machine learning to predict Vegard's law factor and volume size factor for binary substitutional metallic solid solutions.&lt;SEP&gt;Zhou, Y. is a co-author of the 2011 study regarding the safety assessment of the Xiangyun phosphogypsum tailings pond.&lt;SEP&gt;Zhou, Y. is a researcher who co-authored a study on the ecofriendly treatment of phosphogypsum leachates.</data>
