<node id="Gao">
  <data key="d0">Gao</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Gao demonstrated that hydroxyapatite's de-fluoridation efficiency is size-dependent and that biogenic apatite matches synthetic hydroxyapatite performance.&lt;SEP&gt;Gao documented the significant enhancement of PG resource utilization efficiency through new technologies developed by Shandong Lubei Group.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-006</data>
