<node id="Wei">
  <data key="d0">Wei</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Wei examined the adsorption of fulvic acid using hydroxyapatite as an adsorbent.&lt;SEP&gt;Wei reported that cement samples with high PG percentages achieved higher compressive strengths under air curing.&lt;SEP&gt;Wei is a researcher who observed compressive strength in mortar studies.&lt;SEP&gt;Wei is a researcher cited in the footnotes for contributing to the research articles on PG.&lt;SEP&gt;Wei investigated lime dosage effects on phosphogypsum cement mortar, finding that 2% quicklime optimizes impermeability and sulfate corrosion resistance.&lt;SEP&gt;Wei provided statistical data on the production ratio of phosphogypsum relative to phosphoric acid.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792225747</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Textile Industries">
  <data key="d0">Textile Industries</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Textile industries are industrial sectors that heavily discharge toxic organic dyes into water systems.</data>
