  <data key="d0">Level 3</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Level 3 represents the lowest purity grade for phosphogypsum, with relaxed limits and some unspecified parameters.&lt;SEP&gt;The lowest quality grade for phosphogypsum, with unspecified limits for sodium oxide and chloride ions.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-76e07d75a9f5124d07b9dafa2dacfba7-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-76e07d75a9f5124d07b9dafa2dacfba7-chunk-001</data>
