<node id="Gold Nanorods">
  <data key="d0">Gold Nanorods</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Gold nanorods are cylindrical nanoparticles synthesized using wet chemical methods and seed-mediated growth techniques.&lt;SEP&gt;Nanoscale gold structures synthesized using cetyltrimethylammonium bromide as a capping agent.&lt;SEP&gt;Nanoscale gold structures synthesized using cetyltrimethylammonium bromide as a capping agent.</data>
