<node id="Collagen">
  <data key="d0">Collagen</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Collagen is a biomacromolecule that naturally regulates the growth, morphology, and structure of mineral phases in tissues.&lt;SEP&gt;Collagen is a protein component that forms a nano-composite with minerals in bone, contributing to its mechanical quality.&lt;SEP&gt;A biological protein integrated into polyvinyl alcohol-hydroxyapatite scaffolds to replicate natural bone features.&lt;SEP&gt;Collagen is a natural protein used as a core-shell structural component in composite scaffolds for bone repair.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f2534f7a997df3f80305323317b15be9-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f2534f7a997df3f80305323317b15be9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54b92b2ad16a2528ff6a863329c5d403-chunk-008</data>
