  <data key="d2">J. Biomed. Mater. Res. is a scientific journal publishing studies on synthetic bone composites and carbonate substitution in hydroxyapatite.&lt;SEP&gt;J. Biomed. Mater. Res. is the journal that published the 1998 study on carbonate substitution in hydroxyapatite.&lt;SEP&gt;J. Biomed. Mater. Res. is a scientific journal that published a review on analytical methods for hydroxyapatite crystals.</data>
