  <data key="d2">Cryst. Growth Des. is a scientific journal publishing research on the morphology control of fluorapatite crystallites.&lt;SEP&gt;Cryst. Growth Des. is a scientific journal that published research on surfactant control of nanomaterial crystal growth.&lt;SEP&gt;Cryst. Growth Des. is a scientific journal that published a 2009 paper co-authored by K. Teshima and colleagues.&lt;SEP&gt;Cryst. Growth Des. is a scientific journal that published reference 56 in 2014.</data>
