<node id="CTAB">
  <data key="d0">CTAB</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">CTAB, chemically identified as hexadecyltrimethylammonium bromide, is a synthetic cationic surfactant and chemical compound extensively utilized as a structural modifier, crystallization controller, and sacrificial template in advanced material synthesis, with a primary focus on hydroxyapatite (HAp) nanoparticles and microcrystals. In aqueous systems, CTAB ionizes to form tetrahedral cations and self-assembles into positively charged micelle assemblies above its critical micelle concentration, though it can also form smaller spherical micelles under specific conditions. During HAp synthesis, CTAB is typically dissolved in solution B and its concentration is systematically varied relative to Ct to optimize reaction conditions. When combined with citrate, it effectively directs particle morphology by adsorbing onto specific crystal lattice planes, promoting the formation of one-dimensional rod-like nanorods, enhancing size uniformity, and directing oriented crystal growth along the c-axis.

Beyond morphological control, CTAB significantly alters the physicochemical characteristics of synthesized hydroxyapatite. Its incorporation during hydrothermal and aqueous processes increases material crystallinity, modulates the calcium-to-phosphorus ratio, and induces one- and two-dimensional structural modifications. These structural enhancements collectively improve light absorption, facilitate charge separation, increase carrier density, and substantially boost both photocatalytic performance and photoelectrochemical efficiency, including enhanced photocurrent generation. Functioning as a sacrificial template, CTAB is completely washed away or evaporated during post-synthesis processing and calcination, confirming its absence in the final product, such as the HAp-CTAB-9 sample. Additionally, in the synthesis of Surf powder, CTAB’s complete evaporation during calcination inhibits excessive particle growth and generates fine porosity within the final material. Collectively, these multifaceted properties establish CTAB as a highly versatile and indispensable agent across multiple specialized nanoparticle fabrication and manufacturing processes.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f2534f7a997df3f80305323317b15be9-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f2534f7a997df3f80305323317b15be9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f2534f7a997df3f80305323317b15be9-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f2534f7a997df3f80305323317b15be9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f2534f7a997df3f80305323317b15be9-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6825862084b162a4b16cd1037c76e3d7-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2196dee89de9694f28ef4eaa0e85f130-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2196dee89de9694f28ef4eaa0e85f130-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-023</data>
