<node id="Hexadecyltrimethylammonium Bromide">
  <data key="d0">Hexadecyltrimethylammonium Bromide</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Hexadecyltrimethylammonium bromide is the full chemical name for CTAB, a surfactant used in nanoparticle synthesis.&lt;SEP&gt;Hexadecyltrimethylammonium bromide is a surfactant incorporated during hydrothermal synthesis to modify hydroxyapatite morphology and properties.&lt;SEP&gt;Hexadecyltrimethylammonium bromide is a surfactant incorporated during hydrothermal synthesis to modify hydroxyapatite morphology and properties.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f2534f7a997df3f80305323317b15be9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-000</data>
