<node id="Solution B">
  <data key="d0">Solution B</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">Solution B is formed by dissolving CTAB and (NH4)2HPO4 in deionized water, with pH adjusted to 5 using HNO3.&lt;SEP&gt;Solution B consists of HPA specimens combined with phosphoric acid to form phosphorus-containing solutions.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f2534f7a997df3f80305323317b15be9-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-003</data>
