<node id="Nanohydroxyapatite">
  <data key="d0">Nanohydroxyapatite</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Nanohydroxyapatite is a bioceramic material synthesized from phosphogypsum and explored as an alternative phosphorus fertilizer.&lt;SEP&gt;Nanohydroxyapatite is a nanomaterial evaluated as an alternative phosphorus fertilizer in agricultural applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Nanohydroxyapatite is a synthesized material derived from phosphogypsum, explored as a phosphorus source in agriculture.&lt;SEP&gt;Nanohydroxyapatite is a synthesized material derived from phosphogypsum for agricultural and biomedical applications.&lt;SEP&gt;A nanomaterial synthesized from phosphogypsum for agricultural and biomedical applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Nanohydroxyapatite refers to hydroxyapatite nanoparticles derived from phosphogypsum, exhibiting high fluoride adsorption capacity.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2760dc2a11fedad02d24741a978cf20d-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2760dc2a11fedad02d24741a978cf20d-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-176fa906dd9c8409d2d1c49b8bdf9948-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e992f3bad9db87c40308ea55e121bd8a-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792318953</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Thermal Process">
  <data key="d0">Thermal Process</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The Thermal process is an industrial method for producing high-purity phosphoric acid, though it requires high energy costs.&lt;SEP&gt;The thermal process is an industrial method used to produce high-purity phosphoric acid for high-grade chemicals.&lt;SEP&gt;The thermal process uses yellow phosphorus as a raw material and produces anhydrous gypsum type II with minimal impurities, suitable for medical-grade products.&lt;SEP&gt;A phosphoric acid production method compared against the wet di-hemihydrate process.&lt;SEP&gt;The thermal process is a heating procedure that induces mass loss and chemical decomposition.&lt;SEP&gt;Thermal process is an industrial processing method utilizing an electric arc furnace to produce elemental phosphorus and slag.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-022</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792484452</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Green Revolution">
  <data key="d0">Green Revolution</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The Green revolution was a historical period that triggered increased demand for mineral fertilizers and expanded phosphoric acid production capacity.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-000</data>
