  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A synthesis procedure performed in a sealed container at elevated temperatures to produce uniform nHA particles.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydrothermal synthesis is the experimental process used to grow HAP crystals within a specific temperature range.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydrothermal synthesis is a chemical process used to create synthetic hydroxyapatite.</data>
