  <data key="d2">Sylvite is a mineral identified in biochar through XRD peaks at 28° and 41°, corresponding to KCl.&lt;SEP&gt;Sylvite (KCl) is a mineral whose diffraction peaks disappeared from the BC sample during the adsorption process.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9e17ad262bd9835860df552d7ff475f1-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9e17ad262bd9835860df552d7ff475f1-chunk-008</data>
