<node id="Scherrer's Formula">
  <data key="d0">Scherrer's Formula</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Scherrer's Formula is a mathematical method used to calculate the average crystalline size of hydroxyapatite as 3.85 nm.&lt;SEP&gt;Scherrer's formula is applied to XRD data to calculate the average crystalline size of hexagonal pyromorphite.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9e17ad262bd9835860df552d7ff475f1-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9e17ad262bd9835860df552d7ff475f1-chunk-008</data>
