  <data key="d2">KCl is a chemical compound identified as sylvite in the biochar XRD pattern.&lt;SEP&gt;Potassium chloride, a chloride solution tested at 25 degrees.&lt;SEP&gt;KCl is a chemical compound used as a reactant in the double decomposition reaction to produce potassium sulfate.&lt;SEP&gt;Potassium chloride is a chemical used in the experimental setup.</data>
