  <data key="d0">Space Group P63/m</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Space group P63/m defines the symmetry of the hydroxyapatite crystal structure.&lt;SEP&gt;Space group P63/m is the crystallographic symmetry classification determined for the synthesized hydroxyapatite structure.&lt;SEP&gt;Space Group P63/m is the crystallographic space group characterizing the hexagonal structure of nHAp.&lt;SEP&gt;Space Group P63/m is the crystallographic symmetry group identified for the pure hexagonal structural HAp in the nHAp sample.</data>
