  <data key="d0">Space Group P63/m(176)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Space group P63/m(176) is the crystallographic symmetry classification for hexagonal pyromorphite.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9e17ad262bd9835860df552d7ff475f1-chunk-008</data>
