  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">A monovalent cation that shows minimal competitive interference during heavy metal adsorption.&lt;SEP&gt;Na(I) is a monovalent ion that causes steric hindrance and competes for surface adsorption sites on HAP-BC at high concentrations.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9e17ad262bd9835860df552d7ff475f1-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9e17ad262bd9835860df552d7ff475f1-chunk-010</data>
