<node id="K(I)">
  <data key="d0">K(I)</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">A monovalent cation that shows minimal competitive interference during heavy metal adsorption.&lt;SEP&gt;K(I) is a coexisting cation in water that competes with heavy metals during the adsorption process.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9e17ad262bd9835860df552d7ff475f1-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9e17ad262bd9835860df552d7ff475f1-chunk-010</data>
