<node id="Adsorbent">
  <data key="d0">Adsorbent</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A material, specifically HAP-BC, used to remove heavy metals from wastewater through adsorption.&lt;SEP&gt;Adsorbent refers to the material, such as phosphogypsum, that captures metal ions from a solution.&lt;SEP&gt;A material, such as phosphogypsum, used to remove pollutants from a solution.&lt;SEP&gt;Adsorbent describes the function of hydroxyapatite in capturing heavy elements, organic dyes, and fluoride ions.&lt;SEP&gt;Adsorbents are materials that utilize hydroxyapatite to capture and remove heavy elements, organic dyes, and fluoride ions from solutions.&lt;SEP&gt;Adsorbent refers to a material, such as Phosphogypsum, used to remove substances from a solution.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9e17ad262bd9835860df552d7ff475f1-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9e17ad262bd9835860df552d7ff475f1-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9e17ad262bd9835860df552d7ff475f1-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6825862084b162a4b16cd1037c76e3d7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e992f3bad9db87c40308ea55e121bd8a-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792318458</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Ternary system">
  <data key="d0">Ternary system</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">An experimental condition involving a mixed solution of three components used to test HAP-BC adsorption.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9e17ad262bd9835860df552d7ff475f1-chunk-011</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791288603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
