  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A physical process occurring in mesoporous materials at high relative pressures.&lt;SEP&gt;Capillary condensation is a phenomenon occurring at P/Po ≈ 0.9 during nitrogen adsorption isotherm measurements.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9e17ad262bd9835860df552d7ff475f1-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-005</data>
