<node id="Zeolite">
  <data key="d0">Zeolite</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">A conventional absorbent material used for removing pollutants.&lt;SEP&gt;Zeolite is used to treat phosphogypsum for application in binding materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Zeolite is used as a bulking agent in composting livestock manure alongside phosphogypsum co-amendments.&lt;SEP&gt;Zeolite is a bulking agent co-applied with phosphogypsum during the composting of livestock manure.&lt;SEP&gt;Zeolite is a mineral used to treat phosphogypsum to enhance its suitability for use in binding materials.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9e17ad262bd9835860df552d7ff475f1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-045&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-015</data>
