<node id="Jiang">
  <data key="d0">Jiang</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">A researcher who examined the removal capacities of mixed heavy metals using hollow HAP.&lt;SEP&gt;Jiang is a researcher cited for data related to China.&lt;SEP&gt;Jiang is a researcher whose 2024 study explains the chemical forms and effects of fluorine in Phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;A researcher who developed the modified hemihydrate phosphogypsum cementitious material and studied the effects of quicklime and aging time.&lt;SEP&gt;Jiang is a researcher who documented the neurological and chronic poisoning effects of environmental fluorine exposure.&lt;SEP&gt;Jiang is a researcher who calculated the theoretical amount of quicklime required to eliminate soluble P₂O₅ and fluoride ions.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9e17ad262bd9835860df552d7ff475f1-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-023</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791715179</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Chen">
  <data key="d0">Chen</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Chen is a researcher whose work primarily focuses on materials science, environmental remediation, and sustainable industrial evaluation, with a particular emphasis on phosphogypsum and composite backfill materials. In material engineering, Chen has investigated mechanical properties and setting characteristics, notably enhancing the strength of alpha-hemihydrate gypsum by incorporating fluorine and aluminum compounds, and analyzing how ageing time and recycled waste influence material durability. Chen has also examined the effect of fluorine on setting times, while studying fluorine concentration variations and leaching characteristics within composite backfill systems. To assess environmental safety and immobilization efficiency, Chen employed rotary acid leaching and column leaching tests to evaluate leaching behavior and fluoride immobilization, and co-developed schematic diagrams demonstrating the immobilization of toxic metal ions by CPGFM backfill.

Beyond material applications, Chen has contributed to environmental chemistry by reporting adsorption capacities utilizing cross-linked chitosan combined with epichlorohydrin. Furthermore, Chen has advanced sustainability assessment methodologies by proposing the Green Development Degree indicator for evaluating industrial enterprises that utilize phosphogypsum. Chen has also collaborated with Lu to develop emergy-based indicators designed to evaluate overall system performance, demonstrating a consistent commitment to both technical material optimization and comprehensive environmental sustainability metrics.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9e17ad262bd9835860df552d7ff475f1-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792225627</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Zhu">
