  <data key="d0">2D Line Graph</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The 2D line graph illustrates the equilibrium adsorption capacity of phosphogypsum for heavy metals at varying concentrations.&lt;SEP&gt;2D Line Graph is a visual data representation plotting dissolution rate against the number of freeze-thaw cycles.&lt;SEP&gt;An informational chart plotting pH levels against time over a specific period.&lt;SEP&gt;The 2D Line Graph plots the photoelectrochemical efficiency of various samples against applied potential.&lt;SEP&gt;2D Line Graph is the chart type used to display trends of the R (II/III) ratio over time.&lt;SEP&gt;A visual representation plotting compressive strength against replacement percentage for four data series.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9e17ad262bd9835860df552d7ff475f1-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80e3f6300e001922a5ca2a6a8ac2e0d2-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-72ff3bbf1e2b594abc3ec5c8d86e3178-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e0549fcda95f7199440791b20bf85635-chunk-010</data>
