<node id="IAEA">
  <data key="d0">IAEA</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The International Atomic Energy Agency (IAEA) is an international organization that functions as a primary authoritative source for data, research, and regulatory guidance concerning radiation protection and the management of Naturally Occurring Radioactive Material (NORM) residues. The agency regularly publishes comprehensive guidelines, technical reports, and safety documents that specifically address radiation management protocols within the phosphate industry. Beyond its regulatory and safety standardization roles, the IAEA provides essential standard reference materials used for calibration purposes across scientific and industrial applications.

In the context of phosphogypsum utilization, the IAEA is widely cited as a key reference for quantitative estimates regarding worldwide phosphogypsum stacks and data on phosphogypsum consumption rates in road base applications. The agency also supplies critical reference data on the worldwide mean radium-226 activity found in phosphogypsum. Additionally, IAEA research demonstrates that during phosphogypsum transformation, radionuclides migrate to calcium carbonate, a natural process that significantly lowers radioactivity levels in the resulting fertilizer products. Through these combined efforts in data provision, scientific investigation, and safety standardization, the IAEA plays a central role in advancing the safe and informed management of phosphogypsum and associated radiological risks.&lt;SEP&gt;An international body that provided estimates on global phosphogypsum production volumes and environmental impacts.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-042&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-043&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792455733</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
