  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A parameter representing the absolute detection capability of the measurement system.&lt;SEP&gt;Detection efficiency is a parameter representing the probability of detecting photons at the 186 keV energy line.&lt;SEP&gt;Detection efficiency is a dimensionless ratio representing the effectiveness of a detector in capturing radiation compared to the total amount emitted.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-006</data>
