  <data key="d0">Phosphorite Ore</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Phosphorite ore is the raw material imported and mixed to produce phosphogypsum in the studied facility.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphorite ore is the raw material processed to produce phosphogypsum, undergoing chemical operations that break radioactive equilibrium.&lt;SEP&gt;The raw geological material used to produce phosphogypsum and phosphoric acid.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphorite ore is the raw material containing high concentrations of uranium series isotopes used in the process.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphorite Ore is the raw mineral material subjected to chemical processing to produce phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphorite ore is the raw material containing Radium-226 and Uranium-238 isotopes in radioactive equilibrium.</data>
