  <data key="d2">TENORM waste refers to technologically enhanced naturally occurring radioactive material waste, specifically extracted or concentrated in phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;TENORM waste refers to technologically enhanced naturally occurring radioactive material, specifically phosphogypsum, from which natural radionuclides are extracted.&lt;SEP&gt;TENORM waste refers to technologically enhanced naturally occurring radioactive material produced in the fertilizer industry.&lt;SEP&gt;TENORM waste refers to technologically enhanced naturally occurring radioactive material, specifically phosphogypsum, from which radionuclides are extracted.</data>
