  <data key="d0">Alpha Spectrometry</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Alpha spectrometry is a measurement technique compared with gamma spectrometry for environmental natural radioactivity surveys.&lt;SEP&gt;Alpha Spectrometry is an analytical technique employed to survey environmental natural radioactivity.&lt;SEP&gt;Alpha spectrometry is an analytical technique compared with gamma spectrometry for radiological characterization of phosphate fertilizers.</data>
