<node id="Springer">
  <data key="d0">Springer</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Springer is a prominent academic and scientific publishing house that operates as a major platform for hosting and distributing scholarly journals and books. As a leading publisher, it has released a wide range of research and studies covering specialized scientific topics, including uranium mining, phosphogypsum distribution and utilization, associated chemical processes, and the characterization and treatment of mine wastes. Additionally, the organization published the book Metabolism of the Anthroposphere.

Beyond its editorial role, Springer functions as a digital academic journal website platform that hosts numerous scientific papers. The platform incorporates specific verification and update features, notably utilizing the CrossMark logo for document authentication and displaying the Check for updates icon to ensure readers access the most current versions of published works.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-176fa906dd9c8409d2d1c49b8bdf9948-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1b5f95e85d7bfa3b7aab581f3c82b33-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b81aeff540d385f1d1eda298b44619be-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b81aeff540d385f1d1eda298b44619be-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792261045</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
