  <data key="d2">Zielinski is a researcher cited for research on phosphogypsum radionuclide distribution.&lt;SEP&gt;Zielinski investigated chemical activators to improve the compressive strength of anhydrite cement.&lt;SEP&gt;Co-author of a 1994 study investigating activators for phosphogypsum applications.</data>
