<node id="Chemical Processing">
  <data key="d0">Chemical Processing</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Chemical processing is the industrial procedure that transforms phosphorite ore into phosphogypsum and phosphoric acid, causing radionuclide fractionation.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemical Processing is the industrial procedure applied to phosphorite ore that influences the retention and distribution of lead and radium isotopes.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-016</data>
