<node id="Equation 7">
  <data key="d0">Equation 7</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Equation 7 represents the simplified uranium decay chain sequence used as an indicator of radioactive equilibrium.&lt;SEP&gt;Equation 7 calculates the 2020 emergy-to-money ratio (REM_2020) by adjusting the 2015 ratio with GDP and IGDP indices.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792225747</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Equation 8">
  <data key="d0">Equation 8</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Equation 8 expresses the mathematical condition for secular equilibrium where activity concentrations of decay chain isotopes are equal.&lt;SEP&gt;A mathematical formula used to calculate the Applied Bias Photon-to-Current Efficiency percentage based on photocurrent density and applied potential.&lt;SEP&gt;A mathematical formula used to calculate the Applied Bias Photon-to-Current Efficiency percentage based on photocurrent density and applied potential.&lt;SEP&gt;Equation 8 calculates the 2015 emergy-to-money ratio (REM_2015) by dividing total emergy used by GDP in 2015.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792225747</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Thorium Series">
