<node id="Coefficient of Determination">
  <data key="d0">Coefficient of Determination</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Coefficient of determination is a statistical measure indicating the strength of correlation between isotopic ratios and average grain diameter.&lt;SEP&gt;Coefficient of Determination measures the correlation strength between the fitted curve and the observed data points.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-019</data>
