<node id="Coarse Fraction">
  <data key="d0">Coarse Fraction</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">Coarse fraction refers to the larger particle size category of phosphogypsum where organic matter interferes with radium accumulation.&lt;SEP&gt;The coarse fraction is the portion of PG retained by a sieve during wet sieving, containing higher impurity concentrations.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-009</data>
