  <data key="d0">HA Nanostructures</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">HA nanostructures are synthesized with specific dimensions using CTAB in aqueous solutions.&lt;SEP&gt;HA Nanostructures are hydroxyapatite structures synthesized by Yao et al. using CTAB via the wet precipitation route.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-001</data>
