</node>
<node id="CTAB Concentration">
  <data key="d0">CTAB Concentration</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">CTAB concentration is a synthesis condition that strongly affects HA morphology, size, and phases.&lt;SEP&gt;CTAB Concentration refers to the molar amounts of surfactant used in synthesis, which directly influence crystal growth morphology.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-001</data>
