  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Nitrogen adsorption isotherms measure the amount of nitrogen adsorbed by the powders to analyze surface area and porosity.&lt;SEP&gt;Nitrogen adsorption isotherms are experimental curves used to derive BET surface area, cumulative pore volume, and average pore width for the powders.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-006</data>
