  <data key="d0">Dentin</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Dentin is a biological material whose nanorod or needle dimensions are targeted by the surfactant-assisted synthesis route.&lt;SEP&gt;A human calcified tissue with specific dimensions that researchers aim to mimic with HA crystals.&lt;SEP&gt;Dentin is a natural biological tissue containing hydroxyapatite crystals comparable in size to the synthesized nanorods.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-001</data>
