<node id="Cetyltrimethyl Ammonium Bromide">
  <data key="d0">Cetyltrimethyl Ammonium Bromide</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Cetyltrimethyl Ammonium Bromide is a surfactant added to direct the formation of hydroxyapatite nanorods or needles.&lt;SEP&gt;A biocompatible cationic surfactant used to control HA morphology and act as a nucleating site.&lt;SEP&gt;Cetyltrimethyl ammonium bromide is a chemical agent used as a template to synthesize mesoporous hydroxyapatite particles.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-000</data>
