<node id="Surf Route">
  <data key="d0">Surf Route</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The Surf Route is a synthesis variant that incorporates a surfactant to control crystal morphology under specific conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;A synthesis pathway for HA powders conducted with the addition of a surfactant.</data>
