<node id="Cationic Surfactant">
  <data key="d0">Cationic Surfactant</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Cationic Surfactant is a chemical agent used as a template to direct the morphology and size of hydroxyapatite nanopowders.&lt;SEP&gt;Cationic surfactant is used as a template in the hydrothermal synthesis of hydroxyapatite nanopowders.&lt;SEP&gt;Cationic surfactant acts as a template in the hydrothermal synthesis of hydroxyapatite nanopowders.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-008</data>
