<node id="Polyethylene Glycol">
  <data key="d0">Polyethylene Glycol</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">A surfactant utilized to control HA morphology and reduce particle size.&lt;SEP&gt;Polyethylene Glycol is a polymer additive used alongside templates to facilitate the biomimetic synthesis of spherical nanohydroxyapatite.&lt;SEP&gt;A polymer added to calcium phosphate solutions during spray pyrolysis to form nano-sized hydroxyapatite powders.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-015</data>
