  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Cetyltrimethylammonium Bromide is a specific cationic surfactant used as a template in the hydrothermal synthesis of dandelion-like hydroxyapatite.&lt;SEP&gt;A surfactant compound used as a capping agent in the synthesis of gold nanorods.&lt;SEP&gt;A surfactant compound used as a capping agent in the synthesis of gold nanorods.</data>
