<node id="Morphology">
  <data key="d0">Morphology</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Morphology refers to the structural shape and arrangement of the synthesized HA particles, influenced by synthesis conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Morphology refers to the physical shape and structural characteristics of hydroxyapatite particles, which are heavily influenced by synthesis conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Morphology is a physical characteristic of phosphogypsum that is analyzed to determine its marketability.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-019</data>
