</node>
<node id="Average Crystallite Size">
  <data key="d0">Average Crystallite Size</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">A quantitative measure of crystallite dimensions calculated from XRD peak width using the Scherrer equation.&lt;SEP&gt;Average Crystallite Size is a measured physical property of hydroxyapatite powders, expressed in nanometers.</data>
