  <data key="d0">Crystallite Size to Crystallinity Ratio</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The Crystallite Size to Crystallinity Ratio is a calculated metric of 0.53 ± 0.07, showing a direct relationship between the two parameters.</data>
