  <data key="d2">A specific crystal plane labeled in the NoSurf-900C diffraction pattern around 26 degrees.&lt;SEP&gt;Miller Index 002 identifies a distinct peak at approximately 25 degrees 2Theta.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2196dee89de9694f28ef4eaa0e85f130-chunk-006</data>
