  <data key="d2">Stretching Mode refers to molecular vibrations, such as the P-O and OH- stretching modes identified in spectroscopic analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;Stretching Mode refers to vibrational modes of chemical bonds, such as those of PO4^3- and OH groups.&lt;SEP&gt;Stretching Mode refers to vibrational modes of chemical bonds, such as those of PO4^3- and OH groups.</data>
