  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Tetrahedral structural clusters formed by calcium and phosphate ions that facilitate HA particle growth.&lt;SEP&gt;Hexagonal-shaped clusters that form on rod-shaped micellar surfaces and act as nucleating points.</data>
