<node id="Effluent">
  <data key="d0">Effluent</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Effluent is the wastewater generated during phosphogypsum washing that requires cleansing to prevent environmental pollution.&lt;SEP&gt;Effluent is the liquid fraction output from wastewater treatment that can be discharged to waterways or reused.&lt;SEP&gt;Effluent is a component of wastewater that can be lost to water, landfill, or non-soil environments, or recycled to agriculture.&lt;SEP&gt;A liquid output from wastewater treatment that splits into recycled and unused streams.&lt;SEP&gt;Liquid waste from the wastewater sector containing phosphorus that may be lost or recycled.</data>
