<node id="Clinker">
  <data key="d0">Clinker</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Clinker is a primary raw material and fundamental component in cement production, functioning as the intermediate product generated during the clinker firing process. During this thermal manufacturing stage, liquid phases can wrap phosphogypsum, facilitating its direct integration into the clinker matrix. In standard cement paste and composite cement formulations, clinker serves as the base material that is frequently partially substituted or interground with alternative additives, specifically natural gypsum, selenite gypsum, and various forms of phosphogypsum.

In practical and experimental applications, clinker is combined with pretreated or treated phosphogypsum to develop modified cementitious systems. These mixtures are utilized not only in traditional cement manufacturing but also in specialized mortar and concrete preparations, where clinker is often blended with pretreated phosphogypsum alongside slag. Researchers systematically evaluate these composite formulations by adjusting the percentages of phosphogypsum to measure resulting variations in compressive strength and overall material performance. Through these industrial and laboratory processes, clinker remains a central element in creating modified cement alternatives that effectively incorporate industrial by-products.&lt;SEP&gt;A primary component of cement that is interground with treated PG to form the final cement product.&lt;SEP&gt;Clinker is the intermediate product of cement manufacturing produced through high-temperature burning processes.&lt;SEP&gt;Clinker is an intermediate sintered material in cement production whose formation temperature and grinding time are optimized by phosphogypsum.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-038&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e4a551024f80f822f3f35e38ec278151-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-013</data>
