<node id="Zhou">
  <data key="d0">Zhou</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Zhou is a researcher who reported that brick compressive strength improves as phosphogypsum content increases up to 75%.&lt;SEP&gt;Zhou reported that PG addition negatively affected the compressive strength of magnesium potassium phosphate cement.&lt;SEP&gt;Zhou is a researcher who observed compressive strength in mortar studies.&lt;SEP&gt;A researcher who documented microstructural changes in the filling body under varying soluble phosphorus concentrations.&lt;SEP&gt;Zhou is a researcher who investigated the influence of underground environments on phosphorus leaching through drying-wetting cycles.&lt;SEP&gt;Zhou is a researcher whose 2007 work investigates hydrogen bonding between proteins and hydroxyapatite.&lt;SEP&gt;Zhou is a researcher who examined changes in phosphorus flow in an agricultural food chain using substance flow analysis.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4739e42903c95e1fb7e0ecfbca3a12df-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792225747</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Abdelhadi">
  <data key="d0">Abdelhadi</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Abdelhadi created mortar combinations by substituting clinker with PG dried at different temperatures.&lt;SEP&gt;Abdelhadi prepared mortar mixtures with varying phosphogypsum percentages and drying temperatures to measure setting time.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792455585</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Smadi">
  <data key="d0">Smadi</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Smadi found that substituting cement with PG up to 100% decreased mortar compressive strength.&lt;SEP&gt;Smadi is a researcher who found that substituting cement with PG up to 100% decreases mortar compressive strength.&lt;SEP&gt;Smadi is a researcher who calcined PG across a range of temperatures and identified an optimum range of 650-950 °C.&lt;SEP&gt;A researcher who stated that cement paste mixtures experience increased initial and final setting times with PG substitution.&lt;SEP&gt;Smadi found higher soundness in cement paste mixtures in 1999 with increasing PG content.&lt;SEP&gt;Smadi is a researcher who studied the effects of untreated and calcined phosphogypsum on concrete setting time and strength.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792484618</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="lmez">
  <data key="d0">lmez</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">lmez studied how impurities in PG significantly impact cement setting time.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-018</data>
