<node id="Erdem">
  <data key="d0">Erdem</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Erdem co-authored research on the impact of PG impurities on cement setting time.&lt;SEP&gt;Erdem is a researcher who co-authored a study with Ölzmen on refining phosphogypsum using water and milk of lime washing.&lt;SEP&gt;Erdem collaborated with Ӧlmez to demonstrate longer setting times with treated phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;A researcher who co-authored findings on the impact of PG impurities on cement setting time.&lt;SEP&gt;Erdem collaborated with Olmez on studies regarding phosphogypsum purification and cement application.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
