<node id="Drying Shrinkage">
  <data key="d0">Drying Shrinkage</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Drying Shrinkage is a physical property and dimensional stability characteristic that quantifies the reduction in volume or dimensional changes of a material during its drying process. It is routinely evaluated to assess how materials respond to moisture loss, typically under controlled air and oven drying conditions, and is frequently measured at specific intervals such as 28 days to determine long-term performance. As a critical indicator of volumetric response, excessive drying shrinkage can manifest as a dimensional instability defect that restricts practical application in construction and engineering.

The magnitude of Drying Shrinkage and the influence of additives are highly dependent on the specific material matrix. In general cementitious matrices, mortar, and concrete, the incorporation of phosphogypsum substantially increases drying shrinkage, often exacerbating dimensional instability and limiting the material's usability. Conversely, in adobe applications, increasing phosphogypsum content has been observed to decrease drying shrinkage, thereby improving dimensional stability during both air and oven drying. This property has also been specifically characterized in bricks manufactured by Türket and Aksin, as well as in hemihydrate phosphogypsum composites blended with recycled waste glass. Ultimately, Drying Shrinkage serves as a fundamental metric for evaluating material durability, with its behavior and the effects of compositional changes varying distinctly across different base materials and formulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Drying shrinkage is a physical property of adobe soil that decreases with increasing phosphogypsum and natural gypsum content.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e4a551024f80f822f3f35e38ec278151-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e4a551024f80f822f3f35e38ec278151-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e4a551024f80f822f3f35e38ec278151-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e4a551024f80f822f3f35e38ec278151-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-012</data>
