  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Properties of phosphogypsum slag cement significantly affected by the CaO/SO3 ratio.&lt;SEP&gt;Mechanical Characteristics refer to the physical strength and durability of the designed mixes, which are targeted for improvement.</data>
