  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Sulfuric acid leaching is a chemical treatment method applied to remove phosphorus pentoxide and fluorine from phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;A chemical extraction method used to recover rare earth elements from phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Sulfuric acid leaching is an extraction process used to prepare magnesium hydroxide from serpentinite.</data>
