<node id="Non-immersing Method">
  <data key="d0">Non-immersing Method</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A specific analytical technique employed during the Scanning Electron Microscopy examination of brick samples.&lt;SEP&gt;Non-immersing Method is a technique used to form semi-hydrated gypsum into standard bricks for quality control.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-016</data>
