</node>
<node id="Waste River Sludge">
  <data key="d0">Waste River Sludge</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Waste river sludge is a material used as a predominant adhesion agent in cement pastes containing PG.&lt;SEP&gt;Waste river sludge is an industrial byproduct recycled into unfired green bricks.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-033</data>
