  <data key="d2">PG4 is one of four phosphogypsum samples analyzed using X-ray Diffraction to compare mineral phases.&lt;SEP&gt;PG4 is a sample represented by a green line, characterized by a broad amorphous hump and distinct mineral peaks.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-039&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-038</data>
