<node id="Needle-like Structures">
  <data key="d0">Needle-like Structures</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Needle-like structures are long, thin, parallel clusters resembling fibers, characteristic of hydration products like ettringite.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-039</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791365348</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Matrix">
  <data key="d0">Matrix</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The matrix is a rough, granular background in the micrograph, suggesting a solidified paste or binding agent.&lt;SEP&gt;Matrix is the continuous phase of PGCM that water penetrates along micro-cracks during the immersion stage.&lt;SEP&gt;Matrix is the structural base of PGCM containing free water and undergoing hydration reactions.&lt;SEP&gt;The matrix is the internal structure of PGCM where hydration, erosion, and ion balance processes occur.&lt;SEP&gt;The material structure within which air voids and aggregate particles are embedded.&lt;SEP&gt;Mathematical structure containing elements indexed by i and j.&lt;SEP&gt;Matrix represents the base material into which phosphogypsum is incorporated to alter its physical properties.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-039&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-023</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792454775</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="28d">
  <data key="d0">28d</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">28d is an annotation indicating a curing age of 28 days in the context of materials science and cement.&lt;SEP&gt;Represents a curing age of 28 days in scientific contexts.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-039&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-040</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791365348</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
