<node id="FA">
  <data key="d0">FA</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">FA is an aluminum-silicon compound that results in low calcium levels and increased corrosion in the cement-PG system.&lt;SEP&gt;A material added to raw PG to reduce natural moisture content and neutralize acidity.&lt;SEP&gt;Fly ash additive providing strong alkaline buffering to significantly reduce PG acidity.&lt;SEP&gt;A material component used in mixtures P1 through P5.&lt;SEP&gt;A constituent material with defined chemical composition and physical properties documented in the study.&lt;SEP&gt;FA refers to fly ash, a combustion byproduct used as a soil stabilizer.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-160a0fe95f7c82b193c6af751106ab6d-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-160a0fe95f7c82b193c6af751106ab6d-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-160a0fe95f7c82b193c6af751106ab6d-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-764bdde7c1b68efdbe7342cc41c2d3d4-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-764bdde7c1b68efdbe7342cc41c2d3d4-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792141505</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
