<node id="XRD analysis">
  <data key="d0">XRD analysis</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">XRD analysis is a characterization technique used to evaluate concrete samples before and after autoclaving.&lt;SEP&gt;XRD analysis is a technique used to determine the crystalline structure and solid phases of the samples.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80e3f6300e001922a5ca2a6a8ac2e0d2-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792122541</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Autoclaving">
  <data key="d0">Autoclaving</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Autoclaving is a thermal treatment process that decomposes ettringite and transforms CeSeH gel into tobermorite.&lt;SEP&gt;Autoclaving is a curing process applied to aerated concrete that influences hydration and maintains structural strength.&lt;SEP&gt;Autoclaving is a steam pressure treatment process applied to PG to prepare it for brick manufacturing.&lt;SEP&gt;Autoclaving is a high-pressure steam process used to prepare load-bearing building materials from phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Autoclaving is a process used in ASTM C151 to evaluate the soundness of cement paste.&lt;SEP&gt;Autoclaving is a testing procedure used to evaluate the soundness of hardened cement paste by measuring percent elongation.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e0549fcda95f7199440791b20bf85635-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e0549fcda95f7199440791b20bf85635-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792502969</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Tian et al.">
  <data key="d0">Tian et al.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Tian et al. reported that PG primarily functions as a filler in concrete systems, with its activating role requiring further study.&lt;SEP&gt;Tian et al. are researchers whose experimental data is cited in the XRD analysis and compressive strength comparisons.&lt;SEP&gt;Tian et al. are researchers who conducted SEM analysis on concrete samples to examine microstructural changes from Phosphogypsum.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-025</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791365693</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
