<node id="Fig. 16">
  <data key="d0">Fig. 16</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Fig. 16 illustrates the microstructural changes and corrosion effects caused by carbonization on cement-PG composites.&lt;SEP&gt;Fig. 16 is a visual reference showing the relationship between drying time and D50 particle size.&lt;SEP&gt;Fig. 16 displays the powder MPG particle size test results.&lt;SEP&gt;A figure showing conductometric curves and stabilization time of synthetic phosphogypsum with varying P2O5 contents.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-019</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792405868</data>
