  <data key="d2">Fig. 14 displays XRD analysis results from studies conducted by Yang et al. and Tian et al.&lt;SEP&gt;Fig. 14 is a figure illustrating fluorine re-release in CPGFM filling slurry.&lt;SEP&gt;Fig. 14 is a figure demonstrating the correlation between syncrystallized HPO4^2- ion quantity and absorption band peak height.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-017</data>
