  <data key="d0">Hydration-Recrystallization Process</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Hydration-Recrystallization process is a mechanism where gypsum crystals recrystallize in situ to interlock and increase brick strength.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydration-Recrystallization Process is a novel manufacturing technique for preparing non-fired bricks from waste phosphogypsum.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-032</data>
