  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Road bases and subbases are infrastructure components where by-product phosphogypsum is used as a construction material.&lt;SEP&gt;Road bases are foundational layers in road construction where phosphogypsum by-products are applied.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-160a0fe95f7c82b193c6af751106ab6d-chunk-017</data>
