  <data key="d2">Reddy et al. investigated cement replacement with PG, finding optimal strength at 10% replacement.&lt;SEP&gt;Reddy et al. studied the partial replacement of cement with PG at different water-to-binder ratios, concluding 10% PG is optimal.</data>
