  <data key="d2">Chemical admixtures are substances utilized to remedy the decrease in concrete workability caused by PG incorporation.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemical admixtures are additives used to modify the setting time, fluidity, and mechanical properties of phosphorus gypsum-based mortar.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemical admixtures are additives that affect the setting time, fluidity, and mechanical properties of phosphorus gypsum based self-leveling mortar.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemical admixtures are additives used to mitigate the decline in workability caused by PG inclusion.</data>
