<node id="Shrinkage">
  <data key="d0">Shrinkage</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Shrinkage is a physical property of mortar affected by the addition and content level of Plaster Of Paris.&lt;SEP&gt;Shrinkage is a physical property of PGCM that can be reduced by quicklime and cement admixtures.&lt;SEP&gt;A dimensional change property that increases with higher PG content in mortar and bricks.&lt;SEP&gt;Shrinkage is a contraction property of the matrix that is generally increased by the introduction of PG.&lt;SEP&gt;Shrinkage is a physical property of the matrix that increases when phosphogypsum is included.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-012</data>
