  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Bond Strength is a mechanical property of mortar influenced by the integration of Plaster Of Paris.&lt;SEP&gt;Bond strength is a mechanical property measured in self-leveling mortar that declines with increased phosphogypsum content.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-008</data>
