  <data key="d0">Wear Resistance</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Wear Resistance is a durability characteristic of mortar that changes with varying Plaster Of Paris content.&lt;SEP&gt;Wear resistance is a property reduced when phosphogypsum is added to self-leveling mortar.&lt;SEP&gt;A physical property measured to evaluate the durability and surface quality of the flooring tiles.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-011</data>
