  <data key="d2">Self-leveling Mortar is a specialized concrete mixture developed by Yang Et al. containing natural sand, Plaster Of Paris, and cement.&lt;SEP&gt;Self-leveling mortar is a construction material manufactured using phosphogypsum or anhydrite-II phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Self-leveling mortar is a mixture prepared with cement, PG, and natural sand to evaluate workability.&lt;SEP&gt;Self-leveling mortar is a construction mixture prepared by Yang et al. containing cement, PG, and natural sand.</data>
