<node id="Wallboard">
  <data key="d0">Wallboard</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Wallboard is a construction material that can be produced using phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Wallboard is a building material that can incorporate high proportions of Phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Wallboard is a construction material that can utilize phosphogypsum as a substitute for natural gypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Wallboard is a construction material manufactured with PG replacing natural gypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Wallboard is a building material product that extensively utilizes phosphogypsum.</data>
