  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">Aggregate is a construction material reclaimed from Phosphogypsum and processed for concrete production.&lt;SEP&gt;Aggregate is a primary material component used in the formulation of reinforced concrete.&lt;SEP&gt;A construction material component that Hemihydrate Phosphogypsum can replace when it loses gelling activity.</data>
