  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Reaction mechanism refers to the chemical processes of Phosphogypsum hydration that require further study.&lt;SEP&gt;Reaction mechanism refers to the underlying chemical processes that remain unaffected by uneven material mixing.&lt;SEP&gt;Reaction Mechanism refers to the step-by-step chemical pathway elucidated during phosphogypsum decomposition.</data>
