<node id="Akfas">
  <data key="d0">Akfas</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">A researcher cited in the footnotes for contributing data or findings related to the study.&lt;SEP&gt;Akfas is a researcher cited for revealing the presence of fluorite in phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Akfas proved using elemental deportment and microanalysis that gypsum acts as the main REE vector in phosphogypsum.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-010</data>
