<node id="Metallic Pollution">
  <data key="d0">Metallic Pollution</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Metallic pollution is a severe environmental threat to marine systems and human health associated with phosphogypsum dumping.&lt;SEP&gt;Metallic pollution refers to the contamination of aquatic environments by heavy metals and trace elements, posing threats to ecosystems and human health.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-016</data>
