<node id="Huelva Estuary">
  <data key="d0">Huelva Estuary</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">The Huelva Estuary is a crucial marsh ecosystem in Spain facing severe pollution from historical mining and ongoing phosphogypsum disposal.&lt;SEP&gt;Huelva Estuary is a coastal environment where phosphogypsum pollution impacts were assessed and restoration strategies are needed.&lt;SEP&gt;A Spanish estuary studied for trace metal levels and toxicity compared to historical data.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-053&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-018</data>
