  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">The Odiel River is a river in Spain transporting sulfates, metals, and metalloids to the Huelva Estuary.&lt;SEP&gt;The Odiel River forms an estuary with the Tinto River, receiving contaminated effluents from phosphogypsum stacks.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-007</data>
