  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">The Mediterranean Sea is the larger marine basin containing the Gulf of Gabes and receiving pollution from the region.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-017</data>
