<node id="Gabes City">
  <data key="d0">Gabes City</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Gabes City is a location in Tunisia where heavy metal contamination and ecological risks from industrial facilities were assessed.&lt;SEP&gt;Gabes City is a coastal urban area in Tunisia where the phosphate fertilizer industry is established, impacting the surrounding Gulf of Gabes.&lt;SEP&gt;Gabes City is a Tunisian industrial hub surrounded by phosphate fertilizer factories and contaminated coastal areas.&lt;SEP&gt;Gabes City is an industrial coastal area where heavy metal contamination in surface sediments was assessed.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-038&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-021</data>
