  <data key="d2">REE (Rare Earth Elements) are geochemical tracers used to evaluate long-term environmental impacts in the Huelva Estuary.&lt;SEP&gt;REE is an abbreviation for rare earth elements, noted as not uniformly distributed in the phosphogypsum matrix.</data>
