  <data key="d2">Tri-n-octylphosphine oxide, an organic solvent used in leaching mixtures.&lt;SEP&gt;TOPO is a chemical compound combined with tributyl phosphate to enhance the leaching process.&lt;SEP&gt;TOPO is a chemical component of the TBP-TOPO solvent mixture used in the leaching process.&lt;SEP&gt;TOPO is a chemical agent paired with TBP to form varying molar ratios for extraction experiments.</data>
