<node id="Bioleaching">
  <data key="d0">Bioleaching</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A biological extraction method that utilizes microorganisms and organic acids.&lt;SEP&gt;Bioleaching is an emerging technology for recovering rare earth elements from phosphogypsum, characterized by higher metal selectivity and environmentally friendly conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Bioleaching is a biological extraction technique used to recover rare earth elements from industrial waste materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Bioleaching is a method used to extract rare-earth elements from bastnaesite-bearing rock using actinobacteria.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-055&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-050&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-025</data>
