<node id="Leaching Tests">
  <data key="d0">Leaching Tests</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Analytical procedures utilized in solid waste management decision-making to assess material behavior.&lt;SEP&gt;Leaching tests are experimental procedures used to evaluate the infiltration and percolation behavior of phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Leaching tests are procedures developed to predict the release rate of chemical species from solid materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Leaching Tests are experimental procedures used to quantify the mobility of chemical species from phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Leaching tests are analytical procedures used to evaluate the fractionation behavior and release rates of elements over time and temperature.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-053&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-001</data>
