  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The United States Environmental Protection Agency classifies Phosphogypsum as valueless waste.&lt;SEP&gt;The United States Environmental Protection Agency promotes phosphogypsum reuse in construction and agriculture.&lt;SEP&gt;A U.S. government agency responsible for establishing national emission standards for hazardous air pollutants.&lt;SEP&gt;The United States Environmental Protection Agency is the governmental body that developed standardized leaching procedures for evaluating environmental toxicity.</data>
