<node id="Rare-Earth Elements">
  <data key="d0">Rare-Earth Elements</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Rare-earth elements are valuable materials targeted for recovery from industrial and electronic wastes.&lt;SEP&gt;Rare-Earth Elements are valuable components extracted from phosphogypsum fertilizers using leaching processes.&lt;SEP&gt;Rare-earth elements are inorganic complexes whose low-temperature aqueous geochemistry was reviewed in 1990.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-055&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-040&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-038</data>
