  <data key="d0">EU Renewable Energy Directive</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The EU Renewable Energy Directive reported supply gaps in natural and FGD gypsum, highlighting PG's importance.&lt;SEP&gt;The EU Renewable Energy Directive highlights the supply gap of natural and FGD gypsum, emphasizing the importance of phosphogypsum.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-029</data>
