  <data key="d2">The International Fertilizer Association proposes strategies for eliminating legacy phosphogypsum waste through utilization and prevention.&lt;SEP&gt;The International Fertilizer Association released a 2020 report detailing phosphogypsum recycling rates.&lt;SEP&gt;The International Fertilizer Association is an organization that publishes reports on phosphogypsum management.</data>
