  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Dust Emissions are an environmental risk associated with large-scale land-based phosphogypsum storage.&lt;SEP&gt;Dust Emissions are air pollutants controlled by PG reuse methods to reduce emergy loss.&lt;SEP&gt;Dust emissions represent particulate matter released in waste gases, reduced by PG reuse methods.&lt;SEP&gt;Airborne particulate matter in waste gases, another pollutant mitigated by the proposed methods.</data>
