  <data key="d0">Ralstonite</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Ralstonite is a complex mineral frequently formed when fluorine, magnesium, sodium, and aluminum are present in PG.&lt;SEP&gt;Ralstonite is a compound frequently formed when fluorine, magnesium, sodium, and aluminum are present together.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-011</data>
