  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">Brazilian phosphogypsum is igneous phosphogypsum characterized by lower Fe, Ti, P and higher Mg, Si.&lt;SEP&gt;Brazilian phosphogypsum is a type of PG with an igneous origin that exhibits significantly higher concentrations of certain rare earth elements compared to other sources.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-007</data>
