  <data key="d0">Lachehab</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Lachehab performed the transformation of PG in the presence of KOH and CO2 to produce calcium sulfate and potassium sulfate.&lt;SEP&gt;Lachehab is a researcher who conducted a 2020 study on transforming phosphogypsum using potassium hydroxide and carbon dioxide.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-027</data>
