<node id="Potassium Hydroxide">
  <data key="d0">Potassium Hydroxide</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Potassium hydroxide is a versatile chemical compound and strong base widely utilized in industrial processing and materials synthesis. In the context of phosphogypsum valorization, it serves as a primary reagent that facilitates the dispersion, alkaline dissolution, and decomposition of phosphogypsum slurries. This treatment is integral to both dispersion and filtration stages, enabling the conversion of the raw material into valuable byproducts such as calcium carbonate, calcium hydroxide (portlandite), and potassium sulfate. Throughout these reactions, potassium hydroxide acts as a key reactant and chemical base, playing a central role in maximizing the yield and formation of potassium sulfate.

Beyond phosphogypsum processing, potassium hydroxide is a fundamental starting material in the hydrothermal synthesis of hydroxyapatite. During this process, it functions as an active reactant that substitutes calcium ions directly into the hydroxyapatite crystal lattice, thereby modifying and stabilizing the resulting mineral structure.

In analytical chemistry, potassium hydroxide is employed as a standardized titrant for the precise determination of carbon dioxide content. Its concentration in this application is typically calibrated and derived from calcium carbonate mass, ensuring accurate quantitative analysis. Collectively, these applications underscore the compound's critical importance across waste treatment, advanced material fabrication, and chemical measurement.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2196dee89de9694f28ef4eaa0e85f130-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-60e237a0a1045feedf76d35d654a79bd-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80e3f6300e001922a5ca2a6a8ac2e0d2-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80e3f6300e001922a5ca2a6a8ac2e0d2-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80e3f6300e001922a5ca2a6a8ac2e0d2-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80e3f6300e001922a5ca2a6a8ac2e0d2-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80e3f6300e001922a5ca2a6a8ac2e0d2-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80e3f6300e001922a5ca2a6a8ac2e0d2-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80e3f6300e001922a5ca2a6a8ac2e0d2-chunk-019</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792119016</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
