  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Sulfate ions are anions that can be substituted by phosphate ions in the gypsum crystal lattice.&lt;SEP&gt;Sulfate ions are ligands present in the solution, commonly associated with gypsum.</data>
