  <data key="d2">Acidulated water is an irrigation medium that affects soil chemistry and plant nutrition when used with phosphogypsum amendments.&lt;SEP&gt;Acidulated water is an irrigation method studied alongside phosphogypsum amendments for affecting tomato nutrition.</data>
