  <data key="d2">Tomato nutrition is a plant physiological aspect affected by soil amendments and irrigation with acidulated water.&lt;SEP&gt;Tomato nutrition is the agricultural outcome affected by phosphogypsum amendments and acidulated water irrigation.</data>
