  <data key="d0">Column Leaching</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Column Leaching is a bioleaching process type used for recovering rare earth elements from phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Column leaching is a process that triggers changes in fluoride immobilization mechanisms within hardened mixtures.&lt;SEP&gt;Column Leaching is a kinetic extraction technique applied to recover lanthanides from phosphate ore.</data>
