<node id="Kerosene">
  <data key="d0">Kerosene</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Kerosene functions primarily as an organic solvent medium and diluent in various chemical extraction and hydrometallurgical processes. It is specifically utilized to dissolve and carry organic extractants, most notably mixtures of tributyl phosphate (TBP) and trioctyl phosphine oxide (TOPO). In these applications, Kerosene serves as the foundational diluent that facilitates both the leaching and stripping stages of chemical extraction. By providing a stable, non-polar carrier phase, it ensures that the organic extractants remain properly dispersed and chemically active throughout the operational cycles.

The practical applications of Kerosene in this context are particularly prominent in the recovery of rare earth elements, where it enables the efficient dissolution and transport of target metals through organic phases. Additionally, Kerosene is employed in the specialized leaching of phosphogypsum, a byproduct of phosphate fertilizer production. In both scenarios, Kerosene works in tandem with TBP and TOPO to enhance the solubility, reaction kinetics, and overall extraction efficiency of target compounds, thereby optimizing the purification and recovery processes.&lt;SEP&gt;Kerosene is a molecular solvent used to dilute ionic liquids and reduce their viscosity.&lt;SEP&gt;Kerosene is a solvent used in the extraction of uranium and vanadium from carbonate leach solutions.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-edfc4dcbd74cbf0b294f83f2034b209d-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-edfc4dcbd74cbf0b294f83f2034b209d-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791812452</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
