<node id="Engineering Application">
  <data key="d0">Engineering Application</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Engineering applications involve large-scale phosphogypsum consumption for waterproof damming and road paving.&lt;SEP&gt;Engineering application is a sector for phosphogypsum recycling that is in the experimental phase in some provinces.&lt;SEP&gt;The application of PG-derived materials in engineering projects and infrastructure.&lt;SEP&gt;Engineering Application is a category of industrial use for materials like waterproof damming products.&lt;SEP&gt;Engineering application is a category in the legend, color-coded pink, representing a use case for the materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Engineering Application refers to the practical use of the Phosphogypsum Embedded Filler in cast-in situ concrete hollow floor structures.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-98d8b2df45924e721bfa570f652f33e3-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
