<node id="Plastering Mortar">
  <data key="d0">Plastering Mortar</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Plastering mortar is a phosphogypsum-based construction material used in building applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Plastering mortar is a PG-based product used in construction applications.&lt;SEP&gt;A construction material made from processed PG, used for plastering surfaces.&lt;SEP&gt;Plastering Mortar is a construction material produced by the companies.&lt;SEP&gt;Plastering Mortar is a construction material produced using processed phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Plastering Mortar is a construction material produced by Company Q from processed PG.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-003</data>
