<node id="Waterproof Damming Materials">
  <data key="d0">Waterproof Damming Materials</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Waterproof damming materials are engineering products utilizing large quantities of phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Specialized construction materials used for waterproofing and damming, produced from PG.&lt;SEP&gt;Waterproof Damming Materials are engineering application materials produced by the companies.&lt;SEP&gt;Waterproof Damming Materials are engineering materials produced by Company R for construction applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Waterproof Damming Materials are engineering products produced by Company R from processed PG.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-003</data>
