<node id="Comprehensive Utilization">
  <data key="d0">Comprehensive Utilization</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Comprehensive utilization refers to the strategic processing and recycling of industrial byproducts like phosphogypsum to maximize resource efficiency and minimize environmental harm.&lt;SEP&gt;Comprehensive Utilization refers to the current status and developmental trends of effectively using PG.&lt;SEP&gt;Comprehensive utilization refers to the sustainable processing and application of PG across various industries.&lt;SEP&gt;Comprehensive utilization refers to the processes and technologies aimed at effectively using phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Comprehensive utilization refers to the resource utilization of industrial solids like phosphogypsum to offset production and improve industry competitiveness.&lt;SEP&gt;Strategies and processes aimed at recycling and reusing phosphogypsum to reduce environmental impact and resource waste.&lt;SEP&gt;The overarching process of recycling and repurposing phosphogypsum, which holds significant short-to-medium-term growth potential.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-002</data>
