<node id="Scientific Paper">
  <data key="d0">Scientific Paper</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The Scientific Paper is a digital research publication hosted on academic journal websites, distinguished by its updated or modified status, which is visually indicated by a ribbon bookmark notification. It functions as a foundational source document within specific analytical contexts, frequently serving as the referenced material in prompts and datasets dedicated to the study of phosphogypsum.

This publication provides a comprehensive examination of phosphogypsum, detailing its chemical and physical properties through extensive data tables, chart analyses, and supporting photographs. The text explores the specific chemistry of phosphorus within phosphogypsum and offers a rigorous analysis of the thermodynamics governing related chemical reactions. Additionally, the document features technical components such as Equation 35, which is widely recognized as the likely source for cited chemical formulas, thereby establishing the paper as a critical reference for researchers investigating phosphogypsum composition and reaction dynamics.&lt;SEP&gt;Scientific Paper is the publication containing Figure B and the larger figure.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2760dc2a11fedad02d24741a978cf20d-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e4a551024f80f822f3f35e38ec278151-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28fbd4302bba090e667215c840757ff7-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54b92b2ad16a2528ff6a863329c5d403-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-60e237a0a1045feedf76d35d654a79bd-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-176fa906dd9c8409d2d1c49b8bdf9948-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-038</data>
