<node id="Quan">
  <data key="d0">Quan</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Quan is a researcher whose observations indicated that high concentrations of AL molecules enhance the bioactivity of surface-modified HAP nanocrystals.&lt;SEP&gt;Quan is a researcher who observed that surface modification of HAP nanocrystals with high concentration of AL increases bioactivity.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-010</data>
