<node id="Bisphosphonates">
  <data key="d0">Bisphosphonates</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Bisphosphonates are a class of chemical compounds to which AL molecules belong and which show varying affinities for calcium phosphate crystals.&lt;SEP&gt;Bisphosphonates are a class of compounds used to prevent bone loss and deliver therapeutic agents to bone tissue.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-014</data>
