  <data key="d2">A specific HAP sample fabricated at 180 °C with a 1:1 NTA/Ca molar ratio, used for peeling experiments.&lt;SEP&gt;S4T is a sample identifier used to denote a specific batch of HAP in the XPS analysis.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-005</data>
