<node id="HAP-AL">
  <data key="d0">HAP-AL</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">HAP-AL is a composite sample representing HAP modified with AL molecules, analyzed via XPS.&lt;SEP&gt;HAP-AL is the functionalized form of Hydroxyapatite modified with AL molecules, analyzed via XPS and ATR-FTIR.&lt;SEP&gt;An alendronate-modified hydroxyapatite material variant analyzed via infrared spectroscopy, exhibiting distinct spectral peaks.&lt;SEP&gt;A material sample exhibiting broad OH and NH₂ groups, with shifted phosphate peaks indicating structural differences from PVA-peeled HAP.</data>
