<node id="Aqueous Solution">
  <data key="d0">Aqueous Solution</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">The aqueous solution serves as the reaction medium where NTA and calcium ions interact.&lt;SEP&gt;The aqueous solution is the liquid medium in which AL molecules are dissolved for treating HAP microspheres.&lt;SEP&gt;The aqueous solution serves as the electrolyte medium for the photoelectrochemical measurements.&lt;SEP&gt;The aqueous solution serves as the electrolyte medium for the photoelectrochemical measurements.&lt;SEP&gt;An aqueous solution is the medium in which lead speciation and complexation occur.</data>
