  <data key="d2">Aldrich is a chemical supplier that provided Nitrilotriacetic acid trisodium salt monohydrate (NTA) for the study.&lt;SEP&gt;Aldrich is a supplier of chemical reagents such as calcium hydroxide.&lt;SEP&gt;A supplier of calcium hydroxide used in hydroxyapatite synthesis.</data>
