<node id="Fluorophores">
  <data key="d0">Fluorophores</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Fluorophores are chemical agents conjugated to the side groups of Alendronate to display multifunctional behavior in HAP functionalization.</data>
