  <data key="d2">Molecular weight is a physical property of Polyvinyl Alcohol, ranging from 89,000 to 98,000 in this study.&lt;SEP&gt;Molecular weight is a physical constant for compounds like calcium carbonate and carbon dioxide, used in purity calculations.</data>
