  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Needle-like crystalline formations that radiate outward from central points to form rosette or starburst-shaped clusters.&lt;SEP&gt;Needle-like formations that radiate outward and group into radial clusters.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-019</data>
