<node id="Sol-Gel Process">
  <data key="d0">Sol-Gel Process</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A specific synthesis method potentially used to transform raw phosphogypsum into a nanostructured material with spherical morphology.&lt;SEP&gt;The sol-gel process is a previously utilized technique for synthesizing hydroxyapatite, which may yield non-stoichiometric products.&lt;SEP&gt;The sol-gel process is a wet-chemical technique utilized for synthesizing hydroxyapatite materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Sol-gel process is a synthesis technique employed to produce Hydroxyapatite.&lt;SEP&gt;Sol-gel process is a synthesis technique employed to produce Hydroxyapatite.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6825862084b162a4b16cd1037c76e3d7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-001</data>
