<node id="J. Am. Ceram. Soc.">
  <data key="d0">J. Am. Ceram. Soc.</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">J. Am. Ceram. Soc. is a scientific journal that published multiple studies on hydroxyapatite synthesis and coating.&lt;SEP&gt;The Journal of the American Ceramic Society published works by L.L. Hench, W. Suchanek, and others.&lt;SEP&gt;J. Am. Ceram. Soc. is a peer-reviewed scientific journal publishing research on ceramic materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Journal of the American Ceramic Society, a peer-reviewed academic journal publishing materials science research.&lt;SEP&gt;A scientific journal of the American Ceramic Society.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2196dee89de9694f28ef4eaa0e85f130-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-35aef6efc801611130c5dd196fe513df-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792003010</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Acta Biomater.">
  <data key="d0">Acta Biomater.</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Acta Biomater. is a scientific journal that published a review on synthesis methods for nanosized hydroxyapatite.&lt;SEP&gt;Acta Biomater. is a scientific journal that published research on carbon dot and 3D printed hydroxyapatite scaffolds.&lt;SEP&gt;Acta Biomater. is a scientific journal featuring research on biomaterials, including hydroxyapatite for tissue engineering.&lt;SEP&gt;Acta Biomater. is a scientific journal publishing research on biomaterials science.&lt;SEP&gt;Acta Biomater. is the journal that published the 2011 study on nanoscale hydroxyapatite particles.&lt;SEP&gt;Acta Biomater. is a scientific journal that published the 2011 research on nanoscale hydroxyapatite particles for bone tissue engineering.&lt;SEP&gt;Acta Biomater. is a scientific journal that published research on biomaterials.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4a64a852097fdc910b98ed788503ce4-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b81aeff540d385f1d1eda298b44619be-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792261045</data>
