  <data key="d2">Mater. Today: Proc. is a scientific journal that published research on surfactant roles in hydroxyapatite nanorod synthesis.&lt;SEP&gt;A materials today proceedings journal that published the 2020 review on hydroxyapatite synthesis methods.&lt;SEP&gt;A journal publishing an approach towards sustainable development through incorporating phosphogypsum with cement in rigid pavement.</data>
