<node id="Fatty Acids">
  <data key="d0">Fatty Acids</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Fatty acids are organic compounds used as modifiers to tailor the morphological features of sol-gel synthesized mesoporous hydroxyapatite.</data>
