</node>
<node id="Mesoporous Hydroxyapatite">
  <data key="d0">Mesoporous Hydroxyapatite</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Mesoporous hydroxyapatite is a synthesized form of hydroxyapatite whose morphology is tailored using organic modifiers.&lt;SEP&gt;Mesoporous hydroxyapatite is a variant of hydroxyapatite with an irregular pore architecture, used as a high-capacity drug carrier.&lt;SEP&gt;A porous form of hydroxyapatite utilized as a drug delivery vehicle and bone substitute.&lt;SEP&gt;Mesoporous hydroxyapatite is a bone substitute material designed to leach drugs like vancomycin.&lt;SEP&gt;A porous form of hydroxyapatite utilized as a drug delivery vehicle and bone substitute.&lt;SEP&gt;Mesoporous hydroxyapatite is a bone substitute material designed to leach drugs like vancomycin.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-019</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792190414</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hydroxyapatite Nanostructures">
  <data key="d0">Hydroxyapatite Nanostructures</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Hydroxyapatite nanostructures are synthesized forms, such as dandelion-like shapes, created via hydrothermal methods.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791470547</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hydroxyapatite Films">
  <data key="d0">Hydroxyapatite Films</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Hydroxyapatite films are thin layers crystallized on metal substrates using TEP/EDTA doubly regulated hydrothermal processes.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791470547</data>
