  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Potassium sodium tartrate is a carboxylate compound utilized in previous hydrothermal deposition methods for HAP fabrication.&lt;SEP&gt;Potassium Sodium Tartrate is a crystalline salt dissolved in water to prepare a standard solution at 100 g/L.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-60e237a0a1045feedf76d35d654a79bd-chunk-002</data>
