  <data key="d2">A carbon-oxygen bond associated with specific stretching vibrations detected in the spectroscopic data.&lt;SEP&gt;The C-O bond is a chemical bond associated with the carbonate ion adsorbed in HAp.&lt;SEP&gt;The C-O bond is a chemical bond associated with the carbonate ion adsorbed in HAp.</data>
