  <data key="d0">Alendronate</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Alendronate is a specific bisphosphonate drug functionalized onto nanomaterials for targeted bone therapy and drug delivery.&lt;SEP&gt;A compound enriched in electrospun nanofibrous scaffolds to balance osteogenic and osteoclast activity.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-014</data>
