  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A quantitative phase analysis technique applied to characterize crystalline materials in the referenced literature.&lt;SEP&gt;The Rietveld Method is a crystallographic technique used for phase identification and quantification in mineralogical analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;The Rietveld method is a crystallographic technique used for phase analysis and structure refinement.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-002</data>
