  <data key="d2">Device used to measure the zeta potential of HAp particles.&lt;SEP&gt;The Malvern Nano-ZS Zetasizer is the instrument used to measure the zeta potential of HAp particles in SBF solution.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-003</data>
