<node id="DSC">
  <data key="d0">DSC</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">DSC refers to differential scanning calorimetry used to identify exothermic reactions corresponding to protein burning off.&lt;SEP&gt;Differential Scanning Calorimetry, a thermal analysis method used alongside TG.&lt;SEP&gt;DSC is a thermal analysis method represented by a blue line measuring heat flow differences.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4739e42903c95e1fb7e0ecfbca3a12df-chunk-005</data>
