<node id="Apatite Structure">
  <data key="d0">Apatite Structure</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Apatite Structure is the typical crystalline structural arrangement confirmed by the lattice fringe spacing of the synthesized HAp sample.&lt;SEP&gt;Apatite Structure is the crystal structure confirmed by IR and XRD results for all HAP samples before and after heat treatment.</data>
