<node id="PO4 3- Group">
  <data key="d0">PO4 3- Group</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Phosphate ion group exhibiting specific stretching vibration modes in the FTIR spectra.&lt;SEP&gt;PO4 3- group is a phosphate chemical structure identified in hydroxyapatite through characteristic vibrational bands.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphate group present in the sample, identified by characteristic spectral bands.&lt;SEP&gt;The PO4 3- group is an anionic group in hydroxyapatite that promotes adhesion with proteins at low Ca:P ratios.</data>
