<node id="Monoclinic System">
  <data key="d0">Monoclinic System</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A crystallographic system describing the lattice structure of hydrated calcium sulfate.&lt;SEP&gt;A crystal system classification to which calcium sulfate hemihydrate belongs.&lt;SEP&gt;The crystal system category to which calcium sulfate dihydrate belongs.&lt;SEP&gt;The monoclinic system is the crystallographic system to which both brushite and gypsum belong.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-8c22d31cfad5421c936a23705a3bc6e0-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-014</data>
