<node id="Freeze-Thaw Cycle Test">
  <data key="d0">Freeze-Thaw Cycle Test</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A deterioration experiment used to evaluate the antifreeze performance of the cementitious materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Freeze-Thaw Cycle Test is a durability assessment procedure that subjects dried specimens to repeated freezing and thawing conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Freeze-thaw cycle test is an experimental procedure used to evaluate PGCM damage under freezing and thawing conditions.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-010</data>
