<node id="Water-Cement Ratio">
  <data key="d0">Water-Cement Ratio</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Water-Cement Ratio is a mixture parameter fixed at 0.25 for the experimental samples.&lt;SEP&gt;The water-cement ratio is a critical parameter that influences the physical properties of the prepared mortar.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-003</data>
