<node id="Mixing Duration">
  <data key="d0">Mixing Duration</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Mixing Duration refers to the sequential stirring times (2 min, 30 s, 90 s) used to achieve a homogeneous gypsum rheological body.</data>
