<node id="Freeze-Thaw Cycles">
  <data key="d0">Freeze-Thaw Cycles</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A testing procedure used to evaluate the durability and frost resistance of building materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Freeze-Thaw Cycles are environmental stress tests used to evaluate the antifreeze performance and macroscopic damage of PGCM.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-006</data>
