  <data key="d0">Rusong Fu</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Rusong Fu is a researcher and co-author of the study on phosphogypsum-based cementitious materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Rusong Fu is a researcher who contributed to writing, validation, methodology, investigation, data curation, and conceptualization.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-000</data>
