  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A controlled environmental parameter maintained at 50 ± 5% during long-term water resistance testing.&lt;SEP&gt;Relative humidity is a curing parameter (90% RH) that enhances compressive strength when combined with elevated temperature.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-013</data>
