<node id="Desulfurization Gypsum">
  <data key="d0">Desulfurization Gypsum</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Desulfurization gypsum is blended with ground granulated blast furnace slag to create mortars with specific compressive strength and durability.&lt;SEP&gt;Desulfurization gypsum is an alternative gypsum type compared to phosphogypsum in cement production.&lt;SEP&gt;An industrial byproduct competing with phosphogypsum, contributing to its market disadvantages.&lt;SEP&gt;An industrial byproduct that competes with phosphogypsum cement retarders and building materials.</data>
