<node id="Panel (a)">
  <data key="d0">Panel (a)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Panel (a) is a microscopic SEM image showing granular material and pores.&lt;SEP&gt;Panel (a) is the label identifying the XPS survey scan graph in the top left corner.&lt;SEP&gt;Panel (a) is a scientific figure panel showing a zoomed-in view of a material region.&lt;SEP&gt;Panel (a) is the first section of the EDS figure, displaying the bulk composition and trace impurities of the phosphogypsum sample.&lt;SEP&gt;Panel (a) is the specific designation for the X-ray diffraction pattern graph within the document.</data>
