  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Particle nucleation is the initial stage of crystal formation accelerated by rapid heating during microwave irradiation.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c4a64a852097fdc910b98ed788503ce4-chunk-004</data>
