<node id="Theoretical Ca/P Ratio">
  <data key="d0">Theoretical Ca/P Ratio</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The theoretical Ca/P ratio of 1.67 serves as an ideal stoichiometric benchmark for hydroxyapatite samples.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c4a64a852097fdc910b98ed788503ce4-chunk-004</data>
