<node id="Hot Water">
  <data key="d0">Hot Water</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Hot Water is used in the washing process to discard Brij-93 surfactant residues.&lt;SEP&gt;Hot Water is a solvent utilized in the washing process to discard Brij-93 surfactant residues.</data>
