  <data key="d0">Hexadecyltrimethylammonium Bromide (CTAB)</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Hexadecyltrimethylammonium bromide is a cationic surfactant used to regulate the growth of hydroxyapatite crystals.&lt;SEP&gt;Hexadecyltrimethylammonium bromide (CTAB) is a cationic surfactant that significantly raises the surface area of Hydroxyapatite and modifies its crystal development.&lt;SEP&gt;A cationic surfactant used in the synthesis, purchased from Alfa Aesar.&lt;SEP&gt;Hexadecyltrimethylammonium bromide (CTAB) is a cationic surfactant that significantly raises the surface area of Hydroxyapatite and modifies its crystal development.&lt;SEP&gt;A cationic surfactant used in the synthesis, purchased from Alfa Aesar.</data>
