<node id="Fourier Transformed-Infrared Spectroscopy">
  <data key="d0">Fourier Transformed-Infrared Spectroscopy</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Fourier transformed-infrared spectroscopy is an analytical technique used to assess the chemical composition and purity of the product.&lt;SEP&gt;Fourier transformed-infrared spectroscopy is a spectroscopic method used to analyze the chemical composition and functional groups of the product.&lt;SEP&gt;Fourier Transformed-Infrared Spectroscopy is a characterization method used to analyze hydroxyapatite formed in the hydrothermal process.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6825862084b162a4b16cd1037c76e3d7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6825862084b162a4b16cd1037c76e3d7-chunk-001</data>
