  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Solution pH">
  <data key="d0">Solution pH</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Solution pH is a controlled parameter ranging from 5 to 11 that impacts the phase purity and morphology of the product.&lt;SEP&gt;Solution pH is a chemical parameter that dictates surface charge and significantly impacts the adsorption capacity of the adsorbents.&lt;SEP&gt;A monitored parameter that increases during the adsorption process due to hydroxyl ion release.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e992f3bad9db87c40308ea55e121bd8a-chunk-009</data>
