  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Solid-state reaction is a traditional synthesis method for hydroxyapatite that suffers from drawbacks like long reaction times and agglomeration.&lt;SEP&gt;Solid-state reaction is a previously used synthesis technique for hydroxyapatite that suffers from drawbacks like long reaction times.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6825862084b162a4b16cd1037c76e3d7-chunk-001</data>
