  <data key="d2">OH bands are spectral features observed in the FT-IR analysis that indicate the presence of absorbed water.&lt;SEP&gt;Spectral bands observed in the FT-IR spectrum indicating absorbed water in the sample.&lt;SEP&gt;OH Bands indicate the presence of absorbed water in the S-HAp sample structure.&lt;SEP&gt;OH bands observed at specific wavenumbers indicate absorbed water in the sample structure.</data>
