</node>
<node id="Equation 1">
  <data key="d0">Equation 1</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Equation 1 represents the first step of the proposed two-step reaction sequence involving phosphogypsum and phosphoric acid.&lt;SEP&gt;Equation 1 represents the anticipated chemical transformation for preparing HAP from PG waste, H3PO4, and HPA.&lt;SEP&gt;Equation 1 represents the first step of the proposed two-step reaction sequence.&lt;SEP&gt;Equation 1 defines the mathematical formula for calculating adsorption capacity.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2760dc2a11fedad02d24741a978cf20d-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-176fa906dd9c8409d2d1c49b8bdf9948-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e992f3bad9db87c40308ea55e121bd8a-chunk-002</data>
