<node id="Phosphate Fertilizer Plant">
  <data key="d0">Phosphate Fertilizer Plant</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The Phosphate Fertilizer Plant is the industrial facility that generates phosphogypsum as a byproduct.&lt;SEP&gt;A phosphate fertilizer plant is an industrial facility that generates phosphogypsum as a waste byproduct.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphate Fertilizer Plants are industrial facilities identified as sources of heavy element contamination in marine environments.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2760dc2a11fedad02d24741a978cf20d-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-176fa906dd9c8409d2d1c49b8bdf9948-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-021</data>
