  <data key="d2">PG/Water Slurry is an intermediate mixture created during the preparation phase of the chemical process.&lt;SEP&gt;PG/water slurry is a mixture created by combining phosphogypsum with water at a specific weight-to-volume ratio.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2760dc2a11fedad02d24741a978cf20d-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-176fa906dd9c8409d2d1c49b8bdf9948-chunk-009</data>
