  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Sampling Drying is the initial preparation phase that converts raw phosphogypsum into a slurry.&lt;SEP&gt;Sampling drying is a preparatory process step that converts raw phosphogypsum into a slurry mixture.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2760dc2a11fedad02d24741a978cf20d-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-176fa906dd9c8409d2d1c49b8bdf9948-chunk-009</data>
