</node>
<node id="Stockpiles">
  <data key="d0">Stockpiles</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Stockpiles are vast storage areas near fertilizer plants where unused phosphogypsum is deposited.&lt;SEP&gt;Storage configurations for phosphogypsum that require monitoring of ionic strength, pH, and temperature.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-004</data>
