  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Senegal is a country with massive phosphogypsum production managed through stockpiles.&lt;SEP&gt;Senegal is a country where phosphogypsum was used to treat volcanic tuffs and activate pozzolanic reactions.</data>
