<node id="Ecoindicator 99">
  <data key="d0">Ecoindicator 99</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Ecoindicator 99 is a comprehensive life cycle impact assessment (LCIA) method and analytical tool designed to quantify, compare, and rank environmental impacts and ecological footprints across diverse management scenarios. Recognized as a primary impact assessment framework within Life Cycle Assessment (LCA) methodologies, it is natively utilized by various LCA software platforms and is frequently paired with life cycle inventory databases such as Ecoinvent 2.0 for standardized calculations. The method evaluates environmental damage across multiple categories by assigning Point units as its core scoring metric, providing a unified numerical basis for environmental performance evaluation.

In practice, Ecoindicator 99 is applied to assess specific environmental stressors, most notably acidification and eutrophication. However, it is also formally acknowledged that the method exhibits certain limitations in accurately capturing the full complexity of these particular categories. Despite these constraints, it remains a valuable instrument for comparative analysis, having been successfully employed to compute and rank the ecological footprints of specialized waste management strategies, such as alternative approaches for phosphogypsum waste disposal. By generating quantified environmental scores, the method supports data-driven decision-making for sustainable resource management and environmental policy development.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791877169</data>
