  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">2025 is the target year set by the 14th Five-Year Plan for achieving a 60 percent utilization rate for phosphogypsum.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-008</data>
