  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The three phosphorus industries are an industrial sector responsible for significant phosphorus emissions in the Yangtze River Basin.&lt;SEP&gt;Three Phosphorus Industries encompass the phosphorus chemical industry, phosphate mining, and phosphogypsum tailings ponds.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-003</data>
