<node id="20HPA-HAP">
  <data key="d0">20HPA-HAP</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">20HPA-HAP is a modified hydroxyapatite composite adsorbent engineered for the efficient immobilization and removal of heavy metal ions from aqueous solutions and wastewater. The material is synthesized through a doping modification process that incorporates an organophosphate compound, specifically identified as 2-hydroxy phosphonoacetic acid (with some literature also referencing phytic acid in the synthesis context). It is prepared with a precise 20% molar ratio of organophosphate to total phosphorus, which fundamentally alters its surface and chemical properties compared to standard hydroxyapatite.

This composite variant exhibits significantly enhanced adsorption capacity and superior performance relative to unmodified or undoped hydroxyapatite. The removal of heavy metal ions occurs through multiple synergistic mechanisms, including dissolution-precipitation, surface complexation, and ion exchange. These characteristics make 20HPA-HAP a highly effective material for environmental remediation and water treatment applications.

In research and experimental settings, 20HPA-HAP is frequently utilized as a specific composite variant for evaluating adsorption dynamics. It is routinely employed in kinetic modeling studies to understand uptake rates and equilibrium behavior, as well as in desorption experiments to assess material reusability and regeneration potential. Overall, the material represents a targeted advancement in adsorbent technology for heavy metal ion capture.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-015</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791652598</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
