<node id="Phosphonic Acid Group">
  <data key="d0">Phosphonic Acid Group</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">The phosphonic acid group is more likely to provide electrons than the carboxylic group, as indicated by HOMO/LUMO distribution.&lt;SEP&gt;The phosphonic acid group within HPA provides oxygen atoms that form coordination bonds with metal ions.</data>
