  <data key="d0">Coordination Covalent Bonds</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Coordination Covalent Bonds are the chemical linkages formed between deprotonated HPA and heavy metal ions, ensuring stable immobilization.&lt;SEP&gt;Coordination covalent bonds are formed between oxygen atoms and metal ions, stabilizing the composite structure.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-009</data>
