  <data key="d2">BET is a characterization technique used to evaluate surface area and porosity properties of the materials.&lt;SEP&gt;A method used to measure surface area, total pore volume, and average pore diameter of the adsorbents.&lt;SEP&gt;BET is a calculation method used to determine the average pore diameter (4V/A) of the analyzed samples.</data>
