  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Contaminants targeted for removal by the modified HPA-HAP composites due to their improved porous structure.&lt;SEP&gt;Heavy metal pollutants are substances measured in PGEF lixivium, with most showing undetected concentrations.</data>
