  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">An element detected by EDS analysis, confirming the successful incorporation of HPA into HAP.&lt;SEP&gt;Carbon is a reactant that reduces calcium sulfate to generate calcium sulfide during the thermal process.&lt;SEP&gt;A reactant that interacts with calcium sulfate during decomposition, undergoing gasification to carbon monoxide.</data>
