  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">High Voltage is a technical parameter set to 20.00 kV for capturing the Scanning Electron Microscope image.&lt;SEP&gt;High voltage (15.00 kV) is the accelerating voltage setting used to capture the micrograph.</data>
