  <data key="d0">Working Distance</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Working Distance is a technical parameter set to 12.2 mm for capturing the Scanning Electron Microscope image.&lt;SEP&gt;Working distance (11.8 mm) is the distance between the objective lens and the sample surface during imaging.&lt;SEP&gt;Working Distance is an instrumental parameter set to 11.3 mm for the microscopy analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;Working Distance (WD) is a Scanning Electron Microscopy parameter set to 11.0 mm.&lt;SEP&gt;Working Distance is a technical parameter representing the distance between the microscope lens and the sample surface.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80e3f6300e001922a5ca2a6a8ac2e0d2-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-020</data>
