  <data key="d0">Covalent Bond</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A strong chemical bond characterized by negative energy density and specific electron density thresholds at the bond critical point.&lt;SEP&gt;A bond between ions disrupted during temperature treatment, initiating heavy metal replacement.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-016</data>
