<node id="Phosphate Impurities">
  <data key="d0">Phosphate Impurities</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Phosphate Impurities are contaminants present in the phosphogypsum sample that contribute to its composition.&lt;SEP&gt;Contaminants in phosphogypsum that excessively prolong cement setting time and damage early strength.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphate Impurities are chemical contaminants indicated by O-P-O bonds in the phosphogypsum sample.</data>
