  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">XRD Diffraction Patterns are the graphical outputs collected by the XRD technique to identify crystal phases.&lt;SEP&gt;XRD diffraction patterns are experimental outputs that widen in nanocrystals due to intrinsic and crystalline size effects.&lt;SEP&gt;Analytical patterns used to determine the distribution of crystallite sizes for HAp NPs.</data>
