  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Environmental Safety denotes the property that the filler application does not cause secondary contamination, as verified by performance tests.&lt;SEP&gt;Environmental Safety refers to the protection of human health and ecosystems from toxic impacts, a critical requirement for PG recycling.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-98d8b2df45924e721bfa570f652f33e3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-011</data>
