</node>
<node id="Thermal Insulation Property">
  <data key="d0">Thermal Insulation Property</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Thermal Insulation Property is a physical property of the Phosphogypsum Embedded Filler that was evaluated and found to be satisfied.&lt;SEP&gt;The thermal insulation property of PGEF, which was found to be very well at the optimum air layer thickness.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-98d8b2df45924e721bfa570f652f33e3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-98d8b2df45924e721bfa570f652f33e3-chunk-001</data>
