  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Cost Analysis is an aspect of the Phosphogypsum Embedded Filler that was studied, revealing it to be significantly cheaper than reinforced concrete.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-98d8b2df45924e721bfa570f652f33e3-chunk-000</data>
