  <data key="d0">GB/T 14848-2017</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">GB/T 14848-2017 is a ground water quality standard that the barium concentration in PGEF meets.&lt;SEP&gt;A 2017 Chinese national standard establishing quality requirements and limits for groundwater.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-98d8b2df45924e721bfa570f652f33e3-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-031</data>
