  <data key="d5">1792098450</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Stress">
  <data key="d0">Stress</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A compressive load applied downward to the structure, indicated by purple arrows in the schematic.&lt;SEP&gt;Stress is a computed mechanical property of synthesized hydroxyapatite, ranging from -30,902 to 36,940 N m^-2.&lt;SEP&gt;A linearly related physical quantity to strain in crystals, described by Hooke's law and Young's modulus.&lt;SEP&gt;Stress is a physical quantity representing uniform lattice deformation force in the material.&lt;SEP&gt;Stress is a microstructural property measured for HAp samples using XRD models.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-98d8b2df45924e721bfa570f652f33e3-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791835756</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
