  <data key="d0">Cemented Paste Backfill Material</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Cemented Paste Backfill Material is a backfill medium prepared using phosphogypsum, mineral admixtures, and modifiers for high early strength and low cost.</data>
