  <data key="d0">Machine Learning</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Machine Learning employs algorithms to analyze datasets, identify key variables, and dynamically optimize backfill material formulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Machine learning is a computational technique applied to predict Vegard's law factor and volume size factor for metallic solid solutions.</data>
