  <data key="d0">Aluminate Materials</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Aluminate materials are alternative solutions for fluorine pollution, including calcium aluminate cement and gamma alumina.&lt;SEP&gt;Aluminate Materials are substances capable of effectively immobilizing fluorine.&lt;SEP&gt;Aluminate materials are alternative substances used to effectively immobilize fluorine in backfill applications.</data>
