<node id="Gelling Activity">
  <data key="d0">Gelling Activity</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The binding capability of Hemihydrate Phosphogypsum, which decreases over time due to phase conversion and limits its use to aggregate after prolonged aging.&lt;SEP&gt;Gelling activity is a critical quality parameter of phosphogypsum that affects backfill performance.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-010</data>
