  <data key="d2">Mine goaf refers to underground voids left after mining operations, which are filled using CPGB technology to prevent roof collapse.&lt;SEP&gt;Mine goaf is the underground void in a mine that cemented paste backfill technology aims to support and stabilize.</data>
