  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Mechanical Performance">
  <data key="d0">Mechanical Performance</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Mechanical performance refers to the strength and durability of cementitious materials, which is influenced by porosity, hydration products, and impurity levels.&lt;SEP&gt;Mechanical performance refers to the required engineering properties, specifically (E, Rt), achieved by the phosphogypsum-based mixes.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-160a0fe95f7c82b193c6af751106ab6d-chunk-016</data>
