  <data key="d0">GB 8978–1996</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">GB 8978–1996 is a regulatory standard specifying that phosphate concentration in Class I wastewater must not exceed 0.5 mg/L.&lt;SEP&gt;GB 8978–1996 is a regulatory standard that sets the maximum allowable fluoride concentration at 10 mg/L in Class I wastewater.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-021</data>
