<node id="Kaiyang Phosphate Mine">
  <data key="d0">Kaiyang Phosphate Mine</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">A mining site affiliated with Guizhou Kailin Group where CPGB technology was applied to treat goafs.&lt;SEP&gt;Kaiyang Phosphate Mine is a representative phosphate mine in China used to demonstrate different filling paths for PG.</data>
