<node id="Phosphorus Tailings">
  <data key="d0">Phosphorus Tailings</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Phosphorus tailings are a waste product generated by Guizhou Chanheng Group alongside HPG.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphorus tailings are a byproduct contributing 8.76% to the total emergy input in Scenario 3 and serving as a primary source for FR.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphorus tailings are solid waste byproducts whose high production rate makes them a primary component of the FR emergy category.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphorus tailings are treated as a renewable resource in Scenario 3, significantly reducing environmental load.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphorus tailings are a byproduct material whose input value changes significantly impact the environmental loading ratio.&lt;SEP&gt;An additive used in the phosphogypsum processing section.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-032&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-012</data>
