  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Polymeric aluminum chloride is a chemical agent that solidifies fluorides through electrostatic adsorption and ion exchange.&lt;SEP&gt;Polymeric aluminum chloride is a modified material used to enhance the working performance of CPGFM.&lt;SEP&gt;Polymeric aluminum chloride is an additive that immobilizes fluorine through ion exchange and electrostatic adsorption.</data>
