  <data key="d0">CPGB</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">CPGB refers to the cemented paste backfill system whose cost is reduced by using HPG as a cementitious material.&lt;SEP&gt;CPGB refers to combined phosphogypsum backfilling, a technology development trend in China facing various challenges.&lt;SEP&gt;CPGB is an initiative in China aimed at the efficient and economical utilization of PG.</data>
