  <data key="d0">UCS</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">UCS (Uniaxial Compressive Strength) is a metric used to determine the application of CPGFM, with values over 0.2 MPa suitable for goaf backfill.&lt;SEP&gt;UCS is the unconfined compressive strength measured after specific curing and soaking periods.</data>
