  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Modified quartz sand is incorporated to hinder phosphorus migration, requiring a longer duration than iron tailings.&lt;SEP&gt;Modified quartz sand is an additive used to control phosphate pollution in cemented phosphogypsum backfill.</data>
