  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Iron tailings hinder phosphorus migration via monolayer chemical adsorption.&lt;SEP&gt;Iron tailings are a material used for phosphate removal in cemented phosphogypsum backfill.</data>
