  <data key="d0">Guo</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">A researcher who proposed an alternative ranking of fluoride influence on material strength based on experimental findings.&lt;SEP&gt;Guo is a researcher who reported data regarding the solubility of Phosphogypsum in saltwater.&lt;SEP&gt;Guo is a researcher who produced and evaluated phosphogypsum-based cement composites for marine applications.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-001</data>
