<node id="Strength">
  <data key="d0">Strength</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Strength is a mechanical performance metric measured at specific curing intervals.&lt;SEP&gt;A mechanical property of the filling body that degrades due to increased porosity, crystal cohesion loss, and chemical erosion.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-007</data>
