  <data key="d5">1791722879</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Pore Structure">
  <data key="d0">Pore Structure</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Pore structure is a physical characteristic of the filling body that deteriorates significantly under the action of certain fluorides.&lt;SEP&gt;Pore structure refers to the physical arrangement of pores that enhances solidification capacity for heavy metals.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-019</data>
