<node id="Adobe Samples">
  <data key="d0">Adobe Samples</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Adobe samples are cubic and prismatic test specimens prepared from soil mixtures with and without stabilizers.&lt;SEP&gt;Adobe samples are earthen building materials tested for mechanical and physical properties after stabilization.</data>
