<node id="Adobe Soil">
  <data key="d0">Adobe Soil</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">A traditional building material made from earth, which exhibits low resistance to water and high drying shrinkage.&lt;SEP&gt;A natural soil material used in construction, characterized by specific Atterberg limits and grain size distribution.</data>
