  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Soil property measured at 56.41% for the selected adobe soil.&lt;SEP&gt;The liquid limit is a geotechnical parameter indicating the water content at which soil transitions from a plastic to a liquid state.&lt;SEP&gt;Liquid limit is a soil property measured at 56.41% for Soil I and 72.46% for Soil II.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e4a551024f80f822f3f35e38ec278151-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-160a0fe95f7c82b193c6af751106ab6d-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-764bdde7c1b68efdbe7342cc41c2d3d4-chunk-001</data>
