  <data key="d2">Radon-222 is a radioactive isotope whose exhalation rate is measured in phosphogypsum stacks.&lt;SEP&gt;222Rn is a specific radionuclide isotope whose exhalation flux from phosphogypsum is regulated by environmental agencies.&lt;SEP&gt;222Rn is a radionuclide present in stack solutions with significantly higher activity than in surrounding aquifer water.</data>
