  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A chemical process utilized for decontaminating phosphogypsum and removing impurities.&lt;SEP&gt;Citric acid treatment involves soaking phosphogypsum in citric acid solution to react with and remove phosphorus and fluorine impurities, improving microstructure and properties.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-007</data>
