  <data key="d0">Cao</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Cao systematically studied calcination temperature effects on phosphogypsum properties, analyzing changes in chemical mineral composition.&lt;SEP&gt;Cao is a researcher whose 2022 study found that PG-based dry-mix mortar exhibited the best comprehensive performance among four building materials produced from PG.&lt;SEP&gt;Cao represents the weight percentage of calcium oxide in the samples as listed in Table 1.&lt;SEP&gt;Cao is a researcher who studied phosphogypsum from China in 2021 and 2022.</data>
