  <data key="d0">Cyclohexane</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Cyclohexane is a solvent used in the extraction process, yielding a theoretical separation factor of 8.5 for barium over radium.&lt;SEP&gt;A solvent used in the extraction process, found to be more suitable than carbon tetrachloride.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-000</data>
