  <data key="d2">Vienna is the city where the International Atomic Energy Agency is located.&lt;SEP&gt;Vienna is the location where the IAEA published its safety reports on phosphate industry residues.&lt;SEP&gt;Vienna is the headquarters location of the International Atomic Energy Agency, which published safety reports on radiation protection and residue management in the phosphate industry.</data>
