<node id="Optimization">
  <data key="d0">Optimization</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Optimization is the systematic process of adjusting factors like contact time, solvent concentration, molar ratio, and temperature to maximize leaching performance.&lt;SEP&gt;Optimization is a key design procedure aimed at improving the performance and efficiency of pavement mixes.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-160a0fe95f7c82b193c6af751106ab6d-chunk-001</data>
