<node id="TBP-TOPO">
  <data key="d0">TBP-TOPO</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">TBP-TOPO is a solvent mixture used to extract radioactive materials and rare earth elements from phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;A chemical mixture dissolved in kerosene used to facilitate the extraction of radioactive materials from phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;TBP-TOPO is an organic extractant mixture used in kerosene to leach radionuclides from phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;A solvent mixture component used in the leaching process to extract radioactive isotopes and rare earth elements from phosphogypsum.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791790789</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Sequential Chemical Treatment">
  <data key="d0">Sequential Chemical Treatment</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Sequential Chemical Treatment is a combined procedure involving washing with sodium carbonate followed by leaching to decompose insoluble agents.&lt;SEP&gt;Sequential Chemical Treatment involves a two-step procedure using hot ammonium carbonate solution followed by TBP-TOPO in kerosene to maximize removal efficiency.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791790789</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Decontaminated Product">
  <data key="d0">Decontaminated Product</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The Decontaminated Product is the residual material after radionuclide extraction, deemed safe for industrial applications to prepare low-cost products.&lt;SEP&gt;The final treated solid material resulting from the process, containing reduced radioactive concentrations suitable for industrial reuse.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791790789</data>
