<node id="Pre-treatment Process">
  <data key="d0">Pre-treatment Process</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A physical preparation step involving drying, sieving to under 63 micrometers, and washing with sodium carbonate.&lt;SEP&gt;The pre-treatment process involves heating phosphogypsum at specific temperatures and durations to modify its properties.</data>
