<node id="Potassium Nitrate">
  <data key="d0">Potassium Nitrate</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Potassium nitrate is added to Cyphos IL 101 to transform it into the active trihexyl (tetradecyl) phosphonium nitrate ionic liquid.&lt;SEP&gt;Potassium nitrate is used in a three-time equilibration process to convert Cyphos chloride into the nitrate ionic liquid.&lt;SEP&gt;Potassium nitrate is used to convert Cyphos IL 101 chloride into the nitrate ionic liquid.</data>
