  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The volumetric ratio between the aqueous and organic phases, which significantly impacts extraction efficiency.&lt;SEP&gt;A/O Ratio is a process parameter representing the phase ratio between aqueous and organic solutions, optimized at 1/1.&lt;SEP&gt;The A/O ratio is a critical process parameter that influences the stripping efficiency of ionic liquids.</data>
