<node id="Anionic Complexes">
  <data key="d0">Anionic Complexes</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Anionic complexes are negatively charged structures formed between rare earth ions and nitrate ligands during the extraction process.&lt;SEP&gt;Anionic complexes of La, Ce, and Nd are formed during the extraction process and evaluated for efficiency.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-edfc4dcbd74cbf0b294f83f2034b209d-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-edfc4dcbd74cbf0b294f83f2034b209d-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791813073</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Solvation Mechanism">
  <data key="d0">Solvation Mechanism</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Solvation mechanism is the process by which rare earth ions form extractant complexes with the ionic liquid.&lt;SEP&gt;The chemical process by which the ionic liquid extracts rare earth ions to form extractant complexes.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-edfc4dcbd74cbf0b294f83f2034b209d-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-edfc4dcbd74cbf0b294f83f2034b209d-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791813073</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Equation 5">
  <data key="d0">Equation 5</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Equation 5 represents the general extraction mechanism for rare earth ions reacting with nitrate ions and the ionic liquid.&lt;SEP&gt;Equation 5 calculates the emergy loss to human health (L_H) using pollutant mass, DALY, and regional emergy metrics.&lt;SEP&gt;Equation 5 is a non-linear mathematical expression defining the pseudo-second-order adsorption model.&lt;SEP&gt;Equation 5 is a mathematical formula used in the constant heating rate method to confirm the mechanism function.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-edfc4dcbd74cbf0b294f83f2034b209d-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e992f3bad9db87c40308ea55e121bd8a-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d5e4f0f96b4ad61d23685552d3211225-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792364185</data>
