  <data key="d0">Phosphonium Ionic Liquids</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Phosphonium ionic liquids are characterized as cheaper and more thermally stable than ammonium ionic liquids.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphonium Ionic Liquids are chemical compounds whose charge distribution was compared to phosphates.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphonium Ionic Liquids are chemical compounds whose charge distribution was compared to phosphates.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-edfc4dcbd74cbf0b294f83f2034b209d-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-021</data>
