<node id="Equation (1)">
  <data key="d0">Equation (1)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Equation (1) mathematically defines the distribution ratio as the concentration of rare earth ions in the ionic liquid phase divided by the aqueous phase.</data>
