  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">A chemical species represented as La(NO3)2 with a 5- charge, likely intended to be La(NO3)5^2-, that participates in the reaction.&lt;SEP&gt;The lanthanum nitrate complex (La(NO₃)₂⁵⁻) is a reactant in the second chemical equation representing an ion exchange process.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-edfc4dcbd74cbf0b294f83f2034b209d-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-edfc4dcbd74cbf0b294f83f2034b209d-chunk-017</data>
