  <data key="d0">Texture Coefficient ($TC_{hkl}$)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A normalized value quantifying the degree of preferred crystal orientation in a material, calculated via X-ray diffraction intensity ratios.</data>
