  <data key="d2">Average Particle Size is a quantitative metric in Table 4 representing the mean dimension of nanoparticles for each sample.&lt;SEP&gt;Average Particle Size is a parameter calculated by the Nanopowder XRD Processor Demo to characterize nanoparticle dimensions.</data>
