  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The physical size of crystallites, often used interchangeably with crystallite size in estimation models.&lt;SEP&gt;Crystallite dimension is a measured physical parameter estimated from linear fitting slopes and intercepts.</data>
