<node id="SSP Technique">
  <data key="d0">SSP Technique</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A method that improves results for isotropic broadening by focusing on low-angle reflections.&lt;SEP&gt;A method that models strain widening as a Gaussian function and size broadening as a Lorentzian function.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-007</data>
