<node id="Lorentzian Function">
  <data key="d0">Lorentzian Function</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Lorentzian Function is a mathematical model describing the size component of peak widening.&lt;SEP&gt;A mathematical function used in the SSP technique to model size broadening.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-006</data>
