  <data key="d0">Equation 20</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A mathematical formula defining the relationship between total peak broadening and its Gaussian and Lorentzian components.&lt;SEP&gt;A mathematical formula defining the carbon emission intensity indicator as total carbon emissions divided by product output.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-010</data>
