  <data key="d5">1792225860</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Equation 23">
  <data key="d0">Equation 23</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A mathematical formula defining the normalized d-spacing parameter based on lattice spacing and diffraction angle.&lt;SEP&gt;Equation 23 is the mathematical formula for calculating wSO2 or related compound mass fraction from titration data.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-60e237a0a1045feedf76d35d654a79bd-chunk-012</data>
