  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The Tauc Plot Technique is a mathematical method used to estimate absorption frequency and optical band gap.&lt;SEP&gt;The Tauc plot technique is a mathematical method used to estimate absorption frequency and calculate the optical band gap.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-010</data>
