  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Planck's constant is a fundamental physical constant denoted by h in the Tauc plot equation.&lt;SEP&gt;Planck's constant is a physical constant used to calculate photon energy.&lt;SEP&gt;Planck's constant is a physical constant used to calculate photon energy.</data>
