  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">A peak in an X-ray diffraction pattern whose width is measured to analyze crystal properties.&lt;SEP&gt;Diffraction Peak is a feature in XRD patterns that indicates specific mineral phases and crystal structures within the samples.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-008</data>
