<node id="Microwave Hydrothermal Synthesis">
  <data key="d0">Microwave Hydrothermal Synthesis</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Microwave Hydrothermal Synthesis is a synthesis technique used to produce hydroxyapatite nanoparticles at room temperature.&lt;SEP&gt;Microwave hydrothermal synthesis is an advanced, cost-efficient, and environmentally friendly development of the hydrothermal technique.&lt;SEP&gt;Microwave hydrothermal synthesis is a production technique used to convert room temperature hydroxyapatite precursors into nanoparticles.&lt;SEP&gt;Microwave Hydrothermal Synthesis is a heating technique utilizing the MSS2 reactor to produce fully crystalline hydroxyapatite nanopowder.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791854849</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Melanoma Cells">
  <data key="d0">Melanoma Cells</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Melanoma Cells are highly malignant cancer cells studied to evaluate the impact of hydroxyapatite nanoparticles.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791855082</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Osteosarcoma Cells">
  <data key="d0">Osteosarcoma Cells</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Osteosarcoma Cells are bone cancer cells whose growth was inhibited by hydroxyapatite nanoparticles.&lt;SEP&gt;Osteosarcoma cells are cancer cells whose growth is inhibited by nano-HAp, particularly by the smallest 20 nm particles.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791855082</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Bone Marrow Mesenchyme Stem Cells">
  <data key="d0">Bone Marrow Mesenchyme Stem Cells</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Bone Marrow Mesenchyme Stem Cells are stem cells whose viability and spread were improved by hydroxyapatite nanoparticles.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791855082</data>
