  <data key="d2">Volume refers to the 470 mL capacity of the MSS2 reactor vessel.&lt;SEP&gt;Volume represents the amount of titrant consumed during the procedure, recorded in milliliters.&lt;SEP&gt;A physical quantity representing the amount of space occupied, utilized as a variable in both presented equations.</data>
