  <data key="d0">Fitted Curve</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Fitted Curve is a mathematical line overlaid on the histogram to smooth discrete data steps and model the underlying distribution.&lt;SEP&gt;Fitted Curve is a solid black line representing the mathematical fit of the experimental data.</data>
