  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The Ertec Magnum II Reactor is a smaller-scale reaction vessel with a 70 mL volume and 0.6 kW capacity, serving as a baseline for scale comparison.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-012</data>
