<node id="Microwave Heating">
  <data key="d0">Microwave Heating</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Microwave Heating is an efficient energy supply method used to heat reaction reagents, though restricted penetration affects homogeneity at larger scales.&lt;SEP&gt;Microwave Heating is a physicochemical pre-treatment technique applied to increase rare earth element concentration in phosphogypsum prior to extraction.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-018</data>
