<node id="Water Reaction Suspension">
  <data key="d0">Water Reaction Suspension</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Water Reaction Suspension is the medium inside the reaction chamber where microwave penetration is restricted to approximately 2.5 cm.</data>
