<node id="Nonuniform Heating">
  <data key="d0">Nonuniform Heating</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Nonuniform Heating is a challenge in nanomaterial production scaleup caused by restricted energy distribution in larger reaction volumes.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-012</data>
