  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">A minor material phase whose presence can contribute to decreased density in nanomaterials.&lt;SEP&gt;Amorphous Phase represents the disordered structural component of hydroxyapatite material.&lt;SEP&gt;Amorphous phase is a structural component in clinker that is reduced in phosphogypsum-modified samples.</data>
