<node id="Acidification">
  <data key="d0">Acidification</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Acidification is an environmental impact addressed using an alternative assessment method due to data limitations.&lt;SEP&gt;Acidification is an environmental impact category where soil amendment demonstrates the lowest footprint and stack disposal the highest.&lt;SEP&gt;Acidification is an environmental impact metric considered in the sensitivity analysis of PG recycling technologies.&lt;SEP&gt;Acidification is a process step where phosphate substitution in the gypsum network occurs.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-011</data>
