  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Resources is a primary damage category assessing the depletion of raw materials and energy sources.&lt;SEP&gt;One of the four dimensions of the indicator system, focusing on material and resource consumption.&lt;SEP&gt;Resources is a criteria-level dimension in the decision hierarchy representing resource-related indicators.&lt;SEP&gt;Resources is a performance criterion where PG recycling technologies generally demonstrate relatively high performance.&lt;SEP&gt;Resources is a main dimension branching from the total utility in the indicator system.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-003</data>
