  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Slag cement is a building material with a 40% calcium oxide content, similar to the composition of citric acid-treated phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Slag cement is manufactured by combining cement, slag, and phosphogypsum, with calcination temperature affecting setting time.&lt;SEP&gt;Slag cement is a construction material studied for its bulk density when containing phosphogypsum.</data>
