<node id="Bolivar">
  <data key="d0">Bolivar</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Bolivar conducted a 2000 study quantifying the retention rates of radionuclides in phosphogypsum waste.&lt;SEP&gt;Bolivar is a researcher who concluded that most polonium and radium from phosphate rock remain in phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Bolivar led a 2000 study on aquatic contamination by radionuclides in the Tinto and Odiel estuary.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-28fbd4302bba090e667215c840757ff7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-004</data>
