  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Special binder used in the optimized mix for road pavement and capping layers.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydraulic Road Binder is a specialized binding agent tested alongside other materials to enhance pavement mix sustainability and strength.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-160a0fe95f7c82b193c6af751106ab6d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-160a0fe95f7c82b193c6af751106ab6d-chunk-001</data>
