  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Effective Cohesion is a shear test parameter used to evaluate the peak criterion of soil strength.&lt;SEP&gt;Effective Cohesion is a shear strength parameter measured at 2 KPa, indicating the pulverulent behavior of PG material.</data>
