  <data key="d0">Leaching Behaviour</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Environmental property investigating the release of trace contaminants from stabilized materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Leaching Behaviour is a process where heavy metals in MPG react to external environmental effects like rain and temperature.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-160a0fe95f7c82b193c6af751106ab6d-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-024</data>
