  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="P12 Mix">
  <data key="d0">P12 Mix</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Mix formulation with high CM content, exhibiting remarkable stiffness and measurable compressive strength.&lt;SEP&gt;P12 Mix is a material formulation containing 10w% CM and a CM/PG ratio of 0.45, noted for optimal mechanical performance.&lt;SEP&gt;P12 Mix is an optimal construction mixture evaluated for mechanical properties and environmental leaching behavior.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-160a0fe95f7c82b193c6af751106ab6d-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-160a0fe95f7c82b193c6af751106ab6d-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-160a0fe95f7c82b193c6af751106ab6d-chunk-012</data>
