  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">IBI is an immediate stability index used to evaluate pavement and sub-base layers.&lt;SEP&gt;A load-bearing capacity metric that undergoes significant improvement with lime addition in P2 Mix.&lt;SEP&gt;Initial Bearing Index, a measure of bearing capacity recorded in Table 10.</data>
