<node id="Standard Proctor Test">
  <data key="d0">Standard Proctor Test</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A baseline compaction test method used to compare results with higher energy compaction procedures.&lt;SEP&gt;Standard Proctor test is a compaction evaluation method providing WopN and PdoPN measurements.&lt;SEP&gt;The Standard Proctor Test is a laboratory method used to determine the compaction reference values of soil types.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-160a0fe95f7c82b193c6af751106ab6d-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-160a0fe95f7c82b193c6af751106ab6d-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-160a0fe95f7c82b193c6af751106ab6d-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
