<node id="Oedometric Test">
  <data key="d0">Oedometric Test</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A laboratory procedure conducted to define the compressibility and consolidation parameters of raw phosphogypsum samples.&lt;SEP&gt;Oedometric test is a method for measuring compressibility parameters like Cs and sp under load.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-160a0fe95f7c82b193c6af751106ab6d-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-160a0fe95f7c82b193c6af751106ab6d-chunk-012</data>
