</node>
<node id="Secondary Settlement">
  <data key="d0">Secondary Settlement</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Secondary settlement is a slow, long-term deformation observed in raw phosphogypsum continuing even after 53 days of loading.</data>
