  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Anorthite is a calcium aluminum silicate mineral (CaAl2Si2O8) identified in the mineralogical composition.&lt;SEP&gt;Anorthite is a calcium aluminum silicate phase that forms within the quaternary system and influences melting temperature.&lt;SEP&gt;Anorthite is a eutectic mixture formed from calcium oxide, aluminum oxide, and silicon dioxide.</data>
