<node id="Curing Time">
  <data key="d0">Curing Time</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Curing time is the duration over which mixes harden, with performance metrics increasing from 7 to 360 days.&lt;SEP&gt;The duration of curing (3, 7, or 28 days) that affects the tensile strength of material samples.&lt;SEP&gt;A factor establishing a strength hierarchy, with longer durations yielding higher tensile strength.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-160a0fe95f7c82b193c6af751106ab6d-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e0549fcda95f7199440791b20bf85635-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e0549fcda95f7199440791b20bf85635-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
