<node id="Alkaline Conditions">
  <data key="d0">Alkaline Conditions</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Alkaline conditions refer to the chemical environment that drives physical and chemical changes, enhancing stiffness.&lt;SEP&gt;A high pH environment indicated by the presence of hydroxide ions, which facilitates the reaction.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-160a0fe95f7c82b193c6af751106ab6d-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54b92b2ad16a2528ff6a863329c5d403-chunk-010</data>
