<node id="Atterberg Limits">
  <data key="d0">Atterberg Limits</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Atterberg Limits are soil consistency parameters, including Liquid Limit (WL) and Plasticity Index (PI), documented in Table 8.&lt;SEP&gt;Laboratory test method conducted on stabilized soil samples to measure plasticity.&lt;SEP&gt;Atterberg Limits are geotechnical tests used to determine the consistency and plasticity of soils.&lt;SEP&gt;A standardized testing procedure used to determine the critical water content boundaries of fine-grained soils.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-160a0fe95f7c82b193c6af751106ab6d-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-764bdde7c1b68efdbe7342cc41c2d3d4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-764bdde7c1b68efdbe7342cc41c2d3d4-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-764bdde7c1b68efdbe7342cc41c2d3d4-chunk-008</data>
