  <data key="d2">Surfactant concentration is a variable that positively correlates with the degree of crystallinity in prepared samples.&lt;SEP&gt;The varying amounts of surfactant used during synthesis, which correlates with changes in peak intensity and oxygen composition.&lt;SEP&gt;Surfactant concentration is a variable that positively correlates with the degree of crystallinity in prepared samples.&lt;SEP&gt;The varying amounts of surfactant used during synthesis, which correlates with changes in peak intensity and oxygen composition.</data>
