<node id="PPG-derived HAp">
  <data key="d0">PPG-derived HAp</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">PPG-derived HAp refers to Hydroxyapatite synthesized using PPG-containing precursors, resulting in nanorods of varying lengths depending on the surfactant.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydroxyapatite synthesized from PPG precursors via hydrothermal synthesis.&lt;SEP&gt;PPG-derived HAp refers to hydroxyapatite samples synthesized using polypropylene glycol, analyzed for optical properties.&lt;SEP&gt;PPG-derived HAp refers to Hydroxyapatite synthesized using PPG-containing precursors, resulting in nanorods of varying lengths depending on the surfactant.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydroxyapatite synthesized from PPG precursors via hydrothermal synthesis.&lt;SEP&gt;PPG-derived HAp refers to hydroxyapatite samples synthesized using polypropylene glycol, analyzed for optical properties.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-007</data>
