  <data key="d0">Braggs Equation</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Bragg’s Equation is a formula used to calculate the lattice spacing of crystal lattices based on diffraction angles.&lt;SEP&gt;Bragg’s Equation is a formula used to calculate the lattice spacing of crystal lattices based on diffraction angles.</data>
