  <data key="d2">Bromine is an element not detected in the HAp-CTAB-9 sample, further confirming the removal of CTAB.&lt;SEP&gt;Bromine is an element not detected in the HAp-CTAB-9 sample, further confirming the removal of CTAB.&lt;SEP&gt;Bromine is a chemical element whose concentration in phosphogypsum was measured across the sampled locations.</data>
