<node id="HAp-CTAB-9">
  <data key="d0">HAp-CTAB-9</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">HAp-CTAB-9 is a specific variant of PPG-derived hydroxyapatite synthesized with a precise 9 wt% concentration of CTAB surfactant. While some characterizations describe this concentration as relatively high and others as suboptimal, it consistently drives the formation of a distinct nanostructure composed of well-defined one-dimensional nanorods and elongated features, combined with two-dimensional flaky structures. Comprehensive elemental and chemical bonding analyses have confirmed its composition, while physical characterization reveals a BET surface area of 136.01 m²/g and a flat band potential of 0.51 V.

In terms of optoelectronic and photoelectrochemical performance, HAp-CTAB-9 demonstrates exceptional properties that distinguish it among comparable tested samples. It exhibits superior photoinduced electron-hole pair generation, a high charge carrier density, and the lowest charge transfer resistance. These attributes collectively facilitate highly efficient electron transport, resulting in the highest photocurrent intensity and peak photoelectrochemical efficiency observed in the evaluated series. Consequently, HAp-CTAB-9 is established as a highly effective, surfactant-modified hydroxyapatite material with outstanding charge transport capabilities.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-023</data>
