<node id="HAp-P123-9">
  <data key="d0">HAp-P123-9</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">HAp-P123-9 is a specific variant of PPG-derived hydroxyapatite synthesized using a 9 wt% concentration of P123 surfactant. This precise modification induces a notable morphological transformation, characterized by the formation of shorter nanorods and a significant disappearance of flaky structures. These nanorod architectures establish distinct electron transport pathways within the material. In terms of physicochemical properties, HAp-P123-9 exhibits a lower oxygen concentration alongside an intermediate carrier density. The sample also demonstrates the highest pore volume distribution, with distinct peak activity concentrated within the mesopore range.

Despite these tailored structural and textural attributes, HAp-P123-9 has been evaluated for its photoelectrochemical capabilities and consistently yields suboptimal results. The material exhibits very low photocurrent density and overall low efficiency, indicating poor photoelectrochemical performance. Consequently, while the P123 surfactant successfully modifies the nanorod morphology and mesoporous characteristics of the hydroxyapatite, these changes do not translate to enhanced functional efficacy in photoelectrochemical applications.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-023</data>
