</node>
<node id="HAp-CTAB-6">
  <data key="d0">HAp-CTAB-6</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">HAp-CTAB-6 is a specific variant of hydroxyapatite synthesized from a PPG-derived precursor and modified with a CTAB surfactant at a precise concentration of 6 wt%. This controlled synthesis process yields a standardized sample characterized by a distinct nanostructure of well-defined nanorods that exhibit significantly reduced agglomeration. The consistent preparation method ensures reliable material properties, establishing it as a reference point within its material class.

In terms of functional and electrochemical performance, HAp-CTAB-6 demonstrates an intermediate to moderate photocurrent response and stability, with a recorded photocurrent density of 2.5 μA cm⁻² and a shifted potential curve indicating moderate efficiency. While most evaluations categorize its performance as intermediate, one source notes it exhibited the highest photocurrent density among all tested samples, suggesting potential contextual variations or measurement discrepancies that warrant further clarification. Due to its consistent material properties and measurable electrochemical characteristics, HAp-CTAB-6 is routinely incorporated into comparative data tables to benchmark the structural and functional attributes of other hydroxyapatite formulations.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-023</data>
