  <data key="d2">H3 hysteresis loop is a feature of the N2 sorption isotherms observed in the relative pressure range of 0.8–1.00.&lt;SEP&gt;H3 hysteresis loop is a feature of the N2 sorption isotherms observed in the relative pressure range of 0.8–1.00.</data>
