  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">P123 Surfactant self-assembles into micelles and influences Hydroxyapatite crystal growth kinetics through its molecular blocks.&lt;SEP&gt;P123 Surfactant self-assembles into micelles and influences Hydroxyapatite crystal growth kinetics through its molecular blocks.</data>
