<node id="Polypropylene Oxide">
  <data key="d0">Polypropylene Oxide</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Polypropylene Oxide serves as the hydrophobic block of the P123 Surfactant that attaches to Hydroxyapatite crystal surfaces.&lt;SEP&gt;Polypropylene Oxide serves as the hydrophobic block of the P123 Surfactant that attaches to Hydroxyapatite crystal surfaces.</data>
