  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">FESEM Analysis is an imaging technique used to confirm the shorter length of P123-derived Hydroxyapatite nanorods.&lt;SEP&gt;FESEM Analysis is an imaging technique used to confirm the shorter length of P123-derived Hydroxyapatite nanorods.</data>
