  <data key="d2">1D Nanorods are elongated crystal structures of Hydroxyapatite formed during synthesis, influenced by surfactant concentration.&lt;SEP&gt;1D Nanorods are elongated crystal structures of Hydroxyapatite formed during synthesis, influenced by surfactant concentration.</data>
