  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">1D/2D Homojunction Photocatalyst is a photocatalyst formed by the intimate parallel attachment of 1D and 2D Hydroxyapatite structures.&lt;SEP&gt;1D/2D Homojunction Photocatalyst is a photocatalyst formed by the intimate parallel attachment of 1D and 2D Hydroxyapatite structures.</data>
