<node id="Photoinduced Charge Transfer">
  <data key="d0">Photoinduced Charge Transfer</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Photoinduced Charge Transfer is a process efficiently demonstrated by the homojunction photocatalyst, which hinders charge carrier recombination.&lt;SEP&gt;Photoinduced Charge Transfer is a process efficiently demonstrated by the homojunction photocatalyst, which hinders charge carrier recombination.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-005</data>
