  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">PPG-containing Calcium Precursors are added to the solution to form calcium phosphate layers on surfactant assemblies.&lt;SEP&gt;PPG-containing Calcium Precursors are added to the solution to form calcium phosphate layers on surfactant assemblies.</data>
