  <data key="d2">Heterojunction Photocatalyst is a comparative photocatalyst structure mentioned to highlight the superior charge transfer efficiency of the 1D/2D homojunction.&lt;SEP&gt;Heterojunction Photocatalyst is a comparative photocatalyst structure mentioned to highlight the superior charge transfer efficiency of the 1D/2D homojunction.</data>
