  <data key="d2">Charge Carrier Recombination is a process hindered by the 1D/2D homojunction photocatalyst structure, enhancing its performance.&lt;SEP&gt;Charge Carrier Recombination is a process hindered by the 1D/2D homojunction photocatalyst structure, enhancing its performance.</data>
