  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Orientational Growth is a crystal growth process induced by surfactant micelles that provides nucleation sites for HAp particles.&lt;SEP&gt;Orientational Growth is a crystal growth process induced by surfactant micelles that provides nucleation sites for HAp particles.</data>
