<node id="Photoelectrochemical Properties">
  <data key="d0">Photoelectrochemical Properties</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Photoelectrochemical properties are characteristics of the modified hydroxyapatite that enhance its performance in photocatalytic applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Photoelectrochemical properties are the functional characteristics of PPG-derived Hydroxyapatite impacted by surfactant use and crystal morphology.&lt;SEP&gt;Photoelectrochemical properties are characteristics of the modified hydroxyapatite that enhance its performance in photocatalytic applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Photoelectrochemical properties are the functional characteristics of PPG-derived Hydroxyapatite impacted by surfactant use and crystal morphology.</data>
