  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The structural components that orientationally assemble to form the particles on the microsphere surface.&lt;SEP&gt;Nano Whiskers are crystalline HA structures approximately 0.2 to 0.7 mm in length found on the surface of the microspheres.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-54b92b2ad16a2528ff6a863329c5d403-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54b92b2ad16a2528ff6a863329c5d403-chunk-004</data>
