  <data key="d0">Selected Area Electron Diffraction</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Selected area electron diffraction is performed using HR-TEM to examine the microstructures of the samples.&lt;SEP&gt;Selected Area Electron Diffraction is the analytical technique used to generate diffraction patterns in Panel (c) and Panel (f).</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-54b92b2ad16a2528ff6a863329c5d403-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54b92b2ad16a2528ff6a863329c5d403-chunk-012</data>
