  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A synthesis technique used to prepare porous hydroxyapatite core-shell microspheres.&lt;SEP&gt;One-step hydrothermal method is a synthesis technique that integrates in situ ball milling to produce synthetic hydroxyapatite.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-54b92b2ad16a2528ff6a863329c5d403-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-72ff3bbf1e2b594abc3ec5c8d86e3178-chunk-000</data>
