  <data key="d2">The 2000–3000 cm⁻¹ region on the wavenumber axis where curve (b) shows a broader and more intense absorption band.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-35aef6efc801611130c5dd196fe513df-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792002844</data>
