<node id="JCPDS Database">
  <data key="d0">JCPDS Database</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The JCPDS database is a standard reference used to identify crystalline phases by comparing experimental diffraction patterns.&lt;SEP&gt;The JCPDS database provides standard reference patterns used to identify the crystal phases of gypsum and quartz.</data>
