  <data key="d0">Two-Step Extraction Process</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Two-Step Extraction Process denotes a method investigated to increase rare earth element leaching efficiency using hydrochloric acid, raising extraction levels from 51 percent to 81 percent.</data>
