  <data key="d2">Microanalysis denotes an analytical technique used to characterize mineral phases and identify the distribution of elements in phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Microanalysis is a detailed analytical technique used to examine the structural and compositional properties of the samples.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-020</data>
