<node id="Elemental Deportment Calculation">
  <data key="d0">Elemental Deportment Calculation</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A calculation method considering mineral phase quantification and elemental concentration to reveal REE associations.&lt;SEP&gt;Elemental deportment calculation denotes an analytical procedure used to determine the phase association of rare earth elements, cadmium, and uranium.</data>
