<node id="Eutectic Mixtures">
  <data key="d0">Eutectic Mixtures</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Molten phases formed at high temperatures that encapsulate solid materials and impede the reaction kinetics.&lt;SEP&gt;Eutectic mixtures are formed by adding silicon dioxide, aluminum oxide, and magnesium oxide to lower the melting point of the PGI system.&lt;SEP&gt;Lighter layer surrounding the sintered slag core during the reaction stages.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-011</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
