<node id="Vaterite">
  <data key="d0">Vaterite</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Vaterite is a crystalline form of calcium carbonate identified by specific XRD peaks in the carbonation product.&lt;SEP&gt;Vaterite is a mineral polymorph of calcium carbonate that can be produced from phosphogypsum through carbonation.&lt;SEP&gt;Vaterite is a secondary crystalline form of calcium carbonate found alongside calcite in the final product.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-80e3f6300e001922a5ca2a6a8ac2e0d2-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80e3f6300e001922a5ca2a6a8ac2e0d2-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80e3f6300e001922a5ca2a6a8ac2e0d2-chunk-012</data>
