<node id="Synthetic Calcium Carbonate">
  <data key="d0">Synthetic Calcium Carbonate</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">A laboratory-produced variant of calcium carbonate analyzed for elemental composition.&lt;SEP&gt;Synthetic calcium carbonate is a laboratory-produced sample compared with the carbonation product and commercial variants.&lt;SEP&gt;Synthetic calcium carbonate is the product generated from the carbonation process, compared to commercial samples.&lt;SEP&gt;Synthetic calcium carbonate is the high-purity product generated from the carbonation of phosphogypsum in this study.&lt;SEP&gt;A synthetic variant of calcium carbonate with lower vanadium and zinc levels than the commercial variant.&lt;SEP&gt;Synthetic form of calcium carbonate included in the trace element comparison.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-80e3f6300e001922a5ca2a6a8ac2e0d2-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80e3f6300e001922a5ca2a6a8ac2e0d2-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80e3f6300e001922a5ca2a6a8ac2e0d2-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80e3f6300e001922a5ca2a6a8ac2e0d2-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80e3f6300e001922a5ca2a6a8ac2e0d2-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80e3f6300e001922a5ca2a6a8ac2e0d2-chunk-018</data>
