  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">A laboratory-produced variant of potassium sulphate analyzed for elemental composition.&lt;SEP&gt;Synthetic potassium sulphate is a compound whose FTIR spectrum is analyzed and compared with commercial samples.&lt;SEP&gt;The laboratory-produced potassium sulphate characterized by uniform orthorhombic crystals.&lt;SEP&gt;Synthetic potassium sulphate is a sample analyzed using SEM-EDS alongside its commercial counterpart.&lt;SEP&gt;A synthetic variant of potassium sulphate with lower chromium and vanadium levels than the commercial variant.&lt;SEP&gt;Synthetic form of potassium sulphate included in the trace element comparison.</data>
