<node id="Liquid Path">
  <data key="d0">Liquid Path</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The liquid path is the separation stream from the dispersion and filtration step that yields liquid potassium sulphate.&lt;SEP&gt;A process branch where a liquid stream flows into a container labeled liquid potassium sulfate.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-80e3f6300e001922a5ca2a6a8ac2e0d2-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80e3f6300e001922a5ca2a6a8ac2e0d2-chunk-020</data>
