  <data key="d2">Al₂O₃ is a chemical constituent measured in Cement, Fly Ash, and Phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Aluminum oxide is a chemical compound listed as a row in the phosphogypsum composition table.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-764bdde7c1b68efdbe7342cc41c2d3d4-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-025</data>
