  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792159694</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Entropy">
  <data key="d0">Entropy</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A concept measuring the amount of information in a system, where lower values indicate greater information quantity and stronger evaluation roles.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792159694</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Indicator Weights">
  <data key="d0">Indicator Weights</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Quantitative values assigned to criteria or sub-criteria to reflect their importance in a comprehensive evaluation.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792159694</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Comprehensive Weight">
  <data key="d0">Comprehensive Weight</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">An ideal weight vector derived by integrating multiple weighting methods to retain information from all vectors.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792159694</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Maximum Eigenvalue">
  <data key="d0">Maximum Eigenvalue</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The maximum eigenvalue of the judgment matrix, used to calculate the consistency index.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792159694</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Indicator Number">
  <data key="d0">Indicator Number</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The number of criteria or sub-criteria, used in calculating the consistency index and ratio.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792159694</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Linear Coefficients">
  <data key="d0">Linear Coefficients</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Coefficients used in a linear combination to construct the combined weight vector from AHP and EWM vectors.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792159694</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Weight Vector">
  <data key="d0">Weight Vector</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The set of weights obtained from the AHP and EWM methods, used as inputs for Game Theory integration.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792159694</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Combined Weight Vector">
  <data key="d0">Combined Weight Vector</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The vector constructed through a linear combination of weight vectors to minimize deviation from ideal weights.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792159694</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Proportion">
  <data key="d0">Proportion</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The proportion of a technology's value within an indicator, calculated to determine entropy.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792159694</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Value">
  <data key="d0">Value</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The raw value of a technology in a specific indicator, used to calculate proportions.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792159694</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Number of Indicators">
  <data key="d0">Number of Indicators</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The total count of indicators, used in the normalization formula for calculating weighting factors.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792159694</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Uncertainty Analysis">
  <data key="d0">Uncertainty Analysis</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A stage in the proposed evaluation approach to identify the effects of uncertain elements on ranking results.&lt;SEP&gt;Uncertainty analysis is a keyword and analytical consideration in the study regarding risk attitudes and decision-making.&lt;SEP&gt;A process analyzing factors like weighting and aggregation methods to prevent misleading policy messages.&lt;SEP&gt;An analytical process based on the Monte Carlo method to evaluate how utility values and rankings change under uncertain elements.&lt;SEP&gt;Uncertainty Analysis is a statistical technique used to evaluate the impact of input variations on the output of PG recycling technologies.&lt;SEP&gt;Uncertainty Analysis is a sensitivity analysis process using the Monte Carlo method to evaluate output variable variations.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792159694</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="PG Recycling Technology">
  <data key="d0">PG Recycling Technology</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">PG Recycling Technology refers to industrial processes for treating phosphogypsum waste, evaluated for environmental, economic, and social performance.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-011</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792159694</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="MCDA Methods">
  <data key="d0">MCDA Methods</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">MCDA Methods are multi-criteria decision analysis techniques used to rank and evaluate PG recycling technologies.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-011</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792159694</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Chinese Government">
  <data key="d0">Chinese Government</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The governing body implementing policies to stimulate phosphogypsum reduction and recycling in China.&lt;SEP&gt;The Chinese Government implements national and regional policies to promote PG reduction and recycling.&lt;SEP&gt;Chinese Government is an entity striving to promote co-benefits between pollution reduction and carbon emission reduction in industrial sectors.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792226294</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Recycling Determines The Production">
  <data key="d0">Recycling Determines The Production</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Recycling Determines The Production is a mandatory policy in Guizhou linking phosphoric acid production quantities to PG recycling amounts.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-011</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792159694</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hubei Provincial Department Of Economy And Information">
  <data key="d0">Hubei Provincial Department Of Economy And Information</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Hubei Provincial Department Of Economy And Information issued the Technical Regulations for Harmless Treatment of Phosphogypsum.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-011</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792159694</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Technical Regulations For Harmless Treatment Of Phosphogypsum (Trial)">
  <data key="d0">Technical Regulations For Harmless Treatment Of Phosphogypsum (Trial)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Technical Regulations For Harmless Treatment Of Phosphogypsum (Trial) is a regional regulation addressing safe disposal and recycling of PG.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-011</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792159694</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="GB18599">
  <data key="d0">GB18599</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">GB18599 is a national standard that PG soil amendments must meet before recycling.&lt;SEP&gt;GB18599 is a Chinese national standard classifying phosphogypsum as industrial solid waste.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792300104</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="HG/T 4219">
  <data key="d0">HG/T 4219</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">HG/T 4219 is a standard specifying the required properties of PG-based soil amendments.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-011</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792159694</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="GB 38400">
  <data key="d0">GB 38400</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">GB 38400 is a standard governing the properties of PG-derived soil amendments.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-011</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792159694</data>
