<node id="Global Sensitivity Analysis">
  <data key="d0">Global Sensitivity Analysis</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Global Sensitivity Analysis is a quantitative method used to determine the contribution of input parameters to output variations.</data>
