</node>
<node id="Employment Opportunities">
  <data key="d0">Employment Opportunities</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A social dimension indicator receiving increased attention for reflecting social fairness.&lt;SEP&gt;Employment Opportunities is a social indicator significantly influencing the overall performance ranking of PG recycling technologies.&lt;SEP&gt;An indicator that contributes significantly to changes in technological performance.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792159694</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Investment And Construction Cost">
  <data key="d0">Investment And Construction Cost</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Investment And Construction Cost is an economic metric that substantially affects the evaluation results of PG recycling technologies.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-011</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792159694</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Comprehensive Energy Consumption">
  <data key="d0">Comprehensive Energy Consumption</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">A resource dimension indicator with a weight similar to solid waste recycling rate.&lt;SEP&gt;Comprehensive Energy Consumption is an environmental indicator contributing to the performance variation of PG recycling technologies.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792159694</data>
