  <data key="d2">An indicator measuring investment cost within the economic dimension.&lt;SEP&gt;ECO1 is a row identifier in a numerical dataset containing correlation or similarity metrics.&lt;SEP&gt;ECO1 represents investment and construction cost, contributing 3.97% to result variation in the sensitivity analysis.</data>
