  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A theoretical framework integrated into the MCDA method to assess decision-makers' risk attitudes and utility performance.&lt;SEP&gt;A theoretical framework incorporating risk attitudes to identify the utility performance of technologies.&lt;SEP&gt;Utility Theory is a framework that assists in risk-based decision making by incorporating the risk attitudes of decision-makers.&lt;SEP&gt;A theoretical framework introduced in the study to assess the performance of PG recycling technologies and support decision-making.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-000</data>
