<node id="Indicator System">
  <data key="d0">Indicator System</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A structured framework integrating 16 indicators across four dimensions to evaluate PG recycling technologies.&lt;SEP&gt;A structured framework of 16 indicators across four dimensions used to evaluate PG recycling technologies.&lt;SEP&gt;Indicator System is a hierarchical tree structure starting with Total utility and branching into Resources, Environment, Economy, and Society.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-017</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792159973</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="T14">
  <data key="d0">T14</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A PG recycling technology that performs worse in environmental and economic criteria compared to T1.&lt;SEP&gt;A PG recycling technology identified as performing exceptionally well with a utility value above 0.70.&lt;SEP&gt;T14 is a technology in the high utility group with peaks around 0.6, 0.7, and 0.8.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-016</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792159973</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Carbon Emissions">
  <data key="d0">Carbon Emissions</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">An environmental indicator carrying substantial weight in evaluating PG recycling technology performance.&lt;SEP&gt;An indicator contributing significantly to changes in technological performance, accounting for up to 79.42% of the variation in utility.&lt;SEP&gt;Carbon emissions represent the total greenhouse gas output generated by energy consumption and raw material processing in the system.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-023</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792226716</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="ECO2">
  <data key="d0">ECO2</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">An indicator measuring net profit margin on sales within the economic dimension.&lt;SEP&gt;A data metric representing the net profit margin on sales, calculated from enterprise annual reports.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792160084</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="GT">
  <data key="d0">GT</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">GT is a technique employed to integrate weighting vectors from AHP and the entropy weight method to determine final indicator weights.&lt;SEP&gt;A weighting method used to calculate the weights of dimensions in the evaluation framework.&lt;SEP&gt;A weighting method employed to reasonably weight individual indicators and dimensions by minimizing deviation between ideal and derived weights.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792160084</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="AHP">
  <data key="d0">AHP</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">AHP is a method used for weighting indicators through decision hierarchy structuring and pairwise comparison.&lt;SEP&gt;A weighting method used to calculate the weights of dimensions in the evaluation framework.&lt;SEP&gt;A weight strategy method used in conjunction with GT to derive weights for criteria and indicators.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792160084</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="EWM">
  <data key="d0">EWM</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A weighting method used to calculate the weights of dimensions in the evaluation framework.&lt;SEP&gt;A weight strategy method used in conjunction with GT to derive weights for criteria and indicators.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7ce07008b902e3e05b9cea9315e7aa04-chunk-007</data>
