  <data key="d2">Shannon Entropy is a mathematical formula representing a normalized version used in the Entropy Weight Method for multi-criteria decision-making.&lt;SEP&gt;Shannon Entropy is a mathematical measure of uncertainty or information content, specifically a normalized version used in data analysis.</data>
