<node id="Aggregation">
  <data key="d0">Aggregation</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Aggregation is a process step that combines individual utility values into dimension scores and total utility.&lt;SEP&gt;Aggregation refers to the clumping of smaller particles, which becomes significant at longer milling times.&lt;SEP&gt;Aggregation refers to the clumping of hydroxyapatite particles, which milling techniques aim to reduce.</data>
