<node id="Scenario 1">
  <data key="d0">Scenario 1</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Scenario 1 serves as the foundational baseline and original case for monoammonium phosphate (MAP) production, specifically characterized by the traditional practice of phosphogypsum (PG) storage and stockpiling disposal. Functioning as a comprehensive emergy flow model, it systematically accounts for resource inputs, product emergy, environmental impacts, and overall system efficiency. As the primary reference point, Scenario 1 is utilized to calculate change rates in emergy flows across different stages, compare indices under varying production conditions, and evaluate alternative PG resource utilization methods and management strategies. It consistently represents the core MAP production stage and serves as the standard condition for comparative data tables and policy or management impact analyses.

In terms of performance metrics, this baseline scenario is distinguished by its substantial environmental footprint, exhibiting the most significant emergy loss, the highest contributions from dust and solid waste, and elevated pollutant emissions. Despite these environmental burdens, it notably demonstrates the lowest carbon emission intensity among the four evaluated options. Consequently, Scenario 1 provides a critical benchmark for assessing market competitiveness, environmental load, sustainability, carbon intensity, and synergistic effects within the MAP production system, enabling a thorough evaluation of how different resource management approaches influence overall industrial and ecological outcomes.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-033&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-020</data>
