  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">ELR measures environmental load ratio, ranking highest in Scenario 4 and lowest in Scenario 3.&lt;SEP&gt;Environmental loading ratio indicator measured across the four scenarios.&lt;SEP&gt;ELR is a data metric presented in the table, likely representing an efficiency or emission index.&lt;SEP&gt;A component of the ESI metric equation.</data>
