  <data key="d0">Liquid Ammonia</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Liquid ammonia accounts for 20.68% of total emergy input in Scenario 1.&lt;SEP&gt;Liquid ammonia is a key input material contributing significantly to emergy consumption in both Scenario 2 and Scenario 3.&lt;SEP&gt;A chemical resource contributing 19.32% to the total emergy input of the system.&lt;SEP&gt;Liquid ammonia is a key raw material and input for the MAP production stage.&lt;SEP&gt;Liquid ammonia is a key chemical input whose variation affects indicator values across multiple scenarios.&lt;SEP&gt;A primary input chemical for Monoammonium Phosphate production, initially stored in liquid form.&lt;SEP&gt;An input material for the MAP production section.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-032&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-031&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-012</data>
