<node id="Glass Fibers">
  <data key="d0">Glass Fibers</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Glass fibers are mixed with hemihydrate gypsum powder to produce gypsum blocks.&lt;SEP&gt;Glass fibers are mineral additives that improve flexural strength, freeze/thaw resistance, and water resistance when added at 0.35-1% concentration.&lt;SEP&gt;Glass fibers are a type of additive incorporated into Hua's mixture to improve mechanical properties.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-015</data>
