<node id="Production Process">
  <data key="d0">Production Process</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The production process encompasses raw material inputs, energy use, and product outputs within the system boundary.&lt;SEP&gt;A source of carbon emissions involving chemical reactions, specifically between phosphate rock and sulfuric acid.&lt;SEP&gt;A source of carbon emissions within the MPA production system.&lt;SEP&gt;Production process is a major source of carbon emissions, ranking second after fossil fuel combustion.&lt;SEP&gt;A process contributing to energy consumption through phosphate rock decomposition.</data>
