  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Environmental emissions include fluorides, sulfur dioxide, ammonia, and solid waste generated during production.&lt;SEP&gt;Environmental Emissions are byproducts of the production system that require ecological services for dilution.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-023</data>
