  <data key="d0">Operating Costs</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Operating costs are financial metrics that the MAP production stage must concentrate on.&lt;SEP&gt;Operating costs represent a financial parameter whose changes influence emergy-based indicator values in the analyzed scenarios.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-014</data>
