<node id="Fertilizer-Grade Dicalcium Phosphate">
  <data key="d0">Fertilizer-Grade Dicalcium Phosphate</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Fertilizer-grade dicalcium phosphate is a material accounting for the largest share (54.44%) of emergy input in Scenario 3.&lt;SEP&gt;Fertilizer-grade dicalcium phosphate is a chemical input that significantly drives the high emergy input observed in Scenario 3.&lt;SEP&gt;Fertilizer-grade dicalcium phosphate is a processed material whose variation affects indicator values in Scenario 3.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-012</data>
