  <data key="d0">Synergistic Effect Index</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A normalized index positively related to ESI but negatively related to PEI and CEI, used to evaluate co-benefits of industrial scenarios.&lt;SEP&gt;The Synergistic Effect Index measures the holistic synergistic effect of the MAP production process and is heavily influenced by phosphate rock.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-010</data>
