  <data key="d0">Environmental Loading Ratio</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The Environmental Loading Ratio is an environmental indicator significantly impacted by phosphorus tailings and phosphate rock.&lt;SEP&gt;Environmental Loading Ratio represents the ratio of non-renewable and purchased emergy to renewable emergy, indicating environmental stress.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-033</data>
