  <data key="d0">Emergy Evaluation</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Emergy evaluation is the analytical framework used to assess the total emergy input and flows across different scenarios.&lt;SEP&gt;Emergy evaluation is an assessment framework used to calculate and compare emergy-based indicators across different scenarios.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-011</data>
