<node id="MAP Production Process">
  <data key="d0">MAP Production Process</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The MAP production process is the overall manufacturing workflow whose resource structure is affected by PG reuse.&lt;SEP&gt;The MAP production process is the industrial system evaluated across different resource utilization scenarios.&lt;SEP&gt;A holistic production process whose waste heat can be utilized to mitigate carbon emissions from PG drying.&lt;SEP&gt;The MAP production process is the holistic industrial system evaluated across the four scenarios.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-024</data>
