  <data key="d0">Ball Mill</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The Ball mill grinds processed phosphogypsum into hemihydrate gypsum powder.&lt;SEP&gt;A grinding machine used to process raw materials into Hemihydrate Gypsum Powder.&lt;SEP&gt;A ball mill is the equipment used to achieve size reduction of precursors and final powders.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-031&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-72ff3bbf1e2b594abc3ec5c8d86e3178-chunk-001</data>
