<node id="Packaging">
  <data key="d0">Packaging</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Packaging is a processing step where Hemihydrate Gypsum Powder is packaged to become Building Gypsum Powder.&lt;SEP&gt;Packaging is the final step where building gypsum powder is prepared for distribution.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-031&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-030</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792223242</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Measure">
  <data key="d0">Measure</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Measure is an initial processing step in Line B where gypsum powder is measured before stirring.&lt;SEP&gt;Measure is a process step where gypsum powder is quantified before mixing.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-031&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-030</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792223242</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Stir">
  <data key="d0">Stir</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Stir is a mixing process where glass fibre and water are added to gypsum powder.&lt;SEP&gt;Stir is a process step where gypsum powder, glass fibre, and water are mixed.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-031&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-030</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792223242</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Molded">
  <data key="d0">Molded</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Molded is a shaping process applied to the gypsum mixture to form blocks.&lt;SEP&gt;Molding is a process step where gypsum powder mixture is shaped into blocks.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-031&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-030</data>
