  <data key="d0">L_H</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">L_H represents the emergy quantification of human health loss due to environmental impacts.&lt;SEP&gt;L_H refers to emergy loss caused by pollutants' harm to human health.</data>
