  <data key="d0">Renewable Part Of Operation Cost</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Renewable part of operation cost is a source of renewable emergy input (FR).</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-011</data>
