  <data key="d0">Policy Intervention</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Policy intervention is a conceptual framework used to construct dynamic business models for simulating recycling development.&lt;SEP&gt;Policy intervention refers to governmental actions whose effects on solid waste recycling industries are quantified using dynamic business models.&lt;SEP&gt;Policy Intervention refers to governmental measures evaluated for their impact on the solid waste recycling industry.</data>
