  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Wet and thermal routes are industrial production methods for phosphate fertilizer compared using life cycle assessment.&lt;SEP&gt;Wet and thermal routes are production methods for phosphate fertilizer evaluated using life cycle assessment.</data>
