  <data key="d0">Ecological Services</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Ecological Services are required to render pollutant emissions harmless, quantified in emergy terms.&lt;SEP&gt;Ecological services represent environmental capacities used to dilute water and air pollutants generated by the production processes.&lt;SEP&gt;Ecological services are environmental resources used to dilute air and water pollutants, with overall utilization reduced by 11.71% after PG reuse.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-014</data>
