  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">The P fertilizer industry generates phosphogypsum as a primary by-product and requires sustainable resource utilization strategies.&lt;SEP&gt;P Fertilizer Industry is the industrial sector urgently needing synergistic effects from phosphogypsum disposal practices.</data>
