  <data key="d2">Material Flow Analysis is an analytical approach used to construct comprehensive indicators for evaluating industrial enterprises.&lt;SEP&gt;Material flow analysis is a technique used to investigate phosphorus fertilizer utilization efficiency and economic benefits.</data>
