<node id="Substance Flow Analysis">
  <data key="d0">Substance Flow Analysis</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Substance flow analysis is a method used to examine changes in phosphorus flow within agricultural food chains over time.&lt;SEP&gt;Substance flow analysis is a systemic inquiry method used to track the sources, flows, and fate of a specific substance within a defined system.&lt;SEP&gt;Substance Flow Analysis is a material accounting tool used to assess the sustainability and flow paths of phosphorus within the environment.&lt;SEP&gt;Substance Flow Analysis is a methodological framework used as a decision support tool for managing resources like phosphorus.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1b5f95e85d7bfa3b7aab581f3c82b33-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1b5f95e85d7bfa3b7aab581f3c82b33-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1b5f95e85d7bfa3b7aab581f3c82b33-chunk-001</data>
