<node id="Food Security">
  <data key="d0">Food Security</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Food security is a future goal that can be supported by proper phosphogypsum waste recycling and sustainable phosphorus supply.&lt;SEP&gt;Food security is a global priority highlighted during the COVID pandemic, driving supply chain and safety pressures.&lt;SEP&gt;Food Security is the objective of ensuring long-term phosphorus availability, accessibility, and sustainable use in agriculture.&lt;SEP&gt;Food security is a global objective closely linked to sustainable phosphorus management and addressing phosphorus scarcity.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1b5f95e85d7bfa3b7aab581f3c82b33-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1b5f95e85d7bfa3b7aab581f3c82b33-chunk-000</data>
