</node>
<node id="Mining">
  <data key="d0">Mining</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Mining is a sector included in the phosphorus loss analysis, though data on losses were unavailable.&lt;SEP&gt;An economic sector with phosphorus losses of 1 kt/a P, noted as underrepresented due to missing data.&lt;SEP&gt;Sector where circular economy considerations focus on minimizing resource extraction and managing residual waste.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1b5f95e85d7bfa3b7aab581f3c82b33-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1b5f95e85d7bfa3b7aab581f3c82b33-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792404407</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Blood And Bone">
  <data key="d0">Blood And Bone</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">A material in organic waste with questionable phosphorus content data and agricultural reuse.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1b5f95e85d7bfa3b7aab581f3c82b33-chunk-018</data>
