</node>
<node id="Green Organics">
  <data key="d0">Green Organics</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Green Organics refers to organic waste assumed to be associated with food production and consumption.&lt;SEP&gt;A category of waste linked to food production and consumption with absent data.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1b5f95e85d7bfa3b7aab581f3c82b33-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1b5f95e85d7bfa3b7aab581f3c82b33-chunk-005</data>
