  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Queensland is the Australian state where domestic phosphate rock mining for fertiliser production occurs.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1b5f95e85d7bfa3b7aab581f3c82b33-chunk-006</data>
