  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">North Asia is the largest destination for Australian food and agricultural exports, accounting for 37% of the total.&lt;SEP&gt;North Asia, predominantly Japan and China, is the largest destination for Australian food and agricultural exports.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1b5f95e85d7bfa3b7aab581f3c82b33-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1b5f95e85d7bfa3b7aab581f3c82b33-chunk-001</data>
