<node id="Phosphorus Scarcity">
  <data key="d0">Phosphorus Scarcity</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Phosphorus Scarcity is a global driver that creates vulnerability in the Australian food system despite current food security.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphorus Scarcity refers to the global shortage of accessible phosphorus, threatening long-term food production capabilities.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1b5f95e85d7bfa3b7aab581f3c82b33-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1b5f95e85d7bfa3b7aab581f3c82b33-chunk-000</data>
