  <data key="d0">ABARES</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">ABARES is an organization cited as a primary data source for Australian agricultural export destinations.&lt;SEP&gt;An Australian government agency providing data on phosphate rock and food production.&lt;SEP&gt;An Australian government agency cited as a primary data source for food production statistics.&lt;SEP&gt;ABARES is an Australian government agency that published agricultural commodity statistics and mineral data.</data>
