  <data key="d0">Phosphorus Flow Analysis</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Phosphorus Flow Analysis is a specialized application of substance flow analysis used to track phosphorus budgets and identify inefficiencies.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphorus Flow Analysis is a methodological approach used to identify inefficiencies, recovery points, and policy priorities in national food systems.&lt;SEP&gt;A methodology used to track the movement of phosphorus-containing goods through key sectors of the Australian Food System.</data>
