<node id="Agricultural Cropping Systems">
  <data key="d0">Agricultural Cropping Systems</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Agricultural cropping systems are farming operations that receive phosphorus inputs and produce crop harvests.</data>
