<node id="Fertilisers">
  <data key="d0">Fertilisers</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A key sector covering the production, distribution, import, and export of commercial grade mineral phosphate fertilisers.&lt;SEP&gt;Commercial agricultural products whose composition, trade, and environmental processing losses are monitored.&lt;SEP&gt;Fertilisers are synthetic or organic materials applied to pastures and cropping systems to supply phosphorus.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1b5f95e85d7bfa3b7aab581f3c82b33-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1b5f95e85d7bfa3b7aab581f3c82b33-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1b5f95e85d7bfa3b7aab581f3c82b33-chunk-003</data>
