  <data key="d0">von Weizsacker</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">von Weizsacker established that reducing avoidable losses and increasing efficiency is more energy and economically efficient than recycling.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1b5f95e85d7bfa3b7aab581f3c82b33-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792248985</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="ABS">
  <data key="d0">ABS</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The Australian Bureau of Statistics, a primary source for agriculture and livestock data.&lt;SEP&gt;ABS is an organization that provided data on the 211 million head of livestock in Australia.&lt;SEP&gt;ABS is an absorption factor parameter used in exposure calculations.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1b5f95e85d7bfa3b7aab581f3c82b33-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1b5f95e85d7bfa3b7aab581f3c82b33-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792297024</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="ALFA">
  <data key="d0">ALFA</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">ALFA is a cited data source for livestock sector information.&lt;SEP&gt;ALFA is an organization that provided data on the 211 million head of livestock in Australia.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1b5f95e85d7bfa3b7aab581f3c82b33-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1b5f95e85d7bfa3b7aab581f3c82b33-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792248985</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="White et al.">
  <data key="d0">White et al.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">White et al. estimated that the embodied phosphorus of meat products is three times higher than vegetal products.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1b5f95e85d7bfa3b7aab581f3c82b33-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792248985</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Archer">
  <data key="d0">Archer</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Archer noted that Australian livestock systems are more resource efficient than counterparts in Europe or North America.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1b5f95e85d7bfa3b7aab581f3c82b33-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792248985</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Phosphorus Security">
  <data key="d0">Phosphorus Security</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Phosphorus security refers to the long-term accessibility and availability of phosphorus to ensure agricultural productivity and environmental protection.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphorus security is a sustainability goal achieved through measures that increase resilience, efficiency, and closed-loop nature of food systems.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1b5f95e85d7bfa3b7aab581f3c82b33-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1b5f95e85d7bfa3b7aab581f3c82b33-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792248985</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Phosphorus Fertilisers">
  <data key="d0">Phosphorus Fertilisers</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Phosphorus fertilisers are imported and mined inputs heavily utilized in Australia's pasture-fed livestock systems.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1b5f95e85d7bfa3b7aab581f3c82b33-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792248985</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Food System">
  <data key="d0">Food System</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The Australian food system is characterized by substantial phosphorus losses and inefficiencies across production and consumption stages.&lt;SEP&gt;The food system encompasses the production, processing, retail, consumption, and export of agricultural commodities in Australia.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1b5f95e85d7bfa3b7aab581f3c82b33-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1b5f95e85d7bfa3b7aab581f3c82b33-chunk-011</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792248985</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Meat Products">
  <data key="d0">Meat Products</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Meat products are food items estimated to have three times higher embodied phosphorus than vegetal products.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1b5f95e85d7bfa3b7aab581f3c82b33-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792248985</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Wastewater Sector">
  <data key="d0">Wastewater Sector</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The wastewater sector concentrates phosphorus in urban areas, presenting both eutrophication risks and recovery opportunities.&lt;SEP&gt;The wastewater sector is a component of the food system that produces biosolids containing phosphorus.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1b5f95e85d7bfa3b7aab581f3c82b33-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1b5f95e85d7bfa3b7aab581f3c82b33-chunk-011</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792248985</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Food Processing">
  <data key="d0">Food Processing</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Food processing is a stage in the food system that generates organic waste.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1b5f95e85d7bfa3b7aab581f3c82b33-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792248985</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Consumption">
  <data key="d0">Consumption</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Consumption is a stage in the food system that generates organic waste.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1b5f95e85d7bfa3b7aab581f3c82b33-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792248985</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Australian Northern Grazing Systems">
  <data key="d0">Australian Northern Grazing Systems</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Australian northern grazing systems are phosphorus-efficient due to negligible phosphorus inputs.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1b5f95e85d7bfa3b7aab581f3c82b33-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792248985</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Native Grasses">
  <data key="d0">Native Grasses</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Native grasses are used for grazing Australian livestock, contributing to resource efficiency.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1b5f95e85d7bfa3b7aab581f3c82b33-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
