  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Heavy calcium powder functions as a filling material within the mortar mixture.&lt;SEP&gt;Heavy calcium powder is a raw material for PBSLM, accounting for 14.34% of consumption at a cost of 34.42 Yuan per ton.&lt;SEP&gt;Heavy calcium powder is a secondary raw material comprising 30.30% of the desulfurization gypsum based self-leveling mortar.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-028</data>
