<node id="GB/T9776">
  <data key="d0">GB/T9776</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">GB/T9776 is a Chinese national standard for calcined gypsum that modified phosphogypsum meets.&lt;SEP&gt;GB/T9776 is a technical specification standard that outlines the sieve requirements for the preparation process.&lt;SEP&gt;GB/T9776 is a standard specifying the mechanical property requirements for phosphogypsum, which certain thermal treatment conditions successfully meet.&lt;SEP&gt;GB/T9776 is a Chinese standard proposing a maximum setting time limit for MPG.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-007</data>
