<node id="MPG">
  <data key="d0">MPG</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">MPG is a processed, powdered material derived from phosphogypsum (PG) that undergoes calcination, grinding, and hydration to modify its properties and significantly reduce its heavy metal content. As a modified form of PG, MPG is extensively characterized using analytical techniques such as X-ray diffraction (XRD), Fourier-transform infrared spectroscopy (FTIR), and scanning electron microscopy with energy-dispersive X-ray spectroscopy (SEM-EDS) to evaluate its phase composition, chemical structure, crystal lattice changes, and impurity levels under varying temperature and time conditions. Its macroscopic properties, mechanical strength, and hydration behavior are closely monitored, revealing that while its hydration cohesion tends to reduce fluidity, maintaining an optimal dosage maximizes mechanical performance.

In terms of safety and environmental impact, MPG is rigorously evaluated alongside raw PG for heavy metal content, ecological hazards, and human health risks. Although specific samples contain elevated levels of arsenic and cadmium, risk assessments indicate acceptable carcinogenic risks via oral intake and demonstrate substantially lower ecological and health hazards compared to unprocessed PG. Consequently, its deployment in road bases, agricultural amendments, and building materials is governed by strict heavy metal concentration limits. Beyond its environmental applications, MPG serves as a critical industrial input, functioning as the primary raw material for PBSLM production, where it accounts for 63.11% of total consumption at a market cost of 126.22 Yuan per ton.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-015</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792296848</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
