  <data key="d0">US EPA</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The regulatory body that stipulates the HI &lt; 1 standard for non-carcinogenic risk assessment.&lt;SEP&gt;The US EPA is a regulatory body that stipulates safety standards such as a Hazard Index threshold of less than 1.&lt;SEP&gt;The US EPA sets the standard for acceptable carcinogenic risk levels for heavy metals.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-023</data>
