<node id="Table 13">
  <data key="d0">Table 13</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Table 13 presents the potential ecological risk index of heavy metals in PG and MPG.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 13 contains environmental potential ecological risk level (RI) and individual risk (Ei) values for heavy metals in PG.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-020</data>
