<node id="Table 14">
  <data key="d0">Table 14</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Table 14 presents the geo-accumulation index of PG under different pretreatment conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 14 displays the geological accumulation index (Iego) for PG and MPG, indicating pollution levels.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-020</data>
