  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Table 15 presents the hazard index of PG and MPG under different intake pathways.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 15 provides data on non-carcinogenic risks for PG and MPG, evaluated against US EPA standards.</data>
