  <data key="d0">Potential Ecological Risk Index Method</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A risk assessment model used to calculate environmental potential ecological risk levels (RI) and individual risk values (Ei) for heavy metals.&lt;SEP&gt;Potential Ecological Risk Index Method is an analytical technique used to evaluate ecological risks associated with heavy metals in MPG.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-020</data>
