<node id="Holding Time">
  <data key="d0">Holding Time</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Holding Time is an experimental parameter that negatively correlates with dihydrate content and positively correlates with hemihydrate content.&lt;SEP&gt;Holding Time is the duration samples are maintained at a specific temperature, influencing crystallization quality and phase composition.&lt;SEP&gt;Holding time is an experimental parameter measured in hours that correlates with the phase composition of phosphogypsum during thermal treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;An experimental parameter measured in hours, used to track phase composition changes.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-035&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-036&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-010</data>
