<node id="Standard Remediation Technology">
  <data key="d0">Standard Remediation Technology</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Standard remediation technology is a conventional approach that places plants into unfavorable organogenesis conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Standard remediation technology is a conventional approach that creates unfavorable conditions for plants due to high solubility and mobility of hazardous substances.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-25198f8665e133385fd54e5a03e28a44-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-25198f8665e133385fd54e5a03e28a44-chunk-008</data>
