  <data key="d0">Coats-Redfem Method</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The Coats-Redfem Method is utilized alongside other kinetic methods to validate the decomposition mechanism.&lt;SEP&gt;A kinetic calculation method applied to confirm the mechanism model of phosphogypsum decomposition.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d5e4f0f96b4ad61d23685552d3211225-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d5e4f0f96b4ad61d23685552d3211225-chunk-007</data>
