<node id="60 Mesh">
  <data key="d0">60 Mesh</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">60 Mesh indicates the optimal particle size of coal for achieving high calcium oxide recovery.&lt;SEP&gt;60 Mesh is a specific coal particle size identified as optimal for balancing intermediate and final decomposition products.&lt;SEP&gt;60 Mesh is a specific coal particle size determined to be optimal for maximizing CaO recovery and minimizing CaS production.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d5e4f0f96b4ad61d23685552d3211225-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d5e4f0f96b4ad61d23685552d3211225-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d5e4f0f96b4ad61d23685552d3211225-chunk-006</data>
