  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Tube Reactor is the experimental apparatus used to analyze the kinetic characteristics of phosphogypsum decomposition.&lt;SEP&gt;Tube Reactor is an experimental apparatus used for conducting kinetic experiments in the study.&lt;SEP&gt;An experimental apparatus used to conduct the reduction reaction with carbon monoxide.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d5e4f0f96b4ad61d23685552d3211225-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d5e4f0f96b4ad61d23685552d3211225-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d5e4f0f96b4ad61d23685552d3211225-chunk-005</data>
