<node id="Elemental Phosphorus">
  <data key="d0">Elemental Phosphorus</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Elemental Phosphorus is an intermediary produced during the Dry Process of phosphoric acid manufacturing.&lt;SEP&gt;Elemental phosphorus is an intermediary substance produced in the dry process from heated phosphate ore.&lt;SEP&gt;Elemental phosphorus is the primary chemical product output from the thermal process pathway.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-022</data>
