  <data key="d0">NIST Spectrum</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The NIST spectrum serves as a reference standard and target value for optimizing the OH to PO4 ratio during synthesis.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-72ff3bbf1e2b594abc3ec5c8d86e3178-chunk-004</data>
