</node>
<node id="Türket">
  <data key="d0">Türket</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Türket studied the unit weight of bricks manufactured by partially replacing clay with phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Türket is a researcher who co-authored a study on manufacturing bricks with phosphogypsum replacing clay.&lt;SEP&gt;Türket manufactured bricks in 2012 with varying PG replacement levels to analyze drying shrinkage.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-011</data>
