  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Natural hydraulic lime is a component used in brick manufacturing alongside phosphogypsum and natural sand.&lt;SEP&gt;Natural hydraulic lime is a binding agent used in the brick mixture by Bouchhima et al.</data>
