<node id="Polypropene Fibers">
  <data key="d0">Polypropene Fibers</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Polypropene fibers are a fiber type added to mixtures that optimally enhances flexural strength, impact work, and freeze/thaw resistance.&lt;SEP&gt;Polypropene fibers are synthetic additives that improve flexural strength, freeze/thaw resistance, anti-impact work, and water resistance when added at 1-1.7% concentration.&lt;SEP&gt;Synthetic fibers added at 1-1.7% to modify and enhance specific matrix properties.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-016</data>
