  <data key="d0">Sulfate Resistance</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Sulfate resistance is a durability property that increases with higher content of calcined phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;A chemical property of the matrix improved by the introduction of calcined PG.&lt;SEP&gt;Sulfate Resistance is a material property indicating durability against sulfate exposure.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-011</data>
