  <data key="d0">Chemical Resistance</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Chemical resistance is a property that improves with the addition of phosphogypsum to matrices.&lt;SEP&gt;The matrix's ability to withstand chemical attack, which is enhanced by the inclusion of calcined phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemical resistance is a physical property of the matrix studied in relation to phosphogypsum modifications.</data>
