<node id="Milk of Lime">
  <data key="d0">Milk of Lime</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Milk of lime is a calcium hydroxide suspension used to wash and neutralize phosphogypsum after acid treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Milk of lime is used to wash phosphogypsum during the preparation of alkali-activated cement mixtures.&lt;SEP&gt;Milk of lime is a chemical agent used to purify phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;A chemical treatment agent applied to phosphogypsum prior to calcination.&lt;SEP&gt;Milk of lime is a chemical washing agent used to purify phosphogypsum before application.&lt;SEP&gt;Milk of lime is a washing medium used to remove water-soluble impurities from phosphogypsum.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e0549fcda95f7199440791b20bf85635-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e0549fcda95f7199440791b20bf85635-chunk-000</data>
