</node>
<node id="Al-Jabbari">
  <data key="d0">Al-Jabbari</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">A researcher who developed a PG purification process involving washing, sieving, and calcining, with the addition of accelerators.&lt;SEP&gt;Al-Jabbari developed a physical purification method for Phosphogypsum involving washing, sieving, and calcination.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e0549fcda95f7199440791b20bf85635-chunk-001</data>
