  <data key="d0">Unslaked Lime</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">A physical additive mixed with PG that increases cement setting times and decreases mechanical strength.&lt;SEP&gt;Unslaked lime is a chemical additive that increases cement setting times but generally decreases mechanical strength.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-010</data>
