  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Setting times refer to the duration required for cement to harden, which is influenced by various lime additives.&lt;SEP&gt;Setting Times is a property of mortar mixes that increases when cement is replaced with phosphogypsum.</data>
