  <data key="d0">Decarbonation Process</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The decarbonation process is the thermal decomposition of limestone, which is catalytically affected by PG.&lt;SEP&gt;Decarbonation Process is a chemical reaction in cement production where calcium carbonate breaks down, influenced by phosphogypsum content.</data>
