<node id="Replacement Percentage">
  <data key="d0">Replacement Percentage</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The independent variable on the x-axis ranging from 0 to 100, indicating material substitution levels.&lt;SEP&gt;A variable ranging from 0% to 100% that exhibits a negative correlation with tensile strength.&lt;SEP&gt;Replacement percentage is the proportion of phosphogypsum substituted in the material mix, ranging from 0% to 100% in the analyzed data.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e0549fcda95f7199440791b20bf85635-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e0549fcda95f7199440791b20bf85635-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e0549fcda95f7199440791b20bf85635-chunk-010</data>
