<node id="Soundness">
  <data key="d0">Soundness</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Soundness is a durability property of hardened cement paste evaluated through percent elongation after autoclaving.&lt;SEP&gt;A property of hardened cement paste evaluated by measuring percent elongation after autoclaving.&lt;SEP&gt;Soundness is a fresh mix property of PG mortar investigated alongside setting time and hardened mix properties.&lt;SEP&gt;Soundness is a property of cement pastes and mortars that is negatively affected by increased phosphogypsum replacement and gypsum formation.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e0549fcda95f7199440791b20bf85635-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e0549fcda95f7199440791b20bf85635-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e0549fcda95f7199440791b20bf85635-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e0549fcda95f7199440791b20bf85635-chunk-003</data>
