  <data key="d2">Harmful matter present in cement blends that affects soundness and is addressed by ASTM C1038.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e0549fcda95f7199440791b20bf85635-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
