<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Building Materials">
  <data key="d7">31.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation between Building Materials and Phosphogypsum establishes construction products as the primary, high-volume, and global pathway for the resource utilization of this industrial byproduct. Phosphogypsum is extensively evaluated and employed worldwide, particularly in China where it accounts for the majority of current utilization, as a raw or calcined component and binding material across the building materials sector. It is specifically integrated into the development and manufacturing of various construction supplies, including gypsum blocks, boards, cement, cement mortar, bricks, and load-bearing materials. Beyond standard manufacturing, incorporating phosphogypsum serves multiple strategic purposes: it enhances the mechanical strength, durability, and overall physical properties of the resulting materials while functioning as an effective mechanism for industrial waste management. This application provides a sustainable disposal route that actively alleviates shortages of conventional construction resources and supports closed-loop resource utilization.

Consequently, the production of purified phosphogypsum for construction represents a critical industrial practice that effectively balances resource recovery with broader market demands. Despite its established and significant role in the industry, widespread adoption has historically faced market constraints driven by public perception regarding the potential release of radioactivity into the environment. Nevertheless, through rigorous purification processes and controlled manufacturing practices, these safety concerns are effectively mitigated. As a result, the utilization of phosphogypsum in building materials remains a vital, widely implemented practice across multiple countries, continuing to support sustainable construction resource management.</data>
  <data key="d9">application,application sector,component of,constituent,construction,construction use,hazard,high-volume use,industrial application,industrial use,industrial utilization,low-value utilization,manufacturing,manufacturing input,material improvement,material usage,primary application,raw material,reuse application,utilization,utilization field,utilization pathway,utilization route,valorization</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-160a0fe95f7c82b193c6af751106ab6d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-016</data>
