<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Calcium Sulfate Dihydrate">
  <data key="d7">47.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relationship between Calcium Sulfate Dihydrate and Phosphogypsum is fundamentally compositional, with Calcium Sulfate Dihydrate serving as the predominant mineral phase and primary chemical constituent of Phosphogypsum. Phosphogypsum is an industrial byproduct generated during phosphoric acid extraction, and its material identity is intrinsically defined by this compound, which typically accounts for 75% to 95% of its total mass, averaging approximately 90 weight percent. As the main crystalline structure and precipitate within the material, Calcium Sulfate Dihydrate directly governs the overall physical and chemical properties of Phosphogypsum. Its high concentration and structural dominance ensure consistent measurement conditions across different samples and act as a definitive chemical identifier and foundational basis for the material's compositional integrity.

The specific morphological features of Calcium Sulfate Dihydrate, particularly the parallel striations found on its crystal surfaces, intrinsically dictate the reactivity and behavioral characteristics of Phosphogypsum. In analytical contexts, the compound's characteristic diffraction peak is so prominent that it completely disappears when Phosphogypsum content falls below a 15% threshold, further underscoring its critical role in defining the substance's structural identity. Additionally, within reaction contexts, Phosphogypsum is often identified directly as Calcium Sulfate Dihydrate, and the compound is noted to decompose at high temperatures. Together, these attributes highlight how Calcium Sulfate Dihydrate fundamentally shapes the analytical signature, functional behavior, and thermal properties of Phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum is composed primarily of calcium sulfate dihydrate.</data>
  <data key="d9">chemical composition,chemical identity,chemical makeup,chemical reaction,component,composed of,composition,contains,formation,identification,main component,material classification,material constituent,material identity,material similarity,mineral phase,primary component,primary composition,primary constituent,raw state,synonym</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e290dd6268316238694f70c30a367426-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c22d31cfad5421c936a23705a3bc6e0-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4a64a852097fdc910b98ed788503ce4-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6825862084b162a4b16cd1037c76e3d7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-98d8b2df45924e721bfa570f652f33e3-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4739e42903c95e1fb7e0ecfbca3a12df-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-160a0fe95f7c82b193c6af751106ab6d-chunk-0