<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Ammonium Sulfate">
  <data key="d7">18.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation between Ammonium Sulfate and Phosphogypsum describes the industrial process of converting phosphogypsum waste into ammonium sulfate. In this chemical synthesis, phosphogypsum serves as the primary raw material and feedstock. The conversion is typically achieved using ammonium hydroxide through a specialized two-step ammonia-carbonation process, during which ammonium sulfate is recovered as a valuable by-product or secondary chemical compound. Because the industrial conversion involves the controlled flow of radionuclides, the process requires careful technical management to ensure both safety and operational efficiency.

From an economic and industrial standpoint, the production of ammonium sulfate from phosphogypsum waste is utilized within the chemical industry to transform an industrial waste stream into a commercially viable product. This application strongly supports circular economy principles by addressing waste management and resource recovery objectives. However, the synthesized ammonium sulfate operates within a competitive market landscape, frequently competing with cheaper alternative products that are also derived from broader phosphogypsum recycling efforts. Despite these market challenges, the relationship underscores a sustainable and economically strategic method for valorizing phosphogypsum waste.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum serves as the primary raw material for synthesizing ammonium sulfate.&lt;SEP&gt;Hot aqueous ammonium sulfate solutions are used to remove impurities from phosphogypsum.</data>
  <data key="d9">by-product recovery,chemical conversion,chemical conversion product,chemical industry,chemical preparation,chemical process,chemical synthesis,co-production,competition,conversion,industrial byproduct,preparation,product manufacturing,production,production input,production source,production target,purification method,raw material,recycling challenge,synthesis,utilization,waste utilization</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-031&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-043&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-036&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2760dc2a11fedad02d24741a978cf20d-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-35aef6efc801611130c5dd196fe513df-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-001</data>
