  <data key="d8">Phosphogypsum is an industrial byproduct discussed within the context of cementitious materials research.&lt;SEP&gt;PG is incorporated into the production of cementitious materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum is utilized as an admixture in cementitious materials to evaluate durability and mechanical properties.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum serves as a key raw material in the production of cementitious materials.</data>
