<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Hydrothermal Conversion">
  <data key="d7">6.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Hydrothermal conversion is a method used to process phosphogypsum for rare earth recovery.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydrothermal conversion is a method used to process phosphogypsum for rare earth recovery.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydrothermal conversion is a method used to process phosphogypsum for rare earth recovery.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum undergoes hydrothermal conversion to facilitate the leaching of rare earths.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydrothermal conversion is applied to phosphogypsum to facilitate the leaching of valuable elements.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydrothermal conversion is applied to phosphogypsum to enable rare earths leaching.</data>
