<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Journal of Cleaner Production">
  <data key="d7">9.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Journal of Cleaner Production and phosphogypsum are connected through extensive scholarly coverage dedicated to the sustainable utilization, processing, and environmental management of this industrial byproduct. The journal has established itself as a primary platform for disseminating research on phosphogypsum, a connection prominently highlighted by the publication of a special issue entirely devoted to the topic. This dedicated focus underscores the academic and industrial significance of transforming phosphogypsum from a waste material into a valuable resource.

Research featured in the journal spans a wide array of practical applications and technical processes. Significant attention has been given to incorporating phosphogypsum into cementitious and construction materials, demonstrating its viability as a building component. Additionally, studies have explored advanced recovery processes, particularly the leaching of rare earth elements from phosphogypsum, which addresses both resource recovery and waste reduction. The journal also publishes investigations into sorption processes that utilize phosphogypsum for environmental remediation, further emphasizing its role in sustainable environmental management.</data>
  <data key="d9">industrial waste,publication subject,publication venue,research dissemination,research focus,special issue,sustainability focus,thematic focus</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-026</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d12">1792457376</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
