<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Table 1">
  <data key="d7">17.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Table 1 in relation to Phosphogypsum serves as a comprehensive analytical dataset that documents the material's chemical properties, behavior, and applications. The table provides detailed quantitative concentration data for major elements, trace elements, and oxides present in phosphogypsum samples, drawing from various studies to establish constituent percentages and impurity levels. It facilitates geographical comparisons by contrasting the chemical makeup of phosphogypsum sourced from Morocco with samples collected from Hubei, Yunnan, and Guizhou provinces.

Beyond static compositional profiling, the table examines dynamic chemical effects by presenting macro-ion content across different phosphogypsum dosages, highlighting dosage-dependent ion release patterns. It also includes chemical analysis results for nitrate leach liquid derived from the material, offering insights into leachate characteristics. Additionally, Table 1 references application data for phosphogypsum and presents a comparative analysis of its radioactivity relative to conventional building materials. Together, these entries deliver a multifaceted overview encompassing elemental distribution, regional variations, application metrics, and safety-related radiological assessments.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 1 lists the chemical composition of Phosphogypsum from different sources.</data>
  <data key="d9">calculation basis,chemical analysis,chemical composition,composition,composition data,compositional summary,data analysis,data comparison,data presentation,data reference,data representation,data source,data visualization,documentation,documents,dosage tracking,dose response,elemental concentration,experimental variable,radioactivity,regional comparison,summarizes</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-edfc4dcbd74cbf0b294f83f2034b209d-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-25198f8665e133385fd54e5a03e28a44-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d5e4f0f96b4ad61d23685552d3211225-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-001</data>
