<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Phosphate Industry">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The phosphate industry generates raw phosphogypsum as an industrial byproduct.&lt;SEP&gt;The phosphate industry produces phosphogypsum as a hazardous byproduct during the wet manufacturing process for phosphoric acid.&lt;SEP&gt;The phosphate industry generates phosphogypsum as a primary byproduct.</data>
