<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Washing Process">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The washing process removes soluble impurities from raw phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;The washing process applied to phosphogypsum significantly improves its compressive strength at low replacement percentages.&lt;SEP&gt;The washing process is applied to phosphogypsum but has negligible effects on final compressive strength at higher replacement levels.</data>
  <data key="d9">negligible impact,performance improvement,processing step,purification step,treatment</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e0549fcda95f7199440791b20bf85635-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e0549fcda95f7199440791b20bf85635-chunk-010</data>
