  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Portland Slag Cement">
  <data key="d7">7.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Purified phosphogypsum is used as a raw material in the manufacture of Portland slag cement.&lt;SEP&gt;The addition of phosphogypsum to Portland slag cement similarly alters its mechanical and setting properties.&lt;SEP&gt;Thermally treated phosphogypsum influences the physical properties of Portland slag cement.&lt;SEP&gt;Thermally treated phosphogypsum is used to alter the engineering properties of Portland slag cement.&lt;SEP&gt;Thermally treated phosphogypsum is added to Portland slag cement to modify its properties.&lt;SEP&gt;Thermally treated phosphogypsum influences the properties of Portland slag cement.&lt;SEP&gt;Thermally treated phosphogypsum influences the properties of Portland slag cement.</data>
