<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Dihydrate Process">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Phosphogypsum is produced as a byproduct of the dihydrate process for phosphoric acid manufacture.&lt;SEP&gt;The dihydrate process produces phosphogypsum filter cakes containing significant impurities.&lt;SEP&gt;The dihydrate process used in phosphoric acid manufacturing influences the crystal shapes of phosphogypsum.</data>
