<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Radioactive Elements">
  <data key="d7">10.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Phosphogypsum and radioactive elements are intrinsically linked through the presence of naturally occurring, trace hazardous impurities within the industrial byproduct. Derived from the processing of phosphate rocks, phosphogypsum inherently contains radioactive components, particularly radium and uranium, with concentrations varying based on the geological origin of the source material.

These radioactive elements pose significant environmental and health risks, as their release during phosphogypsum applications can lead to soil contamination, impaired plant growth, and adverse effects on human health. Consequently, the presence of these radionuclides substantially restricts the practical application and widespread utilization of phosphogypsum. To mitigate these hazards, specialized management strategies are required, including fixation methods and harmless treatment processes designed to immobilize the radioactive impurities and prevent their uptake into the surrounding environment.&lt;SEP&gt;Radioactive elements are present in trace amounts in phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum contains radioactive elements such as uranium and thorium.</data>
  <data key="d9">application limitation,composition,contains hazard,contains impurity,contamination,environmental impact,environmental risk,fixation requirement,hazardous component,impurity,impurity composition,monitoring,toxic uptake</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-160a0fe95f7c82b193c6af751106ab6d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80e3f6300e001922a5ca2a6a8ac2e0d2-chunk-001</data>
