<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Lead-210">
  <data key="d7">15.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Lead-210 and phosphogypsum are linked by a relationship in which Lead-210 functions as a naturally occurring radioactive contaminant and isotope within the phosphogypsum matrix. This isotope is primarily incorporated through coprecipitation with calcium sulfate, accounting for approximately 80–90% of its retention. Phosphogypsum serves as a primary source material for Lead-210, which can be extracted using organic compounds. Analytical protocols consistently monitor and quantify Lead-210 activity concentrations across various samples to track radioelement levels, with a reported average concentration of 418 ± 11.7 Bq/kg. The isotope exhibits moderate concentration fluctuations throughout the material, displaying notably higher activity levels in coarse fractions.

Due to its radioactive properties, the presence of Lead-210 necessitates purification for safe industrial applications. Furthermore, its bioavailability is actively assessed, particularly when phosphogypsum is evaluated for agricultural purposes such as soil amendment.</data>
  <data key="d9">analysis,component of,composition,concentration tracking,contains,coprecipitates in,extraction target,measured in,measurement,radioactive content,radioactive isotope,radioactivity,radioactivity analysis,radioelement monitoring,radiometric analysis,radionuclide,radionuclide content,sample measurement,source,source material</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-005</data>
