</edge>
<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Differential Thermal Analysis">
  <data key="d7">6.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Phosphogypsum was evaluated using differential thermal analysis to assess treatment improvements.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum was examined via differential thermal analysis to detect thermal transformations.&lt;SEP&gt;Differential Thermal Analysis is coupled with thermogravimetric analysis to identify endothermic peaks during phosphogypsum transformation.&lt;SEP&gt;Differential thermal analysis is used alongside thermogravimetric analysis to determine transformation temperatures in phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Differential thermal analysis is used to identify endothermic and exothermic peaks in phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Differential thermal analysis is used to characterize the decomposition process of phosphogypsum.</data>
  <data key="d9">analytical method,analyzed by,analyzed using,application,characterization,experimental method,material analysis,peak detection,thermal analysis</data>
