<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Wet Process">
  <data key="d7">18.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Phosphogypsum, Wet Process is a relation that defines the industrial pathway through which phosphogypsum is generated as a major byproduct during the wet process treatment of phosphate rock. This procedure is primarily utilized for the production of phosphoric acid and phosphate fertilizers. Throughout the chemical reactions involved, acids are generated that directly influence the impurity profile of the resulting material. Consequently, phosphogypsum emerges as a significant solid, chemical, and industrial byproduct, specifically a hydrated calcium sulfate, produced in considerable quantities alongside phosphoric acid.

The specific variant or type of wet process employed plays a critical role in determining the major elemental composition and overall chemical characteristics of the phosphogypsum. Overall, this relation links phosphate rock processing directly to fertilizer and acid manufacturing, establishing the wet process as the definitive industrial method responsible for the creation of phosphogypsum while simultaneously dictating its chemical properties and impurity levels.&lt;SEP&gt;The wet process is the widely used chemical treatment method that generates phosphogypsum as a by-product.&lt;SEP&gt;The wet process generates phosphogypsum as a final waste byproduct.</data>
  <data key="d9">acid formation,by-product,by-product generation,byproduct,byproduct generation,chemical process,compositional influence,final waste,generates byproduct,generation,industrial byproduct,industrial method,industrial output,industrial process,manufacturing,manufacturing method,manufacturing output,production,production method,waste generation</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2760dc2a11fedad02d24741a978cf20d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-edfc4dcbd74cbf0b294f83f2034b209d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-764bdde7c1b68efdbe7342cc41c2d3d4-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-176fa906dd9c8409d2d1c49b8bdf9948-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-022</data>
