<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Steel Slag">
  <data key="d7">5.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Phosphogypsum is combined with steel slag in specialized cement formulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum and steel slag are combined with granulated blast-furnace slag and limestone cement in research.&lt;SEP&gt;Steel slag is combined with phosphogypsum and other materials to form cement composites.&lt;SEP&gt;Steel slag is combined with phosphogypsum and fly ash to mitigate greenhouse gas emissions from agricultural fields.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum is combined with steel slag and other materials to develop specialized cement formulations.</data>
  <data key="d9">combined application,combined use,composite formation,composite formulation,material combination,mitigation</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-044&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-014</data>
