<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Phosphate Ore">
  <data key="d7">9.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation between Phosphate Ore and Phosphogypsum establishes a direct industrial and chemical dependency in which phosphate ore functions as the essential raw material source. Phosphogypsum is generated as a waste byproduct during the industrial processing and treatment of phosphate ore. This foundational relationship means that the starting material fundamentally dictates the nature of the resulting byproduct.

The chemical characteristics, color, and overall composition of phosphogypsum are directly determined by the nature and inherent variations of the phosphate ore. As the ore undergoes industrial treatment, its compositional profile is transferred into the phosphogypsum. Additionally, while the ore provides the primary chemical foundation, the final composition and physical morphology of the phosphogypsum are also shaped by specific processing conditions applied during manufacturing. Consequently, the properties of phosphogypsum are intrinsically linked to both the geological quality of the phosphate ore and the technical parameters of its extraction and processing.&lt;SEP&gt;The characteristics of Phosphogypsum are strongly influenced by the composition and quality of Phosphate Ore.</data>
  <data key="d9">composition dependency,compositional influence,compositional transfer,industrial byproduct,material origin,production source,raw material,raw material origin,raw material source,source,source material,waste generation</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d12">1792489906</data>
