<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="United States">
  <data key="d7">9.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Phosphogypsum in the United States is a major industrial byproduct, with the nation ranking as the second-largest annual global producer at approximately 30.0 million tonnes. A defining characteristic of this material is its elevated concentration of radionuclides, particularly radium-226 (Ra-226), which necessitates specific pretreatment protocols before any potential application.

Due to regulatory restrictions stemming from these radioactive substances, alongside strategic considerations for anticipated future demand, the United States predominantly manages phosphogypsum through extensive stockpiling. This approach has resulted in a high number of dedicated phosphogypsum stacks nationwide, serving as the primary disposal method. While limited agricultural applications exist, only a small fraction of the material is utilized for farming, leaving the vast majority to be contained within these storage facilities. Consequently, the national handling of phosphogypsum relies heavily on containment infrastructure, driven by both radiological constraints and long-term industrial planning.</data>
  <data key="d9">disposal,geographic distribution,high radionuclides,limited application,major producer,major production,management strategy,production,production volume,radionuclide content,regulatory restriction,stockpiling,storage location,waste management</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-042&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d12">1791773900</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
