<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Lead">
  <data key="d7">13.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation between lead and phosphogypsum is defined by the presence of lead as a heavy metal impurity within the phosphogypsum matrix. Tabular data confirms that phosphogypsum contains lead at concentrations significantly exceeding geological averages, though these levels remain below the rare effect concentration. Within the material, lead exists primarily as heavy metal ions and insoluble precipitates, with a distinct tendency to concentrate in the coarser grain size fractions.

Despite being classified as a toxic metal that poses potential environmental risks, lead exhibits intermediate mobility within phosphogypsum. The formation of insoluble precipitates substantially restricts its release rate into the surrounding environment. Conversely, the chemical properties of phosphogypsum and its slag byproducts are utilized in environmental remediation, where cementitious materials derived from phosphogypsum are applied to stabilize and treat lead-contaminated soils. Consequently, the interaction encompasses both the retention characteristics of lead within the phosphogypsum structure and its practical application in mitigating environmental contamination.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum contains significant concentrations of lead as a heavy metal contaminant.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum contains trace amounts of the heavy metal lead.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum contains lead, which is classified as a toxic element.</data>
  <data key="d9">composition,contains,contaminant,distribution,hazard,immobilization,mobility classification,preferential retention,presence,release rate,remediation,threshold compliance,toxic element,toxic metal,trace content,trace element</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-25198f8665e133385fd54e5a03e28a44-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-25198f8665e133385fd54e5a03e28a44-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-009</data>
