<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Nickel">
  <data key="d7">7.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Phosphogypsum contains nickel, a heavy metal that poses environmental risks.&lt;SEP&gt;Nickel is a trace element analyzed in phosphogypsum samples.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum contains nickel at concentrations lower than the rare effect concentration.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum contains nickel as indicated in the tabular data.&lt;SEP&gt;Nickel is a trace element present in phosphogypsum that is tracked throughout the processing stages.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum contains nickel, a heavy metal found in fine particle fractions.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum releases an estimated 232 tons of nickel into the estuary.</data>
