<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Scanning Electron Microscopy">
  <data key="d7">12.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relationship between Phosphogypsum and Scanning Electron Microscopy involves the systematic application of this imaging technique to characterize the physical and chemical properties of phosphogypsum and its associated materials. Scanning Electron Microscopy is utilized to analyze, examine, and visualize the surface morphology, microstructure, and crystalline or crystal morphology of phosphogypsum particles. This analytical approach provides detailed insights into the solid phases and structural characteristics of the material across various processing stages.

In addition to structural evaluation, Scanning Electron Microscopy is employed to assess the elemental distribution and overall composition of phosphogypsum samples. The technique is applied to a wide range of material states, including raw phosphogypsum, leached phosphogypsum, solid raw and production materials, and solid residues resulting from phosphogypsum decomposition. Through these comprehensive applications, Scanning Electron Microscopy serves as a critical analytical tool for documenting the morphological and compositional attributes of phosphogypsum and its derivative products.&lt;SEP&gt;Scanning Electron Microscopy is used to analyze the microstructure and crystalline arrangement of Phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Scanning Electron Microscopy is used to observe the crystalline structure and morphology of Phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;This microscopy method was used to characterize the surface properties of phosphogypsum samples.</data>
  <data key="d9">analysis,analysis technique,analytical technique,examination,imaging,material characterization,material examination,morphological analysis,structural imaging,structural observation,surface characterization,visualization</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f2534f7a997df3f80305323317b15be9-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80e3f6300e001922a5ca2a6a8ac2e0d2-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80e3f6300e001922a5ca2a6a8ac2e0d2-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-036&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d5e4f0f96b4ad61d23685552d3211225-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d5e4f0f96b4ad61d23685552d3211225-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
