  <data key="d7">6.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Phosphogypsum contains aluminum oxide as one of its impurity components.&lt;SEP&gt;Aluminum oxide is a component in the main chemical composition of phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum contains 0.88% Aluminum Oxide.&lt;SEP&gt;Aluminum oxide is a component of phosphogypsum at 0.08 wt%.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum contains aluminum oxide as part of its initial mixture.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum contains aluminum oxide as a chemical component.</data>
