<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Oxygen Carrier">
  <data key="d7">6.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Oxygen carriers for CLG are derived from phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum is utilized as an oxygen carrier in chemical looping gasification processes.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum can function as an oxygen carrier in chemical looping gasification processes.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum is utilized as a base material or component for oxygen carriers in gasification studies.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum is utilized as a primary component in composite oxygen carriers for gasification processes.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum serves as an oxygen carrier in chemical looping gasification.</data>
  <data key="d9">application,chemical looping,composition,example,functional application,functional role,material application,material composition,material source,material use</data>
