<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Calcium Aluminate Cement">
  <data key="d7">6.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Phosphogypsum affects the hydration properties and strength of calcium aluminate cement.&lt;SEP&gt;Calcium aluminate cement is mixed with varying percentages of phosphogypsum to evaluate strength changes.&lt;SEP&gt;Incorporating Phosphogypsum into calcium aluminate cement eliminates specific hydration products and increases compressive strength.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum affects the hydration properties and compressive strength of calcium aluminate cement.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum is added to calcium aluminate cement to evaluate its effects on hydration properties and strength.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum is utilized alongside calcium aluminate cement to enhance soil and cement properties.</data>
