  <data key="d8">Phosphogypsum is utilized as a raw material or additive in cement production.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum is utilized as a raw material in cement production processes.&lt;SEP&gt;Treated phosphogypsum serves as an alternative set regulator and mineral addition in cement production.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum is recycled for cement production.&lt;SEP&gt;Cement production utilizes waste phosphogypsum to remove phosphate impurities and create building materials.</data>
