<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Yangtze River Economic Belt">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Phosphogypsum is widely distributed in the Yangtze River Economic Belt, posing significant ecological challenges due to large stockpiles and low utilization.&lt;SEP&gt;Effective management of phosphogypsum is crucial for the high-quality development of the Yangtze River Economic Belt.&lt;SEP&gt;Improper disposal of phosphogypsum pollutants significantly threatens the high-quality development of the Yangtze River Economic Belt.</data>
  <data key="d9">distribution,environmental impact,environmental significance</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-012</data>
