<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Radioactivity">
  <data key="d7">10.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation (Phosphogypsum, Radioactivity) centers on the fact that radioactivity serves as a critical and defining physical characteristic of phosphogypsum. This property typically results in radiation levels that are three to four times higher than those present in the original phosphate rock. Because of this elevated radioactivity, the material significantly influences its handling procedures and necessitates careful, ongoing environmental monitoring. Phosphogypsum is actively studied to understand both its radioactivity and its broader environmental impact, although it should be noted that specific research projects may occasionally fail to evaluate this property for particular samples.

The release of radioactivity from phosphogypsum raises substantial concerns regarding general environmental impact and indoor environmental safety. Consequently, the resource utilization of phosphogypsum, including its incorporation into construction products such as phosphogypsum-based bricks, must strictly comply with environmental requirements concerning radioactivity. While current applications require further safety evaluation to fully assess radioactivity levels, the overarching priority remains the rigorous assessment of this property to ensure safe and compliant industrial use.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum exhibits elevated radioactivity levels that can reach up to 60 times the concentration of the original phosphate rock.</data>
  <data key="d9">assessment,concentration,contamination,environmental concern,environmental constraint,environmental impact,inherent property,measurement,property,property assessment,releases,study_scope</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-037&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-160a0fe95f7c82b193c6af751106ab6d-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-002</data>
