<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Sodic Soils">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Phosphogypsum supplies calcium to displace sodium from the exchange complex in sodic soils.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum is applied to sodic soils to replace sodium with calcium and improve soil properties.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum is applied to sodic soils to reduce runoff and interrill erosion.</data>
  <data key="d9">amelioration,application,erosion mitigation,sodium displacement,soil amendment,treatment agent for</data>
