<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Sulfur Dioxide">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Phosphogypsum is chemically converted to release sulfur dioxide gas.&lt;SEP&gt;The reductive decomposition of phosphogypsum to sulfur dioxide has limited understanding.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum decomposition generates sulfur dioxide gas, which diffuses out of the slag.</data>
