<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Phosphoric Acid Production">
  <data key="d7">12.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Phosphogypsum and Phosphoric Acid Production define an industrial relationship in which the manufacturing of phosphoric acid consistently generates phosphogypsum as a solid waste byproduct. This material is produced as an inherent output of industrial phosphoric acid operations, establishing a direct causal link between the chemical production process and the creation of this specific waste stream.

Phosphogypsum is primarily composed of calcium sulphate, and its exact chemical content varies depending on the specific techniques and methodologies utilized during phosphoric acid production. Consequently, the composition of this byproduct is directly tied to the industrial process employed, making it a characteristic and variable waste material of the sector.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum is generated as a byproduct of phosphoric acid production.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphoric acid production generates phosphogypsum as a byproduct.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum is generated as an industrial solid waste during phosphoric acid production.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum is generated as a by-product during the industrial production of phosphoric acid.</data>
  <data key="d9">by-product generation,byproduct,byproduct generation,composition,dependency,generates,industrial by-product generation,industrial origin,industrial output,industrial process,produces waste</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e4a551024f80f822f3f35e38ec278151-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28fbd4302bba090e667215c840757ff7-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54b92b2ad16a2528ff6a863329c5d403-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80e3f6300e001922a5ca2a6a8ac2e0d2-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1775dab65ef7445e05c5e396bcc0009b-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-018</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d12">1792487640</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
