</edge>
<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Setting Time">
  <data key="d7">5.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Phosphogypsum prolongs the initial and final setting time of cement proportionally to its content.&lt;SEP&gt;Increasing phosphogypsum content proportionally extends the setting time of cement.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum is compared against natural gypsum to evaluate differences in initial and final setting times.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum significantly prolongs the initial and final setting time of cement mixtures.&lt;SEP&gt;Untreated phosphogypsum delays setting time due to impurities, while calcined variants improve mechanical properties.</data>
  <data key="d9">chemical interaction,comparative analysis,effect,material evaluation,material interaction,prolongation,property alteration,property modification,retardation</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d12">1792488912</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Calcium Fluoride">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Calcium fluoride forms on cement particle surfaces alongside calcium phosphate, influencing PG's retarder effect.&lt;SEP&gt;Calcium fluoride is produced during the fluoride solution conversion of phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum contains calcium fluoride as one of its chemical forms of fluoride.&lt;SEP&gt;Calcium fluoride co-crystallizes with phosphogypsum during the acid attack process.</data>
  <data key="d9">chemical form,co-crystallization,contains,fluoride conversion,impurity,retardation mechanism,surface reaction,synthesis product</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d12">1792409033</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
