</edge>
<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Civil Engineering">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Civil engineering examines the current application and future growth prospects of phosphogypsum in construction.&lt;SEP&gt;Civil engineering can benefit from interdisciplinary growth in Phosphogypsum-based materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Civil engineering serves as the primary domain for the development and application of phosphogypsum-based materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Civil engineering serves as a primary domain for the resource utilization and development of phosphogypsum-based materials.</data>
