<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Mercury">
  <data key="d7">6.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Phosphogypsum contains mercury, a hazardous pollutant that poses risks to the environment and public health when stockpiled.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum may contain mercury as a toxic metal impurity.&lt;SEP&gt;Mercury is a naturally occurring heavy metal impurity contained within phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum contains Mercury, which is present throughout the sample matrix.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum contains mercury, a toxic heavy metal.&lt;SEP&gt;Mercury is a chemical element whose concentration is analyzed within phosphogypsum samples.</data>
  <data key="d9">chemical composition,composition,contains,elemental composition,impurity,pollutant,toxic element,toxic metal</data>
