<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Environmental Impact">
  <data key="d7">10.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Environmental Impact and Phosphogypsum relation underscores the significant ecological and radiological consequences associated with the accumulation, production, management, and disposal of this industrial byproduct. Phosphogypsum stockpiles are known to cause substantial environmental damage, including widespread pollution and ecosystem degradation. Consequently, the management and stocking practices of phosphogypsum play a critical role in determining the overall environmental footprint. Because of these severe impacts, environmental protection has become a primary driver for scientific and industrial research focused on the safe disposal, effective management, and sustainable utilization of the material. This research closely intersects with studies on radiation safety, reflecting the inherent risks associated with phosphogypsum handling.

Efforts toward the comprehensive and widespread utilization of phosphogypsum aim to directly mitigate its negative environmental effects. Integrating phosphogypsum into industrial processes, particularly within the construction sector, can significantly reduce the broader environmental harm caused by traditional building materials. To achieve these sustainability goals, ongoing initiatives are actively developing advanced recycling strategies and innovative applications for phosphogypsum. These developments transform a hazardous waste product into a valuable resource, effectively balancing industrial needs with ecological preservation and radiation safety standards.&lt;SEP&gt;The storage and disposal of Phosphogypsum cause serious environmental impacts, including chemical and radioactive contamination.&lt;SEP&gt;The production and waste management of phosphogypsum result in significant environmental impacts.</data>
  <data key="d9">causes,consequence association,ecological concern,ecological consequence,ecological damage,ecological effect,ecology,management,management consequence,management focus,mitigation,pollution,recycling driver,research focus,sustainability,waste management</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-037&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d12">1792487793</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Washing">
  <data key="d7">9.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Washing is a physical purification and pre-treatment method applied to raw phosphogypsum to eliminate impurities and enhance the material's functional properties. Recognized as one of several available purification techniques, it is widely recommended for processing phosphogypsum. The process primarily targets water-soluble substances, effectively reducing the concentrations of heavy metals, thorium, rare earth elements, and various oxides within the raw material.

In operational workflows, washing is typically implemented as the initial step during phosphogypsum extraction. Although originally established as a laboratory-scale purification technology, the method has been successfully adapted and scaled for broader industrial applications, ensuring its practical utility in large-scale material processing.</data>
  <data key="d9">impurity removal,industrial application,process sequence,processing method,purification,purification method,purification technology,treated by,treatment,treatment method</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-057&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-819484fd12a30d085e4eb297904c9e2b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d12">1792488907</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
