<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Mineral Carbonation">
  <data key="d7">6.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Phosphogypsum is employed in mineral carbonation for high-efficiency carbon dioxide capture.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum is employed in the mineral carbonation process to capture carbon dioxide.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum is modified via mineral carbonation for CO2 sequestration.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum is utilized in Mineral Carbonation to form calcium oxide nanoparticles and remineralize brine water.&lt;SEP&gt;Mineral carbonation is applied to phosphogypsum waste to produce useful carbonate and sulfate salts.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum serves as a suitable feedstock for mineral carbonation to reduce greenhouse gas emissions.</data>
  <data key="d9">application,carbon capture,carbon sequestration,carbon storage,chemical process,material application,process,treatment,valorization</data>
