<edge source="Sulfuric Acid" target="Wet Process">
  <data key="d7">7.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The wet process utilizes concentrated sulfuric acid to decompose phosphate rock in phosphoric acid plants.&lt;SEP&gt;Concentrated sulfuric acid is the primary chemical agent utilized in the wet process.&lt;SEP&gt;Sulfuric Acid is the primary chemical used to dissolve phosphate rock in the wet process.&lt;SEP&gt;Sulfuric acid is used to digest phosphate rock in the wet process.&lt;SEP&gt;The wet process reacts sulfuric acid with phosphate ore to extract phosphoric acid.&lt;SEP&gt;Sulfuric acid is typically used in the wet process to treat and decompose phosphate rock.&lt;SEP&gt;The wet process utilizes sulfuric acid to react with phosphate rock.</data>
  <data key="d9">chemical reactant,chemical reactant consumption,chemical reagent,digestion,industrial application,process agent,reactant,reagent,treatment,utilizes reagent</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-058&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-022</data>
