  <data key="d7">5.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Fluorapatite and sulfuric acid are primary reactants in the wet process.&lt;SEP&gt;Fluorapatite reacts with sulfuric acid during the acidulation process to initiate the chemical transformation.&lt;SEP&gt;Sulfuric acid reacts with Fluorapatite to attack its mineral structure during the separation process.&lt;SEP&gt;Fluorapatite reacts with sulfuric acid as part of the wet process to produce phosphoric acid.&lt;SEP&gt;Fluorapatite reacts with sulfuric acid to initiate the chemical process.</data>
