<edge source="Rare Earth Elements" target="Recrystallization">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Recrystallization is recommended to enhance the release of soluble rare earth elements from the gypsum matrix.&lt;SEP&gt;The recrystallization of gypsum plates physically releases entrained rare earth elements into the leaching solution.&lt;SEP&gt;Recrystallization manipulates phosphogypsum microstructure to separate and recover rare earth elements.&lt;SEP&gt;Recrystallization increases rare earth element concentration in phosphogypsum prior to extraction.</data>
