<edge source="Rare Earth Elements" target="Leaching">
  <data key="d7">6.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Leaching processes are specifically designed to extract and recover rare earth elements from phosphogypsum matrices.&lt;SEP&gt;Leaching is employed to extract rare earth elements from phosphogypsum using mineral acids.&lt;SEP&gt;Leaching successfully extracts rare earth elements from phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Rare Earth Elements exhibit low mobility during leaching processes, even at high temperatures.&lt;SEP&gt;Leaching is employed to extract rare earth elements from phosphogypsum and fertilizers.&lt;SEP&gt;Leaching is the primary method used to extract rare earth elements from phosphogypsum.</data>
  <data key="d9">extraction,extraction process,extraction target,extraction technique,low mobility,recovery goal,removal,target extraction</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-022</data>
