<edge source="Phosphoric Acid" target="Phosphate Rock">
  <data key="d7">14.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation (Phosphate Rock, Phosphoric Acid) describes the industrial and chemical pathway through which the mineral is converted into a key compound. Phosphate rock serves as the primary raw material and original resource for manufacturing phosphoric acid. This transformation is achieved through various industrial and chemical processing methods, most notably wet processing, in which the rock is dissolved to extract the acid.

A significant byproduct of this wet processing route is the generation of phosphogypsum waste. Beyond its role as a feedstock, the resulting phosphoric acid is also utilized in downstream chemical synthesis. Specifically, it acts as a reactant that combines with additional phosphate rock to synthesize triple superphosphate, a common agricultural fertilizer. Together, these descriptions outline a comprehensive industrial cycle, covering raw material sourcing, chemical extraction, waste generation, and downstream fertilizer production.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphate rock serves as the primary raw material for phosphoric acid production.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphate Rock is processed to produce Phosphoric Acid through the wet acid method.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphate rock is processed to produce phosphoric acid.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphate Rock serves as the primary raw material for producing Phosphoric Acid.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphoric acid production relies on phosphate rock as a fundamental raw material that determines phosphogypsum composition.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphate rock is the primary natural resource processed to manufacture phosphoric acid.</data>
  <data key="d9">chemical processing,chemical reaction,feedstock,fertilizer synthesis,input,manufacturing,production,production process,production source,raw material,raw material source</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-764bdde7c1b68efdbe7342cc41c2d3d4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3d20c90c2a00342300c9b55c3e29f23-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525daf613910500054a23427717dab1f-chunk-000</data>
