  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">High fluoride intake from phosphogypsum leaching is known to cause dental fluorosis.&lt;SEP&gt;Fluorine pollution causes dental fluorosis, posing health risks to local communities.&lt;SEP&gt;Fluorine pollution leads to dental fluorosis in exposed populations.</data>
