</edge>
<edge source="PG" target="Ettringite">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">PG concentration affects ettringite diffraction peak intensity, with longer curing times weakening the peak.&lt;SEP&gt;PG stimulates ettringite creation due to increased residual gypsum content.&lt;SEP&gt;The interaction between PG sulfate and slag generates ettringite as a key hydration byproduct.&lt;SEP&gt;PG reacts with aluminates to produce ettringite, improving material mechanics.</data>
  <data key="d9">chemical reaction,concentration effect,peak intensity,product,production,stimulation</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-011</data>
