<edge source="Hydroxyapatite" target="Heavy Metals">
  <data key="d7">5.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Hydroxyapatite is used to immobilize heavy metals in wastewater and soil environments.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydroxyapatite immobilizes heavy metals through efficient sorption processes.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydroxyapatite is utilized as an adsorbent to remove heavy metals from aqueous solutions.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydroxyapatite-based adsorbents are designed to sequester heavy metals from the environment.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydroxyapatite-based adsorbents are designed to sequester heavy metals from the environment.</data>
