  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Hydroxyapatite reduces the bioavailability of cadmium in contaminated soil.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydroxyapatite removes cadmium ions primarily through an ion exchange mechanism.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydroxyapatite immobilizes cadmium from solution primarily through ion-exchange rather than dissolution-precipitation.</data>
