<edge source="Hydroxyapatite" target="Biomedical Applications">
  <data key="d7">5.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Hydroxyapatite's stability makes it an attractive material for Biomedical Applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydroxyapatite nanostructures are developed for various biomedical and therapeutic applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydroxyapatite is a mineral frequently utilized in biomedical applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydroxyapatite is a ceramic material frequently utilized in biomedical applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydroxyapatite is frequently utilized in biomedical applications.</data>
