  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Hydroxyapatite functions as an adsorbent in wastewater treatment processes for environmental remediation.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydroxyapatite is used in wastewater treatment to remove heavy metal ions from aqueous solutions.</data>
