<edge source="Hydroxyapatite" target="Stoichiometric Hydroxyapatite">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Stoichiometric hydroxyapatite is a pure variant of hydroxyapatite with a Ca/P ratio of 1.67 and the formula Ca10(PO4)6(OH)2.&lt;SEP&gt;Stoichiometric hydroxyapatite is a specific variant of hydroxyapatite with a Ca/P ratio of 1.67.&lt;SEP&gt;Stoichiometric hydroxyapatite is a specific chemical form of hydroxyapatite.</data>
