<edge source="Hydroxyapatite" target="Carbonate-Rich Hydroxyapatite">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Carbonate-rich hydroxyapatite is a non-stoichiometric variant with a Ca/P ratio higher than 1.67 that incorporates carbonate groups.</data>
