</edge>
<edge source="Hydroxyapatite" target="Phosphate Groups">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Phosphate groups form the compact tetrahedral framework that constitutes the hydroxyapatite crystal structure.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphate groups are integral structural components of hydroxyapatite that function as hard Lewis bases.</data>
  <data key="d9">hard Lewis base,lattice framework,structural component</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-009</data>
