  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Hydroxyapatite has approximate lattice parameters of a = 9.37 Å and c = 6.88 Å.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydroxyapatite is characterized by lattice parameters a = 9.423 Å and c = 6.883 Å.&lt;SEP&gt;Lattice parameters characterize the structural properties of synthesized hydroxyapatite.</data>
