  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Hydroxyapatite can be prepared from phosphogypsum waste, proving economical for heavy metal sorption.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum waste is utilized as a precursor material for synthesizing hydroxyapatite nano-materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydroxyapatite nanoparticles are frequently synthesized from phosphogypsum waste as a raw material source.</data>
