<edge source="Hydroxyapatite" target="Fluoride">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Hydroxyapatite demonstrates excellent and superior adsorption capacity for fluoride, removing over 90% in tested solutions.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydroxyapatite adsorbs over 90% of fluoride from solution, with efficiency dependent on particle size.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydroxyapatite nanoparticles prepared from phosphogypsum are applied to remove fluoride from aqueous environments.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydroxyapatite adsorbs fluoride from aqueous solution primarily through surface interactions.</data>
  <data key="d9">adsorbs,adsorption,adsorption target,contaminant removal,de-fluoridation,ion exchange,superior performance</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e992f3bad9db87c40308ea55e121bd8a-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
