</edge>
<edge source="Hydroxyapatite" target="Particle Size">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Hydroxyapatite's fluoride removal efficiency increases with smaller particle sizes.&lt;SEP&gt;Particle size was determined as a property of hydroxyapatite dispersions.&lt;SEP&gt;Particle size is measured to characterize the dimensions of synthesized hydroxyapatite nanoparticles.&lt;SEP&gt;Particle size is a key physical property of hydroxyapatite that is precisely controlled during synthesis.</data>
  <data key="d9">characteristic,measured parameter,measurement,performance dependency,physical property</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4739e42903c95e1fb7e0ecfbca3a12df-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-002</data>
