<edge source="Hydroxyapatite" target="Brij-93 Surfactant">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Brij-93 Surfactant influences the crystallization and morphology of Hydroxyapatite during the synthesis process.&lt;SEP&gt;Brij-93 surfactant modifies hydroxyapatite morphology by chemically capping particle surfaces and preventing agglomeration.&lt;SEP&gt;Brij-93 Surfactant caps Hydroxyapatite crystal surfaces to direct unidirectional growth and prevent agglomeration.&lt;SEP&gt;Brij-93 surfactant concentration directly influences the aspect ratio and mean size of hydroxyapatite crystals.</data>
  <data key="d9">agglomeration prevention,crystallization,morphological control,morphological influence,morphological modifier,morphology control,surface capping</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6825862084b162a4b16cd1037c76e3d7-chunk-000</data>
