<edge source="Hydroxyapatite" target="Potassium Dihydrogen Phosphate">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Hydroxyapatite was synthesized using Potassium Dihydrogen Phosphate as a secondary raw material.&lt;SEP&gt;Potassium dihydrogen phosphate is utilized as a reactant in the hydrothermal synthesis of hydroxyapatite.&lt;SEP&gt;Potassium Dihydrogen Phosphate acts as a primary reactant in the synthesis of Hydroxyapatite.&lt;SEP&gt;Potassium dihydrogen phosphate is mixed with phosphogypsum to synthesize hydroxyapatite.</data>
  <data key="d9">chemical reactant,material synthesis,precursor,raw material,reactant,synthesis</data>
