  <data key="d8">Palmitic acid functions as a surfactant to limit crystal growth and control size distribution.&lt;SEP&gt;Palmitic Acid acts as a surfactant that restricts the size distribution and growth of Hydroxyapatite nanostructures.&lt;SEP&gt;Palmitic acid served as an organic modifier to modify the crystalline structure of hydroxyapatite.</data>
  <data key="d9">organic modifier,size restriction,structural modification,surfactant</data>
