  <data key="d8">Hydroxyapatite possesses a band gap structure that influences its light absorption and optoelectronic performance.&lt;SEP&gt;Band Gap values are measured for the prepared Hydroxyapatite samples to evaluate their electronic properties.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydroxyapatite possesses a band gap structure that influences its light absorption and optoelectronic performance.&lt;SEP&gt;Band Gap values are measured for the prepared Hydroxyapatite samples to evaluate their electronic properties.</data>
