<edge source="X-ray Diffraction" target="Diffraction Angle">
  <data key="d7">6.0</data>
  <data key="d8">X-ray Diffraction data is plotted against the diffraction angle on the horizontal axis.&lt;SEP&gt;The diffraction angle serves as the horizontal axis for plotting X-ray diffraction data.&lt;SEP&gt;X-ray Diffraction data is plotted against diffraction angle on the X-axis in degrees.&lt;SEP&gt;X-ray diffraction measures diffraction angles in degrees to analyze crystalline structures.&lt;SEP&gt;The XRD chart plots intensity against the diffraction angle in degrees.&lt;SEP&gt;Diffraction angle serves as the X-axis parameter for plotting the X-ray diffraction pattern.</data>
  <data key="d9">axis,chart axis,data axis,horizontal axis,measurement,measurement parameter,plots</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-038&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4a64a852097fdc910b98ed788503ce4-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-35aef6efc801611130c5dd196fe513df-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-036</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d12">1792302018</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="X-ray Diffraction" target="Intensity">
  <data key="d7">6.0</data>
  <data key="d8">X-ray Diffraction data is plotted against intensity on the vertical axis.&lt;SEP&gt;X-ray Diffraction generates data plotted against intensity on the Y-axis to show diffraction strength.&lt;SEP&gt;X-ray diffraction records the relative intensity of diffracted X-rays in arbitrary units.&lt;SEP&gt;Intensity is the vertical axis metric measured in arbitrary units for X-ray Diffraction patterns.&lt;SEP&gt;Intensity is the vertical axis metric measured in the X-ray diffraction chart.&lt;SEP&gt;The XRD chart uses intensity in arbitrary units to represent peak heights.</data>
  <data key="d9">chart axis,data axis,measurement,measurement axis,measurement parameter,vertical scale</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-038&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4a64a852097fdc910b98ed788503ce4-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6825862084b162a4b16cd1037c76e3d7-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28fbd4302bba090e667215c840757ff7-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-35aef6efc801611130c5dd196fe513df-chunk-008</data>
