<edge source="Silica Fume" target="PGCM">
  <data key="d7">7.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Silica fume is included as a material component in the PGCM formulation.&lt;SEP&gt;Silica Fume is incorporated into PGCM to modify its material properties and improve durability.&lt;SEP&gt;Silica fume is used in PGCM, but its hydration products decompose in water, accelerating crack widening.&lt;SEP&gt;Silica fume increases the dissolution rate and strength coefficient of PGCM, with optimal mechanical properties observed at 15% dosage.&lt;SEP&gt;Silica fume is added to PGCM, where it reacts with quicklime and negatively impacts sample length growth.&lt;SEP&gt;Silica fume particles polymerize into gel clusters that improve the compactness of PGCM.&lt;SEP&gt;Silica Fume improves the later-stage antifreeze ability, weathering resistance, and compressive strength of PGCM.</data>
  <data key="d9">additive,admixture,compactness,composition,dissolution rate,hydration decomposition,length reduction,material component,performance enhancement,polymerization</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d12">1791516804</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Silica Fume" target="Gongyi Baichuan Environmental Protection Engineering Co., Ltd.">
