<edge source="Quicklime" target="PGCM">
  <data key="d7">7.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Quicklime is added to PGCM to improve its antifreeze performance and strength coefficient.&lt;SEP&gt;Quicklime functions as a binding component within the PGCM formulation.&lt;SEP&gt;Quicklime is added to PGCM to reduce dissolution rate and improve strength, with 2% dosage showing optimal weathering resistance.&lt;SEP&gt;Quicklime content affects PGCM compressive strength, with optimal strength at 2% and reduced strength when unreacted residual exceeds 2%.&lt;SEP&gt;Quicklime is present in PGCM and expands upon water absorption, generating expansion stress that widens cracks.&lt;SEP&gt;Quicklime effectively improves the freeze resistance of PGCM, with optimal effects at 2% content.&lt;SEP&gt;Quicklime enhances weathering resistance and later strength of PGCM, but excessive amounts decrease the strength coefficient.</data>
  <data key="d9">additive,admixture,component,composition,curing effect,expansion stress,freeze resistance improvement,performance enhancement,performance improvement,strength improvement,strength modification</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d12">1791516804</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Quicklime" target="Strength Coefficient">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Quicklime increases the strength coefficient of PGCM, peaking at a 2% content.&lt;SEP&gt;Quicklime optimizes the strength coefficient of PGCM, achieving better results at a 2% content.</data>
  <data key="d9">enhancement effect,optimization</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-011</data>
