<edge source="CTAB" target="HAp-CTAB-9">
  <data key="d7">14.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation (CTAB, HAp-CTAB-9) describes the synthesis and structural modification of a hydroxyapatite composite. HAp-CTAB-9 is composed of hydroxyapatite that has been chemically modified using CTAB as both a surfactant and a templating agent. During the preparation phase, CTAB is incorporated at a precise concentration of 9 wt% to direct the material's growth and control its overall morphology. This templating action successfully induces distinct one-dimensional and two-dimensional structural modifications within the hydroxyapatite matrix.

The primary objective of utilizing CTAB in this synthesis is to significantly enhance the photoelectrochemical properties of the resulting material. Despite the active incorporation of CTAB during fabrication, comprehensive post-preparation analysis confirms that the final HAp-CTAB-9 sample is entirely free of residual CTAB impurities. This indicates a highly effective modification and purification process that yields a structurally optimized composite without surfactant contamination.</data>
  <data key="d9">composition,composition analysis,impurity detection,modification,sample synthesis,surfactant addition,surfactant modification,surfactant template,synthesis component,used in</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-023</data>
