<edge source="Scherrer Equation" target="Peak Broadening">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Scherrer Equation utilizes Peak Broadening as a primary variable in its calculation formula.&lt;SEP&gt;The Scherrer equation incorporates peak broadening to determine crystal dimensions.</data>
  <data key="d9">incorporates,input parameter,mathematical variable,measures</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-017</data>
