  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Scherrer Equation" target="Crystallite Size">
  <data key="d7">6.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Scherrer equation calculates the average crystallite size as its primary output.&lt;SEP&gt;The Scherrer equation is used to estimate the average crystallite size from XRD data.&lt;SEP&gt;The Scherrer equation is used to estimate the average crystallite size of the prepared samples.&lt;SEP&gt;The Scherrer equation is used to estimate the average crystallite size from XRD data.&lt;SEP&gt;The Scherrer equation is used to estimate the average crystallite size of the prepared samples.&lt;SEP&gt;The Scherrer equation calculates the average crystallite size of hydroxyapatite, yielding an average of 28 nm with a 5 nm standard deviation.</data>
  <data key="d9">calculates,calculation,calculation method,estimation,mathematical calculation,primary variable,size estimation</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-72ff3bbf1e2b594abc3ec5c8d86e3178-chunk-009</data>
