<edge source="P123" target="HAp-P123-9">
  <data key="d7">10.0</data>
  <data key="d8">HAp-P123-9 is a composite material composed of Hydroxyapatite modified with the P123 surfactant. The synthesis and preparation of this specific variant rely on P123 acting as a structural directing agent and surfactant during fabrication. A defining characteristic of this formulation is the precise utilization of P123 at a 9 wt% concentration, which directly governs the material's morphological development. Consequently, this controlled surfactant-assisted synthesis yields distinct nanorod structures.

In terms of performance evaluation, the HAp-P123-9 sample exhibits lower efficiency when compared to analogous variants synthesized using CTAB surfactants. The relationship between HAp-P123-9 and P123 is thus characterized by the surfactant's dual role in chemically modifying the base Hydroxyapatite matrix and physically templating its nanostructure, while also influencing its comparative functional efficiency.</data>
  <data key="d9">composition,modification,sample synthesis,surfactant addition,surfactant modification,synthesis component</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f07601cd9e687d5cc5c7d9b6b467f21e-chunk-023</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d12">1792191282</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="P123" target="HAp-P123-3">
  <data key="d7">6.0</data>
  <data key="d8">HAp-P123-3 is synthesized using P123 as a surfactant template.&lt;SEP&gt;P123 was used as a surfactant to synthesize the HAp-P123-3 sample.&lt;SEP&gt;HAp-P123-3 is synthesized using P123 as a surfactant template.&lt;SEP&gt;P123 was used as a surfactant to synthesize the HAp-P123-3 sample.&lt;SEP&gt;HAp-P123-3 is composed of Hydroxyapatite modified with P123 surfactant.&lt;SEP&gt;HAp-P123-3 is synthesized using P123 surfactant, resulting in lower efficiency than CTAB variants.</data>
