  <data key="d8">PGI-1.4 is defined by a specific carbon-to-sulfur molar ratio of 0.5.&lt;SEP&gt;PGI-1.4 is defined and analyzed based on specific C/S Molar Ratios ranging from 0 to 2.0.&lt;SEP&gt;The C/S molar ratio is set at 0.5, 1.0, and 2.0 to investigate the reaction process and slag formation of PGI-1.4.</data>
  <data key="d9">composition parameter,compositional control,compositional parameter,experimental parameter,experimental variable,sample specification</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-006</data>
