<edge source="PBSLM" target="MPG">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">MPG is a component in PBSLM that influences fluidity, flexural strength, and compressive strength.&lt;SEP&gt;MPG hydration cohesion reduces fluidity, while an optimal dosage of 330 g maximizes mechanical properties.&lt;SEP&gt;MPG is a primary raw material comprising 63.11% of PBSLM production.</data>
  <data key="d9">component,composition,dosage optimization,hydration cohesion,mechanical influence,raw material</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad247a75dda6243453b4132b71670203-chunk-025</data>
